15, 323, 13480, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Leave the section closest to you coal-free.\n2. Replace the grill grate.\n3. If using a gas grill, set it up for three-zone grilling.\n4. Keep it hot, keep it clean, keep it lubricated: When the grill grate is hot, clean it with a grill brush, then lubricate it with a grill oiler or a folded paper towel dipped in vegetable oil.\n5. Heat the grill to high heat.\n6. Place the porterhouse on the grill, bone side down.\n7. Grill for approximately 5-7 minutes per side for medium-rare, or adjust according to desired doneness.\n8. Remove and let rest for 5-10 minutes before slicing and serving.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6741128612227567, "g_worst_claim": 0.009774161502718925, "g_content": 1.8513813761921671, "g_traj_mean": 1.3095219135284424}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1588, 374, 1246, 311, 39058, 264, 87186, 7675, 1447, 16, 13, 25193, 279, 3772, 18093, 311, 498, 11497, 12577, 624, 17, 13, 29558, 279, 39058, 85354, 624, 18, 13, 1416, 1667, 264, 6819, 39058, 11, 738, 432, 705, 369, 2326, 77763, 1081, 9400, 624, 19, 13, 13655, 432, 4017, 11, 2506, 432, 4240, 11, 2506, 432, 53394, 657, 25, 3197, 279, 39058, 85354, 374, 4017, 11, 4240, 432, 448, 264, 39058, 15625, 11, 1221, 53394, 349, 432, 448, 264, 39058, 5590, 261, 476, 264, 47035, 5567, 42613, 72207, 304, 35481, 5590, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, here is how to grill a porterhouse:\n\n1. Leave the section closest to you coal-free.\n2. Replace the grill grate.\n3. If using a gas grill, set it up for three-zone grilling.\n4. Keep it hot, keep it clean, keep it lubricated: When the grill grate is hot, clean it with a grill brush, then lubricate it with a grill oiler or a folded paper towel dipped in vegetable oil.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.4786708127341424, "g_worst_claim": 0.210482656955719, "g_content": 3.0334696215252546, "g_traj_mean": 2.0818827152252197}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 39058, 264, 87186, 7675, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 510, 16, 13, 25193, 279, 3772, 18093, 311, 498, 11497, 12577, 624, 17, 13, 29558, 279, 39058, 85354, 624, 18, 13, 1416, 1667, 264, 6819, 39058, 11, 738, 432, 705, 369, 2326, 77763, 1081, 9400, 624, 19, 13, 13655, 279, 39058, 4017, 11, 4240, 11, 323, 53394, 657, 13, 3197, 279, 39058, 85354, 374, 4017, 11, 4240, 432, 448, 264, 39058, 15625, 11, 1221, 53394, 349, 432, 448, 264, 39058, 5590, 261, 476, 264, 47035, 5567, 42613, 72207, 304, 35481, 5590, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to grill a porterhouse, follow these steps:\n1. Leave the section closest to you coal-free.\n2. Replace the grill grate.\n3. If using a gas grill, set it up for three-zone grilling.\n4. Keep the grill hot, clean, and lubricated. When the grill grate is hot, clean it with a grill brush, then lubricate it with a grill oiler or a folded paper towel dipped in vegetable oil.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.124702992217094, "g_worst_claim": 0.210482656955719, "g_content": 2.9724512967196377, "g_traj_mean": 1.9542827606201172}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.84, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "21", "question": "magellan of virginia provider", "gt": "Magellan of Virginia is the Behavioral Health Services Administrator for the Virginia Department of Medical Assistance Services. They administer behavioral health services for members enrolled in Virginia’s Medicaid and FAMIS programs. The site is also for providers, offering them resources like weekly Q&A sessions each Friday from 1 p.m. - 2:30 p.m. where they can address their questions and issues. Additionally, they offer continuing education clock hours/credits for e-learning courses, approved by organizations like the American Psychological Association and the Association of Social Work Boards.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, Magellan of Virginia is a provider of behavioral health services for members enrolled in Virginia’s Medicaid and FAMIS programs. They host weekly calls, known as Provider Q&A Sessions, on Fridays from 1 p.m. to 2:30 p.m. These sessions are open to all providers and are used to address their questions and issues.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, Magellan of Virginia is a provider of behavioral health services for members enrolled in Virginia’s Medicaid and FAMIS programs. They host weekly calls, known as Provider Q&A Sessions, on Fridays from 1 p.m. to 2:30 p.m. These sessions are open to all providers and are used to address their questions and issues.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, Magellan of Virginia is a provider of behavioral health services in Virginia. They are selected by the Virginia Department of Medical Assistance Services (DMAS) to serve as the Behavioral Health Services Administrator (BHSA) for members enrolled in Virginia’s Medicaid and FAMIS programs. Magellan ensures quality behavioral health services are delivered to Virginia Medicaid enrollees, partnering with members, providers, and stakeholders to improve the overall health and well-being of Virginians.\", \"Based on the given passages, Magellan of Virginia is a provider of behavioral health services for members enrolled in Virginia’s Medicaid and FAMIS programs. They host weekly calls, known as Provider Q&A Sessions, on Fridays from 1 p.m. to 2:30 p.m. These sessions are open to all providers and are used to address their questions and issues.\", \"Based on the given passages, Magellan of Virginia offers continuing education clock hours/credits for e-learning courses approved by the American Psychological Association (APA) and the Association of Social Work Boards (ASWB). They are selected by the Virginia Department of Medical Assistance Services (DMAS) to serve as the Behavioral Health Services Administrator (BHSA) for members enrolled in Virginia’s Medicaid and FAMIS programs. Magellan of Virginia administers behavioral health services for these members and aims to ensure quality behavioral health services are delivered. They host weekly provider Q&A sessions on Fridays from 1 p.m. to 2:30 p.m., which are open to all providers to address their questions and issues.\", \"Based on the given passages, Magellan of Virginia provides behavioral health services for Medicaid and FAMIS program members in Virginia. They ensure quality behavioral health services and work to improve the overall health and well-being of Virginians. Magellan of Virginia also hosts weekly provider Q&A sessions on Fridays, where providers can address their questions and issues.\"]", "time_sec": 20.252, "generation_time_seconds": 19.2837, "selection_time_seconds": 0.957, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 6879, 84786, 315, 12989, 374, 264, 9109, 315, 35595, 2820, 3516, 304, 12989, 13, 2379, 525, 4091, 553, 279, 12989, 5887, 315, 12939, 45765, 8307, 320, 8395, 1911, 8, 311, 8683, 438, 279, 71984, 6267, 8307, 28593, 320, 97151, 7778, 8, 369, 3613, 36091, 304, 12989, 748,