{"id": "46", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, here is how to fold a quilt:\n\n1. Lay your quilt on a bed, table or other flat surface.\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias.\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, here is how to fold a quilt:\n\n1. Lay your quilt on a bed, table or other flat surface.\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias.\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface such as a bed, table, or other flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\", \"Based on the given passages, here are the steps to fold a quilt:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface such as a bed, table, or any other flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner of the quilt up toward the center, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner of the quilt up toward the center, again ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner of the quilt down toward the center, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner of the quilt down toward the center, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\", \"Based on the given passages, to fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\", \"Based on the given passages, here is how to fold a quilt:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a bed, table or other flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt.\"]", "time_sec": 24.558, "generation_time_seconds": 23.4906, "selection_time_seconds": 1.0332, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 11555, 264, 60736, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 43924, 697, 60736, 389, 264, 10063, 7329, 1741, 438, 264, 4845, 11, 1965, 11, 476, 1008, 10063, 7329, 624, 17, 13, 60473, 279, 4722, 1290, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 624, 18, 13, 60473, 279, 4722, 2115, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 3