{"id": "47", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "To fold a quilt, follow these steps:\n\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface such as a bed or table.\n2. Fold the lower right corner up towards the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner up towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner down towards the center of the quilt, again on the bias.\n5. Finally, fold the top right corner down towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is also on the bias.", "pred": "These steps ensure that the folds are made on the bias, which helps in maintaining the shape and appearance of the quilt.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "These steps ensure that the folds are made on the bias, which helps in maintaining the shape and appearance of the quilt.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface such as a bed, table, or other flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\", \"Based on the given passages, here is how to fold a quilt:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\", \"Based on the given passages, to fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n1. Lay your quilt on a bed, table or other flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt making sure the fold is on the bias.\", \"Based on the given passages, the steps to fold a quilt are as follows:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface such as a bed or table.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, also ensuring the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, again making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Finally, fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the bias is followed.\\n\\nThese steps ensure that the folds are made on the bias, which helps in maintaining the shape and appearance of the quilt.\"]", "time_sec": 26.66, "generation_time_seconds": 25.9601, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6904, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 11555, 264, 60736, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 43924, 697, 60736, 389, 264, 10063, 7329, 1741, 438, 264, 4845, 11, 1965, 11, 476, 1008, 10063, 7329, 624, 17, 13, 60473, 279, 4722, 1290, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 624, 18, 13, 60473, 279, 4722, 2115, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 624, 19, 13, 60473, 279, 1909, 2115, 9131, 1495, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 1155