{"id": "49", "question": "how to fold a quilt", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to fold a quilt:\n\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface.\n2. Fold the lower right corner up towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner up towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner down towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\n5. Fold the top right corner down towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"How to fold a quilt\" can be summarized in five steps:\n\n1. Lay the quilt flat.\n2. Fold lower right corner up.\n3. Fold lower left corner up.\n4. Fold top left corner down.\n5. Fold top right corner down.", "pred": "1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface, such as a bed or table.\n2. Fold the lower right corner of the quilt up toward the center, making sure the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner of the quilt up toward the center, also ensuring it is on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner of the quilt down toward the center, again making sure it is on the bias.\n5. Fold the top right corner of the quilt down toward the center, ensuring a bias fold.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface, such as a bed or table.\n2. Fold the lower right corner of the quilt up toward the center, making sure the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner of the quilt up toward the center, also ensuring it is on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner of the quilt down toward the center, again making sure it is on the bias.\n5. Fold the top right corner of the quilt down toward the center, ensuring a bias fold.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to fold a quilt, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface s