t corner of the quilt down toward the center, again making sure it is on the bias.\n5. Fold the top right corner of the quilt down toward the center, ensuring a bias fold.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.7460436966068672, "g_worst_claim": -0.019489205800569974, "g_content": 0.827090493563948, "g_traj_mean": 0.6323239803314209}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 11555, 264, 60736, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 43924, 697, 60736, 389, 264, 10063, 7329, 1075, 264, 4845, 476, 1965, 624, 17, 13, 60473, 279, 4722, 1290, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 624, 18, 13, 60473, 279, 4722, 2115, 9131, 705, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 624, 19, 13, 60473, 279, 1909, 2115, 9131, 1495, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 624, 20, 13, 60473, 279, 1909, 1290, 9131, 1495, 8841, 279, 4126, 315, 279, 60736, 11, 22573, 279, 11555, 374, 389, 279, 15470, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Lay your quilt on a flat surface like a bed or table.\n2. Fold the lower right corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\n3. Fold the lower left corner up toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\n4. Fold the top left corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.\n5. Fold the top right corner down toward the center of the quilt, ensuring the fold is on the bias.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.8017004275596696, "g_worst_claim": -0.007911873551515432, "g_content": 0.8372240228168035, "g_traj_mean": 0.6983107924461365}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 58.75, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "50", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "A water pick, also known as a Waterpik, is a beneficial tool for oral care. It is designed to shoot a strong stream of water at the gum line to help eliminate germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush. It can also help maintain overall body health. In comparison to flossing, using a water pick can be easier and leave your mouth feeling cleaner. It can also massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. It is especially useful in cleaning around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot reach.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n- It can help eliminate germs and plaque that are tough to reach with a toothbrush.\n- It can help maintain good oral health.\n- It can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis.\n- It can clean better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n- It can help eliminate germs and plaque that are tough to reach with a toothbrush.\n- It can help maintain good oral health.\n- It can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis.\n- It can clean better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\\n\\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\\n\\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are hard to remove with a toothbrush.\\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which reduces the risk of gingivitis.\\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\\n- It can help eliminate germs and plaque that are tough to reach with a toothbrush.\\n- It can help maintain good oral health.\\n- It can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis.\\n- It can clean better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a Water Pik include helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by eliminating germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush. It can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. Additionally, it helps to clean better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\"]", "time_sec": 21.442, "generation_time_seconds": 20.492, "selection_time_seconds": 0.9412, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 15873, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 429, 525, 11045, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 448, 264, 25507, 36061, 624, 17, 13, 90701, 311, 10306, 1661, 20655, 2820, 624, 18, 13, 9167, 4118, 323, 64692, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 11, 892, 8609, 311, 7949, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 624, 19, 13, 46655, 2664, 2163, 279, 17832, 323, 97654, 11, 17592, 3607, 504, 5671, 429, 76726, 4157, 2615, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6612181918293825, "g_worst_claim": 0.2735609213511149, "g_content": 2.2021032060895647, "g_traj_mean": 1.511710286140442}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 15873, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 429, 525, 2588, 311, 4057, 448, 264, 25507, 36061, 624, 17, 13, 90701, 311, 10306, 1661, 20655, 2820, 624, 18, 13, 9167, 4118, 323, 64692, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 11, 892, 25271, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 624, 19, 13, 46655, 2664, 2163, 279, 17832, 323, 97654, 11, 17592, 3607, 504, 5671, 429, 76726, 4157, 2615, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are hard to remove with a toothbrush.\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which reduces the risk of gingivitis.\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6030681964423923, "g_worst_claim": 0.2735609213511149, "g_content": 2.0326206207275392, "g_traj_mean": 1.415566086769104}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 510, 12, 1084, 646, 1492, 21725, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 429, 525, 11045, 311, 5545, 448, 264, 25507, 36061, 624, 12, 1084, 646, 1492, 10306, 1661, 20655, 2820, 624, 12, 1084, 646, 6245, 323, 49977, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 11, 17719, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 624, 12, 1084, 646, 4240, 2664, 2163, 279, 17832, 323, 97654, 11, 17592, 3607, 504, 5671, 429, 76726, 4157, 2615, 1