{"id": "51", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "A water pick has several benefits, according to the given passages. It can help eliminate germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush. It can also massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. Additionally, a water pick can clean better around the teeth and gums, reaching areas that brushing may not be able to access.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a Water Pik include:\n\n1. Helping to maintain good oral health.\n2. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n3. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\n4. Eliminating pesky germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a Water Pik include:\n\n1. Helping to maintain good oral health.\n2. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n3. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\n4. Eliminating pesky germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\\n\\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\", \"Based on the given passages:\\n- A Water Pik helps to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier.\\n- It can help eliminate plaque and germs that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\\n- It massages and stimulates soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis.\\n- It cleans better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\\n- The Water Pik is designed to shoot a strong stream of water at the gum line to help eliminate germs and plaque.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier. It eliminates germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush, massages and stimulates soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis, and cleans better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a Water Pik include:\\n\\n1. Helping to maintain good oral health.\\n2. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\\n3. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\\n4. Eliminating pesky germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\"]", "time_sec": 20.207, "generation_time_seconds": 19.353, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8433, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 15873, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 429, 525, 11045, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 448, 264, 25507, 36061, 624, 17, 13, 90701, 311, 10306, 1661, 20655, 2820, 624, 18, 13, 9167, 4118, 323, 64692, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 11, 892, 8609, 311, 7949, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 624, 19, 13, 46655, 2664, 2163, 279, 17832, 323, 97654, 11, 17592, 3607, 504, 5671, 429, 76726, 4157, 2615, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7056806506409923, "g_worst_claim": 0.30981606245040894, "g_content": 2.296820867629278, "g_traj_mean": 1.5584746599197388}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 510, 12, 362, 9959, 61162, 8609, 311, 2506, 17832, 11, 97654, 11, 10780, 11, 323, 8084, 2487, 38245, 624, 12, 1084, 646, 1492, 21725, 60364, 323, 17239, 1011, 429, 525, 11045, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 448, 264, 25507, 36061, 624, 12, 1084, 63179, 323, 94355, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 11, 17719, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 624, 12, 1084, 34194, 2664, 2163, 279, 17832, 323, 97654, 11, 17592, 3607, 504, 5671, 429, 76726, 4157, 2615, 624, 12, 576, 9959, 61162, 374, 6188, 311, 6102, 264, 3746, 4269, 315, 3015, 518, 279, 41265, 1555, 311, 1492, 21725, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages:\n- A Water Pik helps to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier.\n- It can help eliminate plaque and germs that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\n- It massages and stimulates soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis.\n- It cleans better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\n- The Water Pik is designed to shoot a strong stream of water at the gum line to help eliminate germs and plaque.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0396324890027238, "g_worst_claim": 0.37340421676635743, "g_content": 2.783144483379289, "g_traj_mean": 1.7897605895996094}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 10476, 311, 2506, 17832, 11, 97654, 11, 10780, 11, 323, 8084, 2487, 38245, 13, 1084, 59844, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 429, 525, 11045, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 448, 264, 25507, 36061, 11, 63179