{"id": "52", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include maintaining good oral health, reducing the risk of gingivitis, cleaning better around the teeth and gums, and eliminating tough-to-remove germs and plaque from the gum line.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\\n\\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a Water Pik include:\\n\\n1. Oral health maintenance: Water Pik is useful in helping to maintain good oral health.\\n2. Massage and stimulation: It can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth.\\n3. Reduced risk of gingivitis: It helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\\n4. Better cleaning: Water Pik helps to clean better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\\n5. Elimination of germs and plaque: It shoots a strong stream of water at the gum line to help eliminate pesky germs and plaque.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\\n\\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\\n2. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\\n3. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\\n\\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\"]", "time_sec": 21.378, "generation_time_seconds": 20.5077, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8502, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 15873, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 429, 525, 11045, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 448, 264, 25507, 36061, 624, 17, 13, 90701, 311, 10306, 1661, 20655, 2820, 624, 18, 13, 9167, 4118, 323, 64692, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 11, 892, 8609, 311, 7949, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 624, 19, 13, 46655, 2664, 2163, 279, 17832, 323, 97654, 11, 17592, 3607, 504, 5671, 429, 76726, 4157, 2615, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n4. Cleaning better ar