c": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "53", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, the benefits of using a water pick (also known as a Waterpik) include:\n\n1. Helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by eliminating germs and plaque.\n2. Being a great oral care tool for removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n4. Being an alternative to flossing and potentially offering similar benefits.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages. The passages do not provide information on other potential benefits of using a water pick, such as its ability to reach areas between teeth or its effectiveness in reducing plaque buildup.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\\n\\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include: \\n\\n1. Helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush. \\n2. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\\n3. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\\n\\n1. It can help you to keep your teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier.\\n2. A water pick is designed to shoot a strong stream of water at your gum line to help eliminate pesky germs and plaque that is tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\\n3. It can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, helping to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\\n4. It helps to clean better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier. Water piks shoot a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush. They can help maintain good oral health by massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. Water piks also help clean better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing can not access.\"]", "time_sec": 21.095, "generation_time_seconds": 20.4189, "selection_time_seconds": 0.663, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 15873, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 429, 525, 11045, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 448, 264, 25507, 36061, 624, 17, 13, 90701, 311, 10306, 1661, 2065