"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier. Water piks shoot a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush. They can help maintain good oral health by massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. Water piks also help clean better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing can not access.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7091442342093304, "g_worst_claim": 0.2767517566680908, "g_content": 2.3023389180501304, "g_traj_mean": 1.7069443464279175}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 53.23, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "54", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n* Helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by eliminating pesky germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush.\n* Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n* Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food particles from areas that brushing cannot access.\n\nTherefore, using a water pick can be an effective addition to your oral hygiene routine, complementing traditional brushing and flossing methods.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\\n\\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\\n\\n1. Helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier.\\n2. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\\n3. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\\n4. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\\n\\nThese details support the conclusion that a water pick is an effective oral care tool with multiple health benefits for maintaining good oral health.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a Water Pik include:\\n- It can help keep teeth, gums, and overall body healthier.\\n- It shoots a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque.\\n- It can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis.\\n- It helps to clean better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\\n- It can be a useful tool for maintaining good oral health.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\\n\\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque: Water picks are designed to shoot a strong stream of water at your gum line, helping to get rid of pesky germs and plaque that are tough to remove with a regular toothbrush.\\n2. Reduced risk of gingivitis: A water pick can massage and stimulate the soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gum disease.\\n3. Better cleaning around teeth and gums: Water picks can clean areas around the teeth and gums that brushing may not reach, effectively removing food particles.\"]", "time_sec": 22.864, "generation_time_seconds": 22.143, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7094, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 15873, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 429, 525, 11045, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 448, 264, 25507, 36061, 624, 17, 13, 90701, 311, 10306, 1661, 20655, 2820, 624, 18, 13, 9167, 4118, 323, 64692, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 11, 892, 8609, 311, 7949, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 624, 19, 13, 46655, 2664, 2163, 279, 17832, 323, 97654, 11, 17592, 3607, 504, 5671, 429, 76726, 4157, 2615, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n1. Eliminating germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush.\n2. Helping to maintain good oral health.\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n4. Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6442432564499776, "g_worst_claim": 0.26409242550532025, "g_content": 2.240471976143973, "g_traj_mean": 1.5173331499099731}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 90701, 311, 2506, 17832, 11, 97654, 11, 10780, 11, 323, 8084, 2487, 38245, 624, 17, 13, 42320, 15873, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 429, 525, 11045, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 448, 264, 25507, 36061, 624, 18, 13, 46655, 2664, 2163, 279, 17832, 323, 97654, 11, 17592, 3607, 504, 5671, 429, 76726, 4157, 2615, 624, 19, 13, 9167, 4118, 323, 64692, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 11, 892, 8609, 311, 7949, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 382, 9485, 3565, 1824, 279, 16688, 429, 264, 3015, 3735, 374, 458, 7373, 20655, 2453, 5392, 448, 5248, 2820, 7567, 369, 20337, 1661, 20655, 2820, 13, 151645], "pred": "These details support the conclusion that a water pick is an effective oral care tool with multiple health benefits for maintaining good oral health.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7087014858989822, "g_worst_claim": 0.26409242550532025, "g_content": 1.873622512817383, "g_traj_mean": 1.3602687120437622}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 264, 9959, 61162, 2924, 510, 12, 1084, 646, 1492, 2506, 17832, 11, 97654, 11, 323, 8084, 2487, 38245, 624, 12, 1084, 43627, 264, 3746, 4269, 315, 3015, 518, 279, 41265, 1555, 311, 21725, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 624, 12, 1084, 646, 6245, 323, 49977, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 11, 17719, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 624, 12, 1084, 8609, 311, 4240, 2664, 2163, 279, 17832, 323, 97654, 11, 17592, 3607, 504, 5671, 429, 76726, 4157, 2615, 624, 12, 1084, 646, 387, 264, 5390, 5392, 369, 20337, 1661, 20655, 2820, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a Water Pik include:\n- It can help keep teeth, gums, and overall body healthier.\n- It shoots a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque.\n- It can massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis.\n- It helps to clean better around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\n- It can be a useful tool for maintaining good oral health.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.757499335355083, "g_worst_claim": 0.26409242550532025, "g_content": 2.5074590047200522, "g_traj_mean": 1.5756453275680542}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 15873, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 25, 9959, 21895, 525, 6188, 311, 6102, 264, 3746, 4269, 315, 3015, 518, 697, 41265, 1555, 11, 10476, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 18050, 7891, 17239, 1011, 323, 60364, 429, 525, 11045, 311, 4057, 448, 264, 5792, 25507, 36061, 624, 17, 13, 79469, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 25, 362, 3015, 3735, 646, 6245, 323, 49977, 279, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 11, 892, 8609, 311, 7949, 279, 5214, 315, 41265, 8457, 624, 18, 13, 23434, 15826, 2163, 17832, 323, 97654, 25, 9959, 21895, 646, 4240, 5671, 2163, 279, 17832, 323, 97654, 429, 76726, 1231, 537, 5545, 11, 13444, 17592, 3607, 18730, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Eliminating germs and plaque: Water picks are designed to shoot a strong stream of water at your gum line, helping to get rid of pesky germs and plaque that are tough to remove with a regular toothbrush.\n2. Reduced risk of gingivitis: A water pick can massage and stimulate the soft tissue in the mouth, which helps to reduce the risk of gum disease.\n3. Better cleaning around teeth and gums: Water picks can clean areas around the teeth and gums that brushing may not reach, effectively removing food particles.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.1244001274040192, "g_worst_claim": 0.26409242550532025, "g_content": 1.6664632943960336, "g_traj_mean": 1.1290903091430664}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 63.46, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "55", "question": "how can i keep birds from building a nest on my porch", "gt": "You can prevent birds from building nests on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch and the top of the porch if it has open rafters. This will block the birds from reaching spaces they often choose to build their nests. If you have a light fixture, you can also install bird netting over it, but make sure the netting is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs and doesn't entangle birds. Another method is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch, as this can scare birds away. Remember to move the plastic hawk periodically to prevent the birds from becoming accustomed to it.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting around the perimeter of your porch and over the light fixture. Make sure to choose nonflammable netting and install it without entangling birds. Alternatively, you can mount a plastic hawk near your porch to scare birds away.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting around the perimeter of your porch and over the light fixture. Make sure to choose nonflammable netting and install it without entangling birds. Alternatively, you can mount a plastic hawk near your porch to scare birds away.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting on your light fixture, try another method.\", \"Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. This netting should be installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. Additionally, you can use a plastic hawk to scare birds away from the porch. Move the plastic hawk periodically to prevent the birds from becoming accustomed to it.\", \"Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting around the perimeter of your porch and over the light fixture. Make sure to choose nonflammable netting and install it without entangling birds. Alternatively, you can mount a plastic hawk near your porch to scare birds away.\", \"Based on the given passages, there are several methods to keep birds from building a nest on your porch:\\n\\n1. Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. This method ensures that birds cannot reach the spaces where they often build their nests, preventing nesting and other associated issues like blocking ventilation and transmitting diseases.\\n\\n2. Install a plastic hawk on or near your porch. The sight of a predator can scare birds away from the area and deter them from nesting on your porch. It is important to move the plastic hawk periodically to prevent birds from becoming accustomed to it, ensuring its effectiveness in keeping birds at bay.\\n\\n3. Consider other products designed to scare birds away from your property. These products can provide additional options for deterring birds from nesting on your porch, complementing the use of bird netting and plastic hawks.\"]", "time_sec": 25.337, "generation_time_seconds": 23.9752, "selection_time_seconds": 1.3248, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 553, 71808, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 13598, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545, 5157, 311, 1936, 862, 95121, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 4582, 11958, 4179, 1280, 916, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 3100, 12507, 311, 2504, 279, 19654, 6, 2615, 311, 432, 11, 18774, 264, 4179, 1280, 429, 374, 2477, 44764, 480, 323, 6092, 311, 990, 2163, 3100, 53220, 13, 37210, 546, 429, 279, 4179, 1280, 374, 10275, 773, 429, 432, 3171, 944, 1197, 4044, 19654, 13, 1416, 498, 646, 944, 990, 4179, 1280, 389, 697, 3100, 12507, 11, 1430, 2441, 1714, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting on your light fixture, try another method.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.80739541603321, "g_worst_claim": 0.2183209458986918, "g_content": 2.6210455894470215, "g_traj_mean": 1.8165327310562134}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 553, 71808, 11958, 4179, 1280, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1096, 4179, 1280, 1265, 387, 10275, 773, 429, 432, 3171, 944, 1197, 4044, 19654, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 990, 264, 12188, 75820, 311, 42930, 19654, 3123, 504, 279, 44647, 13, 14561, 279, 12188, 75820, 47482, 311, 5358, 279, 19654, 504, 10454, 52084, 311, 432, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. This netting should be installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. Additionally, you can use a plastic hawk to scare birds away from the porch. Move the plastic hawk periodically to prevent the birds from becoming accustomed to it.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.098120301299625, "g_worst_claim": 0.2183209458986918, "g_content": 1.800108379787869, "g_traj_mean": 1.2104536294937134}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 553, 71808, 11958, 4179, 1280, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 323, 916, 279, 3100, 12507, 13, 7405, 2704, 311, 5157, 2477, 44764, 480, 4179, 1280, 323, 4582, 432, 2041, 1197, 90104, 19654, 13, 38478, 11, 498, 646, 6470, 264, 12188, 75820, 3143, 697, 44647, 311, 42930, 19654, 3123, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting around the perimeter of your porch and over the light fixture. Make sure to choose nonflammable netting and install it without entangling birds. Alternatively, you can mount a plastic hawk near your porch to scare birds away.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3668473291964758, "g_worst_claim": 0.21939162413279215, "g_content": 2.326770782470703, "g_traj_mean": 1.491273045539856}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1052, 525, 3807, 5413, 311, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 1447, 16, 13, 48384, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1096, 1714, 25351, 429, 19654, 4157, 5545, 279, 12621, 1380, 807, 3545, 1936, 862, 95121, 11, 26160, 66710, 323, 1008, 5815, 4714, 1075, 22188, 55134, 323, 77668, 18808, 382, 17, 13, 19242, 264, 12188, 75820, 389, 476, 3143, 697, 44647, 13, 576, 13929, 315, 264, 66906, 646, 42930, 19654, 3123, 504, 279, 3082, 323, 4040, 1105, 504, 66710, 389, 697, 44647, 13, 1084, 374, 2989, 311, 3271, 279, 12188, 75820, 47482, 311, 5358, 19654, 504, 10454, 52084, 311, 432, 11, 22573, 1181, 26279, 304, 10282, 19654, 518, 22708, 382, 18, 13, 21144, 1008, 3871, 6188, 311, 42930, 19654, 3123, 504, 697, 3343, 13, 4220, 3871, 646, 3410, 5107, 2606, 369, 3392, 14443, 19654, 504, 66710, 389, 697, 44647, 11, 22766, 287, 279, 990, 315, 11958, 4179, 1280, 323, 12188, 305, 29278, 13, 151645], "pred": "3. Consider other products designed to scare birds away from your property. These products can provide additional options for deterring birds from nesting on your porch, complementing the use of bird netting and plastic hawks.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.1306672615182196, "g_worst_claim": 0.1789264678955078, "g_content": 1.5942355069247158, "g_traj_mean": 1.1228126287460327}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 57.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "57", "question": "how can i keep birds from building a nest on my porch", "gt": "To prevent birds from building a nest on your porch, you can attach bird netting to the eves and top of your porch with staples. Additionally, you can install bird netting over your light fixture to deter birds from accessing it. Another option is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds away. It's important to note that any product used to deter birds should be nonflammable and safe to use.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by installing bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it. Choose a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting, you can also attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If neither of these methods works for you, you can mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds away. Make sure to move the plastic hawk periodically to prevent the birds from becoming accustomed to its presence.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by installing bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it. Choose a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting, you can also attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If neither of these methods works for you, you can mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds away. Make sure to move the plastic hawk periodically to prevent the birds from becoming accustomed to its presence.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting on your light fixture, try another method.\", \"Based on the given passages, to keep birds from building a nest on your porch, you can attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. This prevents birds from reaching the spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block birds' access to it, choosing a nonflammable netting that is safe around light bulbs. Another option is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch, which can scare birds away and prevent them from inhabiting your porch. It's also important to move the plastic hawk periodically to avoid birds becoming accustomed to it.\", \"Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by installing bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it. Choose a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting, you can also attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If neither of these methods works for you, you can mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds away. Make sure to move the plastic hawk periodically to prevent the birds from becoming accustomed to its presence.\", \"Based on the given passages, there are several methods to keep birds from building a nest on your porch:\\n\\n1. Attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests.\\n\\n2. Install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it. Choose a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds.\\n\\n3. Mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch. The sight of a predator can scare the birds from the area and keep them from inhabiting your porch. Move the plastic hawk periodically, so the birds do not become accustomed to the plastic hawk, rendering it ineffective.\"]", "time_sec": 29.651, "generation_time_seconds": 28.6651, "selection_time_seconds": 0.969, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 553, 71808, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 13598, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545, 5157, 311, 1936, 862, 95121, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 4582, 11958, 4179, 1280, 916, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 3100, 12507, 311, 2504, 279, 19654, 6, 2615, 311, 432, 11, 18774, 264, 4179, 1280, 429, 374, 2477, 44764, 480, 323, 6092, 311, 990, 2163, 3100, 53220, 13, 37210, 546, 429, 279, 4179, 1280, 374, 10275, 773, 429, 432, 3171, 944, 1197, 4044, 19654, 13, 1416, 498, 646, 944, 990, 4179, 1280, 389, 697, 3100, 12507, 