. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block birds' access to it, choosing a nonflammable netting that is safe around light bulbs. Another option is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch, which can scare birds away and prevent them from inhabiting your porch. It's also important to move the plastic hawk periodically to avoid birds becoming accustomed to it.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4572110342718163, "g_worst_claim": 0.2183209458986918, "g_content": 2.4162445068359375, "g_traj_mean": 1.5973467826843262}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 553, 26632, 11958, 4179, 1280, 916, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 3100, 12507, 311, 2504, 279, 19654, 6, 2615, 311, 432, 13, 22201, 264, 4179, 1280, 429, 374, 2477, 44764, 480, 323, 6092, 311, 990, 2163, 3100, 53220, 13, 37210, 546, 429, 279, 4179, 1280, 374, 10275, 773, 429, 432, 3171, 944, 1197, 4044, 19654, 13, 1416, 498, 646, 944, 990, 4179, 1280, 11, 498, 646, 1083, 15498, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 13866, 315, 1493, 5413, 4278, 369, 498, 11, 498, 646, 6470, 264, 12188, 75820, 389, 476, 3143, 697, 44647, 311, 42930, 279, 19654, 3123, 13, 7405, 2704, 311, 3271, 279, 12188, 75820, 47482, 311, 5358, 279, 19654, 504, 10454, 52084, 311, 1181, 9362, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by installing bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it. Choose a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting, you can also attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If neither of these methods works for you, you can mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds away. Make sure to move the plastic hawk periodically to prevent the birds from becoming accustomed to its presence.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3379394618176728, "g_worst_claim": 0.2183209458986918, "g_content": 2.3962775336371527, "g_traj_mean": 1.5269418954849243}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1052, 525, 3807, 5413, 311, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 1447, 16, 13, 48384, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 13598, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545, 5157, 311, 1936, 862, 95121, 382, 17, 13, 19242, 11958, 4179, 1280, 916, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 3100, 12507, 311, 2504, 279, 19654, 6, 2615, 311, 432, 13, 22201, 264, 4179, 1280, 429, 374, 2477, 44764, 480, 323, 6092, 311, 990, 2163, 3100, 53220, 13, 37210, 546, 429, 279, 4179, 1280, 374, 10275, 773, 429, 432, 3171, 944, 1197, 4044, 19654, 382, 18, 13, 10423, 264, 12188, 75820, 389, 476, 3143, 697, 44647, 13, 576, 13929, 315, 264, 66906, 646, 42930, 279, 19654, 504, 279, 3082, 323, 2506, 1105, 504, 25252, 5853, 697, 44647, 13, 14561, 279, 12188, 75820, 47482, 11, 773, 279, 19654, 653, 537, 3635, 52084, 311, 279, 12188, 75820, 11, 20898, 432, 54188, 13, 151645], "pred": "3. Mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch. The sight of a predator can scare the birds from the area and keep them from inhabiting your porch. Move the plastic hawk periodically, so the birds do not become accustomed to the plastic hawk, rendering it ineffective.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.8073710038190656, "g_worst_claim": 0.2183209458986918, "g_content": 2.5311609027029456, "g_traj_mean": 1.8179951906204224}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partne