 Install the netting so that it doesn't entangle birds.\n\n2. Mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch. Move the plastic hawk periodically to prevent birds from becoming accustomed to it, rendering it ineffective.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6192836949587766, "g_worst_claim": 0.20380387703577676, "g_content": 2.412206013997396, "g_traj_mean": 1.6608240604400635}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 51.98, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "59", "question": "how can i keep birds from building a nest on my porch", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are some ways to keep birds from building nests on your porch:\n\n1. Attach bird netting to the eaves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun (Passage 1:4). This will prevent birds from reaching the areas they often choose to build their nests.\n2. Install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it (Passage 2:1). Choose a non-flammable netting that is safe to use around light bulbs, and ensure that it is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds.\n3. Mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds from the area (Passage 3:1). Move the plastic hawk periodically to avoid the birds becoming accustomed to it.\n\nPlease note that the effectiveness of these methods may vary depending on the type of birds and the location of your porch. If the above methods do not work, you may need to consider other solutions or consult with a professional for assistance.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting on your light fixture, try another method.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting on your light fixture, try another method.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting on your light fixture, try another method.\", \"Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by using bird netting. Attach the netting to the eaves and rafters of your porch with a staple gun. Alternatively, install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it. Choose a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs, ensuring it doesn't entangle birds. Another method is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds away. Move the plastic hawk periodically to maintain its effectiveness.\", \"Based on the given passages, one way to keep birds from building a nest on your porch is to attach bird netting to the eves and open rafters around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. This netting can be made from nonflammable materials and should not entangle birds. Additionally, mounting a plastic hawk on or near the porch can also scare birds away from the area.\", \"Based on the given passages, to keep birds from building a nest on your porch, you can attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a nonflammable netting safe for use around light bulbs. Ensure the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds.\"]", "time_sec": 25.194, "generation_time_seconds": 24.1163, "selection_time_seconds": 1.0686, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 553, 71808, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 13598, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545, 5157, 311, 1936, 862, 95121, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 4582, 11958, 4179, 1280, 916, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 3100, 12507, 311, 2504, 279, 19654, 6, 2615, 311, 432, 11, 18774, 264, 4179, 1280, 429, 374, 2477, 44764, 480, 323, 6092, 311, 990, 2163, 3100, 53220, 13, 37210, 546, 429, 279, 4179, 1280, 374, 10275, 773, 429, 432, 3171, 944, 1197, 4044, 19654, 13, 1416, 498, 646, 944, 990, 4179, 1280, 389, 697, 3100, 12507, 11, 1430, 2441, 1714, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting on your light fixture, try another method.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.831506589026786, "g_worst_claim": 0.2738117178281148, "g_content": 2.678044319152832, "g_traj_mean": 1.851632833480835}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 553, 1667, 11958, 4179, 1280, 13, 48384, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 4693, 323, 52455, 388, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 38478, 11, 4582, 11958, 4179, 1280, 916, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 3100, 12507, 311, 2504, 279, 19654, 6, 2615, 311, 432, 13, 22201, 264, 4179, 1280, 429, 374, 2477, 44764, 480, 323, 6092, 311, 990, 2163, 3100, 53220, 11, 22573, 432, 3171, 944, 1197, 4044, 19654, 13, 13293, 1714, 374, 311, 6470, 264, 12188, 75820, 389, 476, 3143, 697, 44647, 311, 42930, 279, 19654, 3123, 13, 14561, 279, 12188, 75820, 47482, 311, 10306, 1181, 26279, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by using bird netting. Attach the netting to the eaves and rafters of your porch with a staple gun. Alternatively, install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it. Choose a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs, ensuring it doesn't entangle birds. Another method is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds away. Move the plastic hawk periodically to maintain its effectiveness.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.432735657508959, "g_worst_claim": 0.2738117178281148, "g_content": 2.287878389711733, "g_traj_mean": 1.5055758953094482}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 825, 1616, 311, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 374, 311, 15498, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 323, 1787, 52455, 388, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1096, 4179, 1280, 646, 387, 1865, 504, 2477, 44764, 480, 7236, 323, 1265, 537, 1197, 4044, 19654, 13, 22406, 11, 33639, 264, 12188, 75820, 389, 476, 3143, 279, 44647, 646, 1083, 42930, 19654, 3123, 504, 279, 3082, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, one way to keep birds from building a nest on your porch is to attach bird netting to the eves and open rafters around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. This netting can be made from nonflammable materials and should not entangle birds. Additionally, mounting a plastic hawk on or near the porch can also scare birds away from the area.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3227899760544837, "g_worst_claim": 0.2738117178281148, "g_content": 2.395886807828336, "g_traj_mean": 1.530091404914856}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 11, 498, 646, 15498, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 13598, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545, 5157, 311, 1936, 862, 95121, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 4582, 11958, 4179, 1280, 916, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 3100, 12507, 311, 2504, 279, 19654, 6, 2615, 311, 432, 11, 18774, 264, 2477, 44764, 480, 4179, 1280, 6092, 369, 990, 2163, 3100, 53220, 13, 29279, 279, 4179, 1280, 374, 10275, 773, 429, 432, 3171, 944, 1197, 4044, 19654, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to keep birds from building a nest on your porch, you can attach bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a nonflammable netting safe for use around light bulbs. Ensure the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.5792293051352997, "g_worst_claim": 0.2738117178281148, "g_content": 2.582220143285291, "g_traj_mean": 1.7198803424835205}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 53.61, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "60", "question": "how can i keep birds from building a nest on my porch", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some ways to keep birds from building a nest on your porch:\n\n1. Attach bird netting to the eaves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun.\n2. Install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it.\n3. Mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds away.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question of how to keep birds from building a nest on your porch is:\n\nAttach bird netting to the eaves or install bird netting over the light fixture, and/or mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch using a staple gun. Make sure the netting is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Alternatively, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access. Another option is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch, as the sight of a predator can scare the birds away. It is important to move the plastic hawk periodically to prevent the birds from becoming accustomed to it and rendering it ineffective.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch using a staple gun. Make sure the netting is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Alternatively, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access. Another option is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch, as the sight of a predator can scare the birds away. It is important to move the plastic hawk periodically to prevent the birds from becoming accustomed to it and rendering it ineffective.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting on your light fixture, try another method.\", \"Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch using a staple gun. Make sure the netting is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Alternatively, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access. Another option is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch, as the sight of a predator can scare the birds away. It is important to move the plastic hawk periodically to prevent the birds from becoming accustomed to it and rendering it ineffective.\", \"Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. This netting will prevent birds from reaching spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block birds' access to it, choosing a nonflammable netting that is safe around light bulbs. Another method is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch, as the sight of a predator can scare birds away and prevent them from inhabiting your porch.\", \"Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by:\\n\\n1. Attaching bird netting to the eaves around the perimeter of your porch using a staple gun.\\n2. Installing bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access, ensuring the netting is non-flammable and safe around light bulbs.\\n3. Mounting a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds away, and moving it periodically to prevent birds from becoming accustomed to it.\"]", "time_sec": 27.42, "generation_time_seconds": 26.3002, "selection_time_seconds": 1.0999, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 553, 71808, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1416, 697, 44647, 702, 1787, 52455, 388, 11, 990, 279, 48956, 6038, 311, 15498, 279, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 44647, 13, 576, 4179, 1280, 13598, 279, 19654, 504, 18739, 1846, 12621, 807, 3545, 5157, 311, 1936, 862, 95121, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 4582, 11958, 4179, 1280, 916, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 3100, 12507, 311, 2504, 279, 19654, 6, 2615, 311, 432, 11, 18774, 264, 4179, 1280, 429, 374, 2477, 44764, 480, 323, 6092, 311, 990, 2163, 3100, 53220, 13, 37210, 546, 429, 279, 4179, 1280, 374, 10275, 773, 429, 432, 3171, 944, 1197, 4044, 19654, 13, 1416, 498, 646, 944, 990, 4179, 1280, 389, 697, 3100, 12507, 11, 1430, 2441, 1714, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. If your porch has open rafters, use the staple gun to attach the netting to the top of the porch. The netting keeps the birds from reaching those spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access to it, choosing a netting that is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Beware that the netting is installed so that it doesn't entangle birds. If you can't use netting on your light fixture, try another method.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.83004953361955, "g_worst_claim": 0.19368638594945273, "g_content": 2.6793274879455566, "g_traj_mean": 1.8666203022003174}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 553, 71808, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 1667, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 7405, 2704, 279, 4179, 1280, 374, 2477, 44764, 480, 323, 6092, 311, 990, 2163, 3100, 53220, 13, 38478, 11, 498, 646, 4582, 11958, 4179, 1280, 916, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 3100, 12507, 311, 2504, 279, 19654, 6, 2615, 13, 13293, 2999, 374, 311, 6470, 264, 12188, 75820, 389, 476, 3143, 697, 44647, 11, 438, 279, 13929, 315, 264, 66906, 646, 42930, 279, 19654, 3123, 13, 1084, 374, 2989, 311, 3271, 279, 12188, 75820, 47482, 311, 5358, 279, 19654, 504, 10454, 52084, 311, 432, 323, 20898, 432, 54188, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch using a staple gun. Make sure the netting is nonflammable and safe to use around light bulbs. Alternatively, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access. Another option is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch, as the sight of a predator can scare the birds away. It is important to move the plastic hawk periodically to prevent the birds from becoming accustomed to it and rendering it ineffective.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3775450756478012, "g_worst_claim": 0.19368638594945273, "g_content": 2.307667619090969, "g_traj_mean": 1.5095385313034058}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 553, 71808, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 2342, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 448, 264, 48956, 6038, 13, 1096, 4179, 1280, 686, 5358, 19654, 504, 18739, 12621, 807, 3545, 5157, 311, 1936, 862, 95121, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 4582, 11958, 4179, 1280, 916, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 3100, 12507, 311, 2504, 19654, 6, 2615, 311, 432, 11, 18774, 264, 2477, 44764, 480, 4179, 1280, 429, 374, 6092, 2163, 3100, 53220, 13, 13293, 1714, 374, 311, 6470, 264, 12188, 75820, 389, 476, 3143, 697, 44647, 11, 438, 279, 13929, 315, 264, 66906, 646, 42930, 19654, 3123, 323, 5358, 1105, 504, 25252, 5853, 697, 44647, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by attaching bird netting to the eves around the perimeter of your porch with a staple gun. This netting will prevent birds from reaching spaces they often choose to build their nests. Additionally, you can install bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block birds' access to it, choosing a nonflammable netting that is safe around light bulbs. Another method is to mount a plastic hawk on or near your porch, as the sight of a predator can scare birds away and prevent them from inhabiting your porch.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6670116977403036, "g_worst_claim": 0.19368638594945273, "g_content": 2.632326126098633, "g_traj_mean": 1.7628282308578491}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 2506, 19654, 504, 4752, 264, 22791, 389, 697, 44647, 553, 1447, 16, 13, 7711, 11829, 11958, 4179, 1280, 311, 279, 384, 4693, 2163, 279, 46342, 315, 697, 44647, 1667, 264, 48956, 6038, 624, 17, 13, 79800, 11958, 4179, 1280, 916, 279, 1909, 315, 279, 3100, 12507, 311, 2504, 279, 19654, 6, 2615, 11, 22573, 279, 4179, 1280, 374, 2477, 12276, 99110, 323, 6092, 2163, 3100, 53220, 624, 18, 13, 10423, 287, 264, 12188, 75820, 389, 476, 3143, 697, 44647, 311, 42930, 279, 19654, 3123, 11, 323, 7218, 432, 47482, 311, 5358, 19654, 504, 10454, 52084, 311, 432, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, you can keep birds from building a nest on your porch by:\n\n1. Attaching bird netting to the eaves around the perimeter of your porch using a staple gun.\n2. Installing bird netting over the top of the light fixture to block the birds' access, ensuring the netting is non-flammable and safe around light bulbs.\n3. Mounting a plastic hawk on or near your porch to scare the birds away, and moving it periodically to prevent birds from becoming accustomed to it.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4577169470351612, "g_worst_claim": 0.17984835306803384, "g_content": 2.323671677533318, "g_traj_mean": 1.4730172157287598}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 59.72, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.8, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "62", "question": "set default browser to windows", "gt": "Method 1 of 2 in passage 2 provides the steps to set the default web browser in Windows 7.", "pred": "2. For Mozilla Firefox:\n   - Open your Firefox browser.\n   - Click on the Firefox menu button (three horizontal lines).\n   - Select \"Options\" from the pop-out menu.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "2. For Mozilla Firefox:\n   - Open your Firefox browser.\n   - Click on the Firefox menu button (three horizontal lines).\n   - Select \"Options\" from the pop-out menu.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to set the default browser in Windows, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Open the Settings app by clicking the Settings icon in the Start menu or using the Windows + I keyboard shortcut.\\n2. Click on the first option titled System (display, notifications, apps, power).\\n3. In the left-pane, click Default apps.\\n4. Scroll down to the Web browser section.\\n5. Click on the Edge browser entry (or any browser other than Chrome) to reveal Choose an app, and then click Google Chrome to set it as the default browser.\\n\\nThese steps are specific to setting Google Chrome as the default browser. For other browsers like Mozilla Firefox, the process is slightly different.\", \"Based on the given passages, to set a default browser to Windows, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. For Microsoft Edge:\\n   - Open the Settings app by clicking on the Settings icon or using the Windows + I shortcut.\\n   - Click on the \\\"System\\\" option in the left-pane.\\n   - Scroll down to the \\\"Web browser\\\" section.\\n   - Click on \\\"Edge\\\" entry and then click \\\"Google Chrome\\\" to set it as default.\\n\\n2. For Mozilla Firefox:\\n   - Open your Firefox browser.\\n   - Click on the Firefox menu button (three horizontal lines).\\n   - Select \\\"Options\\\" from the pop-out menu.\", \"Based on the given passages, to set the default browser to Windows 7, follow these steps:\\n1. Open the Settings app. To do so, open the Start menu and then click the Settings icon. Alternatively, use the Windows + I keyboard shortcut to quickly open the Settings app.\\n2. In the Settings app, click on the first option titled System (display, notifications, apps, power).\\n3. In the left-pane, click Default apps.\\n4. On the right-side, scroll down to the Web browser section.\\n5. Click on the Edge browser entry (or any browser other than Chrome) to reveal the Choose an app option, and then click on the other browser of your choice, such as Google Chrome, to set it as the default browser.\", \"Based on the given passages, to set the default browser in Windows:\\n\\n1. Open Settings app. To do so, open Start menu and then click Settings icon. Alternatively, use Windows + I keyboard shortcut to quickly open Settings app.\\n2. Click the first option titled System (display, notifications, apps, power).\\n3. In the left-pane, click Default apps.\\n4. On the right-side, scroll down to see Web browser section.\\n5. Click on the Edge browser entry (or any browser other than Chrome) to reveal Choose an app, and then click Google Chrome to set it as default browser.\"]", "time_sec": 26.71, "generation_time_seconds": 25.8321, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8664, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 738, 279, 1638, 6929, 304, 5515, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 5264, 279, 11296, 906, 553, 18458, 279, 11296, 4603, 304, 279, 5145, 5022, 476, 1667, 279, 5515, 488, 358, 13625, 37115, 624, 17, 13, 9189, 389, 279, 1156, 2999, 24849, 739, 320, 5493, 11, 21969, 11, 10500, 11, 2355, 4292, 18, 13, 758, 279, 2115, 38452, 11, 4205, 7899, 10500, 624, 19, 13, 22392, 1495, 311, 279, 4895, 6929, 3772, 624, 20, 13, 9189, 389, 279, 10349, 6929, 4343, 320, 269, 894, 6929, 1008, 1091, 17225, 8, 311, 16400, 22201, 458, 906, 11, 323, 