{"id": "64", "question": "what is the proper way to dispose of a worn usa flag", "gt": "The proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is either by separating the blue field from the flag and burning it in a peaceful manner before burying the ashes, or by conducting a proper ceremony where the flag is folded in the customary triangle fold and then burned.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony. The flag must be folded in the customary triangle fold.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony. The flag must be folded in the customary triangle fold.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony. The flag must be folded in the customary triangle fold.\", \"Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony. If you are able to personally discharge your worn flag from service, this ceremony is the proper way. The flag must be folded in the customary triangle fold.\", \"Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony. The flag must be folded in the customary triangle fold.\", \"Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony. If you are able to personally discharge your worn flag from service, the ceremony that follows is the proper way. The flag must be folded in the customary triangle fold.\"]", "time_sec": 13.761, "generation_time_seconds": 13.1223, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6283, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46