{"id": "67", "question": "what is the proper way to dispose of a worn usa flag", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn US flag is to either:\n\n1. Burn it in a peaceful manner, removing the blue field first and burying the ashes, or\n2. Perform a proper ceremony by folding the flag in a triangle fold before burning it.\n\nTherefore, the answer is: \"Option 1 or Option 2.\"", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony. If you are able to personally discharge your worn flag from service, the ceremony that follows is the proper way. The flag must be folded in the customary triangle fold.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony. If you are able to personally discharge your worn flag from service, the ceremony that follows is the proper way. The flag must be folded in the customary triangle fold.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony. The flag must be folded in the customary triangle fold.\", \"Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn the flag yourself in a proper ceremony. This involves folding the flag in the customary triangle fold.\", \"Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to either put it out for collection after removing the blue field and burning it peacefully with the ashes buried, or to burn the flag yourself in a proper ceremony by folding it in the customary triangle fold.\", \"Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony. If you are able to personally discharge your worn flag from service, the ceremony that follows is the proper way. The flag must be folded in the customary triangle fold.\"]", "time_sec": 14.17, "generation_time_seconds": 13.1594, "selection_time_seconds": 1.0006, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6169, 1616, 311, 27390, 315, 264, 23704, 7279, 5181, 374, 311, 8231, 432, 6133, 304, 264, 6169, 21536, 13, 576, 5181, 1969, 387, 47035, 304, 279, 72248, 21495, 11555, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn it yourself in a proper ceremony. The flag must be folded in the customary triangle fold.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4538117417181382, "g_worst_claim": 0.28651811679204303, "g_content": 1.804200702243381, "g_traj_mean": 1.5888477563858032}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6169, 1616, 311, 27390, 315, 264, 23704, 7279, 5181, 374, 311, 8231, 279, 5181, 6133, 304, 264, 6169, 21536, 13, 1096, 17601, 44742, 279, 5181, 304, 279, 72248, 21495, 11555, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to burn the flag yourself in a proper ceremony. This involves folding the flag in the customary triangle fold.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3030844007391604, "g_worst_claim": 0.28651811679204303, "g_content": 1.643825229845549, "g_traj_mean": 1.4437813758850098}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6169, 1616, 311, 27390, 315, 264, 23704, 7279, 5181, 374, 311, 2987, 2182, 432, 700, 369, 4426, 1283, 17592, 279, 6303, 2070, 323, 19675, 432, 66779, 448, 279, 66001, 26918, 11, 476, 311, 8231, 279, 5181, 6133, 304, 264, 6169, 21536, 553, 44742, 432, 304, 279, 72248, 21495, 11555, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the proper way to dispose of a worn USA flag is to either put it out for collection after removin