u like him.\n5. Pay attention to any signs of discomfort or suggestions from your male coworker that you should stop flirting. Losing your job should not be a risk when the person is not interested.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2880591345156778, "g_worst_claim": 0.2054358720779419, "g_content": 2.036165090707632, "g_traj_mean": 1.3108669519424438}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 3291, 421, 697, 8593, 59968, 261, 374, 87242, 448, 498, 11, 1401, 369, 11929, 315, 6961, 3645, 429, 1231, 387, 29671, 495, 3260, 438, 7244, 5702, 476, 21208, 2718, 11, 323, 22986, 421, 566, 4977, 28113, 476, 13230, 429, 498, 1265, 2936, 87242, 13, 22406, 11, 2908, 3425, 566, 374, 14971, 10887, 498, 700, 61404, 398, 11, 438, 419, 374, 264, 1841, 315, 36705, 476, 65839, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you, look for signs of physical contact that may be misconstrued as sexual activity or fondling, and observe if he seems uncomfortable or suggests that you should stop flirting. Additionally, consider whether he is constantly seeking you out discreetly, as this is a sign of affection or admiration.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4426802349334957, "g_worst_claim": 0.27036231756210327, "g_content": 2.908611297607422, "g_traj_mean": 1.6276824474334717}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 498, 646, 3291, 421, 697, 8593, 59968, 261, 374, 87242, 448, 498, 553, 44971, 279, 2701, 11929, 1447, 16, 13, 34006, 6961, 3645, 429, 655, 28146, 311, 7244, 5702, 476, 646, 387, 29671, 495, 3260, 438, 21208, 2718, 624, 17, 13, 1416, 279, 7412, 498, 2299, 87242, 448, 4977, 28113, 476, 13230, 429, 498, 537, 3060, 87242, 448, 1435, 11, 653, 773, 13, 1446, 1513, 944, 1366, 311, 5214, 13188, 697, 2618, 87242, 448, 1435, 11, 5310, 979, 566, 594, 537, 8014, 624, 18, 13, 5443, 432, 438, 458, 6638, 421, 498, 1366, 311, 728, 700, 448, 1059,