{"id": "74", "question": "how to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some signs that a male coworker may be flirting with you:\n\n* He finds reasons to be near you and seek you out discreetly (Passage 3)\n* He is always staring at you and catches your eye (Passage 2)\n* He touches you unnecessarily or finds excuses to have physical contact with you (Passage 2)\n* He smiles at you excessively or without apparent reason (Passage 2)\n* He seems uncomfortable or suggests that you not continue flirting with him (Passage 1)\n\nIf you observe these behaviors from a male coworker, it may be a sign that he is interested in you and flirting with you. However, it's essential to remember that these signs alone do not necessarily mean the person likes you romantically, and it's possible they just have a friendly interest in you. To confirm their intentions, consider observing their behavior over time, and if you feel comfortable, try initiating a conversation or asking them out.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you, look for signs such as:\n1. Physical contact that eludes to sexual activity or can be misconstrued as fondling.\n2. If the coworker seems uncomfortable or suggests that you not continue flirting with him, do so.\n3. If the coworker finds any reason to touch you, it is a sign of flirting.\n4. If the coworker always smiles at you at work when there is no good reason for it, she may like you.\n5. If the coworker is constantly at your desk and seeking you out discreetly, it's a guarantee that the person likes you.\n6. Finding any reason to have contact with you is an obvious sign of affection or admiration.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you, look for signs such as:\n1. Physical contact that eludes to sexual activity or can be misconstrued as fondling.\n2. If the coworker seems uncomfortable or suggests that you not continue flirting with him, do so.\n3. If the coworker finds any reason to touch you, it is a sign of flirting.\n4. If the coworker always smiles at you at work when there is no good reason for it, she may like you.\n5. If the coworker is constantly at your desk and seeking you out discreetly, it's a guarantee that the person likes you.\n6. Finding any reason to have contact with you is an obvious sign of affection or admiration.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you, look for signs such as:\\n1. Physical contact that eludes to sexual activity or can be misconstrued as fondling.\\n2. If the coworker seems uncomfortable or suggests that you not continue flirting with him, do so.\\n3. If the coworker finds any reason to touch you, it is a sign of flirting.\\n4. If the coworker always smiles at you at work when there is no good reason for it, she may like you.\\n5. If the coworker is constantly at your desk and seeking you out discreetly, it's a guarantee that the person likes you.\\n6. Finding any reason to have contact with you is an obvious sign of affection or admiration.\", \"Based on the given passages, if you want to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you, you can look for signs such as physical contact, stares, and frequent attempts to be near you. Specifically, if he initiates physical contact that seems to elude to sexual activity or can be misconstrued as fondling, and if he seems uncomfortable or suggests that you should stop flirting, then it's likely he is not interested. Additionally, if he frequently stares at you or seeks you out discreetly and has no good reason for it, this could be a sign of affection or admiration.\", \"Based on the given passages, here's how to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you:\\n\\n1. Avoid physical contact that suggests sexual activity or can be misconstrued as fondling. This is because it can make the coworker uncomfortable and risk losing your job.\\n\\n2. Look for signs of interest, such as smiling at you for no apparent reason. If your coworker always smiles at you when there's no good reason for it, she may like you.\\n\\n3. Observe if your coworker is constantly seeking you out discreetly. If she or he is always at your desk, it's a sign that the person likes you.\", \"Based on the given passages, here's how to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you:\\n1. Observe if he avoids physical contact that might be misconstrued as sexual or fondling. If he seems uncomfortable or suggests not continuing the flirtation, follow his lead.\\n2. Watch for signs of discomfort or disinterest when you try to interact with him. If he shows signs of discomfort or suggests not continuing the flirtation, it might be a sign he is not interested.\\n3. Notice if he consistently finds reasons to be near you or to have contact with you. This could be an obvious sign of affection or admiration.\"]", "time_sec": 27.816, "generation_time_seconds": 26.8541, "selection_time_seconds": 0.9433, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 3291, 421, 697, 8593, 59968, 261, 374, 87242, 448, 498, 11, 1401, 369, 11929, 1741, 438, 510, 16, 13, 27379, 3645, 429, 655, 28146, 311, 7244, 5702, 476, 646, 387, 29671, 495, 3260, 438, 21208, 2718, 624, 17, 13, 1416, 279, 59968, 261, 4977, 28113, 476, 13230, 429, 498, 537, 3060, 87242, 448, 1435, 11, 653, 773, 624, 18, 13, 1416, 279, 59968, 261, 13719, 894, 2874, 311, 5796, 498, 11, 432, 374, 264, 1841, 315, 87242, 624, 19, 13, 1416, 279, 59968, 261, 2677, 42532, 518, 498, 518, 975, 979, 1052, 374, 902, 1661, 2874, 369, 432, 11, 1340, 1231, 1075, 498, 624, 20, 13, 1416, 279, 59968, 261, 374, 14971, 518, 697, 18010, 323, 10887, 498, 700, 61404, 398, 11, 432, 594, 264, 15440, 429, 279, 1697, 13151, 498, 624, 21, 13, 42797, 894, 2874, 311, 614, 3645, 448, 498, 374, 458, 8036, 1841, 315, 36705, 476, 65839, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you, look for signs such as:\n1. Physical contact that eludes to sexual activity or can be misconstrued as fondling.\n2. If the coworker seems uncomfortable or suggests that you not continue flirting with him, do so.\n3. If the coworker finds any reason to touch you, it is a sign of flirting.\n4. If the coworker always smiles at you at work when there is no good reason for it, she may like you.\n5. If the coworker is constantly at your desk and seeking you out discreetly, it's a guarantee that the person likes you.\n6. Finding any reason to have contact with you is an obvious sign of affection or admiration.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.701496008693669, "g_worst_claim": 0.20511547724405924, "g_content": 2.893640350877193, "g_traj_mean": 1.818027377128601}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 421, 498, 1366, 311, 3291, 421, 697, 8593, 59968, 261, 374, 87242, 448, 498, 11, 498, 646, 1401, 369, 11929, 1741, 438, 6961, 3645, 11, 94402, 11, 323, 20757, 13553, 311, 387, 3143, 498, 13, 44763, 11, 421, 566, 12672, 973, 6961, 3645, 429, 4977, 311, 655, 793, 311, 7244, 5702, 476, 646, 387, 29671, 495, 3260, 438, 21208, 2718, 11, 323, 421, 566, 4977, 28113, 476, 13230, 429, 498, 1265, 2936, 87242, 11, 1221, 432, 594, 4363, 566, 374, 537, 8014, 13, 22406, 11, 421, 566, 13814, 94402, 518, 498, 476, 25654, 498, 700, 61404, 398, 323, 702, 902, 1661, 2874, 369, 432, 11, 419, 1410, 387, 264, 1841, 315, 36705, 476, 65839, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, if you want to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you, you can look for signs such as physical contact, stares, and frequent attempts to be near you. Specifically, if he initiates physical contact that seems to elude to sexual activity or can be misconstrued as fondling, and if he seems uncomfortable or suggests that you should stop flirting, then it's likely he is not interested. Additionally, if he frequently stares at you or seeks you out discreetly and has no good reason for it, this could be a sign of affection or admiration.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.1771023789290307, "g_worst_claim": 0.20511547724405924, "g_content": 2.687807379828559, "g_traj_mean": 1.424630045890808}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1588, 594, 1246, 311, 3291, 421, 697, 8593, 59968, 261, 374, 87242, 448, 498, 1447, 16, 13, 34006, 6961, 3645, 429, 13230, 7244, 5702, 476, 646, 387, 29671, 495, 3260, 438, 21208, 2718, 13, 1096, 374, 1576, 432, 646, 1281, 279, 59968, 261, 28113, 323, 5214, 13188, 697, 2618, 382, 17, 13, 9192, 369, 11929, 315, 2734, 11, 1741, 438, 36063, 518, 498, 369, 902, 9981, 2874, 13, 1416, 697, 59968, 261, 2677, 42532, 518, 498, 979, 1052, 594, 902, 1661, 2874, 369, 432, 11, 1340, 1231, 1075, 498, 382, 18, 13, 4657, 13267, 421, 697, 59968, 261, 374, 14971, 10887, 498, 700, 61404, 398, 13, 1416, 1340, 476, 566, 374, 2677, 518, 697, 18010, 11, 432, 594, 264, 1841, 429, 279, 1697, 13151, 498, 13, 151645], "pred": "3. Observe if your coworker is constantly seeking you out discreetly. If she or he is always at your desk, it's a sign that the person likes you.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.1414134931430762, "g_worst_claim": 0.20511547724405924, "g_content": 2.0913081067673702, "g_traj_mean": 1.2547578811645508}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1588, 594, 1246, 311, 3291, 421, 697, 8593, 59968, 261, 374, 87242, 448, 498, 510, 16, 13, 4657, 13267, 421, 566, 54852, 6961, 3645, 429, 2578, 387, 29671, 495, 3260, 438, 7244, 476, 21208, 2718, 13, 1416, 566, 4977, 28113, 476, 13230, 537, 14354, 279, 52630, 367, 11, 1795, 806, 2990, 624, 17, 13, 10357, 369, 11929, 315, 43676, 476, 827, 12724, 979, 498, 1430, 311, 16282, 448, 1435, 13, 1416, 566, 4933, 11929, 315, 43676, 476, 13230, 537, 14354, 279, 52630, 367, 11, 432, 2578, 387, 264, 1841, 566, 374, 537, 8014, 624, 18, 13, 24742, 421, 566, 20699, 13719, 7966, 311, 387, 3143, 498, 476, 311, 614, 3645, 448, 498, 13, 1096, 1410, 387, 458, 8036, 1841, 315, 36705, 476, 65839, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, here's how to tell if your male coworker is flirting with you:\n1. Observe if he avoids physical contact that might be misconstrued as sexual or fondling. If he seems uncomfortable or suggests not continuing the flirtation, follow his lead.\n2. Watch for signs of discomfort or disinterest when you try to interact with him. If he shows signs of discomfort or suggests not continuing the flirtation, it might be a sign he is not interested.\n3. Notice if he consistently finds reasons to be near you or to have contact with you. This could be an obvious sign of affection or admiration.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.9500651212295577, "g_worst_claim": 0.16340716679890951, "g_content": 1.859477556668795, "g_traj_mean": 0.9780278205871582}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 44.44, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 3.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "75", "question": "how to cook brats", "gt": "Based on the passages provided, the steps to cook brats are as follows:\n\n1. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook. \n2. Combine beer and onions in a large pot and bring it to a boil. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer, adding red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper.\n3. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\n4. In the meantime, preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat and lightly oil the grate.\n5. After simmering, remove the bratwurst from the beer mixture and reduce the heat to low, continuing to cook the onions.\n6. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning occasionally, for about 10 to 14 minutes until they are browned evenly.\n7. Serve the bratwurst with the beer and onion mixture as a topping or side.", "pred": "1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\n2. Lightly oil the grill grate.\n3. Combine the beer and onions in a large pot; bring to a boil.\n4. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer mixture.\n5. Add red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper to the pot.\n6. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook.\n7. Place the bratwurst in the pot with the onions, butter, and beer.\n8. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\n9. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning once, for 5 to 10 minutes.\n10. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\n2. Lightly oil the grill grate.\n3. Combine the beer and onions in a large pot; bring to a boil.\n4. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer mixture.\n5. Add red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper to the pot.\n6. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook.\n7. Place the bratwurst in the pot with the onions, butter, and beer.\n8. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\n9. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning once, for 5 to 10 minutes.\n10. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, here is how to cook brats:\\n\\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\\n2. Lightly oil the grill grate.\\n3. Combine the beer and onions in a large pot; bring to a boil.\\n4. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer mixture.\\n5. Add red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper to the pot.\\n6. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook.\\n7. Place the bratwurst in the pot with the onions, butter, and beer.\\n8. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\\n9. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning once, for 5 to 10 minutes.\\n10. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.\", \"Based on the given passages, to cook brats, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Preheat the grill to medium-high heat.\\n2. Lightly oil the grill grate.\\n3. Place the bratwurst in a large stock pot along with onions, butter, and beer.\\n4. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding during cooking.\\n5. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\\n6. Remove the bratwurst from the beer mixture and reduce the heat to low.\\n7. Cook the onions in the beer mixture for another 10 to 12 minutes.\\n8. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning once every 5 to 10 minutes.\\n9. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.\\n10. Optionally, brown the onions in butter for 1-2 minutes, stirring frequently to ensure even browning.\\n11. Cook the onions and bratwurst separately for better control over cooking times and to prevent overcooking the onions.\", \"Based on the given passages:\\n\\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat. When hot, lightly oil grate.\\n2. In a large pot, combine the beer and onions. Bring to a boil.\\n3. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer mixture; add red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper.\\n4. Prick bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding during cooking.\\n5. Place the bratwurst in the pot with onions, butter, and beer.\\n6. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\\n7. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning once, for 5 to 10 minutes.\", \"Based on the given passages, here is how to cook brats:\\n\\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\\n2. Lightly oil the grill grate.\\n3. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook.\\n4. Place the bratwursts in a large stock pot with the onions, butter, and beer.\\n5. Add the red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper to the pot.\\n6. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\\n7. Cook the bratwursts on the preheated grill, turning them occasionally to brown evenly, for 10 to 14 minutes.\\n8. Serve the cooked bratwursts with the beer mixture as a topping or side.\"]", "time_sec": 34.403, "generation_time_seconds": 33.4406, "selection_time_seconds": 0.949, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1588, 374, 1246, 311, 4296, 1411, 1862, 1447, 16, 13, 4968, 19963, 458, 15789, 39058, 369, 11051, 27561, 8628, 624, 17, 13, 8658, 398, 5590, 279, 39058, 85354, 624, 18, 13, 46812, 279, 12883, 323, 44597, 304, 264, 3460, 3338, 26, 4446, 311, 264, 43690, 624, 19, 13, 3719, 19052, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 304, 279, 12883, 20980, 624, 20, 13, 2691, 2518, 24353, 81623, 11, 30635, 16723, 11, 12021, 11, 323, 24353, 311, 279, 3338, 624, 21, 13, 2340, 865, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 448, 264, 22435, 311, 5358, 1105, 504, 72645, 438, 807, 4296, 624, 22, 13, 10771, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 304, 279, 3338, 448, 279, 44597, 11, 14100, 11, 323, 12883, 624, 23, 13, 10771, 279, 3338, 916, 11051, 8628, 323, 61815, 369, 220, 16, 20, 311, 220, 17, 15, 4420, 624, 24, 13, 12514, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 389, 279, 855, 383, 657, 39058, 11, 13054, 3055, 11, 369, 220, 20, 311, 220, 16, 15, 4420, 624, 16, 15, 13, 52932, 448, 279, 12883, 20980, 438, 264, 60276, 476, 3108, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\n2. Lightly oil the grill grate.\n3. Combine the beer and onions in a large pot; bring to a boil.\n4. Submerge the bratwurst in the beer mixture.\n5. Add red pepper flakes, garlic powder, salt, and pepper to the pot.\n6. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook.\n7. Place the bratwurst in the pot with the onions, butter, and beer.\n8. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\n9. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning once, for 5 to 10 minutes.\n10. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.169722484901412, "g_worst_claim": 0.11258728057146072, "g_content": 1.6823861258370536, "g_traj_mean": 1.0635695457458496}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 4296, 1411, 1862, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 4968, 19963, 279, 39058, 311, 11051, 27561, 8628, 624, 17, 13, 8658, 398, 5590, 279, 39058, 85354, 624, 18, 13, 10771, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 304, 264, 3460, 5591, 3338, 3156, 448, 44597, 11, 14100, 11, 323, 12883, 624, 19, 13, 2340, 865, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 448, 264, 22435, 311, 5358, 1105, 504, 72645, 2337, 17233, 624, 20, 13, 10771, 279, 3338, 916, 11051, 8628, 323, 61815, 369, 220, 16, 20, 311, 220, 17, 15, 4420, 624, 21, 13, 10783, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 504, 279, 12883, 20980, 323, 7949, 279, 8628, 311, 3347, 624, 22, 13, 12514, 279, 44597, 304, 279, 12883, 20980, 369, 2441, 220, 16, 15, 311, 220, 16, 17, 4420, 624, 23, 13, 12514, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 389, 279, 855, 383, 657, 39058, 11, 13054, 3055, 1449, 220, 20, 311, 220, 16, 15, 4420, 624, 24, 13, 52932, 448, 279, 12883, 20980, 438, 264, 60276, 476, 3108, 624, 16, 15, 13, 96195, 11, 13876, 279, 44597, 304, 14100, 369, 220, 16, 12, 17, 4420, 11, 53954, 13814, 311, 5978, 1496, 293, 50420, 624, 16, 16, 13, 12514, 279, 44597, 323, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 25156, 369, 2664, 2524, 916, 17233, 3039, 323, 311, 5358, 916, 1015, 10746, 279, 44597, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Preheat the grill to medium-high heat.\n2. Lightly oil the grill grate.\n3. Place the bratwurst in a large stock pot along with onions, butter, and beer.\n4. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding during cooking.\n5. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\n6. Remove the bratwurst from the beer mixture and reduce the heat to low.\n7. Cook the onions in the beer mixture for another 10 to 12 minutes.\n8. Cook the bratwurst on the preheated grill, turning once every 5 to 10 minutes.\n9. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.\n10. Optionally, brown the onions in butter for 1-2 minutes, stirring frequently to ensure even browning.\n11. Cook the onions and bratwurst separately for better control over cooking times and to prevent overcooking the onions.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.058177981084661, "g_worst_claim": -0.08470034599304199, "g_content": 1.5557835126163984, "g_traj_mean": 0.9525640606880188}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 1447, 16, 13, 4968, 19963, 458, 15789, 39058, 369, 11051, 27561, 8628, 13, 3197, 4017, 11, 33404, 5590, 85354, 624, 17, 13, 758, 264, 3460, 3338, 11, 15963, 279, 12883, 323, 44597, 13, 39124, 311, 264, 43690, 624, 18, 13, 3719, 19052, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 304, 279, 12883, 20980, 26, 912, 2518, 24353, 81623, 11, 30635, 16723, 11, 12021, 11, 323, 24353, 624, 19, 13, 2340, 865, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 448, 264, 22435, 311, 5358, 1105, 504, 72645, 2337, 17233, 624, 20, 13, 10771, 279, 1411, 266, 86, 32612, 304, 279, 3338, 448, 44597, 11, 14100, 11,