], "pred": "The audiobook will be available in the \"Audiobooks\" section in your iTunes library after the sync is complete.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.002342724748953, "g_worst_claim": 0.35668571790059406, "g_content": 1.486747176558883, "g_traj_mean": 0.9120504856109619}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 96145, 458, 46368, 73328, 504, 458, 12167, 311, 13025, 17601, 279, 2701, 7354, 510, 16, 13, 23205, 13025, 389, 697, 6366, 323, 4564, 697, 12167, 311, 279, 6673, 624, 17, 13, 9189, 389, 330, 32, 20536, 674, 14685, 1, 304, 279, 2115, 3383, 37322, 315, 279, 13025, 3241, 624, 18, 13, 8427, 279, 46368, 73328, 498, 1366, 311, 12811, 553, 18458, 279, 3745, 1790, 311, 279, 2265, 624, 19, 13, 13015, 697, 12167, 311, 279, 11348, 14652, 323, 19633, 279, 1008, 835, 1119, 264, 11348, 2635, 389, 279, 6366, 624, 20, 13, 13824, 369, 13025, 311, 12811, 279, 46368, 73328, 311, 697, 12167, 624, 21, 13, 4636, 279, 12811, 374, 4583, 11, 279, 46368, 73328, 686, 387, 389, 697, 12167, 624, 22, 13, 1446, 646, 1221, 1159, 279, 46368, 73328, 1119, 697, 13025, 6733, 553, 18458, 330, 11511, 1, 323, 26301, 279, 46368, 73328, 504, 279, 6673, 311, 912, 432, 311, 697, 16048, 3671, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, syncing an audiobook from an iPhone to iTunes involves the following steps:\n1. Launch iTunes on your computer and connect your iPhone to the PC.\n2. Click on \"Audiobooks\" in the left task pane of the iTunes window.\n3. Select the audiobook you want to sync by clicking the box next to the title.\n4. Connect your iPhone to the USB cable and plug the other end into a USB port on the computer.\n5. Wait for iTunes to sync the audiobook to your iPhone.\n6. After the sync is complete, the audiobook will be on your iPhone.\n7. You can then import the audiobook into your iTunes library by clicking \"Import\" and selecting the audiobook from the PC to add it to your iOS device.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.8945285149528205, "g_worst_claim": 0.33624080511239857, "g_content": 1.4008915845085592, "g_traj_mean": 0.8830764293670654}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 12811, 46368, 674, 14685, 504, 458, 12167, 311, 13025, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 23205, 13025, 389, 697, 6366, 624, 17, 13, 13015, 697, 12167, 311, 279, 6366, 1667, 264, 11348, 14652, 624, 18, 13, 9189, 389, 279, 829, 315, 697, 12167, 1212, 330, 40835, 1, 304, 279, 2115, 3250, 315, 13025, 624, 19, 13, 22201, 330, 24341, 1, 3403, 279, 1887, 13025, 3241, 624, 20, 13, 8427, 279, 46368, 674, 14685, 498, 1366, 311, 8317, 553, 18458, 279, 31300, 1790, 311, 862, 15311, 624, 21, 13, 9189, 330, 12154, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 323, 5157, 279, 46368, 674, 14685, 498, 1366, 311, 8317, 476, 3293, 330, 2403, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 311, 8317, 678, 315, 1105, 311, 279, 12167, 624, 22, 13, 9189, 330, 28497, 1, 518, 279, 5622, 315, 279, 4171, 311, 38101, 279, 96145, 1882, 624, 23, 13, 96195, 11, 498, 646, 4205, 330, 11511, 1, 311, 912, 501, 46368, 674, 14685, 504, 697, 6673, 311, 697, 16048, 7611, 382, 1359, 2701, 1493, 7354, 11, 498, 646, 7790, 12811, 46368, 674, 14685, 504, 697, 12167, 311, 697, 13025, 6733, 13, 151645], "pred": "By following these steps, you can successfully sync audiobooks from your iPhone to your iTunes library.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.8724014041686982, "g_worst_claim": -0.011885175853967667, "g_content": 1.2129994905911958, "g_traj_mean": 0.8257251977920532}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.86, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "101", "question": "how to sync audiobook from iphone to itunes", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to sync audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes:\n\n1. Turn on the Manually manage music setting in iTunes.\n2. Download the audiobook you want from iTunes.\n3. Connect your iPhone to the computer via USB cable.\n4. Click on \"Audiobooks\" on the left task pane of the iTunes window.\n5. Select the audiobook you want to sync by clicking on its title.\n6. Click \"Sync Audiobooks\" and choose the audiobooks you want to transfer.\n7. Click \"Apply\" to start the syncing process.\n\nAlternatively, you can use Syncios Audiobook Transfer to transfer audiobooks from your iPhone to iTunes. The software allows two-way transfer of files, so you can not only backup files to your PC but also transfer audiobooks from your PC to your iPhone. Here are the steps to use Syncios Audiobook Transfer:\n\n1. Launch Syncios Audiobook Transfer on your computer.\n2. Connect your iPhone to the computer via USB cable.\n3. Click on \"Audiobooks\" on the top menu bar.\n4. Select the audiobooks you want to transfer and click \"Export\" to save them to your computer.\n5. Alternatively, you can also click \"Import\" to add new audiobooks from your computer to your iPhone.\n6. Click \"Apply\" to start the transfer process.\n\nNote that the above steps are based on the assumption that you have already turned on the Manually manage music setting in iTunes. If you have not done so, you will need to do so before attempting to sync your audiobooks.", "pred": "This process ensures that the audiobook is synchronized from the iPhone to iTunes, making it available for further use or transfer to other devices.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "This process ensures that the audiobook is synchronized from the iPhone to iTunes, making it available for further use or transfer to other devices.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to sync an audiobook from an iPhone to iTunes, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Connect your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable.\\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\\n3. In the left pane of iTunes, click on \\\"Audiobooks.\\\"\\n4. Select the audiobook you want to sync by checking the box next to its title.\\n5. Click \\\"Sync Audiobooks\\\" and choose the audiobook you want to transfer or select \\\"All Audiobooks\\\" to transfer all of them.\\n6. Click \\\"Apply\\\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.\", \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"Based on the given passages, to sync an audiobook from an iPhone to iTunes, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Connect your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable.\\n2. Open iTunes on your computer and select your iPhone under the Devices section in the left column.\\n3. In the main iTunes window, click on \\\"Books.\\\"\\n4. Select the audiobook you want to sync from the list of books.\\n5. Click \\\"Sync Audiobooks\\\" and choose the audiobook you want to transfer or select \\\"All Audiobooks\\\" to transfer all of them.\\n6. Click \\\"Apply\\\" at the bottom of the screen to finish the syncing process.\\n\\nThis process ensures that the audiobook is synchronized from the iPhone to iTunes, making it available for further use or transfer to other devices.\", \"Based on the given passages, the steps to sync an audiobook from an iPhone to iTunes are as follows:\\n\\n1. Connect your iPhone to a computer using a USB cable.\\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\\n3. In the left column, click on the name of your iPhone under Devices.\\n4. Click on the \\\"Books\\\" section in the main iTunes window.\\n5. Select the audiobook you want to transfer by clicking the checkbox next to it.\\n6. Click the \\\"Sync Audiobooks\\\" button and choose the audiobook(s) you want to transfer or select \\\"All Audiobooks\\\" to transfer all of them.\\n7. Click \\\"Apply\\\" to start the syncing process.\\n8. Once the syncing is complete, the audiobook will be available in your iTunes library, ready to be synced to your iPhone again if needed.\"]", "time_sec": 26.004, "generation_time_seconds": 24.9547, "selection_time_seconds": 1.0296, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 12811, 458, 46368, 73328, 504, 458, 12167, 311, 13025, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 13015, 697, 12167, 311, 279, 6366, 1667, 264, 11348, 14652, 624, 17, 13, 5264, 13025, 389, 697, 6366, 624, 18, 13, 758, 279, 2115, 37322, 315, 13025, 11, 4205, 389, 330, 32, 20536, 674, 14685, 10040, 19, 13, 8427, 279, 46368, 73328, 498, 1366, 311, 12811, 553, 13295, 279, 3745, 1790, 311, 1181, 2265, 624, 20, 13, 9189, 330, 12154, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 323, 5157, 279, 46368, 73328, 498, 1366, 311, 8317, 476, 3293, 330, 2403, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 311, 8317, 678, 315, 1105, 624, 21, 13, 9189, 330, 28497, 1, 518, 279, 5622, 315, 279, 4171, 311, 4583, 279, 96145, 1882, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Connect your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. In the left pane of iTunes, click on \"Audiobooks.\"\n4. Select the audiobook you want to sync by checking the box next to its title.\n5. Click \"Sync Audiobooks\" and choose the audiobook you want to transfer or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them.\n6. Click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.40519649241735595, "g_worst_claim": 0.010829956084489823, "g_content": 0.4812780776113834, "g_traj_mean": 0.5606224536895752}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": -0.13939431309700012, "g_worst_claim": -0.13939431309700012, "g_content": -0.2330263376235962, "g_traj_mean": -0.1239367425441742}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 12811, 458, 46368, 73328, 504, 458, 12167, 311, 13025, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 13015, 697, 12167, 311, 279, 6366, 1667, 264, 11348, 14652, 624, 17, 13, 5264, 13025, 389, 697, 6366, 323, 3293, 697, 12167, 1212, 279, 40377, 3772, 304, 279, 2115, 3250, 624, 18, 13, 758, 279, 1887, 13025, 3241, 11, 4205, 389, 330, 24341, 10040, 19, 13, 8427, 279, 46368, 73328, 498, 1366, 311, 12811, 504, 279, 1140, 315, 6467, 624, 20, 13, 9189, 330, 12154, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 323, 5157, 279, 46368, 73328, 498, 1366, 311, 8317, 476, 3293, 330, 2403, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 311, 8317, 678, 315, 1105, 624, 21, 13, 9189, 330, 28497, 1, 518, 279, 5622, 315, 279, 4171, 311, 6248, 279, 96145, 1882, 382, 1986, 1882, 25351, 429, 279, 46368, 73328, 374, 21466, 504, 279, 12167, 311, 13025, 11, 3259, 432, 2500, 369, 4623, 990, 476, 8317, 311, 1008, 7611, 13, 151645], "pred": "This process ensures that the audiobook is synchronized from the iPhone to iTunes, making it available for further use or transfer to other devices.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.5127474843588574, "g_worst_claim": -0.08927381955660306, "g_content": 0.559554832569067, "g_traj_mean": 0.49554282426834106}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7354, 311, 12811, 458, 46368, 73328, 504, 458, 12167, 311, 13025, 525, 438, 11017, 1447, 16, 13, 13015, 697, 12167, 311, 264, 6366, 1667, 264, 11348, 14652, 624, 17, 13, 5264, 13025, 389, 697, 6366, 624, 18, 13, 758, 279, 2115, 3250, 11, 4205, 389, 279, 829, 315, 697, 12167, 1212, 40377, 624, 19, 13, 9189, 389, 279, 330, 24341, 1, 3772, 304, 279, 1887, 13025, 3241, 624, 20, 13, 8427, 279, 46368, 73328, 498, 1366, 311, 8317, 553, 18458, 279, 31300, 1790, 311, 432, 624, 21, 13, 9189, 279, 330, 12154, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 3137, 323, 5157, 279, 46368, 73328, 1141, 8, 498, 1366, 311, 8317, 476, 3293, 330, 2403, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 311, 8317, 678, 315, 1105, 624, 22, 13, 9189, 330, 28497, 1, 311, 1191, 279, 96145, 1882, 624, 23, 13, 9646, 279, 96145, 374, 4583, 11, 279, 46368, 73328, 686, 387, 2500, 304, 697, 13025, 6733, 11, 5527, 311, 387, 85028, 311, 697, 12167, 1549, 421, 4362, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Connect your iPhone to a computer using a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. In the left column, click on the name of your iPhone under Devices.\n4. Click on the \"Books\" section in the main iTunes window.\n5. Select the audiobook you want to transfer by clicking the checkbox next to it.\n6. Click the \"Sync Audiobooks\" button and choose the audiobook(s) you want to transfer or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them.\n7. Click \"Apply\" to start the syncing process.\n8. Once the syncing is complete, the audiobook will be available in your iTunes library, ready to be synced to your iPhone again if needed.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.3942001280603495, "g_worst_claim": -0.15859664479891458, "g_content": 0.6608483301450129, "g_traj_mean": 0.4123539626598358}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.04, "GAVIE-Rel": 2.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "102", "question": "how to sync audiobook from iphone to itunes", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's how to sync audiobooks from iPhone to iTunes:\n\n1. Connect your iPhone to your computer using a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. Click on the \"Audiobooks\" tab on the left side of the iTunes window.\n4. Check the boxes next to the audiobooks you want to sync to your iPhone.\n5. Click the \"Sync Audiobooks\" button and choose the audiobooks you want to transfer or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them to your iPhone.\n6. Click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to finish the syncing process.\n\nAlternatively, you can use Syncios Audiobook Transfer to transfer audiobooks from your computer to your iOS device. To do this, follow these steps:\n\n1. Launch Syncios Audiobook Transfer on your computer.\n2. Connect your iPhone to your computer using a USB cable.\n3. Click on the \"Books\" tab on the top menu bar.\n4. Select the audiobooks you want to transfer from your computer to your iPhone.\n5. Click the \"Import\" button to transfer the selected audiobooks to your iPhone.\n\nI hope this helps! Let me know if you have any further questions.", "pred": "To sync audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes, follow these steps:\n1. Connect your iPhone to the computer via a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. In the left pane of iTunes, click on \"Devices\" and select your iPhone.\n4. Expand the \"Books\" section in the main iTunes window.\n5. Select the audiobooks you want to transfer from the list.\n6. Click on \"Sync Audiobooks\" and choose the audiobooks you want to transfer, or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them.\n7. Click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.\n8. If you want to import new audiobooks from your PC to your iPhone, click \"Import\" to add them to your library.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "To sync audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes, follow these steps:\n1. Connect your iPhone to the computer via a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. In the left pane of iTunes, click on \"Devices\" and select your iPhone.\n4. Expand the \"Books\" section in the main iTunes window.\n5. Select the audiobooks you want to transfer from the list.\n6. Click on \"Sync Audiobooks\" and choose the audiobooks you want to transfer, or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them.\n7. Click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.\n8. If you want to import new audiobooks from your PC to your iPhone, click \"Import\" to add them to your library.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to sync an audiobook from an iPhone to iTunes, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Connect your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable.\\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\\n3. In the left pane of iTunes, click on \\\"Audiobooks.\\\"\\n4. Select the audiobook you want to sync by checking the box next to its title.\\n5. Click \\\"Sync Audiobooks\\\" and choose the audiobook you want to transfer or select \\\"All Audiobooks\\\" to transfer all of them.\\n6. Click \\\"Apply\\\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.\", \"Based on the given passages, to sync an audiobook from an iPhone to iTunes, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Connect your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable.\\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\\n3. In the left pane of iTunes, go to \\\"Audiobooks.\\\"\\n4. Select the audiobook you want to sync.\\n5. Click \\\"Sync Audiobooks\\\" and choose the audiobook you want to transfer or select \\\"All Audiobooks\\\" to transfer all of them.\\n6. Click \\\"Apply\\\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.\", \"To sync audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes, follow these steps:\\n1. Connect your iPhone to the computer via a USB cable.\\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\\n3. In the left pane of iTunes, click on \\\"Devices\\\" and select your iPhone.\\n4. Expand the \\\"Books\\\" section in the main iTunes window.\\n5. Select the audiobooks you want to transfer from the list.\\n6. Click on \\\"Sync Audiobooks\\\" and choose the audiobooks you want to transfer, or select \\\"All Audiobooks\\\" to transfer all of them.\\n7. Click \\\"Apply\\\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.\\n8. If you want to import new audiobooks from your PC to your iPhone, click \\\"Import\\\" to add them to your library.\", \"Based on the given passages, to sync audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes, follow these steps:\\n1. Open iTunes on your computer and connect your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable.\\n2. In the left pane of the iTunes window, click on \\\"Audiobooks.\\\"\\n3. Select the audiobooks you want to sync by clicking on the check box next to each audiobook title.\\n4. Click on \\\"Sync Audiobooks\\\" and choose the audiobooks you want to transfer, or select \\\"All Audiobooks\\\" to transfer all of them.\\n5. Click \\\"Apply\\\" at the bottom of the screen to start the syncing process.\\n6. If needed, you can also import new audiobooks to your iOS device by clicking on \\\"Import\\\" and selecting the audiobooks from your PC.\\n7. After syncing is complete, the audiobooks will be available in your iTunes library on your computer.\"]", "time_sec": 30.42, "generation_time_seconds": 29.2151, "selection_time_seconds": 1.1939, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 12811, 458, 46368, 73328, 504, 458, 12167, 311, 13025, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 13015, 697, 12167, 311, 279, 6366, 1667, 264, 11348, 14652, 624, 17, 13, 5264, 13025, 389, 697, 6366, 624, 18, 13, 758, 279, 2115, 37322, 315, 13025, 11, 4205, 389, 330, 32, 20536, 674, 14685, 10040, 19, 13, 8427, 279, 46368, 73328, 498, 1366, 311, 12811, 553, 13295, 279, 3745, 1790, 311, 1181, 2265, 624, 20, 13, 9189, 330, 12154, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 323, 5157, 279, 46368, 73328, 498, 1366, 311, 8317, 476, 3293, 330, 2403, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 311, 8317, 678, 315, 1105, 624, 21, 13, 9189, 330, 28497, 1, 518, 279, 5622, 315, 279, 4171, 311, 4583, 279, 96145, 1882, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Connect your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. In the left pane of iTunes, click on \"Audiobooks.\"\n4. Select the audiobook you want to sync by checking the box next to its title.\n5. Click \"Sync Audiobooks\" and choose the audiobook you want to transfer or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them.\n6. Click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.40519649241735595, "g_worst_claim": 0.010829956084489823, "g_content": 0.4812780776113834, "g_traj_mean": 0.5606224536895752}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 12811, 458, 46368, 73328, 504, 458, 12167, 311, 13025, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 13015, 697, 12167, 311, 279, 6366, 1667, 264, 11348, 14652, 624, 17, 13, 5264, 13025, 389, 697, 6366, 624, 18, 13, 758, 279, 2115, 37322, 315, 13025, 11, 728, 311, 330, 32, 20536, 674, 14685, 10040, 19, 13, 8427, 279, 46368, 73328, 498, 1366, 311, 12811, 624, 20, 13, 9189, 330, 12154, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 323, 5157, 279, 46368, 73328, 498, 1366, 311, 8317, 476, 3293, 330, 2403, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 311, 8317, 678, 315, 1105, 624, 21, 13, 9189, 330, 28497, 1, 518, 279, 5622, 315, 279, 4171, 311, 4583, 279, 96145, 1882, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to sync an audiobook from an iPhone to iTunes, you need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Connect your iPhone to the computer using a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. In the left pane of iTunes, go to \"Audiobooks.\"\n4. Select the audiobook you want to sync.\n5. Click \"Sync Audiobooks\" and choose the audiobook you want to transfer or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them.\n6. Click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.36490995236088636, "g_worst_claim": 0.011000999063253403, "g_content": 0.4375216293334961, "g_traj_mean": 0.5300048589706421}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 12811, 46368, 674, 14685, 504, 458, 12167, 311, 13025, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 510, 16, 13, 13015, 697, 12167, 311, 279, 6366, 4566, 264, 11348, 14652, 624, 17, 13, 5264, 13025, 389, 697, 6366, 624, 18, 13, 758, 279, 2115, 37322, 315, 13025, 11, 4205, 389, 330, 40835, 1, 323, 3293, 697, 12167, 624, 19, 13, 50141, 279, 330, 24341, 1, 3772, 304, 279, 1887, 13025, 3241, 624, 20, 13, 8427, 279, 46368, 674, 14685, 498, 1366, 311, 8317, 504, 279, 1140, 624, 21, 13, 9189, 389, 330, 12154, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 323, 5157, 279, 46368, 674, 14685, 498, 1366, 311, 8317, 11, 476, 3293, 330, 2403, 39828, 674, 14685, 1, 311, 8317, 678, 315, 1105, 624, 22, 13, 9189, 330, 28497, 1, 518, 279, 5622, 315, 279, 4171, 311, 4583, 279, 96145, 1882, 624, 23, 13, 1416, 498, 1366, 311, 1159, 501, 46368, 674, 14685, 504, 697, 6673, 311, 697, 12167, 11, 4205, 330, 11511, 1, 311, 912, 1105, 311, 697, 6733, 13, 151645], "pred": "To sync audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes, follow these steps:\n1. Connect your iPhone to the computer via a USB cable.\n2. Open iTunes on your computer.\n3. In the left pane of iTunes, click on \"Devices\" and select your iPhone.\n4. Expand the \"Books\" section in the main iTunes window.\n5. Select the audiobooks you want to transfer from the list.\n6. Click on \"Sync Audiobooks\" and choose the audiobooks you want to transfer, or select \"All Audiobooks\" to transfer all of them.\n7. Click \"Apply\" at the bottom of the screen to complete the syncing process.\n8. If you want to import new audiobooks from your PC to your iPhone, click \"Import\" to add them to your library.", "grounding_