{"id": "108", "question": "what is the difference between the leeward and windward islands?", "gt": "The Windward Islands are exposed to the wind of the northeast trade winds and are located on the southeastern side of the Caribbean Sea. The Leeward Islands, on the other hand, are located on the northwestern side of the Lesser Antilles and are away from the wind. The windward side receives more rain and is wetter, while the leeward side is drier but still receives some rain.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the leeward and windward islands is that the windward islands are exposed to the wind and receive more rain, making them wetter. The leeward islands, on the other hand, are away from the wind and receive less rain, making them drier.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the leeward and windward islands is that the windward islands are exposed to the wind and receive more rain, making them wetter. The leeward islands, on the other hand, are away from the wind and receive less rain, making them drier.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the difference between the leeward and windward islands is that the windward islands are exposed to the wind and receive more rain, making them wetter. The leeward islands, on the other hand, are away from the wind and receive less rain, making them drier.\", \"Based on the given passages, the difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands is that the Windward Islands receive more rain due to their exposure to the northeast trade winds, which results in them being wetter and having more rainfall. The Leeward Islands, on the other hand, are farther from the shore and receive less rain, making them drier but still getting some rainfall.\", \"Based on the given passages, the difference between the leeward and windward islands is that the windward islands are closer to the wind, are wetter, and receive more rain. In contrast, the leeward islands are farther from the wind and receive less rain, though they still get rain.\", \"Based on the given passages, the difference between the leeward and windward islands is that windward islands are closer to the wind and therefore receive more rain and are wetter, while leeward islands are farther from the shore and receive less rain but still get some rainfall. The passages do not specify the exact numbers of rain or provide further details; they provide an overview of the general conditions of each type of island.\"]", "time_sec": 18.412, "generation_time_seconds": 17.834, "selection_time_seconds": 0.5705, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 279, 512, 24035, 323, 9956, 1606, 29000, 374, 429, 279, 9956, 1606, 29000, 525, 14900, 311, 279, 9956, 323, 5258, 803, 11174, 11, 3259, 1105, 14401, 465, 13, 576, 512, 24035, 29000, 11, 389, 279, 1008, 1424, 11, 525, 3123, 504, 279, 9956, 323, 5258, 2686, 11174, 11, 3259, 1105, 294, 7253, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the leeward and windward islands is that the windward islands are exposed to the wind and receive more rain, making them wetter. The leeward islands, on the other hand, are away from the wind and receive less rain, making them drier.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.6276659637231093, "g_worst_claim": -0.039615952968597413, "g_content": 1.025068759918213, "g_traj_mean": 0.4565964937210083}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 279, 1967, 24035, 323, 22087, 1606, 22235, 374, 429, 279, 22087, 1606, 22235, 5258, 803, 11174, 4152, 311, 862, 14338, 311, 279, 40829, 6559, 28492, 11, 892, 3059, 304, 1105, 1660, 14401, 465, 323, 3432, 803, 52858, 13, 576, 1967, 24035, 22235, 11, 389, 279, 1008, 1424, 11, 525, 42626, 50