{"id": "109", "question": "what is the difference between the leeward and windward islands?", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the Windward Islands are located in the southeastern part of the Caribbean Sea and are exposed to the wind (\"windward\") of the northeast trade winds (northeasterlies), while the Leeward Islands are located in the northwestern part of the Lesser Antilles and are away from the wind (\"lee\"). The main difference between them is their exposure to the wind and the resulting climate. The Windward Islands get more rain and are wetter due to their exposure to the wind, while the Leeward Islands are drier but still get rain.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands is that the Windward Islands get more rain and are wetter because they are exposed to the wind (\"windward\") of the northeast trade winds (northeasterlies). The Leeward Islands, on the other hand, are the farthest from shore and are drier, but still receive some rain.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands is that the Windward Islands get more rain and are wetter because they are exposed to the wind (\"windward\") of the northeast trade winds (northeasterlies). The Leeward Islands, on the other hand, are the farthest from shore and are drier, but still receive some rain.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the difference between the leeward and windward islands is that the windward islands are exposed to the wind and receive more rain, making them wetter. The leeward islands, on the other hand, are away from the wind and receive less rain, making them drier.\", \"Based on the given passages, the difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands is that the Windward Islands get more rain due to their exposure to the northeast trade winds, while the Leeward Islands are farther from the shore and are drier but still receive some rain.\", \"Based on the given passages, the difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands is that the Windward Islands get more rain, are wetter, and are the side of the mountain closest to the ocean. On the other hand, the Leeward Islands are the farthest from shore and are drier but still receive some rainfall.\", \"Based on the given passages, the difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands is that the Windward Islands get more rain and are wetter because they are exposed to the wind (\\\"windward\\\") of the northeast trade winds (northeasterlies). The Leeward Islands, on the other hand, are the farthest from shore and are drier, but still receive some rain.\"]", "time_sec": 15.267, "generation_time_seconds": 14.3895, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8485, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 279, 512, 24035, 323, 9956, 1606, 29000, 374, 429, 279, 9956, 1606, 29000, 525, 14900, 311, 279, 9956, 323, 5258, 803, 11174, 11, 3259, 1105, 14401, 465, 13, 576, 512, 24035, 29000, 11, 389, 279, 1008, 1424, 11, 525, 3123, 504, 279, 9956, 323, 5258, 2686, 11174, 11, 3259, 1105, 294, 7253, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the leeward and windward islands is that the windward islands are exposed to the wind and receive more rain, making them wetter. The leeward islands, on the other hand, are away from the wind and receive less rain, making them drier.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.667971706023583, "g_worst_claim": -0.0154219388961792, "g_content": 1.1194727420806885, "g_traj_mean": 0.49256688356399536}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 279, 1967, 24035, 323, 22087, 1606, 22235, 374, 429, 279, 22087, 1606, 22235, 633, 803, 11174, 4152, 311, 862, 14338, 311, 279, 40829, 6559, 28492, 11, 1393, 279, 1967, 24035, 22235, 525, 42626, 504, 279, 30184, 323, 525, 294, 7253, 714, 2058, 5258, 1045, 11174, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands is that the Windward Islands get more rain due to their exposure to the northeast trade winds, while the Leeward Islands are farther from the shore and are drier but still receive some rain.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.8963179286869093, "g_worst_claim": 0.4032247066497803, "g_content": 1.6491816976796025, "g_traj_mean": 0.9987431168556213}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 279, 1967, 24035, 323, 22087, 1606, 22235, 374, 429, 279, 22087, 1606, 22235, 633, 803, 11174, 11, 525, 14401, 465, 11, 323, 525, 279, 3108, 315, 279, 16301, 18093, 311, 279, 17951, 13, 1913, 279, 1008, 1424, 11, 279, 1967, 24035, 22235, 525, 279, 3041, 60843, 504, 30184, 323, 525, 294, 7253, 714, 2058, 5258, 1045, 52858, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands is that the Windward Islands get more rain, are wetter, and are the side of the mountain closest to the ocean. On the other hand, the Leeward Islands are the farthest from shore and are drier but still receive some rainfall.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3344335754712424, "g_worst_claim": 0.4032247066497803, "g_content": 2.353936195373535, "g_traj_mean": 1.377044439315796}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 279, 1967, 24035, 323, 22087, 1606, 22235, 374, 429, 279, 22087, 1606, 22235, 633, 803, 11174, 323, 525, 14401, 465, 1576, 807, 525, 14900, 311, 279, 9956, 3489, 19154, 1606, 899, 315, 279, 40829, 6559, 28492, 320, 44707, 1782, 2300, 48101, 568, 576, 1967, 24035, 22235, 11, 389, 279, 1008, 1424, 11, 525, 279, 3041, 60843, 504, 30184, 323, 525, 294, 7253, 11, 714, 2058, 5258, 1045, 11174, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands is that the Windward Islands get more rain and are wetter because they are exposed to the wind (\"windward\") of the northeast trade winds (northeasterlies). The Leeward Islands, on the other hand, are the farthest from shore and are drier, but still receive some rain.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2068466203742558, "g_worst_claim": 0.05700386166572571, "g_content": 1.836302977341872, "g_traj_mean": 1.45503568649292}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 3, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 62.07, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "111", "question": "what is the difference between the leeward and windward islands?", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, the main difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands is their exposure to the wind and precipitation. The Windward Islands are exposed to the northeasterly trade winds and receive more rainfall, making them wetter and more humid, while the Leeward Islands are located on the leeward side of the mountains and receive less rainfall, making them drier. Therefore, the answer to the question is:\n\nThe Windward Islands are wetter and more humid due to their exposure to the northeasterly trade winds, while the Leeward Islands are drier and receive less rainfall.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands in the Lesser Antilles is that the Windward Islands are exposed to the wind (\"windward\") of the northeast trade winds (northeasterlies) and thus receive more rain, are wetter, and are the side of the mountain that is closest to the ocean. In contrast, the Leeward Islands are the northwestern islands of the Lesser Antilles and are away from the wind (\"lee\"), resulting in them being drier but still receiving some rain.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands in the Lesser Antilles is that the Windward Islands are exposed to the wind (\"windward\") of the northeast trade winds (northeasterlies) and thus receive more rain, are wetter, and are the side of the mountain that is closest to the ocean. In contrast, the Leeward Islands are the northwestern islands of the Lesser Antilles and are away from the wind (\"lee\"), resulting in them being drier but still receiving some rain.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the difference between the leeward and windward islands is that the windward islands are exposed to the wind and receive more rain, making them wetter. The leeward islands, on the other hand, are away from the wind and receive less rain, making them drier.\", \"Based on the given passages, the difference between the leeward and windward islands is that the windward islands are closer to the ocean and receive more rain, making them wetter, whereas the leeward islands are farther from shore and are drier but still receive some rain.\", \"Based on the given passages, the difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands is as follows:\\n\\n- The Windward Islands are exposed to the wind of the northeast trade winds, receiving more rain and being wetter.\\n- The Leeward Islands, being away from the wind, are drier but still receive some rain.\\n- The Windward Islands are southeastern islands of the Caribbean, while the Leeward Islands are the northwestern islands of the Lesser Antilles.\\n- Martinique is located in the Windward Islands.\\n- The terms \\\"Windward\\\" and \\\"Leeward\\\" are used to describe the exposure to the wind; \\\"windward\\\" means exposed to the wind, and \\\"leeward\\\" means away from the wind.\", \"Based on the given passages, the difference between the Leeward and Windward Islands in the Lesser Antilles is that the Windward Islands are exposed to the wind (\\\"windward\\\") of the northeast trade winds (northeasterlies) and thus receive more rain, are wetter, and are the side of the mountain that is closest to the ocean. In contrast, the Leeward Islands are the northwestern islands of the Lesser Antilles and are away from the wind (\\\"lee\\\"), resulting in them being drier but still receiving some rain.\"]", "time_sec": 21.363, "generation_time_seconds": 20.0562, "selection_time_seconds": 1.2955, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 279, 512, 24035, 323, 9956, 1606, 29000, 374, 429, 279, 9956, 1606, 29000, 525, 14900, 311, 279, 9956, 323, 5258, 803, 11174, 11, 3259, 1105, 14401, 465, 13, 576, 512, 24035, 29000, 11, 389, 279, 1008, 1424, 11, 525, 3123, 504, 279, 9956, 323, 5258, 2686, 11174, 11, 3259, 1105, 294, 7253, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the leeward and windward islands is that the windward islands are exposed to the wind and receive more rain, making them wetter. The leeward islands, on the other hand, are away from the wind and receive less rain, making them drier.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.667971706023583, "g_worst_claim": -0.0154219388961792, "g_content": 1.1194727420806885, "g_traj_mean": 0.49256688356399536}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 279, 512, 24035, 323, 9956, 1606, 29000, 374, 429, 279, 9956, 1606, 29000, 525, 12128, 311, 279, 17951, 323, 5258, 803, 11174, 11, 3259, 1105, 14401, 465, 11, 19853, 279, 512, 24035, 29000, 525, 42626, 504, 30184, 323, 525, 294, 7253, 714, 2058, 5258, 1045, 11174, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the difference between the leeward and windward islands is that the windward islands are closer to the ocean and receive more rain, making them wetter, whereas the leeward islands are farther from shore and are drier but still receive some rain.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.8883470321473804, "g_worst_claim": 0.4032247066497803, "g_content": 1.536508145539657, "g_traj_mean": 0.8697595000267029}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 6672, 1948, 279, 1967, 24035, 323, 22087, 1606, 22235, 374, 438, 11017, 1447, 12, 576, 22087, 1606, 22235, 525, 14900, 311, 279, 9956, 315, 279, 40829, 6559, 28492, 11, 12308, 803, 11174, 323, 1660, 14401, 465, 624, 12, 576, 1967, 24035, 22235, 11, 1660, 3123, 504, 279, 9956, 11, 525, 294, 7253, 714, 2058, 5258, 1045, 11174, 624, 12, 576, 22087, 1606, 22235, 525, 82109, 29000, 315, 279, 34274, 11, 1393, 279, 1967, 24035,