 owner of the property must provide proof of ownership.\\n3. A fee of $75.00 must be paid to process a Water Stock Certificate transfer.\\n4. A new Water Stock Certificate will be issued to the new owner of record.\", \"Based on the given passages, water shares are transferred by following these steps:\\n\\n1. The seller must return the Water Stock Certificate that was assigned to them and sign the back of the certificate.\\n2. The new owner of the property must provide proof of ownership.\\n3. A fee of $75.00 must be paid to process a Water Stock Certificate transfer.\\n4. A new Water Stock Certificate will be issued to the new owner of record.\", \"Based on the given passages:\\nWater shares can be transferred through the following steps:\\n1. The seller must return the Water Stock Certificate assigned to them and sign the back of the certificate.\\n2. The new owner of the property must provide proof of ownership.\\n3. A fee of $75.00 must be paid to process the Water Stock Certificate transfer.\\n4. A new Water Stock Certificate will be issued to the new owner of record.\", \"Based on the given passages, the process for transferring water shares involves the following steps:\\n\\n1. The seller must return the Water Stock Certificate that was assigned to them and sign the back of the certificate.\\n2. The new owner of the property must provide proof of ownership.\\n3. A fee of $75.00 must be paid to process the transfer of water shares.\\n4. A new Water Stock Certificate will be issued to the new owner of record.\\n\\nThese steps are outlined in both text blocks with minor variations in wording but the core steps remain consistent between them.\"]", "time_sec": 21.475, "generation_time_seconds": 20.6073, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8573, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 3015, 13248, 525, 22409, 1526, 279, 2701, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 576, 22856, 1969, 470, 279, 9959, 12648, 31402