, 646, 387, 18663, 13, 19219, 18513, 646, 387, 6707, 18663, 553, 6961, 5413, 11, 1393, 31146, 1373, 11483, 3363, 311, 8651, 862, 74064, 5424, 13, 34157, 525, 279, 1429, 5000, 311, 8651, 438, 807, 525, 279, 10526, 267, 1352, 315, 32055, 13, 151645], "pred": "4. Elements, compounds, and mixtures differ in how easily their components can be separated. Mixtures can be easily separated by physical methods, while compounds require chemical means to separate their constituent elements. Elements are the most difficult to separate as they are the purest form of substances.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.5108530171351535, "g_worst_claim": -0.1740271912680732, "g_content": 0.6108100277253952, "g_traj_mean": 0.49094223976135254}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 11799, 1948, 5424, 11, 31146, 11, 323, 6514, 18513, 525, 438, 11017, 1447, 16, 13, 34157, 525, 23415, 315, 1172, 825, 943, 315, 19124, 323, 525, 279, 10526, 267, 1352, 315, 264, 11483, 19699, 624, 17, 13, 13317, 3095, 525, 32055, 23415, 315, 1378, 476, 803, 2155, 5424, 323, 525, 10526, 32055, 13, 2379, 646, 387, 8424, 2673, 69141, 323, 862, 5888, 525, 12460, 504, 862, 74064, 5424, 624, 18, 13, 19219, 18513, 525, 6961, 27459, 315, 5424, 476, 31146, 1380, 279, 5479, 525, 537, 8424, 2673, 69141, 323, 14060, 862, 1828, 9569, 13, 19219, 18513, 646, 614, 3890, 61544, 323, 1473, 279, 5888, 315, 862, 74064, 32055, 13, 2379, 646, 387, 18663, 6707, 553, 6961, 3363, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Elements are composed of only one type of atom and are the purest form of a chemical substance.\n2. Compounds are substances composed of two or more different elements and are pure substances. They can be chemically bonded and their properties are distinct from their constituent elements.\n3. Mixtures are physical combinations of elements or compounds where the parts are not chemically bonded and retain their own identity. Mixtures can have variable compositions and show the properties of their constituent substances. They can be separated easily by physical means.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.9671988915604993, "g_worst_claim": 0.4550575017929077, "g_content": 1.4828045493678044, "g_traj_mean": 1.0286173820495605}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1588, 525, 279, 11799, 1948, 5424, 11, 31146, 11, 323, 6514, 18513, 1447, 16, 13, 34157, 25, 29588, 32055, 23415, 315, 1172, 825, 943, 315, 19124, 11, 448, 678, 32199, 3432, 279, 1852, 1372, 315, 462, 34411, 624, 17, 13, 13317, 3095, 25, 3719, 9436, 23415, 315, 1378, 476, 803, 2155, 5424, 11, 1380, 279, 5424, 525, 8424, 2673, 69141, 323, 14060, 862, 1828, 9569, 624, 18, 13, 19219, 18513, 25, 27379, 27459, 315, 5424, 476, 31146, 1380, 279, 5479, 525, 537, 8424, 2673, 69141, 323, 646, 387, 21893, 18663, 624, 19, 13, 33099, 367, 25, 34157, 323, 31146, 646, 387, 18663, 553, 6961, 3363, 11, 19853, 6514, 18513, 614, 264, 3890, 18037, 323, 1473, 279, 5888, 315, 74064, 32055, 624, 20, 13, 53828, 8023, 25, 1527, 3110, 315, 264, 20980, 374, 279, 16566, 11, 892, 5610, 5257, 44512, 429, 646, 387, 21893, 18663, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Elements: Pure substances composed of only one type of atom, with all atoms having the same number of protons.\n2. Compounds: Substances composed of two or more different elements, where the elements are chemically bonded and retain their own identity.\n3. Mixtures: Physical combinations of elements or compounds where the parts are not chemically bonded and can be physically separated.\n4. Separation: Elements and compounds can be separated by physical means, whereas mixtures have a variable composition and show the properties of constituent substances.\n5. Atmosphere: An example of a mixture is the atmosphere, which contains various gases that can be physically separated.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.9722074376585134, "g_worst_claim": 0.3880937099456787, "g_content": 1.1597194948058198, "g_traj_mean": 0.877989