1, 1795, 1493, 7354, 510, 16, 13, 95210, 279, 46622, 10378, 3421, 389, 279, 4889, 315, 697, 3753, 624, 17, 13, 10783, 279, 3421, 11, 22573, 279, 10378, 44239, 21521, 700, 421, 537, 4937, 6758, 476, 19046, 311, 279, 2114, 594, 27263, 624, 18, 13, 9590, 279, 4766, 315, 279, 14178, 1667, 264, 46622, 10378, 15625, 624, 19, 13, 10783, 279, 10378, 504, 279, 1182, 315, 279, 46622, 553, 6975, 837, 23593, 279, 10378, 41904, 323, 33832, 432, 700, 315, 279, 45711, 34731, 10284, 624, 20, 13, 9590, 279, 10378, 518, 279, 1182, 315, 279, 46622, 1667, 279, 46622, 10378, 15625, 624, 21, 13, 1032, 6459, 279, 10378, 323, 3271, 279, 46622, 1182, 2348, 279, 7002, 624, 49574, 11, 498, 646, 4240, 279, 5622, 4065, 6945, 315, 279, 46622, 323, 279, 3082, 2163, 279, 57920, 4051, 369, 17423, 15826, 13, 151645], "pred": "To clean a dryer vent, follow these steps:\n1. Locate the dryer vent cover on the outside of your house.\n2. Remove the cover, ensuring the vent duct slides out if not fastened or sealed to the home's exterior.\n3. Clean the inside of the hole using a dryer vent brush.\n4. Remove the vent from the back of the dryer by unscrewing the vent clamp and sliding it out of the elbow-shaped joint.\n5. Clean the vent at the back of the dryer using the dryer vent brush.\n6. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall.\nAdditionally, you can clean the bottom front panel of the dryer and the area around the lint filter for thorough cleaning.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.5505903271502788, "g_worst_claim": 0.09976427753766377, "g_content": 2.151162540211397, "g_traj_mean": 1.6589436531066895}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 65.12, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "259", "question": "how to clean dryer vent", "gt": "Sure, here's a brief answer to the question \"How to clean dryer vent\" based on the given passages:\n\nTo clean the dryer vent, start by locating the vent cover on the outside of the house and removing it. Then, remove the vent from the back of the dryer and use a dryer vent brush to clean the lint from the vent and the hole in the back of the dryer. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall. Additionally, consider removing the bottom front panel of the dryer and cleaning the area around the lint filter for a more thorough cleaning. Use a vacuum nozzle to clean the lint deposits and ensure your dryer runs efficiently.\n\nIf the passages did not contain the necessary information to answer the question, I would have replied with \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\"", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to clean a dryer vent, follow these steps:\n1. Locate the dryer vent cover on the outside of your house.\n2. Remove the cover; the vent duct should slide right out if it isn't fastened or sealed to the home's exterior.\n3. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from inside the hole.\n4. Remove the vent from the back of the dryer by unscrewing the vent clamp and sliding the vent out of the elbow-shaped joint.\n5. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from the vent as well as the hole in the back of the dryer.\n6. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall.\nAdditionally, you may want to remove the bottom front panel of the dryer and clean there also. Pay attention to the area around the lint filter, too. By removing the lint filter frame, easier access to lint deposits can be gained, and a vac nozzle can be slipped in for a more thorough cleaning. This will also help your dryer run as efficiently as it can.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to clean a dryer vent, follow these steps:\n1. Locate the dryer vent cover on the outside of your house.\n2. Remove the cover; the vent duct should slide right out if it isn't fastened or sealed to the home's exterior.\n3. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from inside the hole.\n4. Remove the vent from the back of the dryer by unscrewing the vent clamp and sliding the vent out of the elbow-shaped joint.\n5. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from the vent as well as the hole in the back of the dryer.\n6. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall.\nAdditionally, you may want to remove the bottom front panel of the dryer and clean there also. Pay attention to the area around the lint filter, too. By removing the lint filter frame, easier access to lint deposits can be gained, and a vac nozzle can be slipped in for a more thorough cleaning. This will also help your dryer run as efficiently as it can.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to clean a dryer vent, follow these steps:\\n1. Locate the dryer vent cover on the outside of your house.\\n2. Remove the cover; the vent duct should slide right out if it isn't fastened or sealed to the home's exterior.\\n3. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from inside the hole.\\n4. Remove the vent from the back of the dryer by unscrewing the vent clamp and sliding the vent out of the elbow-shaped joint.\\n5. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from the vent as well as the hole in the back of the dryer.\\n6. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall.\\nAdditionally, you may want to remove the bottom front panel of the dryer and clean there also. Pay attention to the area around the lint filter, too. By removing the lint filter frame, easier access to lint deposits can be gained, and a vac nozzle can be slipped in for a more thorough cleaning. This will also help your dryer run as efficiently as it can.\", \"Based on the given passages, to clean the dryer vent, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Locate the dryer vent cover on the outside of your house.\\n2. Remove the cover. The vent duct should slide right out if it isn't fastened or sealed to the home's exterior.\\n3. Using a dryer vent brush, remove the lint from inside the hole.\\n4. Remove the vent from the back of the dryer by unscrewing the vent clamp and sliding the vent out of the elbow-shaped joint.\\n5. Using a dryer vent brush, remove the lint from the vent as well as the hole in the back of the dryer.\\n6. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall.\\n7. While cleaning the vents, remove the bottom front panel of the dryer and clean there also.\\n8. Pay attention to the area around the lint filter.\\n9. By removing the lint filter frame, easier access to lint deposits can be gained, and a vac nozzle can be slipped in for a more thorough cleaning.\\n10. It will also help your dryer run as efficiently as it can.\", \"Based on the given passages, to clean a dryer vent, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Locate the dryer vent cover on the outside of your house.\\n2. Remove the cover; the vent duct should slide right out if it isn't fastened or sealed to the home's exterior.\\n3. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from inside the hole.\\n4. Remove the vent from the back of the dryer by unscrewing the vent clamp and sliding the vent out of the elbow-shaped joint.\\n5. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from the vent as well as the hole in the back of the dryer.\\n6. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall.\", \"Based on the given passages, to clean a dryer vent, follow these steps:\\n1. Locate the dryer vent cover on the outside of your house.\\n2. Remove the cover; the vent duct should slide right out if it isn't fastened or sealed to the home's exterior.\\n3. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from inside the hole.\\n4. Remove the vent from the back of the dryer by unscrewing the vent clamp and sliding the vent out of the elbow-shaped joint.\\n5. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from the vent as well as the hole in the back of the dryer.\\n6. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall.\\nAdditionally, consider removing the bottom front panel of the dryer and cleaning there also, and paying attention to the area around the lint filter. By removing the lint filter frame, easier access to lint deposits can be gained, and a vac nozzle can be slipped in for a more thorough cleaning. This will also help your dryer run as efficiently as it can.\"]", "time_sec": 36.031, "generation_time_seconds": 35.013, "selection_time_seconds": 1.0077, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 4240, 264, 46622, 10378, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 510, 16, 13, 95210, 279, 46622, 10378, 3421, 389, 279, 4889, 315, 697, 3753, 624, 17, 13, 10783, 279, 3421, 26, 279, 10378, 44239, 1265, 14983, 1290, 700, 421, 432, 4436, 944, 4937, 6758, 476, 19046, 311, 279, 2114, 594, 27263, 624, 18, 13, 12091, 697, 46622, 10378, 15625, 11, 4057, 279, 57920, 504, 4766, 279, 14178, 624, 19, 13, 10783, 279, 10378, 504, 279, 1182, 315, 279, 46622, 553, 6975, 837, 23593, 279, 10378, 41904, 323, 33832, 279, 10378, 700, 315, 279, 45711, 34731, 10284, 624, 20, 13, 12091, 697, 46622, 10378, 15625, 11, 4057, 279, 57920, 504, 279, 10378, 438, 1632, 438, 279, 14178, 304, 279, 1182, 315, 279, 46622, 624, 21, 13, 1032, 6459, 279, 10378, 323, 3271, 279, 46622, 1182, 2348, 279, 7002, 624, 49574, 11, 498, 1231, 1366, 311, 4057, 279, 5622, 4065, 6945, 315, 279, 46622, 323, 4240, 1052, 1083, 13, 11471, 6529, 311, 279, 3082, 2163, 279, 57920, 4051, 11, 2238, 13, 3216, 17592, 279, 57920, 4051, 4034, 11, 8661, 2615, 311, 57920, 33651, 646, 387, 18163, 11, 323, 264, 9283, 81881, 646, 387, 42478, 304, 369, 264, 803, 17423, 15826, 13, 1096, 686, 1083, 1492, 697, 46622, 1598, 438, 29720, 438, 432, 646, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to clean a dryer vent, follow these steps:\n1. Locate the dryer vent cover on the outside of your house.\n2. Remove the cover; the vent duct should slide right out if it isn't fastened or sealed to the home's exterior.\n3. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from inside the hole.\n4. Remove the vent from the back of the dryer by unscrewing the vent clamp and sliding the vent out of the elbow-shaped joint.\n5. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from the vent as well as the hole in the back of the dryer.\n6. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall.\nAdditionally, you may want to remove the bottom front panel of the dryer and clean there also. Pay attention to the area around the lint filter, too. By removing the lint filter frame, easier access to lint deposits can be gained, and a vac nozzle can be slipped in for a more thorough cleaning. This will also help your dryer run as efficiently as it can.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.8928875560085632, "g_worst_claim": 0.2583400209744771, "g_content": 2.3652812302714645, "g_traj_mean": 1.849066972732544}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 4240, 279, 46622, 10378, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 95210, 279, 46622, 10378, 3421, 389, 279, 4889, 315, 697, 3753, 624, 17, 13, 10783, 279, 3421, 13, 576, 10378, 44239, 1265, 14983, 1290, 700, 421, 432, 4436, 944, 4937, 6758, 476, 19046, 311, 279, 2114, 594, 27263, 624, 18, 13, 12091, 264, 46622, 10378, 15625, 11, 4057, 279, 57920, 504, 4766, 279, 14178, 624, 19, 13, 10783, 279, 10378, 504, 279, 1182, 315, 279, 46622, 553, 6975, 837, 23593, 279, 10378, 41904, 323, 33832, 279, 10378, 700, 315, 279, 45711, 34731, 10284, 624, 20, 13, 12091, 264, 46622, 10378, 15625, 11, 4057, 279, 57920, 504, 279, 10378, 438, 1632, 438, 279, 14178, 304, 279, 1182, 315, 279, 46622, 624, 21, 13, 1032, 6459, 279, 10378, 323, 3271, 279, 46622, 1182, 2348, 279, 7002, 624, 22, 13, 5976, 15826, 279, 80207, 11, 4057, 279, 5622, 4065, 6945, 315, 279, 46622, 323, 4240, 1052, 1083, 624, 23, 13, 11471, 6529, 311, 279, 3082, 2163, 279, 57920, 4051, 624, 24, 13, 3216, 17592, 279, 57920, 4051, 4034, 11, 8661, 2615, 311, 57920, 33651, 646, 387, 18163, 11, 323, 264, 9283, 81881, 646, 387, 42478, 304, 369, 264, 803, 17423, 15826, 624, 16, 15, 13, 1084, 686, 1083, 1492, 697, 46622, 1598, 438, 29720, 438, 432, 646, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Locate the dryer vent cover on the outside of your house.\n2. Remove the cover. The vent duct should slide right out if it isn't fastened or sealed to the home's exterior.\n3. Using a dryer vent brush, remove the lint from inside the hole.\n4. Remove the vent from the back of the dryer by unscrewing the vent clamp and sliding the vent out of the elbow-shaped joint.\n5. Using a dryer vent brush, remove the lint from the vent as well as the hole in the back of the dryer.\n6. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall.\n7. While cleaning the vents, remove the bottom front panel of the dryer and clean there also.\n8. Pay attention to the area around the lint filter.\n9. By removing the lint filter frame, easier access to lint deposits can be gained, and a vac nozzle can be slipped in for a more thorough cleaning.\n10. It will also help your dryer run as efficiently as it can.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.857038377060544, "g_worst_claim": 0.1561089058717092, "g_content": 2.26476813751517, "g_traj_mean": 1.762446403503418}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 4240, 264, 46622, 10378, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 95210, 279, 46622, 10378, 3421, 389, 279, 4889, 315, 697, 3753, 624, 17, 13, 10783, 279, 3421, 26, 279, 10378, 44239, 1265, 14983, 1290, 700, 421, 432, 4436, 944, 4937, 6758, 476, 19046, 311, 279, 2114, 594, 27263, 624, 18, 13, 12091, 697, 46622, 10378, 15625, 11, 4057, 279, 57920, 504, 4766, 279, 14178, 624, 19, 13, 10783, 279, 10378, 504, 279, 1182, 315, 279, 46622, 553, 6975, 837, 23593, 279, 10378, 41904, 323, 33832, 279, 10378, 700, 315, 279, 45711, 34731, 10284, 624, 20, 13, 12091, 697, 46622, 10378, 15625, 11, 4057, 279, 57920, 504, 279, 10378, 438, 1632, 438, 279, 14178, 304, 279, 1182, 315, 279, 46622, 624, 21, 13, 1032, 6459, 279, 10378, 323, 3271, 279, 46622, 1182, 2348, 279, 7002, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Locate the dryer vent cover on the outside of your house.\n2. Remove the cover; the vent duct should slide right out if it isn't fastened or sealed to the home's exterior.\n3. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from inside the hole.\n4. Remove the vent from the back of the dryer by unscrewing the vent clamp and sliding the vent out of the elbow-shaped joint.\n5. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from the vent as well as the hole in the back of the dryer.\n6. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.5819258076849365, "g_worst_claim": 0.2583400209744771, "g_content": 2.018731454702524, "g_traj_mean": 1.5759692192077637}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 4240, 264, 46622, 10378, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 510, 16, 13, 95210, 279, 46622, 10378, 3421, 389, 279, 4889, 315, 697, 3753, 624, 17, 13, 10783, 279, 3421, 26, 279, 10378, 44239, 1265, 14983, 1290, 700, 421, 432, 4436, 944, 4937, 6758, 476, 19046, 311, 279, 2114, 594, 27263, 624, 18, 13, 12091, 697, 46622, 10378, 15625, 11, 4057, 279, 57920, 504, 4766, 279, 14178, 624, 19, 13, 10783, 279, 10378, 504, 279, 1182, 315, 279, 46622, 553, 6975, 837, 23593, 279, 10378, 41904, 323, 33832, 279, 10378, 700, 315, 279, 45711, 34731, 10284, 624, 20, 13, 12091, 697, 46622, 10378, 15625, 11, 4057, 279, 57920, 504, 279, 10378, 438, 1632, 438, 279, 14178, 304, 279, 1182, 315, 279, 46622, 624, 21, 13, 1032, 6459, 279, 10378, 323, 3271, 279, 46622, 1182, 2348, 279, 7002, 624, 49574, 11, 2908, 17592, 279, 5622, 4065, 6945, 315, 279, 46622, 323, 15826, 1052, 1083, 11, 323, 12515, 6529, 311, 279, 3082, 2163, 279, 57920, 4051, 13, 3216, 17592, 279, 57920, 4051, 4034, 11, 8661, 2615, 311, 57920, 33651, 646, 387, 18163, 11, 323, 264, 9283, 81881, 646, 387, 42478, 304, 369, 264, 803, 17423, 15826, 13, 1096, 686, 1083, 1492, 697, 46622, 1598, 438, 29720, 438, 432, 646, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to clean a dryer vent, follow these steps:\n1. Locate the dryer vent cover on the outside of your house.\n2. Remove the cover; the vent duct should slide right out if it isn't fastened or sealed to the home's exterior.\n3. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from inside the hole.\n4. Remove the vent from the back of the dryer by unscrewing the vent clamp and sliding the vent out of the elbow-shaped joint.\n5. Using your dryer vent brush, remove the lint from the vent as well as the hole in the back of the dryer.\n6. Reconnect the vent and move the dryer back against the wall.\nAdditionally, consider removing the bottom front panel of the dryer and cleaning there also, and paying attention to the area around the lint filter. By removing the lint filter frame, easier access to lint deposits can be gained, and a vac nozzle can be slipped in for a more thorough cleaning. This will also help your dryer run as efficiently as it can.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.8793378224722492, "g_worst_claim": 0.2583400209744771, "g_content": 2.3489591637436225, "g_traj_mean": 1.8453643321990967}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 50.48, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "260", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "MSM powder offers several benefits. It helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, thereby increasing energy levels. It also makes cell walls more permeable. The powder aids in the absorption of more nutrients, particularly when paired with Co-enzyme Q10. Additionally, MSM powder can help relieve muscular aches and pains and reduce inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Improves oxygen efficiency: It helps the body get more oxygen into the blood with less effort.\n2. Increases energy: By making cell walls more permeable, it enhances energy levels.\n3. Aids nutrient absorption: It helps the body absorb nutrients more effectively.\n4. Reduces inflammation: It eases muscular aches and pains and reduces inflammation due to injuries or conditions like arthritis.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Improves oxygen efficiency: It helps the body get more oxygen into the blood with less effort.\n2. Increases energy: By making cell walls more permeable, it enhances energy levels.\n3. Aids nutrient absorption: It helps the body absorb nutrients more effectively.\n4. Reduces inflammation: It eases muscular aches and pains and reduces inflammation due to injuries or conditions like arthritis.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\\n2. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\\n4. Locks with Co-enzyme Q10 to aid in its utilization by the body.\\n5. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\\n6. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\\n7. Helps reduce swelling by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. Improves oxygen efficiency: It helps the body get more oxygen into the blood with less effort.\\n2. Increases energy: By making cell walls more permeable, it enhances energy levels.\\n3. Aids nutrient absorption: It helps the body absorb nutrients more effectively.\\n4. Reduces inflammation: It eases muscular aches and pains and reduces inflammation due to injuries or conditions like arthritis.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\\n1. Helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\\n3. Assisting in the absorption of nutrients like vitamins and minerals.\\n4. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder are as follows:\\n\\n1. Helps increase energy by making the cell walls more permeable.\\n2. Assists in the absorption of nutrients, particularly vitamins and minerals, due to its role as a co-enzyme with Coenzyme Q10.\\n3. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\\n4. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis by regulating the pressure inside and outside the cells.\"]", "time_sec": 21.32, "generation_time_seconds": 20.7754, "selection_time_seconds": 0.5366, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 88516, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 67048, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 88516, 34306, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 4292, 19, 13, 15701, 82, 448, 3539, 12, 64628, 1207, 16, 15, 311, 12296, 304, 1181, 49449, 553, 279, 2487, 624, 20, 13, 6512, 38135, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 21, 13, 3731, 62271, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 624, 22, 13, 88516, 7949, 54207, 553, 43363, 3015, 7262, 4766, 323, 4889, 7761, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Locks with Co-enzyme Q10 to aid in its utilization by the body.\n5. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\n7. Helps reduce swelling by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0480759471664167, "g_worst_claim": 0.3863019148508708, "g_content": 2.502796754998676, "g_traj_mean": 1.8690433502197266}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 21961, 2342, 23552, 15024, 25, 1084, 8609, 279, 2487, 633, 803, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 448, 2686, 5041, 624, 17, 13, 67048, 4802, 25, 3216, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 11, 432, 56824, 4802, 5866, 624, 18, 13, 362, 3365, 49023, 43125, 25, 1084, 8609, 279, 2487, 34306, 36393, 803, 13444, 624, 19, 13, 3731, 62271, 36040, 25, 1084, 384, 2264, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 323, 25271, 36040, 4152, 311, 14970, 476, 4682, 1075, 54552, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Improves oxygen efficiency: It helps the body get more oxygen into the blood with less effort.\n2. Increases energy: By making cell walls more permeable, it enhances energy levels.\n3. Aids nutrient absorption: It helps the body absorb nutrients more effectively.\n4. Reduces inflammation: It eases muscular aches and pains and reduces inflammation due to injuries or conditions like arthritis.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2654503598118363, "g_worst_claim": 0.3863019148508708, "g_content": 1.8071002570950254, "g_traj_mean": 1.1330534219741821}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 510, 16, 13, 90701, 311, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 73440, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 2688, 11083, 304, 279, 43125, 315, 36393, 1075, 45092, 323, 32972, 624, 19, 13, 6512, 83346, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 20, 13, 3731, 58044, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n1. Helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Assisting in the absorption of nutrients like vitamins and minerals.\n4. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6844720989021962, "g_worst_claim": 0.3848048448562622, "g_content": 2.3614392961774553, "g_traj_mean": 1.569068193435669}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 525, 438, 11017, 1447, 16, 13, 88516, 5263, 4802, 553, 3259, 279, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 17, 13, 2688, 1671, 304, 279, 43125, 315, 36393, 11, 7945, 45092, 323, 32972, 11, 4152, 311, 1181, 3476, 438, 264, 1062, 12, 64628, 448, 3539, 64628, 1207, 16, 15, 624, 18, 13, 6512, 38135, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 19, 13, 3731, 62271, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 553, 57399, 279, 7262, 4766, 323, 4889, 279, 7761, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder are as follows:\n\n1. Helps increase energy by making the cell walls more permeable.\n2. Assists in the absorption of nutrients, particularly vitamins and minerals, due to its role as a co-enzyme with Coenzyme Q10.\n3. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n4. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis by regulating the pressure inside and outside the cells.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4452848140747, "g_worst_claim": 0.3863019148508708, "g_content": 2.1742816501193576, "g_traj_mean": 1.4501357078552246}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 48.54, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "261", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "The benefits of MSM powder include helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, aiding in the absorption of nutrients, relieving muscular aches and pains, and reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n1. Helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Assisting in the absorption of more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Helping to relieve muscular aches and pains.\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis, by equalizing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n1. Helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Assisting in the absorption of more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Helping to relieve muscular aches and pains.\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis, by equalizing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\\n2. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\\n4. Locks with Co-enzyme Q10 to aid in its utilization by the body.\\n5. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\\n6. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\\n7. Helps reduce swelling by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\\n1. Helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently.\\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\\n3. Assisting in the absorption of more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\\n4. Helping to relieve muscular aches and pains.\\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis, by equalizing water pressure inside and outside cells.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. Increases energy efficiency by enhancing oxygen delivery to the blood with the same amount of work.\\n2. Increases energy by making cell walls more permeable.\\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients, specifically vitamins and minerals, when co-enzyme Q10 is present.\\n4. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\\n5. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases like arthritis by equalizing water pressure inside and outside cells.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\\n1. Improving oxygen flow in the blood\\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable\\n3. Helping to absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals)\\n4. Relieving muscular aches and pains\\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis\"]", "time_sec": 20.854, "generation_time_seconds": 19.9639, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8765, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 88516, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 67048, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 88516, 34306, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 4292, 19, 13, 15701, 82, 448, 3539, 12, 64628, 1207, 16, 15, 311, 12296, 304, 1181, 49449, 553, 279, 2487, 624, 20, 13, 6512, 38135, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 21, 13, 3731, 62271, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 624, 22, 13, 88516, 7949, 54207, 553, 43363, 3015, 7262, 4766, 323, 4889, 7761, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Locks with Co-enzyme Q10 to aid in its utilization by the body.\n5. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\n7. Helps reduce swelling by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0051431235206953, "g_worst_claim": 0.2910576065381368, "g_content": 2.4757077491889565, "g_traj_mean": 1.8430328369140625}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 510, 16, 13, 90701, 311, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 624, 17, 13, 73440, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 2688, 11083, 304, 279, 43125, 315, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 4292, 19, 13, 90701, 311, 47739, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 20, 13, 3731, 58044, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 11, 553, 6144, 4849, 3015, 7262, 4766, 323, 4889, 7761, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n1. Helping to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Assisting in the absorption of more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Helping to relieve muscular aches and pains.\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis, by equalizing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.8034261803978529, "g_worst_claim": 0.2910576065381368, "g_content": 2.420275812563689, "g_traj_mean": 1.6101493835449219}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 67048, 4802, 15024, 553, 46494, 23552, 9691, 311, 279, 6543, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 67048, 4802, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 88516, 34306, 803, 36393, 11, 11689, 45092, 323, 32972, 11, 979, 1062, 12, 64628, 1207, 16, 15, 374, 3042, 624, 19, 13, 6512, 38135, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 20, 13, 3731, 62271, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1075, 54552, 553, 6144, 4849, 3015, 7262, 4766, 323, 4889, 7761, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Increases energy efficiency by enhancing oxygen delivery to the blood with the same amount of work.\n2. Increases energy by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients, specifically vitamins and minerals, when co-enzyme Q10 is present.\n4. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n5. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases like arthritis by equalizing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.893597422390388, "g_worst_claim": 0.2910576065381368, "g_content": 2.464639734338831, "g_traj_mean": 1.7625136375427246}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 510, 16, 13, 21961, 4405, 23552, 6396, 304, 279, 6543, 198, 17, 13, 73440, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 198, 18, 13, 90701, 311, 34306, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 340, 19, 13, 6512, 83346, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 198, 20, 13, 3731, 58044, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n1. Improving oxygen flow in the blood\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable\n3. Helping to absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals)\n4. Relieving muscular aches and pains\n5. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.58435425369107, "g_worst_claim": 0.29013816515604657, "g_content": 2.069605777138158, "g_traj_mean": 1.3809113502502441}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 73.81, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "264", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of MSM powder:\n\n1. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable and allowing nutrients to be absorbed more efficiently.\n2. Helps reduce inflammation and swelling in muscles and joints.\n3. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n4. Enhances the absorption of vitamins and minerals, including Co-enzyme Q10.\n\nNote that the passages do not mention any other specific benefits of MSM powder beyond these points.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Helps increase energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n2. Assists in absorbing more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n3. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n4. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases like arthritis.\n5. Improves the efficiency of oxygen intake into the blood.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Helps increase energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n2. Assists in absorbing more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n3. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n4. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases like arthritis.\n5. Improves the efficiency of oxygen intake into the blood.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\\n2. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\\n4. Locks with Co-enzyme Q10 to aid in its utilization by the body.\\n5. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\\n6. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\\n7. Helps reduce swelling by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, allowing for more efficient oxygen intake.\\n2. Helping to absorb more nutrients like vitamins and minerals, with Co-enzyme Q10 working better in the presence of MSM.\\n3. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\\n4. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis, by balancing the water pressure inside and outside cells.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. Helps increase energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\\n2. Assists in absorbing more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\\n3. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\\n4. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases like arthritis.\\n5. Improves the efficiency of oxygen intake into the blood.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. Improving oxygen uptake in the blood.\\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\\n3. Helping the body absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\\n4. Reducing muscular aches and pains.\\n5. Decreasing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\"]", "time_sec": 20.826, "generation_time_seconds": 20.0154, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7932, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 88516, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 67048, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 88516, 34306, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 4292, 19, 13, 15701, 82, 448, 3539, 12, 64628, 1207, 16, 15, 311, 12296, 304, 1181, 49449, 553, 279, 2487, 624, 20, 13, 6512, 38135, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 21, 13, 3731, 62271, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 624, 22, 13, 88516, 7949, 54207, 553, 43363, 3015, 7262, 4766, 323, 4889, 7761, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Locks with Co-enzyme Q10 to aid in its utilization by the body.\n5. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\n7. Helps reduce swelling by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.988532325323346, "g_worst_claim": 0.2563653786977132, "g_content": 2.433732630842823, "g_traj_mean": 1.8281145095825195}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 73440, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 11, 10693, 369, 803, 11050, 23552, 22881, 624, 17, 13, 90701, 311, 34306, 803, 36393, 1075, 45092, 323, 32972, 11, 448, 3539, 12, 64628, 1207, 16, 15, 3238, 2664, 304, 279, 9362, 315, 67491, 624, 18, 13, 6512, 83346, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 19, 13, 3731, 58044, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 11, 553, 43363, 279, 3015, 7262, 4766, 323, 4889, 7761, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, allowing for more efficient oxygen intake.\n2. Helping to absorb more nutrients like vitamins and minerals, with Co-enzyme Q10 working better in the presence of MSM.\n3. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n4. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis, by balancing the water pressure inside and outside cells.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6766719590670596, "g_worst_claim": 0.2730017105738322, "g_content": 2.33642084458295, "g_traj_mean": 1.6065956354141235}}, 