{"id": "265", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n* Helping to increase oxygen efficiency in the blood\n* Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable\n* Enhancing nutrient absorption, particularly when taken with Co-enzyme Q10\n* Relieving muscular aches and pains\n* Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis\n\nTherefore, MSM powder has several benefits for overall health and wellness, including improved oxygenation, energy, and reduction of pain and inflammation.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Helping to increase energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, allowing for more efficient oxygen and nutrient absorption.\n2. Assisting in the absorption of nutrients (vitamins and minerals) by co-presenting with coenzyme Q10.\n3. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n4. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis, by balancing the water pressure inside and outside of cells.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Helping to increase energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, allowing for more efficient oxygen and nutrient absorption.\n2. Assisting in the absorption of nutrients (vitamins and minerals) by co-presenting with coenzyme Q10.\n3. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n4. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis, by balancing the water pressure inside and outside of cells.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\\n2. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\\n4. Locks with Co-enzyme Q10 to aid in its utilization by the body.\\n5. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\\n6. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\\n7. Helps reduce swelling by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. Helps to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\\n2. Increases energy by making cell walls more permeable.\\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\\n4. Locks with coenzyme Q10 to aid in utilizing it fully.\\n5. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\\n6. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis by addressing the water pressure inside cells.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. Helping to increase energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, allowing for more efficient oxygen and nutrient absorption.\\n2. Assisting in the absorption of nutrients (vitamins and minerals) by co-presenting with coenzyme Q10.\\n3. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\\n4. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis, by balancing the water pressure inside and outside of cells.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\\n\\n1. Increased energy levels due to improved oxygen absorption and permeability of cell walls.\\n2. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals) by co-enzyming with Coenzyme Q10.\\n3. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\\n4. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis by balancing water pressure inside and outside the cells.\"]", "time_sec": 20.765, "generation_time_seconds": 19.8661, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8893, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 88516, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 67048, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 88516, 34306, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 4292, 19, 13, 15701, 82, 448, 3539, 12, 64628, 1207, 16, 15, 311, 12296, 304, 1181, 49449, 553, 279, 2487, 624, 20, 13, 6512, 38135, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 21, 13, 3731, 62271, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 624, 22, 13, 88516, 7949, 54207, 553, 43363, 3015, 7262, 4766, 323, 4889, 7761, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Locks with Co-enzyme Q10 to aid in its utilization by the body.\n5. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.\n7. Helps reduce swelling by balancing water pressure inside and outside cells.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0072395311028695, "g_worst_claim": 0.3494686683019002, "g_content": 2.4441005900754766, "g_traj_mean": 1.84628164768219}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 88516, 311, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 67048, 4802, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 88516, 34306, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 4292, 19, 13, 15701, 82, 448, 1062, 64628, 1207, 16, 15, 311, 12296, 304, 34888, 432, 7225, 624, 20, 13, 6512, 38135, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 21, 13, 3731, 62271, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 553, 27020, 279, 3015, 7262, 4766, 7761, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Helps to get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increases energy by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals).\n4. Locks with coenzyme Q10 to aid in utilizing it fully.\n5. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis by addressing the water pressure inside cells.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.020559174815814, "g_worst_claim": 0.3494686683019002, "g_content": 2.7792437626765323, "g_traj_mean": 1.9228720664978027}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 90701, 311, 5263, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 11, 10693, 369, 803, 11050, 23552, 323, 49023, 43125, 624, 17, 13, 2688, 11083, 304, 279, 43125, 315, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 8, 553, 1062, 48024, 287, 448, 1062, 64628, 1207, 16, 15, 624, 18, 13, 6512, 83346, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 19, 13, 3731, 58044, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 11, 553, 43363, 279, 3015, 7262, 4766, 323, 4889, 315, 7761, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Helping to increase energy levels by making cell walls more permeable, allowing for more efficient oxygen and nutrient absorption.\n2. Assisting in the absorption of nutrients (vitamins and minerals) by co-presenting with coenzyme Q10.\n3. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n4. Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis, by balancing the water pressure inside and outside of cells.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.577183863617793, "g_worst_claim": 0.3494686683019002, "g_content": 2.5236924489339194, "g_traj_mean": 1.510498046875}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 61597, 4802, 5866, 4152, 311, 12944, 23552, 43125, 323, 54324, 2897, 315, 2779, 14285, 624, 17, 13, 88516, 34306, 803, 36393, 320, 54811, 37825, 323, 32972, 8, 553, 1062, 12, 16597, 1600, 287, 448, 3539, 64628, 1207, 16, 15, 624, 18, 13, 6512, 38135, 51092, 264, 8528, 323, 50166, 624, 19, 13, 3731, 62271, 36040, 4152, 311, 10895, 476, 46188, 18808, 1741, 438, 54552, 553, 43363, 3015, 7262, 4766, 323, 4889, 279, 7761, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Increased energy levels due to improved oxygen absorption and permeability of cell walls.\n2. Helps absorb more nutrients (vitamins and minerals) by co-enzyming with Coenzyme Q10.\n3. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n4. Reduces inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis by balancing water pressure inside and outside the cells.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.693034739119322, "g_worst_claim": 0.3485492467880249, "g_content": 2.6436432548191235, "g_traj_mean": 1.747166633605957}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 60.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "266", "question": "introduction to visual merchandising and relation to the consumer", "gt": "Visual merchandising is a strategy used by retailers to attract customers to their store and influence their buying behavior. It involves the presentation of the store and its merchandise in a way that aligns with the retailer's goals and marketing strategy. The visual merchandiser's role is crucial as they not only help bring customers to the store but also influence their purchasing decisions, akin to \"making the horse drink\" as per G. Surrendar's analogy. Particularly, visual merchandising related to shop windows has been found to significantly impact consumer buying behavior, with variations observed based on gender and the store attributes most valued by consumers in shopping centers.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, visual merchandising is a strategy employed by retailers to attract and engage customers in their stores. It involves the visual presentation of products and the overall store environment to project the retail strategy and align with the company's goals. This practice is crucial in enhancing consumer buying behavior. Visual merchandising is not merely about displaying products; it aims to make the products appealing and relatable to potential customers. In the context of shop windows, visual merchandising is particularly influential in shaping consumer buying decisions. The study in passage 3 highlights the impact of visual merchandising, especially through shop windows, on consumer behavior, suggesting that it significantly influences how consumers perceive and interact with products in a retail environment.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, visual merchandising is a strategy employed by retailers to attract and engage customers in their stores. It involves the visual presentation of products and the overall store environment to project the retail strategy and align with the company's goals. This practice is crucial in enhancing consumer buying behavior. Visual merchandising is not merely about displaying products; it aims to make the products appealing and relatable to potential customers. In the context of shop windows, visual merchandising is particularly influential in shaping consumer buying decisions. The study in passage 3 highlights the impact of visual merchandising, especially through shop windows, on consumer behavior, suggesting that it significantly influences how consumers perceive and interact with products in a retail environment.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, visual merchandising is a strategy used by retailers to attract customers to their stores. It involves creating an appealing visual display that aligns with the retail strategy and company goals. This approach is more effective than relying solely on advertising, as it engages customers directly in the store environment. Visual merchandising is crucial in influencing consumer behavior, particularly in shopping centers, where it can impact the buying decisions of different genders and influence the perception of store attributes.\", \"Based on the given passages, visual merchandising plays a crucial role in connecting the retail strategy and company goals with consumer behavior. The visual merchandiser is aware of these factors and projects them in the store. Earlier, advertising was the sole media for attracting customers, but now, visual merchandising is pivotal in bringing customers closer to the shopping experience.\\n\\nVisual merchandising is described as making the \\\"horse drink\\\" after marketing has brought the horse to the water, indicating its importance in engaging customers. This chapter aims to understand the theoretical aspects of visual merchandising and explain its impact on consumer behavior, particularly focusing on the influence of shop windows on consumer buying behavior according to their sex and the store attributes most valued by consumers in shopping centers.\", \"Based on the given passages, visual merchandising is a strategy where the merchandiser is aware of the retail strategy and company goals to project them in the store. While earlier retailers used advertising as the only media to attract customers, visual merchandising enhances the store's appeal by making the advertised product more appealing and drawing customers in. This strategy is so effective that it is likened to marketing bringing the horse to the water, while visual merchandising makes the horse drink. The role of visual merchandising is to influence consumer buying behavior, particularly through shop windows, and to study the attributes most valued by consumers in shopping centers.\", \"Based on the given passages, visual merchandising is a strategy employed by retailers to attract and engage customers in their stores. It involves the visual presentation of products and the overall store environment to project the retail strategy and align with the company's goals. This practice is crucial in enhancing consumer buying behavior. Visual merchandising is not merely about displaying products; it aims to make the products appealing and relatable to potential customers. In the context of shop windows, visual merchandising is particularly influential in shaping consumer buying decisions. The study in passage 3 highlights the impact of visual merchandising, especially through shop windows, on consumer behavior, suggesting that it significantly influences how consumers perceive and interact with products in a retail environment.\"]", "time_sec": 27.019, "generation_time_seconds": 26.4457, "selection_time_seconds": 0.5639, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 374, 264, 8282, 1483, 553, 29182, 311, 9320, 6310, 311, 862, 10533, 13, 1084, 17601, 6825, 458, 32252, 9124, 3037, 429, 5285, 82, 448, 279, 10806, 8282, 323, 2813, 8845, 13, 1096, 5486, 374, 803, 7373, 1091, 38561, 21063, 389, 12876, 11, 438, 432, 68489, 6310, 5961, 304, 279, 3553, 4573, 13, 20185, 21733, 437, 3791, 374, 16587, 304, 65600, 11502, 7709, 11, 7945, 304, 11919, 18652, 11, 1380, 432, 646, 5421, 279, 11833, 11181, 315, 2155, 81328, 323, 10173, 279, 20431, 315, 3553, 8201, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, visual merchandising is a strategy used by retailers to attract customers to their stores. It involves creating an appealing visual display that aligns with the retail strategy and company goals. This approach is more effective than relying solely on advertising, as it engages customers directly in the store environment. Visual merchandising is crucial in influencing consumer behavior, particularly in shopping centers, where it can impact the buying decisions of different genders and influence the perception of store attributes.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.157626936556821, "g_worst_claim": 0.36614763736724854, "g_content": 1.9436488248864, "g_traj_mean": 1.204241156578064}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 11088, 264, 16587, 3476, 304, 20913, 279, 10806, 8282, 323, 2813, 8845, 448, 11502, 7709, 13, 576, 9124, 21733, 437, 12059, 374, 7853, 315, 1493, 9363, 323, 7079, 1105, 304, 279, 3553, 13, 46893, 11, 12876, 572, 279, 13309, 3687, 369, 50547, 6310, 11, 714, 1431, 11, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 374, 59750, 304, 12678, 6310, 12128, 311, 279, 11919, 3139, 382, 9594, 21733, 437, 3791, 374, 7481, 438, 3259, 279, 330, 59675, 7027, 1, 1283, 8493, 702, 7117, 279, 15223, 311, 279, 3015, 11, 18860, 1181, 12650, 304, 22570, 6310, 13, 1096, 12453, 21538, 311, 3535, 279, 31787, 13566, 315, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 323, 10339, 1181, 5421, 389, 11502, 7709, 11, 7945, 21080, 389, 279, 10173, 315, 8061, 11030, 389, 11502, 11833, 7709, 4092, 311, 862, 1839, 323, 279, 3553, 82