 the horse drink. The role of visual merchandising is to influence consumer buying behavior, particularly through shop windows, and to study the attributes most valued by consumers in shopping centers.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.919145982380333, "g_worst_claim": 0.4569949706395467, "g_content": 3.067035675048828, "g_traj_mean": 1.8929460048675537}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 374, 264, 8282, 19446, 553, 29182, 311, 9320, 323, 16579, 6310, 304, 862, 10533, 13, 1084, 17601, 279, 9124, 15496, 315, 3871, 323, 279, 8084, 3553, 4573, 311, 2390, 279, 10806, 8282, 323, 5285, 448, 279, 2813, 594, 8845, 13, 1096, 6588, 374, 16587, 304, 46494, 11502, 11833, 7709, 13, 20185, 21733, 437, 3791, 374, 537, 16234, 911, 27940, 3871, 26, 432, 21538, 311, 1281, 279, 3871, 32252, 323, 1351, 15086, 311, 4650, 6310, 13, 758, 279, 2266, 315, 8061, 11030, 11, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 374, 7945, 31449, 304, 45520, 11502, 11833, 11181, 13, 576, 3920, 304, 21085, 220, 18, 21314, 279, 5421, 315, 9124, 21733, 437, 3791, 11, 5310, 1526, 8061, 11030, 11, 389, 11502, 7709, 11, 22561, 429, 432, 11941, 33353, 1246, 13417, 44393, 323, 16282, 448, 3871, 304, 264, 10806, 4573, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, visual merchandising is a strategy employed by retailers to attract and engage customers in their stores. It involves the visual presentation of products and the overall store environment to project the retail strategy and align with the company's goals. This practice is crucial in enhancing consumer buying behavior. Visual merchandising is not merely about displaying products; it aims to make the products appealing and relatable to potential customers. In the context of shop windows, visual merchandising is particularly influential in shaping consumer buying decisions. The study in passage 3 highlights the impact of visual merchandising, especially through shop windows, on consumer behavior, suggesting that it significantly influences how consumers perceive and interact with products in a retail environment.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.9729851692445881, "g_worst_claim": 0.15386605262756348, "g_content": 1.6306707021352407, "g_traj_mean": 0.965641975402832}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 3, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 41.06, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "271", "question": "earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy", "gt": "The earliest signs of pregnancy often include mood swings and unusual emotional behavior due to a flood of hormones in the body. Dizziness can also occur as pregnancy causes blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop. Other early symptoms can include a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping. Approximately half of all pregnant women experience nausea and vomiting, and around 3 in 10 women experience nausea without vomiting, with these symptoms typically starting around six weeks after their last period.", "pred": "Based on the given passages:\n\n1. A missed period is a common early sign of pregnancy.\n2. Bloating, spotting, and cramping can also be signs of pregnancy.\n3. Nausea and vomiting are common symptoms of pregnancy, starting around six weeks after the last period for most women.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages:\n\n1. A missed period is a common early sign of pregnancy.\n2. Bloating, spotting, and cramping can also be signs of pregnancy.\n3. Nausea and vomiting are common symptoms of pregnancy, starting around six weeks after the last period for most women.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\\n1. Missed period\\n2. Bloating\\n3. Spotting\\n4. Cramping\\n5. Mood swings\\n6. Dizziness\\n7. Nausea and vomiting (for some women)\\n8. Lightheadedness or dizziness due to blood vessel dilation and drop in blood pressure\", \"Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy mentioned include:\\n1. Mood swings due to hormonal changes in the body.\\n2. Dizziness caused by blood vessel dilation and low blood pressure.\\n3. Missed period.\\n4. Bloating.\\n5. Spotting.\\n6. Cramping.\", \"Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\\n1. Missed period\\n2. Bloating\\n3. Spotting\\n4. Cramping\\n5. Mood swings\\n6. Dizziness\\n7. Nausea and vomiting (around half of all pregnant women)\", \"Based on the given passages:\\n\\n1. A missed period is a common early sign of pregnancy.\\n2. Bloating, spotting, and cramping can also be signs of pregnancy.\\n3. Nausea and vomiting are common symptoms of pregnancy, starting around six weeks after the last period for most women.\"]", "time_sec": 15.917, "generation_time_seconds": 15.1248, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7832, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 2924, 510, 16, 13, 8906, 291, 4168, 198, 17, 13, 425, 28493, 198, 18, 13, 23297, 1280, 198, 19, 13, 4553, 30457, 198, 20, 13, 93567, 56790, 198, 21, 13, 422, 96645, 198, 22, 13, 451, 3454, 64, 323, 62471, 320, 1958, 1045, 3198, 340, 23, 13, 444, 1090, 11417, 291, 2090, 476, 294, 96645, 4152, 311, 6543, 26182, 74278, 323, 5943, 304, 6543, 7262, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\n1. Missed period\n2. Bloating\n3. Spotting\n4. Cramping\n5. Mood swings\n6. Dizziness\n7. Nausea and vomiting (for some women)\n8. Lightheadedness or dizziness due to blood vessel dilation and drop in blood pressure", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.0019481380780537, "g_worst_claim": 0.22754557927449545, "g_content": 1.3836355770335478, "g_traj_mean": 1.0169123411178589}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 9733, 2924, 510, 16, 13, 93567, 56790, 4152, 311, 73118, 4344, 304, 279, 2487, 624, 17, 13, 422, 96645, 8881, 553, 6543, 26182, 74278, 323, 3347, 6543, 7262, 624, 18, 13, 8906, 291, 4168, 624, 19, 13, 425, 28493, 624, 20, 13, 23297, 1280, 624, 21, 13, 4553, 30457, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy mentioned include:\n1. Mood swings due to hormonal changes in the body.\n2. Dizziness caused by blood vessel dilation and low blood pressure.\n3. Missed period.\n4. Bloating.\n5. Spotting.\n6. Cramping.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.9690040711200598, "g_worst_claim": 0.06484744283888075, "g_content": 1.1873072999896426, "g_traj_mean": 0.9158881306648254}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 2924, 510, 16, 13, 8906, 291, 4168, 198, 17, 13, 425, 28493, 198, 18, 13, 23297, 1280, 198, 19, 13, 4553, 30457, 198, 20, 13, 93567, 56790, 198, 21, 13, 422, 96645, 198, 22, 13, 451, 3454, 64, 323, 62471, 320, 19454, 4279, 315, 678, 20280, 3198, 8, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\n1. Missed period\n2. Bloating\n3. Spotting\n4. Cramping\n5. Mood swings\n6. Dizziness\n7. Nausea and vomiting (around half of all pregnant women)", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.8475091912807562, "g_worst_claim": 0.24028690656026205, "g_content": 1.4035178593226842, "g_traj_mean": 0.8558998107910156}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 1447, 16, 13, 362, 13628, 4168, 374, 264, 4185, 4124, 1841, 315, 19636, 624, 17, 13, 425, 28493, 11, 89219, 11, 323, 1560, 30457, 646, 1083, 387, 11929, 315, 19636, 624, 18, 13, 451, 3454, 64, 323, 62471, 525, 4185, 13495, 315, 19636, 11, 5916, 2163, 4743, 5555, 1283, 279, 1537, 4168, 369, 1429, 3198, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages:\n\n1. A missed period is a common early sign of pregnancy.\n2. Bloating, spotting, and cramping can also be signs of pregnancy.\n3. Nausea and vomiting are common symptoms of pregnancy, starting around six weeks after the last period for most women.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.7554157669375641, "g_worst_claim": 0.34141752936623315, "g_content": 1.0568251927693686, "g_traj_mean": 0.881888747215271}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 3, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 47.92, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "272", "question": "earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy", "gt": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, dizziness, bloating, spotting, cramping, nausea, and vomiting.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\n1. A missed period\n2. Bloating\n3. Spotting\n4. Cramping", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\n1. A missed period\n2. Bloating\n3. Spotting\n4. Cramping", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\\n1. Missed period\\n2. Bloating\\n3. Spotting\\n4. Cramping\\n5. Mood swings\\n6. Dizziness\\n7. Nausea and vomiting (for some women)\\n8. Lightheadedness or dizziness due to blood vessel dilation and drop in blood pressure\", \"Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\\n1. Missed period\\n2. Bloating\\n3. Spotting\\n4. Cramping\\nThese symptoms can often be easily overlooked and may be among the first indications that a woman is pregnant.\", \"Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\\n1. A missed period\\n2. Bloating\\n3. Spotting\\n4. Cramping\", \"The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy can include a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping. These symptoms may be easily overlooked. Mood swings, dizziness, nausea, and vomiting are also common in pregnancy, with nausea starting around six weeks after the last period.\"]", "time_sec": 14.3, "generation_time_seconds": 13.6998, "selection_time_seconds": 0.5895, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 2924, 510, 16, 13, 8906, 291, 4168, 198, 17, 13, 425, 28493, 198, 18, 13, 23297, 1280, 198, 19, 13, 4553, 30457, 198, 20, 13, 93567, 56790, 198, 21, 13, 422, 96645, 198, 22, 13, 451, 3454, 64, 323, 62471, 320, 1958, 1045, 3198, 340, 23, 13, 444, 1090, 11417, 291, 2090, 476, 294, 96645, 4152, 311, 6543, 26182, 74278, 323, 5943, 304, 6543, 7262, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\n1. Missed period\n2. Bloating\n3. Spotting\n4. Cramping\n5. Mood swings\n6. Dizziness\n7. Nausea and vomiting (for some women)\n8. Lightheadedness or dizziness due to blood vessel dilation and drop in blood pressure", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.0019481380780537, "g_worst_claim": 0.22754557927449545, "g_content": 1.3836355770335478, "g_traj_mean": 1.0169123411178589}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 2924, 510, 16, 13, 8906, 291, 4168, 198, 17, 13, 425, 28493, 198, 18, 13, 23297, 1280, 198, 19, 13, 4553, 30457, 198, 9485, 13495, 646, 3545, 387, 6707, 44436, 323, 1231, 387, 4221, 279, 1156, 55090, 429, 264, 5220, 374, 20280, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\n1. Missed period\n2. Bloating\n3. Spotting\n4. Cramping\nThese symptoms can often be easily overlooked and may be among the first indications that a woman is pregnant.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.4808135817448298, "g_worst_claim": 0.24028690656026205, "g_content": 1.2677253995622908, "g_traj_mean": 0.7699415683746338}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 2924, 510, 16, 13, 362, 13628, 4168, 198, 17, 13, 425, 28493, 198, 18, 13, 23297, 1280, 198, 19, 13, 4553, 30457, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include:\n1. A missed period\n2. Bloating\n3. Spotting\n4. Cramping", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.5534255107243856, "g_worst_claim": 0.3106200695037842, "g_content": 1.0688098458682789, "g_traj_mean": 0.7870455980300903}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 646, 2924, 264, 13628, 4168, 11, 14211, 1095, 11, 89219, 11, 323, 1560, 30457, 13, 4220, 13495, 1231, 387, 6707, 44436, 13, 93567, 56790, 11, 294, 96645, 11, 60780, 11, 323, 62471, 525, 1083, 4185, 304, 19636, 11, 448, 60780, 5916, 2163, 4743, 5555, 1283, 279, 1537, 4168, 13, 151645], "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy can include a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping. These symptoms may be easily overlooked. Mood swings, dizziness, nausea, and vomiting are also common in pregnancy, with nausea starting around six weeks after the last period.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.636077600918013, "g_worst_claim": 0.720432134775015, "g_content": 2.0314944231951677, "g_traj_mean": 1.4364784955978394}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 53.33, "GAVIE-Rel": 5.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "276", "question": "what is severe osteoporosis", "gt": "Severe osteoporosis is a condition characterized by significant bone density loss, resulting in weakened bones and increased risk of fractures. Symptoms may include sudden and severe back pain, loss of height over time, fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, fractures, particularly in the spine or hips, are likely to occur.", "pred": "Severe osteoporosis can cause fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury. The bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Severe osteoporosis can cause fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury. The bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.", "cot": "[\"Severe osteoporosis can be characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.\", \"Severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms that have developed due to significant bone density loss. These symptoms can include back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to experience fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can occur even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.\", \"Severe osteoporosis can cause fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury. The bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.\", \"Severe osteoporosis can result in fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. These fractures can happen even without a fall or injury, as the bones of the spine and hips, which support the body's weight, become so weak that they start to compress.\"]", "time_sec": 20.986, "generation_time_seconds": 20.1212, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8528, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 646, 387, 31871, 553, 13495, 1741, 438, 1182, 6646, 11, 4709, 315, 2608, 916, 882, 448, 264, 42032, 16367, 47278, 11, 323, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854, 13, 17147, 6380, 11, 264, 1697, 448, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 4363, 311, 614, 77232, 11, 1429, 3545, 304, 279, 34676, 476, 42423, 320, 8206, 1824, 279, 2487, 594, 4680, 8, 476, 304, 279, 85778, 504, 1411, 4527, 2348, 264, 4399, 13, 2869, 531, 1413, 315, 279, 34676, 646, 3537, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 458, 10895, 11, 438, 279, 24854, 315, 279, 34676, 3635, 773, 7469, 429, 807, 1191, 311, 24611, 13, 151645], "pred": "Severe osteoporosis can be characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6142977016650157, "g_worst_claim": 0.8643802404403687, "g_content": 2.07097808174465, "g_traj_mean": 1.5406527519226074}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 31871, 553, 13495, 429, 614, 7881, 4152, 311, 5089, 17240, 17457, 4709, 13, 4220, 13495, 646, 2924, 1182, 6646, 11, 4709, 315, 2608, 916, 882, 448, 264, 42032, 16367, 47278, 11, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854, 13, 17147, 6380, 11, 264, 1697, 448, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 4363, 311, 3139, 77232, 11, 1429, 3545, 304, 279, 34676, 476, 42423, 320, 8206, 1824, 279, 2487, 594, 4680, 8, 476, 304, 279, 85778, 504, 1411, 4527, 2348, 264, 4399, 13, 2869, 531, 1413, 315, 279, 34676, 646, 12170, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 458, 10895, 11, 438, 279, 24854, 315, 279, 34676, 3635, 773, 7469, 429, 807, 1191, 311, 24611, 13, 151645], "pred": "Severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms that have developed due to significant bone density loss. These symptoms can include back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to experience fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can occur even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4578867473951405, "g_worst_claim": 0.7987239701407296, "g_content": 1.9600493819625289, "g_traj_mean": 1.4820303916931152}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 646, 5240, 77232, 11, 1429, 3545, 304, 279, 34676, 476, 42423, 320, 8206, 1824, 279, 2487, 594, 4680, 8, 476, 304, 279, 85778, 504, 1411, 4527, 2348, 264, 4399, 13, 2869, 531, 1413, 315, 279, 34676, 646, 3537, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 458, 10895, 13, 576, 24854, 315, 279, 34676, 3635, 773, 7469, 429, 807, 1191, 311, 24611, 13, 151645], "pred": "Severe osteoporosis can cause fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury. The bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.628710766487797, "g_worst_claim": 1.0914047029283311, "g_content": 2.2177132826585035, "g_traj_mean": 1.8183112144470215}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 646, 1102, 304, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854, 13, 4220, 77232, 646, 3537, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 10895, 11, 438, 279, 24854, 315, 279, 34676, 323, 42423, 11, 892, 1824, 279, 2487, 594, 4680, 11, 3635, 773, 7469, 429, 807, 1191, 311, 24611, 13, 151645], "pred": "Severe osteoporosis can result in fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. These fractures can happen even without a fall or injury, as the bones of the spine and hips, which support the body's weight, become so weak that they start to compress.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3257530086346692, "g_worst_claim": 0.838658196585519, "g_content": 1.7984558741251628, "g_traj_mean": 1.2226014137268066}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.35, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "278", "question": "what is severe osteoporosis", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, severe osteoporosis refers to a condition where the bones have been significantly weakened to the point of causing symptoms such as back pain, loss of height, and fractures. According to passage 3, osteoporosis typically has no symptoms until significant bone damage has occurred, making it a \"silent disease\" until it reaches this advanced stage. Passage 2 also highlights that compression fractures of the spine are a common cause of osteoporosis pain, which can be severe and debilitating. Therefore, severe osteoporosis is characterized by a high risk of fractures, particularly in the spine and hips, as well as persistent back pain and loss of height.", "pred": "Severe osteoporosis is characterized by a condition where the bones have been weakened by bone density loss. Symptoms may include back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips which support the body's weight, or in the wrists from bracing against a fall.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Severe osteoporosis is characterized by a condition where the bones have been weakened by bone density loss. Symptoms may include back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips which support the body's weight, or in the wrists from bracing against a fall.", "cot": "[\"Severe osteoporosis can be characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.\", \"Based on the given passages, severe osteoporosis can be indicated by symptoms such as sudden, severe back pain that worsens when standing or walking, some pain relief when lying down, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Additionally, without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. The bones of the spine can become so weak that they start to compress even without a fall or an injury.\", \"Severe osteoporosis is characterized by a condition where the bones have been weakened by bone density loss. Symptoms may include back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips which support the body's weight, or in the wrists from bracing against a fall.\", \"Based on the given passages, severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms that include:\\n\\n1. Back pain, which is sudden and severe and worsens when standing or walking.\\n2. Loss of height over time with a stooped posture.\\n3. Fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones.\\n4. Without treatment, a person with osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall.\\n5. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.\\n\\nThese symptoms indicate that the bones have been weakened by significant bone density loss, and the person may have developed fractures or other structural issues in their skeleton.\"]", "time_sec": 26.468, "generation_time_seconds": 25.67, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7896, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 646, 387, 31871, 553, 13495, 1741, 438, 1182, 6646, 11, 4709, 315, 2608, 916, 882, 448, 264, 42032, 16367, 47278, 11, 323, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854, 13, 17147, 6380, 11, 264, 1697, 448, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 4363, 311, 614, 77232, 11, 1429, 3545, 304, 279, 34676, 476, 42423, 320, 8206, 1824, 279, 2487, 594, 4680, 8, 476, 304, 279, 85778, 504, 1411, 4527, 2348, 264, 4399, 13, 2869, 531, 1413, 315, 279, 34676, 646, 3537, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 458, 10895, 11, 438, 279, 24854, 315, 279, 34676, 3635, 773, 7469, 429, 807, 1191, 311, 24611, 13, 151645], "pred": "Severe osteoporosis can be characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6300355840465683, "g_worst_claim": 0.8722999095916748, "g_content": 2.0780679453974185, "g_traj_mean": 1.542467713356018}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 646, 387, 16317, 553, 13495, 1741, 438, 10968, 11, 15386, 1182, 6646, 429, 46193, 724, 979, 11259, 476, 11435, 11, 1045, 6646, 15957, 979, 20446, 1495, 11, 323, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854,