{"id": "279", "question": "what is severe osteoporosis", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, severe osteoporosis refers to a condition where there is significant bone density loss, leading to symptoms such as sudden and severe back pain, loss of height, and an increased risk of fractures, particularly in the spine, hips, and wrists.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, severe osteoporosis refers to a condition where bones have been weakened by significant bone density loss, leading to severe symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. These symptoms may include sudden, severe back pain that gets worse when standing or walking, some pain relief when lying down, and fractures that happen even without a fall or injury. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips, which support the body's weight, or in the wrists from bracing against a fall.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, severe osteoporosis refers to a condition where bones have been weakened by significant bone density loss, leading to severe symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. These symptoms may include sudden, severe back pain that gets worse when standing or walking, some pain relief when lying down, and fractures that happen even without a fall or injury. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips, which support the body's weight, or in the wrists from bracing against a fall.", "cot": "[\"Severe osteoporosis can be characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.\", \"Severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips, which support the body's weight, or in the wrists from bracing against a fall.\", \"Based on the given passages, severe osteoporosis refers to a condition where bones have been weakened by significant bone density loss, leading to severe symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. These symptoms may include sudden, severe back pain that gets worse when standing or walking, some pain relief when lying down, and fractures that happen even without a fall or injury. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips, which support the body's weight, or in the wrists from bracing against a fall.\", \"Severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury. The bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.\"]", "time_sec": 23.645, "generation_time_seconds": 22.822, "selection_time_seconds": 0.81, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 646, 387, 31871, 553, 13495, 1741, 438, 1182, 6646, 11, 4709, 315, 2608, 916, 882, 448, 264, 42032, 16367, 47278, 11, 323, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854, 13, 17147, 6380, 11, 264, 1697, 448, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 4363, 311, 614, 77232, 11, 1429, 3545, 304, 279, 34676, 476, 42423, 320, 8206, 1824, 279, 2487, 594, 4680, 8, 476, 304, 279, 85778, 504, 1411, 4527, 2348, 264, 4399, 13, 2869, 531, 1413, 315, 279, 34676, 646, 3537, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 458, 10895, 11, 438, 279, 24854, 315, 279, 34676, 3635, 773, 7469, 429, 807, 1191, 311, 24611, 13, 151645], "pred": "Severe osteoporosis can be characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips (which support the body's weight) or in the wrists from bracing against a fall. Fractures of the spine can happen even without a fall or an injury, as the bones of the spine become so weak that they start to compress.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.5642794408998288, "g_worst_claim": 0.8699373006820679, "g_content": 2.0170273158861245, "g_traj_mean": 1.5214420557022095}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1514, 19289, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 31871, 553, 13495, 1741, 438, 1182, 6646, 11, 4709, 315, 2608, 916, 882, 448, 264, 42032, 16367, 47278, 11, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854, 13, 17147, 6380, 11, 264, 1697, 448, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 4363, 311, 614, 77232, 11, 1429, 3545, 304, 279, 34676, 476, 42423, 11, 892, 1824, 279, 2487, 594, 4680, 11, 476, 304, 279, 85778, 504, 1411, 4527, 2348, 264, 4399, 13, 151645], "pred": "Severe osteoporosis is characterized by symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips, which support the body's weight, or in the wrists from bracing against a fall.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6543164018924896, "g_worst_claim": 0.8606302397591727, "g_content": 2.3162741661071777, "g_traj_mean": 1.5002801418304443}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 19257, 311, 264, 2971, 1380, 24854, 614, 1012, 57664, 553, 5089, 17240, 17457, 4709, 11, 6388, 311, 15386, 13495, 1741, 438, 1182, 6646, 11, 4709, 315, 2608, 916, 882, 448, 264, 42032, 16367, 47278, 11, 323, 77232, 315, 279, 5198, 50213, 68, 11, 85778, 11, 42423, 11, 476, 1008, 24854, 13, 4220, 13495, 1231, 2924, 10968, 11, 15386, 1182, 6646, 429, 5221, 10960, 979, 11259, 476, 11435, 11, 1045, 6646, 15957, 979, 20446, 1495, 11, 323, 77232, 429, 3537, 1496, 2041, 264, 4399, 476, 10895, 13, 17147, 6380, 11, 264, 1697, 448, 15386, 51268, 88666, 10704, 374, 4363, 311, 614, 77232, 11, 1429, 3545, 304, 279, 34676, 476, 42423, 11, 892, 1824, 279, 2487, 594, 4680, 11, 476, 304, 279, 85778, 504, 1411, 4527, 2348, 264, 4399, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, severe osteoporosis refers to a condition where bones have been weakened by significant bone density loss, leading to severe symptoms such as back pain, loss of height over time with a stooped posture, and fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. These symptoms may include sudden, severe back pain that gets worse when standing or walking, some pain relief when lying down, and fractures that happen even without a fall or injury. Without treatment, a person with severe osteoporosis is likely to have fractures, most often in the spine or hips, which support the body's weight, or in the wrists from