{"id": "300", "question": "how to make hot water heater circulate", "gt": "To make a hot water heater circulate, one can install a recirculation system. The system consists of a pump that pulls hot water from the water heater and simultaneously sends cool water from the hot water lines back to the water heater to be reheated and reused. This ensures that hot water is always available without having to wait for it to circulate naturally. Recirculation systems can be controlled by a button, timer, or motion sensor.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, a hot water heater can be made to circulate hot water through a recirculating pump. This pump rapidly pulls hot water from the water heater and simultaneously sends cool water from the hot water lines back to the water heater to be reheated and reused. The circulation can be controlled by the push of a button, a timer, or a motion sensor.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, a hot water heater can be made to circulate hot water through a recirculating pump. This pump rapidly pulls hot water from the water heater and simultaneously sends cool water from the hot water lines back to the water heater to be reheated and reused. The circulation can be controlled by the push of a button, a timer, or a motion sensor.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to make a hot water heater circulate, a hot water circulation pump is used. This pump sends cool water in the pipes back to the water heater through a return line. The pump circulates this water through the water heater as needed to keep it hot. This continuous loop of water through the water heater ensures that hot water is always available.\", \"Based on the given passages, to make a hot water heater circulate, a recirculating pump is used. This pump rapidly pulls hot water from the water heater, simultaneously sending cool water back through the hot water lines to be reheated and reused. This continuous loop of water ensures that hot water is always available when needed.\", \"Based on the given passages, to make a hot water heater circulate, a hot water circulation pump can be used. This pump sends cool water in the pipes back to the water heater through a return line. The pump circulates this water through the water heater as needed to keep it hot. This continuous loop of water through the water heater ensures that hot water is always available.\", \"Based on the given passages, a hot water heater can be made to circulate hot water through a recirculating pump. This pump rapidly pulls hot water from the water heater and simultaneously sends cool water from the hot water lines back to the water heater to be reheated and reused. The circulation can be controlled by the push of a button, a timer, or a motion sensor.\"]", "time_sec": 17.494, "generation_time_seconds": 17.0285, "selection_time_seconds": 0.4544, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 1281, 264, 4017, 3015, 42238, 4225, 6334, 11, 264, 4017, 3015, 34755, 13834, 374, 1483, 13, 1096, 13834, 21308, 7010, 3015, 304, 279, 31175, 1182, 311, 279, 3015, 42238, 1526, 264, 470, 1555, 13, 576, 13834, 4225, 23156, 419, 3015, 1526, 279, 3015, 42238, 438, 4362, 311, 2506, 432, 4017, 13, 1096, 19259, 6337, 315, 3015, 1526, 279, 3015, 42238, 25351, 429, 4017, 3015, 374, 2677, 2500, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to make a hot water heater circulate, a hot water circulation pump is used. This pump sends cool water in the pipes back to the water heater through a return line. The pump circulates this water through the water heater as needed to keep it hot. This continuous loop of water through the water heater ensures that hot water is always available.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2818481822159293, "g_worst_claim": 0.32985373338063556, "g_content":