{"id": "310", "question": "avg cost to install a second floor in a house", "gt": "Hiring a remodeling contractor to build a second floor addition can cost between $100-$300 a square foot for a typical addition, but the cost can go as high as $400-$500 per square foot depending on the complexity, quality of materials and local labor rates. Building a second floor can cost at least 20 percent more than building the same square footage at ground level.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the average cost to install a second floor in a house ranges from $100 to $400 per square foot, depending on complexity, quality of materials, and local labor rates.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the average cost to install a second floor in a house ranges from $100 to $400 per square foot, depending on complexity, quality of materials, and local labor rates.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the average cost to install a second floor in a house can range from $100 to $400 per square foot, depending on complexity, quality of materials, and local labor rates.\", \"Based on the given passages, the average cost to install a second floor in a house can range from $100-$300 per square foot for a typical addition, with a flight of stairs and a bath, depending on the complexity, quality of materials, and local labor rates.\", \"Based on the given passages, the average cost to install a second floor in a house ranges from $100 to $400 per square foot, depending on complexity, quality of materials, and local labor rates.\", \"Based on the given passages, the average cost to install a second floor in a house ranges from $100 to $400 per square foot, depending on complexity, quality of materials, and local labor rates.\"]", "time_sec": 15.449, "generation_time_seconds": 14.7009, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7382, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"ro