rint is typically measured in tons of carbon dioxide (CO2) released into the atmosphere. It takes into account various activities such as heating homes with oil, coal, or gas, producing food, and driving automobiles. By tracking carbon footprint, individuals and organizations can assess the amount of greenhouse gases they are contributing to the environment and make informed decisions to reduce their impact.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.7430857467192871, "g_worst_claim": -0.15090482234954833, "g_content": 0.9914009094238281, "g_traj_mean": 0.6416648030281067}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7286, 315, 264, 12499, 42872, 10953, 279, 12158, 5421, 315, 697, 18899, 11, 18860, 279, 3311, 315, 12499, 39489, 323, 1008, 36547, 44512, 8947, 438, 264, 1102, 315, 697, 7298, 7488, 13, 1096, 18662, 8609, 304, 8660, 279, 2790, 12158, 2456, 315, 5257, 3738, 7488, 2878, 264, 2661, 882, 4034, 13, 362, 12499, 42872, 374, 5990, 16878, 304, 19608, 315, 12499, 39489, 320, 8281, 17, 8, 5880, 1119, 279, 16566, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the concept of a carbon footprint measures the environmental impact of your lifestyle, indicating the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of your daily activities. This measurement helps in understanding the total environmental effect of various human activities within a given time frame. A carbon footprint is usually measured in tons of carbon dioxide (CO2) released into the atmosphere.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.9488949484753431, "g_worst_claim": 0.22707849740982056, "g_content": 1.4719911619674328, "g_traj_mean": 1.0090415477752686}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 2456, 315, 264, 12499, 42872, 374, 311, 6629, 279, 12158, 5421, 315, 5257, 3738, 7488, 2878, 264, 2661, 882, 4034, 11, 11136, 16878, 304, 19608, 315, 12499, 39489, 320, 8281, 17, 8, 5880, 1119, 279, 16566, 13, 1096, 18662, 8609, 304, 8660, 279, 12158, 2456, 315, 7488, 1741, 438, 23579, 10415, 448, 5590, 11, 11497, 11, 476, 6819, 11, 18545, 50776, 11, 323, 10350, 15556, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the effect of a carbon footprint is to measure the environmental impact of various human activities within a given time frame, typically measured in tons of carbon dioxide (CO2) released into the atmosphere. This measurement helps in understanding the environmental effect of activities such as heating homes with oil, coal, or gas, raising livestock, and operating restaurants.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6047877563972666, "g_worst_claim": 0.22707849740982056, "g_content": 1.9362245217347755, "g_traj_mean": 1.1467616558074951}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 3, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 36.59, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "321", "question": "what is the effect of carbon footprint", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, the effect of carbon footprint is to measure the environmental impact of an individual's lifestyle and daily activities, specifically the amount of greenhouse gases produced, such as carbon dioxide, as a result of those activities. The carbon footprint is typically measured in tons of CO2 released into the atmosphere. The passages also mention that reducing one's carbon footprint can have a significant impact on the environment, even with seemingly small changes. Additionally, the average carbon footprint is mentioned to be around 6 tons per year, with a higher amount in the US due to automobile emissions.", "pred": "The effect of a carbon footprint refers to the environmental impact of an individual's or group's lifestyle, as measured by the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced. A carbon footprint, expressed in tons, quantifies the environmental effect of daily activities. Reducing one's carbon footprint by altering lifestyle habits can lead to significant environmental benefits. For instance, changing the way you live, even small adjustments, can have a substantial impact on reducing your carbon footprint.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The effect of a carbon footprint refers to the environmental impact of an individual's or group's lifestyle, as measured by the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced. A carbon footprint, expressed in tons, quantifies the environmental effect of daily activities. Reducing one's carbon footprint by altering lifestyle habits can lead to significant environmental benefits. For instance, changing the way you live, even small adjustments, can have a substantial impact on reducing your carbon footprint.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the effect of carbon footprint is to measure the environmental impact of human activities. It quantifies the total amount of greenhouse gases produced by various human activities within a given time frame, typically measured in tons of carbon dioxide (CO2) released into the atmosphere. This measurement helps in understanding the environmental effect of lifestyle choices, such as using energy for heating, consuming food, and driving vehicles. Reducing carbon footprint involves making changes in daily activities to decrease the amount of greenhouse gases produced, which can lead to a significant positive impact on the environment.\", \"The effect of a carbon footprint refers to the environmental impact of an individual's or group's lifestyle, as measured by the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced. A carbon footprint, expressed in tons, quantifies the environmental effect of daily activities. Reducing one's carbon footprint by altering lifestyle habits can lead to significant environmental benefits. For instance, changing the way you live, even small adjustments, can have a substantial impact on reducing your carbon footprint.\", \"Based on the given passages, carbon footprint measures the environmental impact of a person's lifestyle. It indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of daily activities. The carbon footprint can be reduced by changing the way one lives, and even small changes can make a significant difference. The average carbon footprint per person is 6 tons per year globally, with the U.S. averaging 20 tons per year, much of which is attributed to automobile emissions. Carbon footprint is the total amount of greenhouse gases produced by various human activities within a given time frame, typically measured in tons of carbon dioxide released into the atmosphere. It affects the environment by contributing to climate change due to the greenhouse gases produced.\", \"Based on the given passages, the effect of carbon footprint is to measure the environmental impact of various human activities. The carbon footprint is the total amount of greenhouse gases produced by these activities within a given time frame, typically measured in tons of carbon dioxide (CO2) released into the atmosphere. This measurement helps in understanding the environmental effect of a person's lifestyle, including activities such as heating a home, eating a burger at a restaurant, and driving a car. The purpose is to highlight the positive or negative impact on the environment and to encourage lifestyle changes to reduce the footprint.\"]", "time_sec": 23.375, "generation_time_seconds": 22.6821, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6832, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 2456, 315, 12499, 42872, 374, 311, 6629, 279, 12158, 5421, 315, 3738, 7488, 13, 1084, 10272, 9606, 279, 2790, 3311, 315, 36547, 44512, 8947, 553, 5257, 3738, 7488, 2878, 264, 2661, 882, 4034, 11, 11136, 16878, 304, 19608, 315, 12499, 39489, 320, 8281, 17, 8, 5880, 1119, 279, 16566, 13, 1096, 18662, 8609, 304, 8660, 279, 12158, 2456, 315, 18899, 11454, 11, 1741, 438, 1667, 4802, 369, 23579, 11, 34108, 3607, 11, 323, 9842, 11474, 13, 3731, 58044, 12499, 42872, 17601, 3259, 4344, 304, 7298, 7488, 311, 18472, 279, 3311, 315, 36547, 44512, 8947, 11, 892, 646, 2990, 311, 264, 5089, 6785, 5421, 389, 279, 4573, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the effect of carbon footprint is to measure the environmental impact of human activities. It quantifies the total amount of greenhouse gases produced by various human activities within a given time frame, typically measured in tons of carbon dioxide (CO2) released into the atmosphere. This measurement helps in understanding the environmental effect of lifestyle choices, such as using energy for heating, consuming food, and driving vehicles. Reducing carbon footprint involves making changes in daily activities to decrease the amount of greenhouse gases produced, which can lead to a significant positive impact on the environment.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.954660773764278, "g_worst_claim": 0.22707849740982056, "g_content": 1.2635657787322998, "g_traj_mean": 0.8521486520767212}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [785, 2456, 315, 264, 12499, 42872, 19257, 311, 279, 12158, 5421, 315, 458, 3842, 594, 476, 1874, 594, 18899, 11, 438, 16878, 553, 279, 3311, 315, 12499, 39489, 323, 1008, 36547, 44512, 8947, 13, 362, 12499, 42872, 11, 13302, 304, 19608, 11, 10272, 9606, 279, 12158, 2456, 315, 7298, 7488, 13, 3731, 58044, 825, 594, 12499, 42872, 553, 59823, 18899, 25785, 646, 2990, 311, 5089, 12158, 7567, 13, 1752, 2867, 11, 10018, 279, 1616, 498, 3887, 11, 1496, 2613, 32974, 11, 646, 614, 264, 11924, 5421, 389, 17719, 697, 12499, 42872, 13, 151645], "pred": "The effect of a carbon footprint refers to the environmental impact of an individual's or group's lifestyle, as measured by the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced. A carbon footprint, expressed in tons, quantifies the environmental effect of daily activities. Reducing one's carbon footprint by altering lifestyle habits can lead to significant environmental benefits. For instance, changing the way you live, even small adjustments, can have a substantial impact on reducing your carbon footprint.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.5171280071883768, "g_worst_claim": 0.18441683595830743, "g_content": 1.3609976768493652, "g_traj_mean": 1.1312812566757202}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 12499, 42872, 10953, 279, 12158, 5421, 315, 264, 1697, 594, 18899, 13, 1084, 14807, 279, 3311, 315, 12499, 39489, 323, 1008, 36547, 44512, 8947, 438, 264, 1102, 315, 7298, 7488, 13, 576, 12499, 42872, 646, 387, 11046, 553, 10018, 279, 1616, 825, 6305, 11, 323, 1496, 2613, 4344, 646, 1281, 264, 5089, 6672, 13, 576, 5461, 12499, 42872, 817, 1697, 374, 220, 21, 19608, 817, 1042, 30450, 11, 448, 279, 547, 808, 13, 43764, 220, 17, 15, 19608, 817, 1042, 11, 1753, 315, 892, 374, 29606, 311, 34428, 20143, 13, 21487, 42872, 374, 279, 2790, 3311, 315, 36547, 44512, 8947, 553, 5257, 3738, 7488, 2878, 264, 2661, 882, 4034, 11, 11136, 16878, 304, 19608, 315, 12499, 39489, 5880, 1119, 279, 16566, 13, 1084, 21501, 279, 4573, 553, 28720, 311, 9977, 2297, 4152, 311, 279, 36547, 44512, 8947, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, carbon footprint measures the environmental impact of a person's lifestyle. It indicates the amount of carbon dioxide and other greenhouse gases produced as a result of daily activities. The carbon footprint can be reduced by changing the way one lives, and even small changes can make a significant difference. The average carbon footprint per person is 6 tons per year globally, with the U.S. averaging 20 tons per year, much of which is attributed to automobile emissions. Carbon footprint is the total amount of greenhouse gases produced by various human activities within a given time frame, typically measured in tons of carbon dioxide released into the atmosphere. It affects the environment by contributing to climate change due to the greenhouse gases produced.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.187104189853044, "g_worst_claim": 0.22745192050933838, "g_content": 1.5304389227004278, "g_traj_mean": 1.2028857469558716}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 2456, 315, 12499, 42872, 374, 311, 6629, 279, 12158, 5421, 315, 5257, 3738, 7488, 13, 576, 12499, 42872, 374, 279, 2790, 3311, 315, 36547, 44512, 8947, 553, 1493, 7488, 2878, 264, 2661, 882, 4034, 11, 11136, 16878, 304, 19608, 315, 12499, 39489, 320, 8281, 17, 8, 5880, 1119, 279, 16566, 13, 1096, 18662, 8609, 304, 8660, 279, 12158, 2456, 315, 264, 1697, 594, 18899, 11, 2670, 7488, 1741, 438, 23579, 264, 2114, 11, 12182, 264, 44623, 518, 264, 10729, 11, 323, 9842, 264, 1803, 13, 576, 7428, 374, 311, 11167, 279, 6785, 476, 8225, 5421, 389, 279, 4573, 323, 311, 14907, 18899, 4344, 311, 7949, 279, 42872, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the effect of carbon footprint is to measure the environmental impact of various human activities. The carbon footprint is the total amount of greenhouse gases produced by these activities within a given time frame, typically measured in tons of carbon dioxide (CO2) released into the atmosphere. This measurement helps in understanding the environmental effect of a person's lifestyle, including activities such as heating a home, eating a burger at a restaurant, and driving a car. The purpose is to highlight the positive or negative impact on the environment and to encourage lifestyle changes to reduce the footprint.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.960428448008043, "g_worst_claim": 0.22707849740982056, "g_content": 1.37194371627549, "g_traj_mean": 0.8917654156684875}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 52.54, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "324", "question": "how well do patterned rollers work", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here's what we can conclude about how well patterned rollers work:\n\nPassage 1 suggests that homemade texture or decorative paint rollers can work better than commercial ones for certain faux finishes because they can create a random pattern of texture.\n\nPassage 2 provides a personal testimonial about the effectiveness of the Dermaroller for improving the appearance of skin. The writer claims that it makes their skin look younger and healthier, and that it works best when used with serums or moisturizers. However, there is no direct mention of patterned rollers in this passage.\n\nPassage 3 provides instructions for creating a basic texture roller using an old roller pad with clumped tufts and random patterns created by stretching and twisting rubber bands. This passage suggests that patterned rollers can create a textured finish on walls, but there is no information on how effective they are or how well they work.\n\nTherefore, based on the given passages, it is difficult to say definitively how well patterned rollers work. Passage 1 suggests that they may be effective for certain applications, while passage 2 provides a personal endorsement of a specific product (Dermaroller) for improving skin appearance. Passage 3 provides instructions for creating a basic texture roller, but does not provide any information on its effectiveness. Therefore, the answer to the original question is: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, patterned rollers work well. The passages mention that homemade texture or decorative paint rollers can work better than commercial rollers because they allow for random patterns of texture, which are essential for many faux finishes. The Dermaroller is also mentioned to have some success in stimulating skin, making it look younger and with a healthier glow. However, the effectiveness may vary depending on the area of application, as the Dermaroller works better on the face than on the neck and chest. Overall, patterned rollers can be effective for certain purposes, but their success may depend on the specific product and application.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, patterned rollers work well. The passages mention that homemade texture or decorative paint rollers can work better than commercial rollers because they allow for random patterns of texture, which are essential for many faux finishes. The Dermaroller is also mentioned to have some success in stimulating skin, making it look younger and with a healthier glow. However, the effectiveness may vary depending on the area of application, as the Dermaroller works better on the face than on the neck and chest. Overall, patterned rollers can be effective for certain purposes, but their success may depend on the specific product and application.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, patterned rollers can work well, but the effectiveness may vary depending on the type of roller and the user's skin type. For example, the Dermaroller worked well for the user on their face, but caused redness on their neck and chest. The Basic Texture Roller, on the other hand, can be effective for applying texture to walls, but requires careful adjustment of the rubber bands to maintain the desired pattern.\", \"Based on the given passages, patterned rollers work well. The passages mention that homemade texture or decorative paint rollers can work better than commercial rollers because they allow for random patterns of texture, which are essential for many faux finishes. The Dermaroller is also mentioned to have some success in stimulating skin, making it look younger and with a healthier glow. However, the effectiveness may vary depending on the area of application, as the Dermaroller works better on the face than on the neck and chest. Overall, patterned rollers can be effective for certain purposes, but their success may depend on the specific product and application.\", \"Based on the given passages, patterned rollers can work well, especially for creating random textures and patterns on walls. For example, homemade texture or decorative paint rollers can be more effective than commercial varieties for applying a random pattern of texture, which is essential for many faux finishes. However, the effectiveness of patterned rollers may vary depending on the specific pattern and the material being used.\", \"Based on the given passages, patterned rollers can work well for various applications. However, the effectiveness can vary depending on factors such as the type of roller and the material used. For example, homemade texture or decorative paint rollers can work better than commercial ones for certain finishes that rely on applying a random pattern of texture to walls. Additionally, the Dermaroller is claimed to make a difference in skin health and appearance, although individual results may vary. The Basic Texture Roller is another example of a patterned roller that can be used for various purposes, as long as the roller pad is properly maintained and adjusted during use.\"]", "time_sec": 21.939, "generation_time_seconds": 21.218, "selection_time_seconds": 0.711, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 5383, 291, 88613, 646, 975, 1632, 11, 714, 279, 26279, 1231, 13289, 11649, 389, 279, 943, 315, 28451, 323, 279, 1196, 594, 6787, 943, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 279, 75408, 277, 69396, 6439, 1632, 369, 279, 1196, 389, 862, 3579, 11, 714, 8881, 2518, 2090, 389, 862, 12975, 323, 15138, 13, 576, 14625, 18757, 44542, 11, 389, 279, 1008, 1424, 11, 646, 387, 7373, 369, 18950, 10434, 311, 14285, 11, 714, 7460, 16585, 27075, 315, 279, 22674, 20892, 311, 10306, 279, 12685, 5383, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, patterned rollers can work well, but the effectiveness may vary depending on the type of roller and the user's skin type. For example, the Dermaroller worked well for the user on their face, but caused redness on their neck and chest. The Basic Texture Roller, on the other hand, can be effective for applying texture to walls, but requires careful adjustment of the rubber bands to maintain the desired pattern.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.646816570822136, "g_worst_claim": 0.2225263516108195, "g_content": 2.2490016392299106, "g_traj_mean": 1.349963903427124}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 5383, 291, 88613, 975, 1632, 13, 576, 46769, 6286, 429, 35333, 10434, 476, 45436, 6177, 88613, 646, 975, 2664, 1091, 8353, 88613, 1576, 807, 2138, 369, 4194, 12624, 315, 10434, 11, 892, 525, 7565, 369, 1657, 50427, 33036, 13, 576, 75408, 277, 69396, 374, 1083, 9733, 311, 614, 1045, 2393, 304, 64692, 6787, 11, 3259, 432, 1401, 14650, 323, 448, 264, 38245, 35966, 13, 4354, 11, 279, 26279, 1231, 13289, 11649, 389, 279, 3082, 315, 3766, 11, 438, 279, 75408, 277, 69396, 4278, 2664, 389, 279, 3579, 1091, 389, 279, 12975, 323, 15138, 13, 27893, 11, 5383, 291, 88613, 646, 387, 7373, 369, 3654, 9895, 11, 714, 862, 2393, 1231, 6761, 389, 279, 3151, 1985, 323, 3766, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, patterned rollers work well. The passages mention that homemade texture or decorative paint rollers can work better than commercial rollers because they allow for random patterns of texture, which are essential for many faux finishes. The Dermaroller is also mentioned to have some success in stimulating skin, making it look younger and with a healthier glow. However, the effectiveness may vary depending on the area of application, as the Dermaroller works better on the face than on the neck and chest. Overall, patterned rollers can be effective for certain purposes, but their success may depend on the specific product and application.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.200262034240711, "g_worst_claim": 0.0780608852704366, "g_content": 2.273504322972791, "g_traj_mean": 1.3725430965423584}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 5383, 291, 88613, 646, 975, 1632, 11, 5310, 369, 6825, 4194, 29853, 323, 12624, 389, 14285, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 35333, 10434, 476, 45436, 6177, 88613, 646, 387, 803, 7373, 1091, 8353, 35580, 369, 18950, 264, 4194, 5383, 315, 10434, 11, 892, 374, 7565, 369, 1657, 50427, 33036, 13, 4354, 11, 279, 26279, 315, 5383, 291, 88613, 1231, 13289, 11649, 389, 279, 3151, 5383, 323, 279, 3684, 1660, 1483, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, patterned rollers can work well, especially for creating random textures and patterns on walls. For example, homemade texture or decorative paint rollers can be more effective than commercial varieties for applying a random pattern of texture, which is essential for many faux finishes. However, the effectiveness of patterned rollers may vary depending on the specific pattern and the material being used.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.355344445932479, "g_worst_claim": 0.2225263516108195, "g_content": 1.8538097381591796, "g_traj_mean": 1.380265712738037}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 5383, 291, 88613, 646, 975, 1632, 369, 5257, 8357, 13, 4354, 11, 279, 26279, 646, 13289, 11649, 389, 9363, 1741, 438, 279, 943, 315, 28451, 323, 279, 3684, 1483, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 35333, 10434, 476, 45436, 6177, 88613, 646, 975, 2664, 1091, 8353, 6174, 369, 3654, 33036, 429, 17188, 389, 18950, 264, 4194, 5383, 315, 10434, 311, 14285, 13, 22406, 11, 279, 75408, 277, 69396, 374, 11660, 311, 1281, 264, 6672, 304, 6787, 2820, 323, 11094, 11, 7892, 3842, 3059, 1231, 13289, 13, 576, 14625, 18757, 44542, 374, 2441, 3110, 315, 264, 5383, 291, 28451, 429, 646, 387, 1483, 369, 5257, 9895, 11, 438, 1293, 438, 279, 28451, 11016, 374, 10277, 18401, 323, 23368, 2337, 990, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, patterned rollers can work well for various applications. However, the effectiveness can vary depending on factors such as the type of roller and the material used. For example, homemade texture or decorative paint rollers can work better than commercial ones for certain finishes that rely on applying a random pattern of texture to walls. Additionally, the Dermaroller is claimed to make a difference in skin health and appearance, although individual results may vary. The Basic Texture Roller is another example of a patterned roller that can be used for various purposes, as long as the roller pad is properly maintained and adjusted during use.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2249567097693523, "g_worst_claim": 0.22298429409662882, "g_content": 2.349091302780878, "g_traj_mean": 1.5082144737243652}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 38.43, "GAVIE-Rel": 3.3, "GAVIE-Acc": 2.2, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "325", "question": "how well do patterned rollers work", "gt": "Based on the given passages, it appears that patterned rollers can work well for creating textured finishes on walls, as they can produce a random pattern of texture that is often desired in faux finishing techniques. The third passage provides instructions for creating a DIY texture roller by modifying an existing roller pad with rubber bands to create clumps and random patterns, which can be used to apply paint and create a textured finish.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"How well do patterned rollers work?\" is:\n\nThey can work well for creating textured finishes on walls, especially when used with faux finishing techniques.", "pred": "In conclusion, patterned rollers can be effective for certain decorative or cosmetic applications, but their performance can vary depending on the specific use and whether they are used in conjunction with other products.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "In conclusion, patterned rollers can be effective for certain decorative or cosmetic applications, but their performance can vary depending on the specific use and whether they are used in conjunction with other products.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, patterned rollers can work well, but the effectiveness may vary depending on the type of roller and the user's skin type. For example, the Dermaroller worked well for the user on their face, but caused redness on their neck and chest. The Basic Texture Roller, on the other hand, can be effective for applying texture to walls, but requires careful adjustment of the rubber bands to maintain the desired pattern.\", \"Based on the given passages, the effectiveness of patterned rollers can be assessed as follows:\\n\\n1. The passages indicate that patterned rollers can work well for certain applications, such as decorative paints used for faux finishes. According to passage 1, these rollers can work better than commercial varieties because they allow for random patterns of texture, which is essential for many faux finishes.\\n\\n2. The effectiveness of patterned rollers varies depending on the specific use or application. For instance, passage 2 mentions that the Dermaroller works well for some users on their face, but not on their neck and chest, indicating a need for careful selection based on the intended use.\\n\\n3. The passages also suggest that the success of patterned rollers may depend on additional factors, such as the type of serum or moisturizer used in conjunction with them. Passage 2 notes that the Dermaroller works best when used with serums or moisturizers immediately afterward, suggesting that the roller's effect might be enhanced by a complementary product.\\n\\nIn conclusion, patterned rollers can be effective for certain decorative or cosmetic applications, but their performance can vary depending on the specific use and whether they are used in conjunction with other products.\", \"Based on the given passages, patterned rollers, both homemade and commercial, can work effectively for creating random patterns on walls. The passage mentions that homemade texture or decorative paint rollers, as well as commercial texture rollers, can be used for applying a random pattern of texture to walls. This approach often works well for faux finishes, which rely on applying a random pattern. While the effectiveness of commercial rollers is noted for their set pattern, homemade rollers can offer more flexibility and creativity in achieving random textures.\", \"Based on the given passages:\\nPatterned rollers can work well for texture or decorative effects, but they depend on the specific pattern and the skill of the user. Homemade texture rollers can be more effective for some faux finishes as they allow for a random pattern application. Commercial texture rollers, on the other hand, apply paint with a set pattern.\"]", "time_sec": 25.138, "generation_time_seconds": 24.1847, "selection_time_seconds": 0.9416, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 5383, 291, 88613, 646, 975, 1632, 11, 714, 279, 26279, 1231, 13289, 11649, 389, 279, 943, 315, 28451, 323, 279, 1196, 594, 6787, 943, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 279, 75408, 277, 69396, 6439, 1632, 369, 279, 1196, 389, 862, 3579, 11, 714, 8881, 2518, 2090, 389, 862, 12975, 323, 15138, 13, 576, 14625, 18757, 44542, 11, 389, 279, 1008, 1424, 11, 646, 387, 7373, 369, 18950, 10434, 311, 14285, 11, 714, 7460, 16585, 27075, 315, 279, 22674, 20892, 311, 10306, 279, 12685, 5383, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, patterned rollers can work well, but the effectiveness may vary depending on the type of roller and the user's skin type. For example, the Dermaroller worked well for the user on their face, but caused redness on their neck and chest. The Basic Texture Roller, on the other hand, can be effective for applying texture to walls, but requires careful adjustment of the rubber bands to maintain the desired pattern.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.646816570822136, "g_worst_claim": 0.2225263516108195, "g_content": 2.2490016392299106, "g_traj_mean": 1.349963903427124}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 26279, 315, 5383, 291, 88613, 646, 387, 31348, 438, 11017, 1447, 16, 13, 576, 46769, 13216, 429, 5383, 291, 88613, 646, 975, 1632, 369, 3654, 8357, 11, 1741, 438, 45436, 56848, 1483, 369, 50427, 33036, 13, 10548, 311, 21085, 220, 16, 11, 1493, 88613, 646, 975, 2664, 1091, 8353, 35580, 1576, 807, 2138, 369, 4194, 12624, 315, 10434, 11, 892, 374, 7565, 369, 1657, 50427, 33036, 382, 17, 13, 576, 26279, 315, 5383, 291, 88613, 34227, 11649, 389, 279, 3151, 990, 476, 3766, 13, 1752, 2867, 11, 21085, 220, 17, 33845, 429, 279, 75408, 277, 69396, 4278, 1632, 369, 1045, 3847, 389, 862, 3579, 11, 714, 537, 389, 862, 12975, 323, 15138, 11, 18860, 264, 1184, 369, 16585, 6589, 3118, 389, 279, 10602, 990, 382, 18, 13, 576, 46769, 1083, 4190, 429, 279, 2393, 315, 5383, 291, 88613, 1231, 6761, 389, 5107, 9363, 11, 1741, 438, 279, 943, 315, 40429, 476, 53802, 3135, 1483, 304, 31446, 448, 1105, 13, 98475, 220, 17, 8388, 429, 279, 75408, 277, 69396, 4278, 1850, 979, 1483, 448, 1420, 6237, 476, 53802, 12230, 7069, 47943, 11, 22561, 429, 279, 28451, 594, 2456, 2578, 387, 23922, 553, 264, 57435, 1985, 382, 641, 16688, 11, 5383, 291, 88613, 646, 387, 7373, 369, 3654, 45436, 476, 45452, 8357, 11, 714, 862, 5068, 646, 13289, 11649, 389, 279, 3151, 990, 323, 3425, 807, 525, 1483, 304, 31446, 448, 1008, 3871, 13, 151645], "pred": "In conclusion, patterned rollers can be effective for certain decorative or cosmetic applications, but their performance can vary depending on the specific use and whether they are used in conjunction with other products.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.8992009404387674, "g_worst_claim": 0.004901338707317005, "g_content": 1.3381001702670394, "g_traj_mean": 0.817531406879425}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 5383, 291, 88613, 11, 2176, 35333, 323, 8353, 11, 646, 975, 13444, 369, 6825, 4194, 12624, 389, 14285, 13, 576, 21085, 33845, 429, 35333, 10434, 476, 45436, 6177, 88613, 11, 438, 1632, 438, 8353, 10434, 88613, 11, 646, 387, 1483, 369, 18950, 264, 4194, 5383, 315, 10434, 311, 14285, 13, 1096, 5486, 3545, 4278, 1632, 369, 50427, 33036, 11, 892, 17188, 389, 18950, 264, 4194, 5383, 13, 5976, 279, 26279, 315, 8353, 88613, 374, 10342, 369, 862, 738, 5383, 11, 35333, 88613, 646, 3010, 803, 24177, 323, 27597, 304, 31045, 4194, 29853, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, patterned rollers, both homemade and commercial, can work effectively for creating random patterns on walls. The passage mentions that homemade texture or decorative paint rollers, as well as commercial texture rollers, can be used for applying a random pattern of texture to walls. This approach often works well for faux finishes, which rely on applying a random pattern. While the effectiveness of commercial rollers is noted for their set pattern, homemade rollers can offer more flexibility and creativity in achieving random textures.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4128354150987485, "g_worst_claim": 0.2225263516108195, "g_content": 1.8571165605024857, "g_traj_mean": 1.3618143796920776}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 510, 15760, 291, 88613, 646, 975, 1632, 369, 10434, 476, 45436, 6239, 11, 714, 807, 6761, 389, 279, 3151, 5383, 323, 279, 9947, 315, 279, 1196, 13, 84808, 10434, 88613, 646, 387, 803, 7373, 369, 1045, 50427, 33036, 438, 807, 2138, 369, 264, 4194, 5383, 3766, 13, 27843, 10434, 88613, 11, 389, 279, 1008, 1424, 11, 3796, 6177, 448, 264, 738, 5383, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages:\nPatterned rollers can work well for texture or decorative effects, but they depend on the specific pattern and the skill of the user. Homemade texture rollers can be more effective for some faux finishes as they allow for a random pattern application. Commercial texture rollers, on the other hand, apply paint with a set pattern.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4907479955563467, "g_worst_claim": -0.0279776326247624, "g_content": 2.381115632898667, "g_traj_mean": 1.4299530982971191}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.58, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "329", "question": "how to boil potatoes for easy peeling", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here's how to boil potatoes for easy peeling:\n\nPassage 1 recommends boiling the potatoes until they are tender, then transferring them to an ice water bath to stop the cooking process. After cooling, the skin can be easily peeled off. This method takes 15 minutes to cook the potatoes and 5 seconds to peel each one.\n\nPassage 2 suggests peeling the potatoes before cooking, as their skin can be tough and papery. However, no specific instructions are provided for peeling.\n\nPassage 3 provides a step-by-step guide for peeling cooked potatoes. The method involves scoring the potatoes all the way around the center, boiling them for about 15 minutes, then placing them in an ice water bath to cool. Once cooled, the skin can be easily removed. This method takes about 30 minutes total time.\n\nTherefore, based on the provided passages, the best way to boil potatoes for easy peeling is to boil them until tender, then transfer them to an ice water bath to stop the cooking process and make the skin easier to remove. Scoring the potatoes before boiling can also help loosen the skin for easier peeling.", "pred": "This method ensures that the potatoes are cooked until tender, making the peeling process quick and easy.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "This method ensures that the potatoes are cooked until tender, making the peeling process quick and easy.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to boil potatoes for easy peeling, follow these steps:\\n1. Bring a pot of water to a boil.\\n2. With a knife, score your potatoes all the way around the center.\\n3. Place your potatoes in the pot and boil for about 15 minutes or so.\\n4. Prepare a bowl of ice water and place your potatoes in the water.\\n5. Swish it around for a few seconds just enough so that it's cool enough to handle.\\n6. Remove your potato from the water and remove the skin.\", \"Based on the given passages, to boil potatoes for easy peeling, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Bring a pot of water to a boil.\\n2. Score your potatoes all the way around the center with a knife.\\n3. Place your potatoes in the boiling water and cook for about 15 minutes or until tender.\\n4. Prepare a bowl of ice water and place your potatoes in the water.\\n5. Swish them around for a few seconds to cool them down just enough to handle.\\n6. Remove the potatoes from the water and peel off the skin.\\n\\nThis method ensures that the potatoes are cooked until tender, making the peeling process quick and easy.\", \"Based on the given passages, here is how to boil potatoes for easy peeling:\\n\\n1. Bring a pot of water to a boil.\\n2. With a knife, score your potatoes all the way around the center.\\n3. Place your potatoes in the pot and boil for about 15 minutes or so.\\n4. Prepare a bowl of ice water and place your potatoes in the water.\\n5. Swish it around for a few seconds just enough so that it’s cool enough to handle.\\n6. Remove your potato from the water and remove the skin.\", \"Based on the given passages, to boil potatoes for easy peeling, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Bring a pot of water to a boil according to the instructions.\\n2. Score the potatoes all the way around the center using a knife.\\n3. Place the scored potatoes in the boiling water.\\n4. Boil them for about 15 minutes.\\n5. Prepare a bowl of ice water.\\n6. Transfer the potatoes from the boiling water to the ice water bowl.\\n7. Swish the potatoes in the ice water for a few seconds to cool them down.\\n8. Remove the potatoes from the ice water and peel the skin easily.\\n\\nThe passage mentions a time of 15 minutes for boiling and 5 seconds for peeling each cooked potato.\"]", "time_sec": 25.301, "generation_time_seconds": 24.3944, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8789, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 43690, 34167, 369, 4135, 1051, 20058, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 510, 16, 13, 39124, 264, 3338, 315, 3015, 311, 264, 43690, 624, 17, 13, 3085, 264, 21430, 11, 5456, 697, 34167, 678, 279, 1616, 2163, 279, 4126, 624, 18, 13, 10771, 697, 34167, 304, 279, 3338, 323, 43690, 369, 911, 220, 16, 20, 4420, 476, 773, 624, 19, 13, 31166, 264, 19212, 315, 9853, 3015, 323, 1992, 697, 34167, 304, 279, 3015, 624, 20, 13, 4492, 812, 432, 2163, 369, 264, 2421, 6486, 1101, 3322, 773, 429, 432, 594, 7010, 3322, 311, 3705, 624, 21, 13, 10783, 697, 38734, 504, 279, 3015, 323, 4057, 279, 6787, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to boil potatoes for easy peeling, follow these steps:\n1. Bring a pot of water to a boil.\n2. With a knife, score your potatoes all the way around the center.\n3. Place your potatoes in the pot and boil for about 15 minutes or so.\n4. Prepare a bowl of ice water and place your potatoes in the water.\n5. Swish it around for a few seconds just enough so that it's cool enough to handle.\n6. Remove your potato from the water and remove the skin.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.307382206616084, "g_worst_claim": 0.0943608283996582, "g_content": 1.5348828125, "g_traj_mean": 1.43306565284729}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 43690, 34167, 369, 4135, 1051, 20058, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 39124, 264, 3338, 315, 3015, 311, 264, 43690, 624, 17, 13, 18115, 697, 34167, 678, 279, 1616, 2163, 279, 4126, 448, 264, 21430, 624, 18, 13, 10771, 697, 34167, 304, 279, 49837, 3015, 323, 4296, 369, 911, 220, 16, 20, 4420, 476, 3080, 27582, 624, 19, 13, 31166, 264, 19212, 315, 9853, 3015, 323, 1992, 697, 34167, 304, 279, 3015, 624, 20, 13, 4492, 812, 1105, 2163, 369, 264, 2421, 6486, 311, 7010, 1105, 1495, 1101, 3322, 311, 3705, 624, 21, 13, 10783, 279, 34167, 504, 279, 3015, 323, 57112, 1007, 279, 6787, 382, 1986, 1714, 25351, 429, 279, 34167, 525, 29105, 3080, 27582, 11, 3259, 279, 1051, 20058, 1882, 3974, 323, 4135, 13, 151645], "pred": "This method ensures that the potatoes are cooked until tender, making the peeling process quick and easy.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.9554038404504769, "g_worst_claim": 0.09448455770810445, "g_content": 1.104626890088691, "g_traj_mean": 0.9925576448440552}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1588, 374, 1246, 311, 43690, 34167, 369, 4135, 1051, 20058, 1447, 16, 13, 39124, 264, 3338, 315, 3015, 311, 264, 43690, 624, 17, 13, 3085, 264, 21430, 11, 5456, 697, 34167, 678, 279, 1616, 2163, 279, 4126, 624, 18, 13, 10771, 697, 34167, 304, 279, 3338, 323, 43690, 369, 911, 220, 16, 20, 4420, 476, 773, 624, 19, 13, 31166, 264, 19212, 315, 9853, 3015, 323, 1992, 697, 34167, 304, 279, 3015, 624, 20, 13, 4492, 812, 432, 2163, 369, 264, 2421, 6486, 1101, 3322, 773, 429, 432, 748, 7010, 3322, 311, 3705, 624, 21, 13, 10783, 697, 38734, 504, 279, 3015, 323, 4057, 279, 6787, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, here is how to boil potatoes for easy peeling:\n\n1. Bring a pot of water to a boil.\n2. With a knife, score your potatoes all the way around the center.\n3. Place your potatoes in the pot and boil for about 15 minutes or so.\n4. Prepare a bowl of ice water and place your potatoes in the water.\n5. Swish it around for a few seconds just enough so that it’s cool enough to handle.\n6. Remove your potato from the water and remove the skin.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.466602016301144, "g_worst_claim": 0.3029615879058838, "g_content": 1.609655539194743, "g_traj_mean": 1.481135606765747}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 43690, 34167, 369, 4135, 1051, 20058, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 39124, 264, 3338, 315, 3015, 311, 264, 43690, 4092, 311, 279, 11221, 624, 17, 13, 18115, 279, 34167, 678, 279, 1616, 2163, 279, 4126, 1667, 264, 21430, 624, 1