{"id": "331", "question": "how to boil potatoes for easy peeling", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's how to boil potatoes for easy peeling:\n\n1. Bring a pot of water to a boil.\n2. Score your potatoes all the way around the center with a knife.\n3. Place your potatoes in the pot and boil for about 15 minutes or so.\n4. Prepare a bowl of ice water and place your potatoes in the water.\n5. Swish it around for a few seconds just enough so that it’s cool enough to handle.\n6. Remove your potato from the water and remove the skin.\n\nThe ice water bath helps to stop the cooking process and cool down the potatoes quickly, making the skin easier to peel off.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to boil potatoes for easy peeling, follow these steps:\n1. Bring a pot of water to a boil.\n2. Score your potatoes all the way around the center with a knife.\n3. Place your potatoes in the pot and boil for about 15 minutes or so.\n4. Prepare a bowl of ice water and place your potatoes in the water.\n5. Swish it around for a few seconds just enough so that it's cool enough to handle.\n6. Remove your potatoes from the water and remove the skin.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to boil potatoes for easy peeling, follow these steps:\n1. Bring a pot of water to a boil.\n2. Score your potatoes all the way around the center with a knife.\n3. Place your potatoes in the pot and boil for about 15 minutes or so.\n4. Prepare a bowl of ice water and place your potatoes in the water.\n5. Swish it around for a few seconds just enough so that it's cool enough to handle.\n6. Remove your potatoes from the water and remove the skin.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to boil potatoes for easy peeling, follow these steps:\\n1. Bring a pot of water to a boil.\\n2. With a knife, score your potatoes all the way around the center.\\n3. Place your potatoes in the pot and boil for about 15 minutes or so.\\n4. Prepare a bowl of ice water and place your potatoes in the water.\\n5. Swish it around for a few seconds just enough so that it's cool enough to handle.\\n6. Remove your potato from the water and remove the skin.\", \"Based on the given passages, to boil potatoes for easy peeling, follow these steps:\\n1. Bring a pot of water to a boil.\\n2. Score your potatoes all the way around the center with a knife.\\n3. Place your potatoes in the pot and boil for about 15 minutes or so.\\n4. Prepare a bowl of ice water and place your potatoes in the water.\\n5. Swish it around for a few seconds just enough so that it's cool enough to handle.\\n6. Remove your potatoes from the water and remove the skin.\", \"Based on the given passages, to boil potatoes for easy peeling, follow these steps:\\n1. Bring a pot of water to a boil.\\n2. Score your potatoes all the way around the center.\\n3. Place your potatoes in the pot and boil for about 15 minutes or so.\\n4. Prepare a bowl of ice water and place your potatoes in the water.\\n5. Swish it around for a few seconds just enough so that it’s cool enough to handle.\\n6. Remove your potato from the water and remove the skin.\", \"Based on the given passages, to boil potatoes for easy peeling, you should:\\n\\n1. Bring a pot of water to a boil.\\n2. With a knife, score your potatoes all the way around the center.\\n3. Place your potatoes in the pot and boil for about 15 minutes or so.\\n4. Prepare a bowl of ice water and place your potatoes in the water.\\n5. Swish it around for a few seconds just enough so that it’s cool enough to handle.\"]", "time_sec": 22.777, "generation_time_seconds": 21.7425, "selection_time_seconds": 1.0256, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 43690, 34167, 369, 4135, 1051, 20058, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 510, 16, 13, 39124, 264, 3338, 315, 3015, 311, 264, 43690, 624, 17, 13, 30