g_worst_claim": 0.04117056727409363, "g_content": 2.0047772904516945, "g_traj_mean": 1.4248954057693481}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1588, 374, 1246, 311, 1281, 55149, 1447, 16, 13, 1416, 1081, 9400, 25, 715, 256, 481, 26070, 264, 6819, 476, 60103, 39058, 311, 11051, 320, 18, 20, 15, 58472, 311, 220, 19, 20, 15, 58472, 4292, 256, 481, 10783, 279, 55149, 504, 279, 46399, 11, 1992, 1105, 13041, 88, 24067, 705, 389, 279, 39058, 624, 256, 481, 32988, 1105, 448, 19187, 624, 256, 481, 17757, 279, 39058, 323, 4296, 369, 220, 20, 4420, 624, 256, 481, 40284, 323, 15625, 279, 55149, 323, 4296, 2441, 220, 20, 4420, 624, 256, 481, 15003, 311, 4296, 11, 64661, 323, 76726, 1449, 220, 20, 4420, 11, 3080, 279, 19187, 702, 12045, 6758, 323, 279, 55149, 525, 31713, 1526, 323, 614, 39058, 15423, 624, 256, 481, 10657, 1081, 9400, 882, 25, 220, 17, 15, 4420, 382, 17, 13, 1416, 23387, 22471, 10823, 510, 256, 481, 10783, 279, 38554, 504, 279, 5622, 315, 279, 55149, 624, 256, 481, 10224, 279, 55149, 304, 264, 312, 325, 278, 480, 8968, 323, 912, 14016, 45277, 19187, 311, 3421, 624, 256, 481, 7083, 279, 27815, 7215, 448, 8811, 14189, 46399, 11, 49817, 46399, 311, 1855, 264, 15632, 382, 18, 13, 14263, 287, 510, 256, 481, 43924, 279, 55149, 389, 1909, 315, 279, 29659, 304, 264, 3175, 6193, 624, 256, 481, 19219, 64307, 448, 14473, 16205, 320, 333, 1667, 8, 323, 15625, 55149, 389, 2176, 11067, 624, 256, 481, 15515, 35144, 55149, 448, 9058, 10273, 323, 3272, 29273, 311, 5978, 279, 10273, 34951, 288, 311, 279, 20131, 13041, 13, 151645], "pred": "3. Seasoning:\n   - Lay the ribs on top of the rack in a single layer.\n   - Mix mustard with liquid smoke (if using) and brush ribs on both sides.\n   - Sprinkle ribs with dry rub and pat gently to ensure the rub adheres to the rib meat.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.344233102764505, "g_worst_claim": 0.1728929877281189, "g_content": 2.2682282690908395, "g_traj_mean": 1.3769057989120483}}], "