ite bread through the shredding disk of a food processor to make coarse crumbs.\n3. Spread the crumbs on a baking sheet.\n4. Bake in the preheated oven until the crumbs are dry but not toasted, for about 6 to 8 minutes.\n5. Shake the baking sheet twice during baking to ensure even drying.\n6. Once baked, remove the crumbs from the oven and allow them to cool completely.\n7. Transfer the cooled crumbs to an airtight container and store them at room temperature for up to 2 weeks.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.9343962203757782, "g_worst_claim": 0.27608846581500507, "g_content": 1.2444535407467165, "g_traj_mean": 0.8354106545448303}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 3, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 71.35, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "412", "question": "how do i breed a shugabeats in my singing monsters", "gt": "To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you must first obtain the Shugabush Monster from another island. This will turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg. After hatching them, buy the breeding structure. Then, use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats monster. The order of the monsters does not matter.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg.\n3. Hatch the egg.\n4. Buy the breeding structure.\n5. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg.\n3. Hatch the egg.\n4. Buy the breeding structure.\n5. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg.\\n3. Hatch the egg.\\n4. Buy the breeding structure.\\n5. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into eggs.\\n3. Hatch the eggs.\\n4. Purchase the breeding structure.\\n5. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.\", \"Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from another island.\\n2. Turn the Shugabush Monster into an egg by hatching it.\\n3. Purchase the breeding structure for the Shugabush Island.\\n4. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to breed the Shugabeats.\\n5. Note that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island. Doing this will turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg, which you then need to hatch. After hatching, you should buy the breeding structure and use the combination of the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats. It's important to note that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter.\"]", "time_sec": 16.556, "generation_time_seconds": 15.9093, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6401, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 27775, 264, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 304, 3017, 10833, 287, 62708, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 63424, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 27973, 504, 279, 1008, 12922, 624, 17, 13, 11999, 697, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 62708, 1119, 458, 18636, 624, 18, 13, 58894, 279, 18636, 624, 19, 13, 11292, 279, 39208, 5944, 624, 20, 13, 5443, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 323, 279, 49840, 38630, 304, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 10720, 39208, 5944, 311, 633, 279, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg.\n3. Hatch the egg.\n4. Buy the breeding structure.\n5. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Isla