them.\\n3. Purchase the breeding structure for the Shugabush Island.\\n4. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the breeding structure to create the Shugabeats.\\n\\nNote: The order in which you breed the monsters does not matter.\", \"Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you must obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island. Doing this will turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg. The next step is to hatch the eggs and then buy the breeding structure. Then, breed the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats. It's important to note that the breeding of monsters left or right does not matter.\", \"Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg.\\n3. Hatch the egg.\\n4. Purchase the breeding structure.\\n5. Breed the Shugabush and Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.\"]", "time_sec": 16.487, "generation_time_seconds": 15.7026, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7788, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 27775, 264, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 304, 3017, 10833, 287, 62708, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 63424, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 27973, 504, 279, 1008, 12922, 624, 17, 13, 11999, 697, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 62708, 1119, 458, 18636, 624, 18, 13, 58894, 279, 18636, 624, 19, 13, 11292, 279, 39208, 5944, 624, 20, 13, 5443, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 323, 279, 49840, 38630, 304, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 10720, 39208, 5944, 311, 633, 279, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters in