{"id": "415", "question": "how do i breed a shugabeats in my singing monsters", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's what we know about breeding a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters:\n\n* We need to breed a Shugabush Monster with a Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get a Shugabeats.\n* The breeding combination for Shugabeats is Shugabush + Furcorn.\n* Breeding left or right does not matter.\n\nTherefore, to breed a Shugabeats, you need to have a Shugabush Monster and a Furcorn, and then breed them together in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.\n\nAnswer: Breed a Shugabush Monster and a Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters:\n\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg.\n3. Hatch the egg.\n4. Buy the breeding structure.\n5. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters:\n\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg.\n3. Hatch the egg.\n4. Buy the breeding structure.\n5. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg.\\n3. Hatch the egg.\\n4. Buy the breeding structure.\\n5. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.\", \"Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from another island. This will turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg, which you then need to hatch. Afterward, you should buy the breeding structure on the Shugabush Island. To breed the Shugabeats, combine the Shugabush and the Furcorn using the breeding structure. It's important to note that breeding the monsters left or right does not matter.\", \"Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters:\\n\\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg.\\n3. Hatch the egg.\\n4. Buy the breeding structure.\\n5. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.\", \"Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.\"]", "time_sec": 14.83, "generation_time_seconds": 14.1031, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7191, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 27775, 264, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 304, 3017, 10833, 287, 62708, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 63424, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 27973, 504, 279, 1008, 12922, 624, 17, 13, 11999, 697, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 62708, 1119, 458, 18636, 624, 18, 13, 58894, 279, 18636, 624, 19, 13, 11292, 279, 39208, 5944, 624, 20, 13, 5443, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 323, 279, 49840, 38630, 304, 279, 1417, 768, 370, 1116, 10720, 39208, 5944, 311, 633, 279, 1417, 768, 8229, 1862, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island.\n2. Turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg.\n3. Hatch the egg.\n4. Buy the breeding structure.\n5. Use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.129042307