{"id": "436", "question": "how to find someone in france", "gt": "To find someone in France, you can use the website www.pagesjaunes.fr, the French version of the white pages. Enter the last name of the person in the \"Nom\" field and optionally enter their first name in the \"Prenom\" field. If you know the address, you can enter it in the \"Ou\" section. Leave it blank if you don't know the address. Click on \"Trouver\" to search for the name. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number of the matching listings.", "pred": "These steps are based on the information provided in passages 1, 2, and 3.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "These steps are based on the information provided in passages 1, 2, and 3.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to find someone in France, you can use the French white pages (in English) at http://www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en. When searching, instead of typing Paris in the City field, write IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field. This will search for the person in Paris and its suburbs. Additionally, you can try posting an MC (missed connection) on Paris Craigslist (http://paris.craigslist.org/cgi-bin/pers...\", \"To find someone in France, you can use the French white pages, which can be accessed through www.pagesjaunes.fr. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field. You can also enter a first name in the Prenom field if you know it. If you have address information, you can enter it in the Ou section. Otherwise, you can leave it blank to search the entire country. Clicking the Trouver button will search for the name and display the search results, which will show the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria. Another option is to try posting an MC (missed connection) on Paris Craigslist.\", \"Based on the given passages, to find someone in France, you can use the following steps:\\n1. Visit www.pagesjaunes.fr, the Pages Blanches, which is the French version of the white pages.\\n2. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field.\\n3. Optionally, you can enter a first name in the Prenom field.\\n4. If you know the address, enter it in the Ou section; otherwise, leave it blank to search the entire country.\\n5. Click the Trouver button to search for the name.\\n6. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\", \"Based on the given passages, here are the steps to find someone in France:\\n\\n1. Go to www.pagesjaunes.fr, the French version of the white pages.\\n\\n2. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field.\\n\\n3. You can enter a first name in the Prenom field, but it's optional.\\n\\n4. If you know the address, enter it in the Ou section. Otherwise, leave it blank to search the entire country.\\n\\n5. Click Trouver to search for the name.\\n\\n6. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\\n\\nThese steps are based on the information provided in passages 1, 2, and 3.\"]", "time_sec": 19.717, "generation_time_seconds": 18.9674, "selection_time_seconds": 0.744, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 1477, 4325, 304, 9625, 11, 498, 646, 990, 279, 8585, 4158, 6816, 320, 258, 6364, 8, 518, 1758, 1110, 2136, 37980, 5580, 8531, 18798, 4322, 65, 59014, 30, 5205, 61757, 13, 3197, 15039, 11, 4518, 315, 19496, 12095, 304, 279, 4311, 2070, 11, 3270, 71555, 320, 269, 358, 273, 409, 9625, 8, 304, 279, 50221, 9290, 476, 5537, 2070, 13, 1096, 686, 2711, 369, 279, 1697, 304, 12095, 323, 1181, 46913, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 1430, 17004, 458, 20869, 320, 1831, 291, 3633, 8, 389, 12095, 72292, 320, 1254, 1110, 1732