{"id": "438", "question": "how to find someone in france", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are the steps to find someone in France:\n\n1. Check the French White Pages (in English): You can use the website pagesjaunes.fr to search for people in France. To search for someone in Paris or its suburbs, enter \"IDF\" (Ile de France) in the department or region field instead of typing Paris.\n2. Use the nom field to enter the last name of the person you are looking for, and you can also include their first name in the prenom field.\n3. Provide address information, if known, in the ou section to refine your search.\n4. Click \"trouver\" to search for the name, and the search results will display name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\n\nNote that the effectiveness of these methods may depend on how up-to-date the information in the white pages is and whether the person you are looking for has listed their contact information publicly.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to find someone in France, you can use the French white pages (in English) at www.pagesjaunes.fr. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field, and optionally first name and address information. Click Trouver to search for the name. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to find someone in France, you can use the French white pages (in English) at www.pagesjaunes.fr. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field, and optionally first name and address information. Click Trouver to search for the name. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to find someone in France, you can use the French white pages (in English) at http://www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en. When searching, instead of typing Paris in the City field, write IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field. This will search for the person in Paris and its suburbs. Additionally, you can try posting an MC (missed connection) on Paris Craigslist (http://paris.craigslist.org/cgi-bin/pers...\", \"Based on the given passages, here are the steps to find someone in France:\\n\\n1. Visit www.pagesjaunes.fr, the French version of the white pages.\\n2. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field.\\n3. Optionally, enter a first name in the Prenom field.\\n4. Enter address information in the Ou section if known, otherwise leave it blank to search the entire country.\\n5. Click Trouver to search for the name.\\n6. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\", \"Based on the given passages, to find someone in France, you can use the French white pages (in English) at www.pagesjaunes.fr. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field, and optionally first name and address information. Click Trouver to search for the name. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\", \"Based on the given passages, here is how to find someone in France:\\n\\n1. Visit www.pagesjaunes.fr, the French version of the white pages.\\n2. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field.\\n3. Optionally, enter a first name in the Prenom field.\\n4. Enter address information in the Ou section if known.\\n5. Click Trouver to search for the name.\\n6. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\\n\\nAlternative methods mentioned:\\n- Use the French white pages (in English): http://www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en\\n- Post a missing person notice on Paris Craigslist: http://paris.craigslist.org/cgi-bin/pers...\"]", "time_sec": 18.973, "generation_time_seconds": 18.1325, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8315, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 1477, 4325, 304, 9625, 11, 498, 646, 990, 279, 8585, 4158, 6816, 320, 258, 6364, 8, 518, 1758, 1110, 2136, 37980, 5580, 8531, 18798, 4322, 65, 59014, 30, 5205, 61757, 13, 3197, 15039, 11, 4518, 315, 19496, 12095, 304, 279, 4311, 2070, 11, 3270, 71555, 320, 269, 358, 273, 409, 9625, 8, 304, 279, 50221, 9290, 476, 5537, 2070, 13, 1096, 686, 2711, 369, 279, 1697, 304, 12095, 323, 1181, 46913, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 1430, 17004, 458, 20869, 320, 1831, 291, 3633, 8, 389, 12095, 72292, 320, 1254, 1110, 1732, 285, 520, 956, 48922, 2659, 70416, 49125, 4322, 388, 1112, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to find someone in France, you can use the French white pages (in English) at http://www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en. When searching, instead of typing Paris in the City field, write IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field. This will search for the person in Paris and its suburbs. Additionally, you can try posting an MC (missed connection) on Paris Craigslist (http://paris.craigslist.org/cgi-bin/pers...", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.1007421132877773, "g_worst_claim": 0.224747101465861, "g_content": 3.5599007955411586, "g_traj_mean": 2.6269114017486572}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1588, 525, 279, 7354, 311, 1477, 4325, 304, 9625, 1447, 16, 13, 19008, 8438, 37980, 5580, 8531, 18798, 11, 279, 8585, 2319, 315, 279, 4158, 6816, 624, 17, 13, 11252, 279, 1537, 829, 315, 279, 1697, 498, 2299, 15039, 369, 304, 279, 36900, 2070, 624, 18, 13, 96195, 11, 3725, 264, 1156, 829, 304, 279, 393, 44843, 2070, 624, 19, 13, 11252, 2621, 1995, 304, 279,