{"id": "439", "question": "how to find someone in france", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's how to find someone in France:\n\n1. Use a people search website specifically designed for France, such as People Search France.\n2. Check the French white pages (in English) at PagesJaunes.fr. Instead of typing Paris in the City field, write IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field to search for the person in Paris and its suburbs.\n3. Post a missed connection (MC) on Paris Craigslist.\n4. Visit the Pages Blanches (the French version of the white pages) at PagesJaunes.fr. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field, and optionally enter a first name in the Prenom field. Enter address information, if known, in the Ou section. Click Trouver to search for the name. The search results will display name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to find someone in France:\n1. Visit www.pagesjaunes.fr, the French version of the white pages.\n2. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field.\n3. Optionally, enter a first name in the Prenom field.\n4. Enter address information, if known, in the Ou section.\n5. If you want to search the entire country, leave the Ou section blank.\n6. Click Trouver to search for the name.\n7. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to find someone in France:\n1. Visit www.pagesjaunes.fr, the French version of the white pages.\n2. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field.\n3. Optionally, enter a first name in the Prenom field.\n4. Enter address information, if known, in the Ou section.\n5. If you want to search the entire country, leave the Ou section blank.\n6. Click Trouver to search for the name.\n7. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to find someone in France, you can use the French white pages (in English) at http://www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en. When searching, instead of typing Paris in the City field, write IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field. This will search for the person in Paris and its suburbs. Additionally, you can try posting an MC (missed connection) on Paris Craigslist (http://paris.craigslist.org/cgi-bin/pers...\", \"Based on the given passages, here is how to find someone in France:\\n\\n1. Visit www.pagesjaunes.fr, the French version of the white pages.\\n2. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field.\\n3. Enter a first name in the Prenom field if you have it.\\n4. Enter address information, if known, in the Ou section or leave it blank to search the entire country.\\n5. Click Trouver to search for the name.\\n6. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\", \"Based on the given passages, here are the steps to find someone in France:\\n1. Visit www.pagesjaunes.fr, the French version of the white pages.\\n2. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field.\\n3. Optionally, enter a first name in the Prenom field.\\n4. Enter address information, if known, in the Ou section.\\n5. If you want to search the entire country, leave the Ou section blank.\\n6. Click Trouver to search for the name.\\n7. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\", \"Based on the given passages, here's how to find someone in France:\\n\\n1. Visit www.pagesjaunes.fr, the Pages Blanches (French version of the white pages).\\n2. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the 'Nom' field.\\n3. If you know the first name, enter it in the 'Prenom' field.\\n4. Enter any known address information in the 'Ou' section.\\n5. If no specific information is known, leave the 'Ou' section blank to search the entire country.\\n6. Click 'Trouver' to search for the name.\\n7. The search results will display the name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\"]", "time_sec": 21.689, "generation_time_seconds": 20.8795, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8003, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 1477, 4325, 304, 9625, 11, 498, 646, 990, 279, 8585, 4158, 6816, 320, 258, 6364, 8, 518, 1758, 1110, 2136, 37980, 5580, 8531, 18798, 4322, 65, 59014, 30, 5205, 61757, 13, 3197, 15039, 11, 4518, 315, 19496, 12095, 304, 279, 4311, 2070, 11, 3270, 71555, 320, 269, 358, 273, 409, 9625, 8, 304, 279, 50221, 9290, 476, 5537, 2070, 13, 1096, 686, 2711, 369, 279, 1697, 304, 12095, 323, 1181, 46913, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 1430, 17004, 458, 20869, 320, 1831, 291, 3633, 8, 389, 12095, 72292, 320, 1254, 1110, 1732, 285, 520, 956, 48922, 2659, 70416, 49125, 4322, 388, 1112, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to find someone in France, you can use the French white pages (in English) at http://www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en. When searching, instead of typing Paris in the City field, write IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field. This will search for the person in Paris and its suburbs. Additionally, you can try posting an MC (missed connection) on Paris Craigslist (http://paris.craigslist.org/cgi-bin/pers...", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0788695788483174, "g_worst_claim": 0.22620713710784912, "g_content": 3.5661829506478657, "g_traj_mean": 2.6089346408843994}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1588,