s' resentment towards British control and taxation policies.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2904241271239767, "g_worst_claim": 0.25735942522684735, "g_content": 1.8680610656738281, "g_traj_mean": 1.209579586982727}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 14889, 1671, 16441, 311, 279, 54787, 3218, 315, 220, 16, 22, 21, 20, 304, 5257, 5510, 11, 2176, 16401, 323, 2477, 75727, 306, 13, 576, 2856, 12720, 3855, 448, 25650, 21907, 1741, 438, 9963, 11929, 323, 76574, 77001, 1075, 330, 2753, 15190, 367, 2041, 78046, 1189, 4354, 11, 1493, 25650, 21907, 3545, 80600, 1119, 16877, 804, 448, 7855, 14856, 11, 6388, 311, 37711, 13, 576, 54787, 3218, 572, 3884, 438, 264, 5089, 53343, 389, 279, 14889, 1671, 6, 3188, 553, 48841, 2118, 50627, 2041, 862, 14433, 11, 892, 572, 264, 3598, 1459, 315, 51140, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the colonists responded to the Stamp Act of 1765 in various ways, both violent and non-violent. The initial reaction started with peaceful protests such as holding signs and chanting slogans like \"No Taxation without Representation.\" However, these peaceful protests often escalated into confrontations with British soldiers, leading to arrests. The Stamp Act was seen as a significant infringement on the colonists' rights by imposing direct taxation without their consent, which was a major point of contention.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.0045854550078666, "g_worst_claim": 0.11268192788828975, "g_content": 1.3784419468470983, "g_traj_mean": 0.8982905149459839}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 3, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 38.22, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "461", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "gt": "Cupping massage has several benefits. It is known to help eliminate toxins from the body and improve blood circulation. It also aids in pain relief by reducing tissue inflammation, which subsequently improves flexibility and increases range of motion. Additionally, cupping massage has mental benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include:\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include:\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include:\\n\\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.\\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include:\\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.\\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include:\\n\\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. This is achieved through the creation of a vacuum in the cup, which applies negative pressure.\\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can improve range of motion, increase flexibility, and control pain.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include:\\n\\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage effectively removes toxins from the body, as a vacuum is created in the cup, applying negative pressure.\\n2. Improved circulation: Cupping increases blood circulation.\\n3. Pain relief: It reduces inflammation of tissues, enhancing range of motion, flexibility, and controlling pain.\\n4. Mental benefits: Cupping massage decreases anxiety and depression, providing therapeutic effects.\"]", "time_sec": 17.208, "generation_time_seconds": 16.4163, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7864, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 374, 458, 7373, 1616, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 13, 3197, 264, 28202, 374, 3465, 304, 279, 10525, 11, 264, 8225, 7262, 374, 9251, 624, 17, 13, 58123, 34755, 25, 61597, 6543, 34755, 646, 1083, 387, 7117, 911, 553, 10525, 9989, 624, 18, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 8609, 7949, 36040, 315, 38781, 13, 1096, 646, 1492, 5263, 2088, 315, 11379, 11, 7269, 24177, 11, 323, 2524, 6646, 624, 19, 13, 37795, 7567, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 1083, 702, 36371, 7567, 1075, 43549, 18056, 323, 18210, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6440436219878214, "g_worst_claim": 0.28201643625895184, "g_content": 1.9630764820536628, "g_traj_mean": 1.5876879692077637}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 510, 16, 13, 42320, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 374, 458, 7373, 1616, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 13, 3197, 264, 28202, 374, 3465, 304, 279, 10525, 11, 264, 8225, 7262, 374, 9251, 624, 17, 13, 58123, 34755, 25, 61597, 6543, 34755, 646, 1083, 387, 7117, 911, 553, 10525, 9989, 624, 18, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 8609, 7949, 36040, 315, 38781, 13, 1096, 646, 1492, 5263, 2088, 315, 11379, 11, 7269, 24177, 11, 323, 2524, 6646, 624, 19, 13, 37795, 7567, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 1083, 702, 36371, 7567, 1075, 43549, 18056, 323, 18210, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include:\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.64613555834008, "g_worst_claim": 0.28201643625895184, "g_content": 1.9612743190077484, "g_traj_mean": 1.5862176418304443}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 374, 458, 7373, 1616, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 13, 1096, 374, 16994, 1526, 279, 9688, 315, 264, 28202, 304, 279, 10525, 11, 892, 16790, 8225, 7262, 624, 17, 13, 58123, 34755, 25, 61597, 6543, 34755, 646, 1083, 387, 7117, 911, 553, 10525, 9989, 624, 18, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 8609, 7949, 36040, 315, 38781, 11, 892, 646, 7269, 2088, 315, 11379, 11, 5263, 24177, 11, 323, 2524, 6646, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include:\n\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. This is achieved through the creation of a vacuum in the cup, which applies negative pressure.\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\n3. Pain relie