ing massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body.\\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include:\\n\\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body.\\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues, which can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.\\n\\nAdditionally, the passages mention that the vacuum created in the cup during a cupping massage applies a negative pressure. This further supports the benefits of detoxification and improved circulation.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include:\\n\\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage effectively removes toxins from the body.\\n2. Improved circulation: It increases blood circulation.\\n3. Pain relief: Helps reduce inflammation and pain, improving range of motion and flexibility.\\n4. Mental benefits: Reduces anxiety and depression.\"]", "time_sec": 16.906, "generation_time_seconds": 16.1808, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7178, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 374, 458, 7373, 1616, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 13, 3197, 264, 28202, 374, 3465, 304, 279, 10525, 11, 264, 8225, 7262, 3