{"id": "464", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of cupping massage:\n\n* Eliminates toxins\n* Improves circulation\n* Provides pain relief\n* Reduces inflammation\n* Has therapeutic benefits such as reducing anxiety and depression\n\nAccording to the passages, cupping massage can help remove toxins from the body, increase blood flow, relieve pain, and have a positive impact on mental well-being.", "pred": "1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include:\\n\\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.\\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include:\\n\\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage effectively removes toxins from the body by creating a vacuum that applies negative pressure.\\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation is brought about by cupping, enhancing overall health.\\n3. Pain relief: Cupping massage reduces inflammation of tissues, which can enhance range of motion, improve flexibility, and alleviate pain.\\n4. Mental benefits: Cupping massage offers therapeutic advantages, such as decreasing anxiety and depression.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include the following: 1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. 2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping. 3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression. Additionally, a cupping massage helps to eliminate toxins from the body through the use of a vacuum to create a negative pressure.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include:\\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage effectively removes toxins from the body by creating negative pressure within the cups.\\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation is achieved through cupping, benefiting overall health.\\n3. Pain relief: Cupping massage reduces inflammation and pain in tissues, enhancing flexibility and range of motion.\\n4. Mental benefits: It offers therapeutic effects such as decreasing anxiety and depression, contributing to mental well-being.\"]", "time_sec": 17.428, "generation_time_seconds": 16.8154, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6083, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 374, 458, 7373, 1616, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 13, 3197, 264, 28202, 374, 3465, 304, 279, 10525, 11, 264, 8225, 7262, 374, 9251, 624, 17, 13, 58123, 34755, 25, 61597, 6543, 34755, 646, 1083, 387, 7117, 911, 553, 10525, 9989, 624, 18, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 8609, 7949, 36040, 315, 38781, 13, 1096, 646, 1492, 5263, 2088, 315, 11379, 11, 7269, 24177, 11, 323, 2524, 6646, 624, 19, 13, 37795, 7567, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 1083, 702, 36371, 7567, 1075, 43549, 18056, 323, 18210, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can also be brought about by cupping.\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7335954574252421, "g_worst_claim": 0.2779136498769124, "g_content": 2.0803904298876152, "g_traj_mean": 1.6504006385803223}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 13444, 28160, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 553, 6825, 264, 28202, 429, 16790, 8225, 7262, 624, 17, 13, 58123, 34755, 25, 61597, 6543, 34755, 374, 7117, 911, 553, 10525, 9989, 11, 46494, 8084, 2820, 62