ht about by cupping. 3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain. Mental benefits: A cupping massage also has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression. Additionally, a cupping massage helps to eliminate toxins from the body through the use of a vacuum to create a negative pressure.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6442690211691908, "g_worst_claim": 0.2779136498769124, "g_content": 2.028653693921638, "g_traj_mean": 1.5320606231689453}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 510, 16, 13, 42320, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 13444, 28160, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 553, 6825, 8225, 7262, 2878, 279, 25374, 624, 17, 13, 58123, 34755, 25, 61597, 6543, 34755, 374, 16994, 1526, 10525, 9989, 11, 82915, 8084, 2820, 624, 18, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 10861, 9989, 6245, 25271, 36040, 323, 6646, 304, 38781, 11, 46494, 24177, 323, 2088, 315, 11379, 624, 19, 13, 37795, 7567, 25, 1084, 6081, 36371, 6239, 1741, 438, 43549, 18056, 323, 18210, 11, 28720, 311, 10502, 1632, 32751, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of cupping massage include:\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage effectively removes toxins from the body by creating negative pressure within the cups.\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation is achieved through cupping, benefiting overall health.\n3. Pain relief: Cupping massage reduces inflammation and pain in tissues, enhancing flexibility and range of motion.\n4. Mental benefits: It offers therapeutic effects such as decreasing anxiety and depression, contributing to mental well-being.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.343386503833863, "g_worst_claim": 0.2779136498769124, "g_content": 1.876293454851423, "g_traj_mean": 1.2473071813583374}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 48.08, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "467", "question": "benefits of hiking as a hobby facts", "gt": "Hiking as a hobby has numerous benefits for both the body and the mind. It is an inexpensive and accessible activity that can be enjoyed by individuals of all fitness levels. Hiking allows people to explore and discover beautiful natural areas, promoting a deeper connection with the environment. It also has positive effects on mental health, reducing stress and anxiety. Additionally, hiking is a cardiovascular activity that can improve overall fitness and reduce the risk of heart disease. Exposure to sunshine during hiking can also increase vitamin D levels in the body. Overall, hiking offers a wide range of benefits for individuals seeking physical and mental well-being.", "pred": "These benefits highlight the positive impact of hiking on both physical and mental well-being, making it a valuable hobby for individuals looking to improve their health and connect with nature.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "These benefits highlight the positive impact of hiking on both physical and mental well-being, making it a valuable hobby for individuals looking to improve their health and connect with nature.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, hiking as a hobby offers several benefits:\\n\\n1. **Mental Health**: Hiking promotes mental health by being more varied than other types of exercise, particularly those undertaken in a gym. It helps combat symptoms of stress and anxiety, as being in nature is ingrained in our DNA.\\n\\n2. **Physical Fitness**: Hiking is a cardiovascular activity that can reduce the chances of heart disease and increase overall fitness, depending on how hard one pushes during a hike.\\n\\n3. **Accessibility**: Hiking is inexpensive and easy to start, making it accessible to people of all fitness levels. Most people live within driving distance of wonderful hiking spots, which is a good way of getting to know an area.\\n\\n4. **Sunlight Exposure**: Being exposed to sunshine while hiking increases levels of vitamin D, which is beneficial for overall health.\\n\\nThese benefits highlight the positive impact of hiking on both physical and mental well-being, making it a valuable hobby for individuals looking to improve their health and connect with nature.\", \"Based on the given passages, hiking as a hobby offers several benefits:\\n\\n1. **Mental Health**: Hiking promotes mental health by providing a varied form of exercise that can combat symptoms of stress and anxiety. Research shows that being in nature, which is a natural part of our DNA, can help us better manage stress.\\n\\n2. **Physical Health**: Hiking is a cardiovascular activity that can reduce the risk of heart disease and improve overall fitness. Depending on the intensity of the hike, it can also contribute to better cardiovascular health, which is essential for maintaining good physical health.\\n\\n3. **Accessibility**: Hiking is inexpensive and easy to start. Most people live within driving distance of wonderful hiking spots, making it accessible to people of all fitness levels. It's a great way to explore new areas and get to know your surroundings better.\\n\\n4. **Variety**: Compared to other forms of exercise, such as gym workouts, hiking is more varied, offering a different type of physical and mental challenge. This variety can make the activity more enjoyable and engaging.\", \"Based on the given passages, hiking as a hobby offers several benefits for both the body and the mind. It promotes mental health by providing varied exercise, reducing stress and anxiety, and is ingrained in our DNA. It also benefits the cardiovascular system, potentially reducing the chances of heart disease and increasing overall fitness. Hiking is inexpensive and easy to start, making it accessible to people of all fitness levels. It is a good way to discover new areas and get to know the surroundings, contributing to personal growth and appreciation for nature.\", \"Based on the provided passages, the benefits of hiking as a hobby include:\\n\\n1. Outdoor hiking promotes mental health by varying the exercise experience compared to indoor activities.\\n2. Hiking involves exposure to sunshine, which increases vitamin D levels.\\n3. It is a cardiovascular activity that can reduce the chances of heart disease and increase overall fitness.\\n4. Research indicates that hiking has a positive impact on combating stress and anxiety, as it reminds people of their natural connection to the environment.\"]", "time_sec": 22.309, "generation_time_seconds": 21.5441, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7557, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 37364, 438, 264, 31528, 6081, 3807, 7567, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 44, 6296, 6267, 95518, 472, 19233, 38890, 10502, 2820, 553, 1660, 803, 27730, 1091, 1008, 4494, 315, 10158, 11, 7945, 1846, 44079, 304, 264, 18813, 13, 1084, 8609, 12610, 13495, 315, 8464, 323, 18056, 11, 438, 1660, 304, 6993, 374, 80236, 2627, 304, 1039, 15552, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 39253, 35708, 95518, 472, 19233, 374, 264, 40613, 5702, 429, 646, 7949, 279, 16963, 315, 4746, 8457, 323, 5263, 8084, 17042, 11, 11649, 389, 1246, 2588, 825, 40702, 2337, 264, 34231, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 85369, 95518, 472, 19233, 374, 43152, 323, 4135, 311, 1191, 11, 3259, 432, 15614, 311, 1251, 315, 678, 17042, 5866, 13, 7496, 1251, 3887, 2878, 9842, 6010, 315, 11117, 37364, 18773, 11, 892, 374, 264, 1661, 1616, 315, 3709, 311, 1414, 458, 3082, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 30092, 4145, 70766, 95518, 20690, 14900, 311, 51395, 1393, 37364, 12703, 5866, 315, 27071, 422, 11, 892, 374, 23699, 369, 8084, 2820, 382, 9485, 7567, 11167, 279, 6785, 5421, 315, 37364, 389, 2176, 6961, 323, 10502, 1632, 32751, 11, 3259, 432, 264, 15172, 31528, 369, 7775, 3330, 311, 7269, 862, 2820, 323, 4564, 448, 6993, 13, 151645], "pred": "These benefits highlight the positive impact of hiking on both physical and mental well-being, making it a valuable hobby for individuals looking to improve their health and connect with nature.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4588089325813458, "g_worst_claim": 0.07902883782106288, "g_content": 1.8777193679023034, "g_traj_mean": 1.3556619882583618}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 37364, 438, 264, 31528, 6081, 3807, 7567, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 44, 6296, 6267, 95518, 472, 19233, 38890, 10502, 2820, 553, 8241, 264, 27730, 1352, 315, 10158, 429, 646, 12610, 13495, 315, 8464, 323, 18056, 13, 8319, 4933, 429, 1660, 304, 6993, 11, 892, 374, 264, 5810, 949, 315, 1039, 15552, 11, 646, 1492, 601, 2664, 10091, 8464, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 39253, 6267, 95518, 472, 19233, 374, 264, 40613, 5702, 429, 646, 7949, 279, 5214, 315, 4746, 8457, 323, 7269, 8084, 17042, 13, 39630, 389, 279, 20612, 315, 279, 34231, 11, 432, 646, 1083, 16792, 311, 2664, 40613, 2820, 11, 892, 374, 7565, 369, 20337, 1661, 6961, 2820, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 85369, 95518, 472, 19233, 374, 43152, 323, 4135, 311, 1191, 13, 7496, 1251, 3887, 2878, 9842, 6010, 315, 11117, 37364, 18773, 11, 3259, 432, 15614, 311, 1251, 315, 678, 17042, 5866, 13, 1084, 594, 264, 2244, 1616, 311, 13186, 501, 5671, 323, 633, 311, 1414, 697, 39090, 2664, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 56135, 2611, 95518, 58713, 311, 1008, 7586, 315, 10158, 11, 1741, 438, 18813, 45844, 11, 37364, 374, 803, 27730, 11, 10004, 264, 2155, 943, 315, 6961, 323, 10502, 8645, 13, 1096, 8045, 646, 1281, 279, 5702, 803, 31080, 323, 22570, 13, 151645], "pred": "4. **Variety**: Compared to other forms of exercise, such as gym workouts, hiking is more varied, offering a different type of physical and mental challenge. This variety can make the activity more enjoyable and engaging.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.9110260732162687, "g_worst_claim": 0.26229145129521686, "g_content": 1.51531248826247, "g_traj_mean": 0.9271308779716492}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 37364, 438, 264, 31528, 6081, 3807, 7567, 369, 2176, 279, 2487, 323, 279, 3971, 13, 1084, 38890, 10502, 2820, 553, 8241, 27730, 10158, 11, 17719, 8464, 323, 18056, 11, 323, 374, 80236, 2627, 304, 1039, 15552, 13, 1084, 1083, 7567, 279, 40613, 1849, 11, 13581, 17719, 279, 16963, 315, 4746, 8457, 323, 7703, 8084, 17042, 13, 472, 19233, 374, 43152, 323, 4135, 311, 1191, 11, 3259, 432, 15614, 311, 1251, 315, 678, 17042, 5866, 13, 1084, 374, 264, 1661, 1616, 311, 6997, 501, 5671, 323, 633, 311, 1414, 279, 39090, 11, 28720, 311, 4345, 6513, 323, 34896, 369, 6993, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, hiking as a hobby offers several benefits for both the body and the mind. It promotes mental health by providing varied exercise, reducing stress and anxiety, and is ingrained in our DNA. It also benefits the cardiovascular system, potentially reducing the chances of heart disease and increasing overall fitness. Hiking is inexpensive and easy to start, making it accessible to people of all fitness levels. It is a good way to discover new areas and get to know the surroundings, contributing to personal growth and appreciation for nature.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2544231284060345, "g_worst_claim": 0.2612052758534749, "g_content": 2.0756009659677184, "g_traj_mean": 1.2663546800613403}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 3897, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 37364, 438, 264, 31528, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 32682, 37364, 38890, 10502, 2820, 553, 28765, 279, 10158, 3139, 7707, 311, 29519, 7488, 624, 17, 13, 472, 19233, 17601, 14338, 311, 51395, 11, 892, 12703, 27071, 422, 5866, 624, 18, 13, 1084, 374, 264, 40613, 5702, 429, 646, 7949, 279, 16963, 315, 4746, 8457, 323, 5263, 8084, 17042, 624, 19, 13, 8319, 14807, 429, 37364, 702, 264, 6785, 5421, 389, 95078, 8464, 323, 18056, 11, 438, 432, 34610, 1251, 315, 862, 5810, 3633, 311, 279, 4573, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Outdoor hiking promotes mental health by varying the exercise experience compared to indoor activities.\n2. Hiking involves exposure to sunshine, which increases vitamin D levels.\n3. It is a cardiovascular activity that can reduce the chances of heart disease and increase overall fitness.\n4. Research indicates that hiking has a positive impact on combating stress and anxiety, as it reminds people of their natural connection to the environment.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3778524305637538, "g_worst_claim": 0.009916619708140692, "g_content": 2.376639556884766, "g_traj_mean": 1.45675790309906}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.47, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "469", "question": "benefits of hiking as a hobby facts", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of hiking as a hobby:\n\n1. Outdoor hiking promotes mental health (Passage 1).\n2. Hiking can help increase your levels of vitamin D through exposure to sunshine (Passage 2).\n3. Hiking has a positive impact on combating symptoms of stress and anxiety (Passage 3).\n\nTherefore, the main benefits of hiking as a hobby are its positive effects on mental health, physical health, and stress reduction.", "pred": "These benefits highlight the positive impact of hiking on both physical and mental well-being, making it a valuable hobby for individuals looking to improve their health and connect with nature.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "These benefits highlight the positive impact of hiking on both physical and mental well-being, making it a valuable hobby for individuals looking to improve their health and connect with nature.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, hiking as a hobby offers several benefits:\\n\\n1. **Mental Health**: Hiking promotes mental health by being more varied than other types of exercise, particularly those undertaken in a gym. It helps combat symptoms of stress and anxiety, as being in nature is ingrained in our DNA.\\n\\n2. **Physical Fitness**: Hiking is a cardiovascular activity that can reduce the chances of heart disease and increase overall fitness, depending on how hard one pushes during a hike.\\n\\n3. **Accessibility**: Hiking is inexpensive and easy to start, making it accessible to people of all fitness levels. Most people live within driving distance of wonderful hiking spots, which is a good way of getting to know an area.\\n\\n4. **Sunlight Exposure**: Being exposed to sunshine while hiking increases levels of vitamin D, which is beneficial for overall health.\\n\\nThese benefits highlight the positive impact of hiking on both physical and mental well-being, making it a valuable hobby for individuals looking to improve their health and connect with nature.\", \"Based on the given passages, hiking as a hobby offers several benefits. Firstly, it promotes mental health by being more varied than other forms of exercise and being a good way to get to know an area. Secondly, hiking is a cardiovascular activity that can reduce the chances of heart disease and increase overall fitness. Lastly, being exposed to nature while hiking has a positive impact on combating stress and anxiety as it is ingrained in our DNA.\", \"Based on the given passages, hiking has several benefits as a hobby. Firstly, it promotes mental health, as it is more varied than many other types of exercise and being in nature is ingrained in our DNA. Secondly, being exposed to sunshine during a hike will increase your levels of vitamin D, which is beneficial for your cardiovascular system. Hiking can also reduce the chances of heart disease and increase your overall fitness. Additionally, research shows that hiking has a positive impact on combating the symptoms of stress and anxiety.\", \"Based on the given passages, hiking as a hobby offers various benefits:\\n1. **Mental Health**: Hiking promotes mental well-being and can combat stress and anxiety. The exposure to nature is beneficial for mental health, as it aligns with human nature and can help in reducing symptoms of stress and anxiety.\\n2. **Cardiovascular Health**: Hiking is a cardiovascular activity that can reduce the risk of heart disease and improve overall fitness. Depending on the intensity of the hike, it can provide significant benefits to the cardiovascular system.\\n3. **Affordability**: Hiking is inexpensive and easy to start, making it accessible to people of all fitness levels. It can be a good way to explore new areas and discover hiking spots nearby.\\n4. **Variety**: Hiking offers a more varied experience compared to other types of exercise, particularly those done in a gym, which can make the activity more engaging and enjoyable.\\n5. **Sunshine and Vitamin D**: Being exposed to sunlight while hiking can increase vitamin D levels, which is important for overall health and wellbeing.\\n6. **Discovery**: Hiking can be a way to discover new places and get to know an area better, enhancing the experience and making it more enjoyable.\"]", "time_sec": 22.2, "generation_time_seconds": 21.4599, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7354, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 37364, 438, 264, 31528, 6081, 3807, 7567, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 44, 6296, 6267, 95518, 472, 19233, 38890, 10502, 2820, 553, 1660, 803, 27730, 1091, 1008, 4494, 315, 10158, 11, 7945, 1846, 44079, 304, 264, 18813, 13, 1084, 8609, 12610, 13495, 315, 8464, 323, 18056, 11, 438, 1660, 304, 6993, 374, 80236, 2627, 304, 1039, 15552, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 39253, 35708, 95518, 472, 19233, 374, 264, 40613, 5702, 429, 646, 7949, 279, 16963, 315, 4746, 8457, 323, 5263, 8084, 17042, 11, 11649, 389, 1246, 2588, 825, 40702, 2337, 264, 34231, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 85369, 95518, 472, 19233, 374, 43152, 323, 4135, 311, 1191, 11, 3259, 432, 15614, 311, 1251, 315, 678, 17042, 5866, 13, 7496, 1251, 3887, 2878, 9842, 6010, 315, 11117, 37364, 18773, 11, 892, 374, 264, 1661, 1616, 315, 3709, 311, 1414, 458, 3082, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 30092, 4145, 70766, 95518, 20690, 14900, 311, 51395, 1393, 37364, 12703, 5866, 315, 27071, 422, 11, 892, 374, 23699, 369, 8084, 2820, 382, 9485, 7567, 11167, 279, 6785, 5421, 315, 37364, 389, 2176, 6961, 323, 10502, 1632, 32751, 11, 3259, 432, 264, 15172, 31528, 369, 7775, 3330, 311, 7269, 862, 2820, 323, 4564, 448, 6993, 13, 151645], "pred": "These benefits highlight the positive impact of hiking on both physical and mental well-being, making it a valuable hobby for individuals looking to improve their health and connect with nature.", "grounding_scores": {"g