90, 374, 1865, 504, 7722, 1062, 443, 6128, 624, 17, 13, 1230, 1097, 1589, 33457, 5590, 702, 264, 12460, 54179, 323, 17172, 429, 374, 5558, 2337, 73185, 624, 18, 13, 431, 4006, 33457, 5590, 702, 264, 5080, 19578, 1459, 320, 19, 20, 15, 12348, 434, 8, 7707, 311, 650, 1097, 1589, 33457, 5590, 320, 18, 20, 15, 12348, 434, 4292, 19, 13, 1230, 1097, 1589, 33457, 5590, 23377, 264, 23034, 33457, 17172, 323, 54179, 11, 1393, 37191, 33457, 5590, 32191, 1181, 11957, 33457, 17172, 323, 702, 902, 41545, 1238, 12656, 476, 22068, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the differences between refined and unrefined coconut oil include:\n1. Refined coconut oil is made from dried coconuts, while unrefined coconut oil is made from fresh coconuts.\n2. Unrefined coconut oil has a distinct aroma and flavor that is lost during refining.\n3. Refined coconut oil has a higher smoking point (450 degrees F) compared to unrefined coconut oil (350 degrees F).\n4. Unrefined coconut oil carries a mild coconut flavor and aroma, while refined coconut oil loses its signature coconut flavor and has no discernible taste or smell.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.9730104993450596, "g_worst_claim": 0.07404607075911301, "g_content": 1.3400552094872318, "g_traj_mean": 0.9291931986808777}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.21, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "478", "question": "change of address u.s. postal service", "gt": "Passage 3 provides information on how to change your address with the U.S. Postal Service. You can visit their website, call the USPS Call Center, or fill out and submit a form at a U.S. Post Office.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the U.S. Postal Service offers a fast, versatile, and secure change of address service that can notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the Postal Service (USPS). The service can be initiated through three methods: visiting https://moversguide.usps.com/, calling the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or filling out and submitting PS Form 3575 at any U.S. Post Office.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the U.S. Postal Service offers a fast, versatile, and secure change of address service that can notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the Postal Service (USPS). The service can be initiated through three methods: visiting https://moversguide.usps.com/, calling the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or filling out and submitting PS Form 3575 at any U.S. Post Office.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the U.S. Postal Service offers a fast and versatile change of address service that can notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the Postal Service. The service is secure, using the latest encryption technologies to ensure data safety. To change your address, you can visit https://moversguide.usps.com/, call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or fill out and submit PS Form 3575 at any U.S. Post Office.\", \"Based on the given passages, changing your address with the U.S. Postal Service can be done in three ways:\\n\\n1. Visit https://moversguide.usps.com/ and safeguard your personal information with identity validation by a simple $1 charge to your credit or debit card.\\n\\n2. Call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777).\\n\\n3. Fill out and submit PS Form 3575, which can be picked up at any U.S. Post Office, and submitted at the Post Office. The form may be submitted at any U.S. Post Office, mailed to any Post Office, or provided to any Postal Mail Carrier.\", \"Based on the given passages, the U.S. Postal Service offers a fast, versatile, and secure change of address service that can notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the Postal Service (USPS). The service can be initiated through three methods: visiting https://moversguide.usps.com/, calling the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or filling out and submitting PS Form 3575 at any U.S. Post Office.\", \"Based on the given passages, changing your address with the U.S. Postal Service can be done in a few ways:\\n\\n1. **Online**: You can complete the U.S. Postal Service Official Change of Address form online, which can be found through categorized forms that allow you to find what you need quickly and easily.\\n\\n2. **Visit Website**: You can visit https://moversguide.usps.com/ to change your address. This option involves safeguarding your personal information with identity validation by a simple $1 charge to your credit or debit card.\\n\\n3. **Call Center**: You can call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777) to request a change of address.\\n\\n4. **Form Submission**: You can fill out and submit PS Form 3575, which can be picked up at any U.S. Post Office. This form can be submitted at any U.S. Post Office, mailed to any Post Office, or provided to any Postal Mail Carrier.\\n\\nEach method allows for a change of address for services such as forwarding business mail and personal mail, ensuring that you maintain service continuity even when relocating.\"]", "time_sec": 22.909, "generation_time_seconds": 22.1418, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7614, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 547, 808, 13, 54217, 5362, 6081, 264, 4937, 323, 31945, 2297, 315, 2621, 2473, 429, 646, 15456, 705, 311, 220, 16, 15, 15, 11104, 304, 5256, 311, 279, 54217, 5362, 13, 576, 2473, 374, 9767, 11, 1667, 279, 5535, 25463, 14310, 311, 5978, 821, 7149, 13, 2014, 2297, 697, 2621, 11, 498, 646, 3947, 3703, 1110, 76, 8969, 48370, 21916, 1690, 905, 34545, 1618, 279, 84876, 7143, 5832, 518, 220, 16, 12, 23, 15, 15, 12, 7384, 32340, 5012, 320, 16, 12, 23, 15, 15, 12, 17, 22, 20, 12, 23, 22, 22, 22, 701, 476, 5155, 700, 323, 9318, 11405, 3377, 220, 18, 20, 22, 20, 518, 894, 547, 808, 13, 3877, 8246, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the U.S. Postal Service offers a fast and versatile change of address service that can notify up to 100 organizations in addition to the Postal Service. The service is secure, using the latest encryption technologies to ensure data safety. To change your address, you can visit https://moversguide.usps.com/, call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or fill out and submit PS Form 3575 at any U.S. Post Office.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3673709080963539, "g_worst_claim": 0.36424513657887775, "g_content": 2.324169158935547, "g_traj_mean": 1.4402905702590942}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 10018, 697, 2621, 448, 279, 547, 808, 13, 54217, 5362, 646, 387, 2814, 304, 2326, 5510, 1447, 16, 13, 19008, 3703, 1110, 76, 8969, 48370, 21916, 1690, 905, 14, 323, 47971, 697, 4345, 1995, 448, 9569, 10519, 553, 264, 4285, 400, 16, 6757, 311, 697, 6668, 476, 45353, 3701, 382, 17, 13, 7143, 279, 84876, 7143, 5832, 518, 220, 16, 12, 23, 15, 15, 12, 7384, 32340, 5012, 320, 16, 12, 23, 15, 15, 12, 17, 22, 20, 12, 23, 22, 22, 22, 3593, 18, 13, 21979, 700, 323, 9318, 11405, 3377, 220, 18, 20, 22, 20, 11, 892, 646, 387, 12771, 705, 518, 894, 547, 808, 13, 3877, 8246, 11, 323, 14634, 518, 279, 3877, 8246, 13, 576, 