{"id": "481", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked if you have used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The company does not guarantee your security when using these apps and may send you a warning message before locking your account. If you have been warned multiple times and continue using third-party apps, your account may remain locked.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.\", \"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat is temporarily locked because you used a third-party app to access Snapchat. The company cannot guarantee your security if you use third-party apps, and they may lock your Snapchat account. They will usually send you a message before they do so, but if you have been locked out of your account and don't know why, using third-party apps may be a reason. The only thing you can do at the moment is to uninstall that app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone.\", \"Based on the given passages, if your Snapchat account is temporarily locked, it might be due to the use of third-party apps. Snapchat warns users when they attempt to log in using third-party apps more than three times. If this happens, the app will lock the account. To regain access, the user must uninstall the third-party app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone.\", \"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you are using third-party apps to access Snapchat. Snapchat cannot guarantee security when users employ these third-party apps, which may lead to account locking. The company may send a warning message before locking the account, but if the account is already locked, it could be due to the use of such third-party applications.\"]", "time_sec": 14.668, "generation_time_seconds": 13.9099, "selection_time_seconds": 0.753, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 697, 55179, 2692, 374, 27092, 16061, 1576, 498, 1483, 4843, 24031, 10500, 311, 2615, 55179, 13, 576, 46769, 6286, 429, 55179, 4157, 15440, 4763, 421, 4843, 24031, 10500, 525, 1483, 11, 323, 807, 1231, 5296, 697, 2692, 13, 22406, 11, 279, 46769, 13216, 429, 55179, 21308, 18993, 1573, 37855, 9618, 4152, 311, 4843, 24031, 906, 10431, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.0871208670623322, "g_worst_claim": 0.31198891003926593, "g_content": 1.1593127395167495, "g_traj_mean": 1.1014485359191895}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 697, 55179, 374, 27092, 16061, 1576, 498, 1483, 264, 4843, 24031, 906, 311, 2615, 55179, 13, 576, 2813, 4157, 15440, 697, 4763, 421, 498, 990, 4843, 24031, 10500, 11, 323, 807, 1231, 5296, 697, 55179, 2692, 13, 2379, 686, 5990, 3624, 498, 264, 1943, 1573, 807, 653, 773, 11, 714, 421, 498, 614, 1012, 16061, 700, 315, 697, 2692, 323, 1513, 944, 1414, 3170, 11, 1667, 4843, 24031, 10500, 1231, 387, 264, 2874, 13, 576, 1172, 3166, 498, 646, 653, 518, 279, 4445, 374, 311, 53635, 429, 906, 323, 3783, 369, 458, 3946, 55179, 906, 311, 4994, 369, 279, 5515, 14307, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat is temporarily locked because you used a third-party app to access Snapchat. The company cannot guarantee your security if you use third-party apps, and they may lock your Snapchat account. They will usually send you a message before they do so, but if you have been locked out of your account and don't know why, using third-party apps may be a reason. The only thing you can do at the moment is to uninstall that app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4702715412127958, "g_worst_claim": 0.31198891003926593, "g_content": 1.7506352379208518, "g_traj_mean": 1.6395483016967773}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 421, 697, 55179, 2692, 374, 27092, 16061, 11, 432, 2578, 387, 4152, 311, 279, 990, 315, 4843, 24031, 10500, 13, 55179, 48040, 3847, 979, 807, 4774, 311, 1487, 304, 1667, 4843, 24031, 10500, 803, 1091, 2326, 3039, 13, 1416, 419, 8573, 11, 279, 906, 686, 5296, 279, 2692, 13, 2014, 48555, 2615, 11, 279, 1196, 1969, 53635, 279, 4843, 24031, 906, 323, 3783, 369, 458, 3946, 55179, 906, 311, 4994, 369, 279, 5515, 1430