{"id": "482", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the given passages, Snapchat may temporarily lock an account if the user has been using third-party applications to access the app. These third-party apps can compromise the security of the account and put the user and their friends at risk. Snapchat may send a warning message before locking the account, but if the user continues to use third-party apps, their account may be locked.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.\", \"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked if you are using third-party apps to access it. Third-party apps are not officially supported by Snapchat and can potentially harm your account security. Snapchat will usually send you a message before locking your account due to these apps. If you have been locked out and are unsure why, using third-party apps could be a reason. The only solution mentioned is to uninstall the third-party app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for your device.\", \"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account could be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party apps. The passages indicate that third-party apps may lock your Snapchat account if they are used to access the platform, and Snapchat cannot guarantee your security when using such apps. The account is usually locked after a certain number of warnings, typically three times, before being locked on the fourth attempt. To regain access, you must uninstall the third-party app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone.\", \"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you are using a third-party app to access Snapchat, which puts you and your friends at risk. Snapchat cannot guarantee your security if you use third-party apps, so they may lock your Snapchat account. If you have been locked out of your account and don't know why, using third-party apps may be a reason. The only way to get back into your account is to uninstall the third-party app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for your device.\"]", "time_sec": 15.858, "generation_time_seconds": 15.0679, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7846, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 697, 55179, 2692, 374, 27092, 16061, 1576, 498, 1483, 4843, 24031, 10500, 311, 2615, 55179, 13, 576, 46769, 6286, 429, 55179, 4157, 15440, 4763, 421, 4843, 24031, 10500, 525, 1483, 11, 323, 807, 1231, 5296, 697, 2692, 13, 22406, 11, 279, 46769, 13216, 429, 55179, 21308, 18993, 1573, 37855, 9618, 4152, 311, 4843, 24031, 906, 10431, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.1121371525750126, "g_worst_claim": 0.30916247765223187, "g_content": 1.1903796340479995, "g_traj_mean": 1.139840841293335}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 697, 55179, 2692, 1231, 387, 27092, 16061, 421, 498, 525, 1667, 4843, 24031, 10500, 311, 2615, 432, 13, 20861, 24031, 10500, 525, 537, 18562, 7248, 553, 55179, 323, 646, 13581, 11428, 697, 2692, 4763, 13, 55179, 686, 5990, 3624, 498, 264, 1943, 1573, 37855, 697, 2692, 4152, 311, 1493, 10500, 13, 1416, 498, 614, 1012, 16061, 700, 323, 525, 42903, 3170, 11, 1667, 4843, 24031, 10500, 1410, 387, 264, 2874, 13, 576, 1172, 6291, 9733, 374, 311, 53635, 279, 4843, 24031, 906, 323, 3783, 369, 458, 3946, 55179, 906, 311, 4994, 369, 697, 3671, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked if you are using third-party apps to access it. Third-party apps are not officially supported by Snapchat and can potentially harm your account security. Snapchat will usually send you a message before locking your account due to these apps. If you have been locked out and are unsure why, using third-party apps could be a reason. The only solution mentioned is to uninstall the third-party app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for your device.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.1159155583778309, "g_worst_claim": 0.18569459634668686, "g_content": 1.5565584872631317, "g_traj_mean": 1.2379108667373657}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 697, 55179, 2692, 1410, 387, 27092, 16061, 4152, 311, 279, 990, 315, 4843, 24031, 10500, 13, 57