ts you and your friends at risk. Snapchat cannot guarantee your security if you use third-party apps, so they may lock your Snapchat account. If you have been locked out of your account and don't know why, using third-party apps may be a reason. The only way to get back into your account is to uninstall the third-party app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for your device.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3245462177414091, "g_worst_claim": 0.30916247765223187, "g_content": 1.4542500813802084, "g_traj_mean": 1.3490352630615234}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 48.84, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "483", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the given passages, it appears that Snapchat may lock accounts that use third-party applications to access the platform more than four times. If a user has been locked out of their account and doesn't know why, using third-party apps may be a reason. Third-party apps are applications that are not developed or officially supported by Snapchat, such as third-party messaging or camera apps. Using these apps may put the user's account at risk, as well as their friends'. Additionally, there are many reasons why people are getting locked out of Snapchat, including using third-party apps.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.\", \"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party apps. If you have been locked out of your account and don't know why, using third-party apps could be a reason. Snapchat cannot guarantee your security if you use these third-party apps, so they may lock your Snapchat account. They will usually send you a message before they do so.\", \"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account might be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party apps. These apps may compromise your security, leading Snapchat to lock your account after 4 warnings. For example, someone named Nancy received 3 warnings before her account was locked. Nicole encountered issues with her snaps not downloading and was warned about third-party applications. Snapchat cannot guarantee security when third-party apps are used, which may result in account locking. To regain access, uninstall the third-party app and await the official Snapchat app update.\", \"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party apps. Snapchat cannot guarantee security when third-party apps are used, which can lead to the account being locked. The passages mention that Snapchat sends a warning before locking an account, but if you receive a warning and continue to use third-party apps, your account may still be locked. If you have recently seen warnings about third-party apps, this could be the reason for your account being temporarily locked.\"]", "time_sec": 15.216, "generation_time_seconds": 14.4412, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7699, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 697, 55179, 2692, 374, 27092, 16061, 1576, 498, 1483, 4843, 24031, 10500, 311, 2615, 55179, 13, 576, 46769, 6286, 429, 55179, 4157, 15440, 4763, 421, 4843, 24031, 10500, 525, 1483, 11, 323, 807, 1231, 5296, 697, 2692, 13, 22406, 11, 279, 46769, 13216, 429, 55179, 21308, 18993, 1573, 37855, 9618, 4152, 311, 4843, 24031, 906, 10431, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.099954023110239, "g_worst_claim": 0.36750109990437824, "g_content": 1.2516494519782788, "g_traj_mean": 1.1204502582550049}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 697, 55179, 2692, 1231, 387, 27092, 16061, 4152, 311, 279, 990, 315, 4843, 24031, 10500, 13, 1416, 498, 614, 1012, 16061, 700, 315, 697, 2692, 323, 1513, 944, 1414, 3170, 11, 1667, 4843, 24031, 10500, 1410, 387, 264, 2874, 13, 55179, 4157, 15440, 697, 4763, 421, 498, 990, 1493, 4843, 24031, 10500, 11, 773, 807, 1231, 5296, 697, 55179, 2692, 13, 2379, 686, 5990, 3624, 498, 264, 1943, 1573, 807, 653, 773, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party apps. If you have been locked out of your account and don't know why, using third-party apps could be a reason. Snapchat cannot guarantee your security if you use these third-party apps, so they may lock your Snapchat account. They will usually send you a message before they do so.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.422210503002954, "g_worst_claim": 0.36750109990437824, "g_content": 1.602184772491455, "g_traj_mean": 1.4743690490722656}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 697, 55179, 2692, 2578, 387, 27092, 16061, 4152, 311, 279, 990, 315, 4843, 24031, 10500, 13, 4220, 10500, 1231, 29385, 697, 4763, 11, 6388, 55179, 311, 5296, 697, 2692, 1283, 220, 19, 18993, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 4325, 6941, 34236, 3949, 220, 18, 18993, 1573, 1059, 2692, 572, 16061, 13, 44030, 23057, 4714, 448, 1059, 51304, 537, 32477, 323, 572, 18683, 911, 4843, 24031, 8357, 13, 55179, 4157, 15440, 4763, 979, 4843, 24031, 10500, 525, 1483, 11, 892, 1231, 1102, 304, 2692, 37855, 13, 2014, 48555, 2615, 11, 53635, 279, 4843, 24031, 906, 323, 2535, 279, 3946, 55179, 906, 2647, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account might be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party apps. These apps may compromise your security, leading Snapchat to lock your account after 4 warnings. For example, someone named Nancy received 3 warnings before her account was locked. Nicole encountered issues with her snaps not downloading and was warned about third-party applications. Snapchat cannot guarantee security when third-party apps are used, which may result in account locking. To regain access, uninstall the third-party app and await the official Snapchat app update.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.279923281922088, "g_worst_claim": 0.3661564588546753, "g_content": 2.1305598208778784, "g_traj_mean": 1.45387864112854}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 697, 55179, 2692, 1231, 387, 27092, 16061, 4152, 311, 279, 990, 315, 4843, 24031, 10500, 13, 55179, 4157, 15440, 4763, 979, 4843, 24031, 10500, 525, 1483, 11, 892, 646, 2990, 311, 279, 2692, 1660, 16061, 13, 576, 46769, 6286, 429, 55179, 21308, 264, 9958, 1573, 37855, 458, 2692, 11, 714, 421, 498, 5258, 264, 9958, 323, 3060, 311, 990, 4843, 24031, 10500, 11, 697, 2692, 1231, 2058, 387, 16061, 13, 1416, 498, 614, 5926, 3884, 18993, 911, 4843, 24031, 10500, 11, 419, 1410, 387, 279, 2874, 369, 697, 2692, 1660, 27092, 16061, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party apps. Snapchat cannot guarantee security when third-party apps are used, which can lead to the account being locked. The passages mention that Snapchat sends a warning before locking an account, but if you receive a warning and continue to use third-party apps, your account may still be locked. If you have recently seen warnings about third-party apps, this could be the reason for your account being temporarily locked.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.6590810122230254, "g_worst_claim": 0.13962647318840027, "g_content": 0.789391040802002, "g_traj_mean": 0.7374381422996521}}], "selected_rollout": 2, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 35.19, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "484", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here is why your Snapchat account might be temporarily locked:\n\n1. Using third-party apps to access Snapchat without authorization: According to passage 2, Snapchat does not guarantee the security of accounts accessed through third-party apps. If you have been using such apps, it could result in your account being locked.\n2. Exceeding the limit of warnings for third-party app usage: Passage 1 mentions that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts that use third-party apps excessively. If you have exceeded the limit of warnings, your account might be temporarily locked.\n\nTherefore, the most likely reason for your Snapchat account being temporarily locked is due to the unauthorized use of third-party apps.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party applications. These apps are not guaranteed to be secure by Snapchat, which can lead to potential security risks and account lockouts. Snapchat may send you messages warning about the use of third-party apps, and if you ignore these warnings and continue to use them, your account can be locked. In these cases, you may need to uninstall the third-party app, wait for the official Snapchat app to appear, and take any other necessary steps as instructed by Snapchat to regain access to your account.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party applications. These apps are not guaranteed to be secure by Snapchat, which can lead to potential security risks and account lockouts. Snapchat may send you messages warning about the use of third-party apps, and if you ignore these warnings and continue to use them, your account can be locked. In these cases, you may need to uninstall the third-party app, wait for the official Snapchat app to appear, and take any other necessary steps as instructed by Snapchat to regain access to your account.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.\", \"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. This practice is not recommended by Snapchat and can lead to account lockout. The company cannot guarantee your security if you use these third-party apps, so they may lock your account. As a result, you may receive a message warning you about third-party apps before your account is locked. To regain access to your account, you need to uninstall the third-party app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for the Windows Phone.\", \"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party applications. Snapchat cannot guarantee your security if you use these third-party apps, so they may lock your Snapchat account. The app will usually send you a message before doing so. However, if you have been locked out of your account and don't know why, using third-party apps may be a reason. To regain access, you should uninstall the third-party app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for your device.\", \"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party applications. These apps are not guaranteed to be secure by Snapchat, which can lead to potential security risks and account lockouts. Snapchat may send you messages warning about the use of third-party apps, and if you ignore these warnings and continue to use them, your account can be locked. In these cases, you may need to uninstall the third-party app, wait for the official Snapchat app to appear, and take any other necessary steps as instructed by Snapchat to regain access to your account.\"]", "time_sec": 16.684, "generation_time_seconds": 15.7868, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8919, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 697, 55179, 2692, 374, 27092, 16061, 1576, 498, 1483, 4843, 24031, 10500, 311, 2615, 55179, 13, 576, 46769, 6286, 429, 55179, 4157, 15440, 4763, 421, 4843, 24031, 10500, 525, 1483, 11, 323, 807, 1231, 5296, 697, 2692, 13, 22406, 11, 279, 46769, 13216, 429, 55179, 21308, 18993, 1573, 37855, 9618, 4152, 311, 4843, 24031, 906, 10431, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.0871208670623322, "g_worst_claim": 0.31198891003926593, "g_content": 1.1593127395167495, "g_traj_mean": 1.1014485359191895}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 697, 55179, 2692, 374, 27092, 16061, 1576, 498, 1483, 4843, 24031, 10500, 311, 2615, 55179, 13, 1096, 6588, 374, 537, 11102, 553, 55179, 323, 646, 2990, 311, 2692, 5296, 411, 13, 576, 2813, 4157, 15440, 697, 4763, 421, 498, 990, 1493, 4843, 24031, 10500, 11, 773, 807, 1231, 5296, 697, 2692, 13, 1634, 264, 1102, 11, 498, 1231, 5258, 264, 1943, 9958, 498, 911, 4843, 24031, 10500, 1573, 697, 2692, 374, 16061, 13, 2014, 48555, 2615, 311, 697, 2692, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 53635, 279, 4843, 24031, 906, 323, 3783, 369, 458, 3946