{"id": "485", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, it appears that your Snapchat account has been temporarily locked due to using third-party apps. According to passage 2, Snapchat does not guarantee security when using third-party apps, and they may lock your account if they detect such usage. Passage 3 also mentions that Snapchat has taken steps to punish individuals who use third-party apps, which could result in account lockout.\n\nIt's possible that you have been warned multiple times by Snapchat about using third-party apps, as mentioned in passage 1, and your account has been locked as a result. To regain access to your account, you may need to stop using third-party apps and wait for an official Snapchat app to become available for your device, as suggested in passage 2.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account might be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party applications. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if you use third-party apps, which may lead to your account being locked. The warning messages before the account lockout indicate that the use of third-party apps is a reason for the lockout. To resolve this, you should uninstall the third-party app and wait for the official Snapchat app to appear.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account might be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party applications. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if you use third-party apps, which may lead to your account being locked. The warning messages before the account lockout indicate that the use of third-party apps is a reason for the lockout. To resolve this, you should uninstall the third-party app and wait for the official Snapchat app to appear.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if third-party apps are used, and they may lock your account. Additionally, the passages indicate that Snapchat sends warnings before locking accounts due to third-party app usage.\", \"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you are using third-party apps to access Snapchat. Snapchata cannot guarantee your security if you use these third-party apps, so they may lock your Snapchat account. They will usually send you a message before they do so. However, if you have been locked out of your account and don't know why, using third-party apps may be a reason.\", \"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used a third-party application to access Snapchat. These third-party apps are not officially supported by Snapchat and can compromise your account's security. Snapchat may lock your account if the third-party app warns you more than three times. If your account is locked, you may need to uninstall the third-party app and wait for an official Snapchat app to appear for your device.\", \"Based on the given passages, your Snapchat account might be temporarily locked due to the use of third-party applications. The passages mention that Snapchat cannot guarantee security if you use third-party apps, which may lead to your account being locked. The warning messages before the account lockout indicate that the use of third-party apps is a reason for the lockout. To resolve this, you should uninstall the third-party app and wait for the official Snapchat app to appear.\"]", "time_sec": 14.621, "generation_time_seconds": 13.9064, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7101, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 697, 55179, 2692, 374, 27092, 16061, 1576, 498, 1483, 4843