ore the account lockout indicate that the use of third-party apps is a reason for the lockout. To resolve this, you should uninstall the third-party app and wait for the official Snapchat app to appear.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.0783276230421461, "g_worst_claim": 0.42207197348276776, "g_content": 1.437765121459961, "g_traj_mean": 1.1546015739440918}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 3, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 40.54, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "488", "question": "how to plan a trip to germany", "gt": "To plan a trip to Germany, it is important to plan ahead and be aware of the rules and regulations regarding travel with pets. It is also recommended to research the best ways to save money during your trip, such as looking into discounted flights, cheap hotels and hostels, and affordable dining options. Additionally, learning about German life and culture can enhance your overall trip experience.", "pred": "1. Budget: Check out budget travel tips for Germany including discounts on flights, hotels, hostels, and sightseeing. This information can be found in the first passage.\n2. Visa requirements: Ensure you have the necessary documents and are aware of any visa requirements. Both passages 1 and 2 mention visa requirements as part of the travel tips.\n3. Time of visit: Determine the best time to visit Germany based on personal preferences and weather conditions. Passages 1 and 2 do not provide specific details about the best time to visit, but you can refer to these passages for general travel tips.\n4. Pet travel: If traveling with pets, research air travel, vaccinations, and pet-friendly accommodations. Passage 2 provides tips for pet travel, including air travel and vaccinations.\n5. Cultural understanding: Learn about German life and culture to enhance your experience. Both passages 3 and 1 emphasize the importance of understanding the country's culture for a more enjoyable trip.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "1. Budget: Check out budget travel tips for Germany including discounts on flights, hotels, hostels, and sightseeing. This information can be found in the first passage.\n2. Visa requirements: Ensure you have the necessary documents and are aware of any visa requirements. Both passages 1 and 2 mention visa requirements as part of the travel tips.\n3. Time of visit: Determine the best time to visit Germany based on personal preferences and weather conditions. Passages 1 and 2 do not provide specific details about the best time to visit, but you can refer to these passages for general travel tips.\n4. Pet travel: If traveling with pets, research air travel, vaccinations, and pet-friendly accommodations. Passage 2 provides tips for pet travel, including air travel and vaccinations.\n5. Cultural understanding: Learn about German life and culture to enhance your experience. Both passages 3 and 1 emphasize the importance of understanding the country's culture for a more enjoyable trip.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to plan a trip to Germany, you should consider the following steps:\\n\\n1. Check visa requirements: Ensure you have the necessary visa for Germany.\\n2. Determine the best time to visit: Consider the best time of year to travel to Germany based on weather and events.\\n3. Research what to see: Look into popular attractions and cultural experiences in Germany.\\n4. Plan your budget: Use budget travel tips to save money on flights, accommodation, and sightseeing.\\n5. Consider traveling with pets: If you have pets, research pet-friendly accommodations and travel regulations.\\n6. Learn about German culture: Understanding German life and culture can enhance your trip's enjoyment and understanding.\", \"Based on the given passages, to plan a trip to Germany, one should consider the following:\\n\\n1. Budget: Check out budget travel tips for Germany including discounts on flights, hotels, hostels, and sightseeing. This information can be found in the first passage.\\n2. Visa requirements: Ensure you have the necessary documents and are aware of any visa requirements. Both passages 1 and 2 mention visa requirements as part of the travel tips.\\n3. Time of visit: Determine the best time to visit Germany based on personal preferences and weather conditions. Passages 1 and 2 do not provide specific details about the best time to visit, but you can refer to these passages for general travel tips.\\n4. Pet travel: If traveling with pets, research air travel, vaccinations, and pet-friendly accommodations. Passage 2 provides tips for pet travel, including air travel and vaccinations.\\n5. Cultural understanding: Learn about German life and culture to enhance your experience. Both passages 3 and 1 emphasize the importance of understanding the country's culture for a more enjoyable trip.\", \"Based on the given passages, to plan a trip to Germany, you should consider the following aspects:\\n\\n1. Budget: Look for budget travel tips to save money. This includes finding discounts on flights, hotels, and hostels, as well as exploring affordable restaurants and public transportation.\\n\\n2. Visa requirements: Ensure you have the necessary visa for travel to Germany.\\n\\n3. Travel dates and locations: Decide when and where to go in Germany, considering the best times for visiting different areas and attractions.\\n\\n4. Sightseeing: Research popular attractions and landmarks in German cities and towns.\\n\\n5. Transportation: Understand the options for getting around in Germany, such as trains and buses.\\n\\n6. Accommodation: Consider pet-friendly hotels and pet regulations for traveling with your pet.\\n\\n7. Cultural understanding: Learn about German life and culture to enrich your trip and make it more enjoyable.\\n\\nBy considering these factors, you can plan a comprehensive and rewarding trip to Germany.\", \"Based on the given passages, here are the steps to plan a trip to Germany:\\n\\n1. Understand visa requirements: Check the visa requirements for Germany to ensure you have the necessary documentation before your trip.\\n2. Determine when and where to go in Germany: Decide on the best time of year to visit and the specific regions or cities you wish to explore.\\n3. Research what to see in Germany: Familiarize yourself with the main attractions, historical sites, and cultural landmarks in Germany to make the most of your trip.\\n4. Budget for your trip: Use budget travel tips to save money on flights, accommodations, public transportation, and sightseeing.\\n5. Plan your transportation: Consider the best mode of transportation for your trip, such as flights, trains, or bus travel.\\n6. Accommodations: Look for budget-friendly options like hotels, hostels, or Airbnb to save money on accommodation costs.\\n7. Explore local cuisine: Research and plan for affordable and delicious restaurants to enjoy German food during your trip.\\n8. Public transportation: Familiarize yourself with the public transportation system in Germany to navigate the country efficiently and affordably.\\n9. Cultural immersion: Learn about German life and culture to enrich your travel experience and make it more enjoyable and rewarding.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you can plan a well-rounded and enjoyable trip to Germany that maximizes the experience and minimizes costs.\"]", "time_sec": 27.691, "generation_time_seconds": 26.9113, "selection_time_seconds": 0.775, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 3119, 264, 8411, 311, 9856, 11, 498, 1265, 2908, 279, 2701, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 4248, 26655, 8502, 25, 29279, 498, 614, 279, 5871, 26655, 369, 9856, 624, 17, 13, 29901, 279, 1850, 882, 311, 3947, 25, 21144, 279, 1850, 882, 315, 1042, 311, 5821, 311, 9856, 3118, 389, 9104, 323, 4357, 624, 18, 13, 8319, 1128, 311, 1490, 25, 9192, 1119, 5411, 38491, 323, 12752, 11449, 304, 9856, 624, 19, 13, 9680, 697, 8039, 25, 5443, 8039, 5821, 10414, 311, 3581, 3220, 389, 24908, 11, 27278, 11, 323, 13929, 65054, 624, 20, 13, 21144, 20971, 448, 25103, 25, 1416, 498, 614, 25103, 11, 3412, 6753, 21896, 54613, 323, 5821, 14305, 624, 21, 13, 14934, 911, 5938, 7674, 25, 45451, 5938, 2272, 323, 7674, 646, 18379, 697, 8411, 594, 44178, 323, 8660, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Check visa requirements: Ensure you have the necessary visa for Germany.\n2. Determine the best time to visit: Consider the best time of year to travel to Germany based on weather and events.\n3. Research what to see: Look into popular attractions and cultural experiences in Germany.\n4. Plan your budget: Use budget travel tips to save money on flights, accommodation, and sightseeing.\n5. Consider traveling with pets: If you have pets, research pet-friendly accommodations and travel regulations.\n6. Learn about German culture: Understanding German life and culture can enhance your trip's enjoyment and understanding.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.9455860554935667, "g_worst_claim": 0.31810450553894043, "g_content": 1.2737817506532412, "g_traj_mean": 0.8741799592971802}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 3119, 264, 8411, 311, 9856, 11, 825, 1265, 2908, 279, 2701, 1447, 16, 13, 27269, 25, 4248, 700, 8039, 5821, 10414, 369, 9856, 2670, 31062, 389, 24908, 11, 24332, 11, 3468, 2010, 11, 323, 13929, 65054, 13, 1096, 1995, 646, 387, 1730, 304, 279, 1156, 21085, 624, 17, 13, 43334, 8502, 25, 29279, 498, 614, 279, 5871, 9293, 323, 525, 7853, 315, 894, 26655, 8502, 13, 11733, 46769, 220, 16, 323, 220, 17, 6286, 26655, 8502, 438, 949, 315, 279, 5821, 10414, 624, 18, 13, 4120, 315, 3947, 25, 29901, 279, 1850, 882, 311, 3947, 9856, 3118, 389, 4345, 19322, 323, 9104, 4682, 13, 9970, 1134, 220, 16, 323, 220, 17, 653, 537, 3410, 3151, 3565, 911, 279, 1850, 882, 311, 3947, 11, 714, 498, 646, 8300, 311, 1493, 46769, 369, 4586, 5821, 10414, 624, 19, 13, 11333, 5821, 25, 1416, 20971, 448, 25103, 11, 3412, 3720, 5821, 11, 90871, 11, 323, 6753, 21896, 54613, 13, 98475, 220, 17, 5707, 10414, 369, 6753, 5821, 11, 2670, 3720, 5821, 323, 90871, 624, 20, 13, 40233, 8660, 25, 14934, 911, 5938, 2272, 323, 7674, 311, 18379, 697, 3139, 13, 11733, 46769, 220, 18, 323, 220, 16, 45932, 279, 12650, 315, 8660, 279, 3146, 594, 7674, 369, 264, 803, 31080, 8411, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Budget: Check out b