ion skin can be dry or normal in some areas and oily in others, such as the T-zone (nose, forehead, and chin). This is mentioned in passage 3.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.8839230585763023, "g_worst_claim": 0.0651245191693306, "g_content": 1.3865741794392215, "g_traj_mean": 0.9896618127822876}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 9363, 429, 5240, 77471, 6787, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 74126, 41822, 25, 1416, 697, 6554, 476, 6981, 702, 77471, 6787, 11, 498, 525, 4363, 311, 614, 432, 438, 1632, 13, 1096, 374, 4152, 311, 279, 1059, 94354, 6993, 315, 77471, 6787, 13, 576, 46769, 4190, 429, 279, 8046, 374, 1251, 1265, 18555, 862, 20727, 369, 77471, 6787, 4751, 1091, 58671, 432, 389, 9968, 476, 18899, 4344, 382, 17, 13, 91108, 24202, 28635, 25, 1416, 697, 77471, 6787, 4041, 323, 5780, 11, 432, 1231, 614, 2686, 311, 653, 448, 55004, 323, 803, 311, 653, 448, 73118, 4344, 304, 697, 2487, 13, 576, 46769, 1083, 4190, 429, 9968, 702, 264, 7199, 2456, 389, 279, 5590, 1880, 315, 279, 6787, 382, 18, 13, 85856, 6787, 25, 4329, 1251, 614, 10601, 6787, 11, 892, 646, 387, 9058, 476, 4622, 304, 1045, 5671, 323, 77471, 304, 3800, 11, 1741, 438, 279, 350, 77763, 320, 77, 960, 11, 51254, 11, 323, 45075, 568, 576, 46769, 4190, 429, 10601, 6787, 646, 8193, 38432, 18840, 657, 70928, 11, 3691, 35810, 11, 323, 41199, 6787, 13, 151645], "pred": "3. Combination skin: Some people have combination skin, which can be dry or normal in some areas and oily in others, such as the T-zone (nose, forehead, and chin). The passages suggest that combination skin can produce overly dilated pores, blackheads, and shiny skin.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.274905905589204, "g_worst_claim": 0.10421817832522923, "g_content": 2.1014404296875, "g_traj_mean": 1.253210425376892}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 9363, 429, 5240, 77471, 6787, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 83286, 25, 506, 1541, 6787, 374, 1059, 