{"id": "533", "question": "what are safety pins in a first aid box used for", "gt": "Based on the given passages, safety pins in a first aid box are used for various purposes such as immobilizing an injured arm, securing a bandana over a bleeding wound, and helping to keep a severe wound closed. Additionally, safety pins can be used to remove splinters in the wilderness.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, safety pins in a first aid box are used for immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling, securing a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg, and helping keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. Additionally, safety pins are also used to remove splinters in the wilderness.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, safety pins in a first aid box are used for immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling, securing a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg, and helping keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. Additionally, safety pins are also used to remove splinters in the wilderness.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, safety pins in a first aid box are used for several purposes:\\n\\n1. Immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling.\\n2. Securing a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg.\\n3. Keeping a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances.\\n4. Removing splinters in the wilderness.\", \"Based on the given passages, safety pins are commonly used in first aid boxes for immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling, securing a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg, and using them to help keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. Additionally, safety pins can be used to remove splinters from the wilderness.\", \"Based on the given passages, safety pins in a first aid box are used for immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling, securing a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg, and helping keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. Additionally, safety pins are also used to remove splinters in the wilderness.\", \"Based on the given passages, safety pins in a first aid box are used for multiple purposes:\\n\\n1. Immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling.\\n2. Securing a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg.\\n3. Helping to keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances.\\n\\nThe passages emphasize the versatility of safety pins, highlighting their ability to serve as makeshift tools in survival situations, particularly in first aid, where they can be used creatively to address injuries and aid in recovery.\"]", "time_sec": 16.064, "generation_time_seconds": 15.325, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7334, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 7149, 26944, 304, 264, 1156, 12296, 3745, 525, 1483, 369, 3807, 9895, 1447, 16, 13, 15335, 27929, 4849, 458, 6773, 553, 8983, 1229, 279, 74423, 315, 264, 1293, 36153, 15478, 311, 1181, 15138, 311, 11153, 264, 86080, 6773, 87633, 624, 17, 13, 4520, 1677, 264, 7055, 3362, 916, 264, 27493, 323, 34663, 6773, 476, 2472, 624, 18, 13, 55378, 264, 15386, 26555, 7877, 304, 1992, 315, 61936, 304, 13207, 13161, 624, 19, 13, 66703, 12503, 49940, 304, 279, 48262, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, safety pins in a first aid box are used for several purposes:\n\n1. Immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling.\n2. Securing a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg.\n3. Keeping a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances.\n4. Removing splinters in the wilderness.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.2430723832058237, "g_worst_claim": 0.382400115331014, "g_content": 2.609153400767933, "g_traj_mean": 2.0780749320983887}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 7149, 26944, 525, 16626, 1483, 304, 1156, 12296, 14697, 369, 76341, 4849, 458, 6773, 553, 8983, 1229, 279, 74423, 315, 264, 1293, 36153, 15478, 311, 1181, 15138, 311, 11153, 264, 86080, 6773, 87633, 11, 40477, 264, 7055, 3362, 916, 264, 27493, 323, 34663, 6773, 476, 2472, 11, 323, 1667, 1105, 311, 1492, 2506, 264, 15386, 26555, 7877, 304, 1992, 315, 61936, 304, 13207, 13161, 13, 22406, 11, 7149, 26944, 646, 387, 1483, 311, 4057, 12503, 49940, 504, 279, 48262, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, safety pins are commonly used in first aid boxes for immobilizing an arm by pinning the cuff of a long sleeve shirt to its chest to fashion a makeshift arm sling, securing a bandana over a wounded and bleeding arm or leg, and using them to help keep a severe wound closed in place of stitches in dire circumstances. Additionally, safety pins can be used to remove splinters from the wilderness.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.970338515012692, "g_worst_claim": 0.382400115331014, "g_content": 2.643491448296441, "g_traj_mean": 2.1454339027404785}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 7149, 26944, 304, 264, 1156, 12296, 3745, 525, 1483, 369, 76341, 4849, 458, 6773, 553, 8983, 1229, 279, 74423, 315, 264, 1293, 36153, 15478, 311, 1181, 15138, 311, 11153, 264, 86080, 6773, 87633, 11, 40477, 264, 7055, 3362, 916, 264, 27493, 323, 34663, 6773, 476, 2472, 11, 323, 10476, 2506, 264, 15386, 26555, 7877, 304, 1992, 315, 61936, 304