{"id": "542", "question": "what traits do people have that are born in october?", "gt": "People born in October are described as having a keen interest in and an eye for form and structure, which can make them good architects, interior decorators, designers, or any profession that combines art and structure. They are also described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful individuals. They are at their best when they are in control, their own boss, or working on their own. They can also get along with others and possess necessary \"people skills\", although they can occasionally show impatience. Despite being restless at heart, they crave stability and security, which is why they work hard at whatever they do.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, people born in October have various traits depending on the specific day of the month:\n\n- October 1: Success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful. Best when in control, but can be impatient.\n- October 5: Restless at heart but craves stability and security, leading to hard work.\n\nThese traits are based on Astrology, Numerology, and Cartomancy.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, people born in October have various traits depending on the specific day of the month:\n\n- October 1: Success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful. Best when in control, but can be impatient.\n- October 5: Restless at heart but craves stability and security, leading to hard work.\n\nThese traits are based on Astrology, Numerology, and Cartomancy.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, people born in October have various traits depending on the specific day of the month:\\n\\n- October 1: Success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful. Best when in control, but can be impatient.\\n- October 5: Restless at heart but craves stability and security, leading to hard work.\\n\\nThese traits are based on Astrology, Numerology, and Cartomancy.\", \"Based on the given passages, people born in October have the following traits:\\n\\n- Born Today, October 14: Individuals born on this date have a great interest in and eye for form and structure, making them suitable for professions such as architecture, interior decoration, design, or any profession combining art and structure.\\n- Born Today, October 1: People born on this date are described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful. They excel when in control, as their own bosses, or working independently, but may occasionally show impatience.\\n- Born Today, October 5: Those born on this date are characterized as restless at heart but crave stability and security, leading them to work hard in their endeavors.\", \"Based on the given passages, people born in October are associated with various traits:\\n\\n1. If You Were Born Today, October 14: Individuals born on this date have a great interest in form and structure, making good architects, interior decorators, designers, or other professions that combine art and structure.\\n2. If You Were Born Today, October 1: These individuals are described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful, with a preference for being in control and working on their own, although they also have the necessary people skills to get along with others.\\n3. If You Were Born Today, October 5: Born on this date, people are described as restless at heart but crave stability and security, leading them to work hard at whatever they do.\\n\\nThese traits are based on Astrology, Numerology, and Cartomancy, and the information is presented as general characteristics for people born on a date in any birth year.\", \"Based on the given passages, people born in October have traits such as a great interest in and eye for form and structure, making them suitable for professions combining art and structure. Additionally, those born on October 1 are described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful individuals who are best when in control or working independently but also have the necessary people skills. People born on October 5 are characterized as restless at heart but crave stability and security, working hard at whatever they do.\"]", "time_sec": 19.358, "generation_time_seconds": 18.5395, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8134, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1251, 9223, 304, 6527, 614, 5257, 24055, 11649, 389, 279, 3151, 1899, 315, 279, 2254, 1447, 12, 6527, 220, 16, 25, 13047, 35085, 11, 34409, 11, 323, 15726, 7988, 13, 7107, 979, 304, 2524, 11, 714, 646, 387, 73697, 624, 12, 6527, 220, 20, 25, 9063, 1717, 518, 4746, 714, 1560, 4693, 19753, 323, 4763, 11, 6388, 311, 2588, 975, 382, 9485, 24055, 525, 3118, 389, 64129, 35681, 11, 47124, 2449, 11, 323, 13115, 316, 6572, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, people born in October have various traits depending on the specific day of the month:\n\n- October 1: Success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful. Best when in control, but can be impatient.\n- October 5: Restless at heart but craves stability and security, leading to hard work.\n\nThese traits are based on Astrology, Numerology, and Cartomancy.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.1938781217292505, "g_worst_claim": 0.323807954788208, "g_content": 3.3947760092245565, "g_traj_mean": 2.082470178604126}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1251, 9223, 304, 6527, 614, 279, 2701, 24055, 1447, 12, 37816, 11201, 11, 6527, 220, 16, 19, 25, 61425, 9223, 389, 419, 2400, 614, 264, 2244, 2734, 304, 323, 7912, 369, 1352, 323, 5944, 11, 3259, 1105, 14452, 369, 68692, 1741, 438, 17646, 11, 14791, 20228, 11, 2884, 11, 476, 894, 4808, 34171, 1947, 323, 5944, 624, 12, 37816, 11201, 11, 6527, 220, 16, 25, 8853, 9223, 389, 419, 2400, 525, 7481, 438, 2393, 35085, 11, 34409, 11