{"id": "546", "question": "what traits do people have that are born in october?", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some traits associated with people born in October:\n\n* Interest in form and structure (Passage 1)\n* Success-oriented and charming (Passage 2)\n* Personal power and impatience (Passage 2)\n* Crave stability and security (Passage 3)\n\nHowever, it's important to note that these are generalizations based on astrological signs and not all individuals will exhibit these traits. Additionally, there is no information about specific personality traits or characteristics of people born in October. Therefore, I cannot provide a more detailed answer based solely on the given passages.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, people born in October have various traits depending on the specific day of the month:\n\n- October 1: Success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful. Best when in control, but can be impatient.\n- October 5: Restless at heart but craves stability and security, leading to hard work.\n\nThese traits are based on Astrology, Numerology, and Cartomancy.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, people born in October have various traits depending on the specific day of the month:\n\n- October 1: Success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful. Best when in control, but can be impatient.\n- October 5: Restless at heart but craves stability and security, leading to hard work.\n\nThese traits are based on Astrology, Numerology, and Cartomancy.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, people born in October have various traits depending on the specific day of the month:\\n\\n- October 1: Success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful. Best when in control, but can be impatient.\\n- October 5: Restless at heart but craves stability and security, leading to hard work.\\n\\nThese traits are based on Astrology, Numerology, and Cartomancy.\", \"People born in October show traits of having a great interest in form and structure, making them suitable for professions that combine art and structure. They also tend to be success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful, with a preference for being in control or working independently. However, they may occasionally display impatience with others.\", \"Based on the given passages, people born in October have the following traits:\\n\\n- October 14: Great interest in and eye for form and structure, suitable for professions combining art and structure.\\n- October 5: Restless at heart, but crave stability and security, work hard at whatever they do.\\n- October 1: Success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful individuals who thrive when in control or working independently, though may display impatience occasionally.\", \"Based on the given passages, people born in October tend to have traits related to structure and form. According to passage 1, those born on October 14 \\\"have a great interest in, and eye for, form and structure\\\" and would excel in professions involving art and structure such as architecture, interior decoration, or design. Passage 3 mentions several famous individuals born in October, suggesting their success and public presence may reflect these traits.\"]", "time_sec": 14.269, "generation_time_seconds": 13.6677, "selection_time_seconds": 0.5968, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1251, 9223, 304, 6527, 614, 5257, 24055, 11649, 389, 279, 3151, 1899, 315, 279, 2254, 1447, 12, 6527, 220, 16, 25, 13047, 35085, 11, 34409, 11, 323, 15726, 7988, 13, 7107, 979, 304, 2524, 11, 714, 646, 387, 73697, 624, 12, 6527, 220, 20, 25, 9063, 1717, 518, 4746, 714, 1560, 4693, 19753, 323, 4763, 11, 6388, 311, 2588, 975, 382, 9485, 24055, 525, 3118, 389, 64129, 35681, 11, 47124, 2449, 11, 323, 13115, 316, 6572, 13, 151645], "pred": "B