{"id": "547", "question": "what traits do people have that are born in october?", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some traits associated with people born in October:\n\n* A keen eye for form and structure (October 14)\n* Success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful (October 1)\n* Restless at heart but craving stability and security (October 5)\n\nIt's important to note that these are generalizations and not necessarily applicable to every individual born in October.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, people born on October 14 have a great interest in and eye for form and structure, making them suitable for professions that combine art and structure. People born on October 1 have a success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful individual who is best when in control but also has the necessary \"people skills.\" People born on October 14 are likely to excel in fields such as architecture, interior decorating, design, or any profession that requires both artistry and structure.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, people born on October 14 have a great interest in and eye for form and structure, making them suitable for professions that combine art and structure. People born on October 1 have a success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful individual who is best when in control but also has the necessary \"people skills.\" People born on October 14 are likely to excel in fields such as architecture, interior decorating, design, or any profession that requires both artistry and structure.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, people born in October have various traits depending on the specific day of the month:\\n\\n- October 1: Success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful. Best when in control, but can be impatient.\\n- October 5: Restless at heart but craves stability and security, leading to hard work.\\n\\nThese traits are based on Astrology, Numerology, and Cartomancy.\", \"Based on the given passages, people born in October have the following traits:\\n\\n1. Born Today, October 14: They have a great interest in and eye for form and structure. They would make good architects, interior decorators, designers, or any profession that combines art and structure.\\n\\n2. Born Today, October 1: They are success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful individuals. They are at their best when in control, their own boss, or working on their own. However, they can occasionally show impatience.\\n\\n3. Born Today, October 5: They are restless at heart but crave stability and security, working hard at whatever they do.\\n\\nAdditional famous people born in October include Charlton Heston, Jackie Collins, Anne Rice, Susan Sarandon, Alicia Silverstone, Rachael Leigh Cook, and Buster Keaton.\", \"Based on the given passages, people who are born in October have traits such as a great interest in form and structure, and they may have a desire for stability and security.\", \"Based on the given passages, people born on October 14 have a great interest in and eye for form and structure, making them suitable for professions that combine art and structure. People born on October 1 have a success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful individual who is best when in control but also has the necessary \\\"people skills.\\\" People born on October 14 are likely to excel in fields such as architecture, interior decorating, design, or any profession that requires both artistry and structure.\"]", "time_sec": 16.078, "generation_time_seconds": 15.34, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7333, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1251, 9223, 304, 6527, 614, 5257, 24055, 11649, 389, 279, 3151, 1899, 315, 279, 2254, 1447, 12, 6527, 220, 16, 25, 13047, 35085, 11, 34409, 11, 323, 15726, 7988, 13, 7107, 979, 3