{"id": "571", "question": "how to do the skill moves on fifa 16 for xbox one", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here is how to perform skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing): Press and hold the LT button on the Xbox controller, followed by a quick tap of the RB button.\n\nThat's it! This combination will allow you to perform the ball juggling skill move while standing on the field in FIFA 16 on Xbox One.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to perform the skill move \"Ball Juggle (while standing)\" on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to hold the LT button and tap the RB button.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to perform the skill move \"Ball Juggle (while standing)\" on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to hold the LT button and tap the RB button.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to perform the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to use the following button combinations:\\n\\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing) — LT (hold) + RB (tap).\", \"Based on the given passages:\\nTo execute the Ball Juggle skill move on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to hold the LT button and tap the RB button while standing.\", \"Based on the given passages, to perform the skill move \\\"Ball Juggle (while standing)\\\" on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to hold the LT button and tap the RB button.\", \"Based on the given passages, to execute the skill moves on FIFA 16 for the Xbox One console, you need to use the following button combination:\\n\\n1. Press and hold the LT button.\\n2. Tap the RB button.\\n\\nThese button combinations are specific to the Xbox One console and will allow you to perform the skill moves in the game.\"]", "time_sec": 10.774, "generation_time_seconds": 10.1256, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6443, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 