{"id": "572", "question": "how to do the skill moves on fifa 16 for xbox one", "gt": "Sure, I can help you with that! Based on the given passages, here's how to do skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing): Hold LT + tap RB.\n\nNote that this combination works for Xbox 360 and Xbox One controllers. If you're playing on PC with a controller, the buttons may be different. Additionally, there are tutorial videos available online that show what each skill move looks like, which can be helpful in mastering these moves.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to perform the skill move \"Ball Juggle\" on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to hold the LT button and tap the RB button while standing.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to perform the skill move \"Ball Juggle\" on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to hold the LT button and tap the RB button while standing.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to perform the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to use the following button combinations:\\n\\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing) — LT (hold) + RB (tap).\", \"Based on the given passages, to execute skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, use the button combinations provided in passage 1. For example, to perform the Ball Juggle skill move while standing, press and hold LT (left trigger) and tap RB (right bumper).\", \"Based on the given passages, to perform the skill move \\\"Ball Juggle\\\" on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to hold the LT button and tap the RB button while standing.\", \"Based on the given passages, to perform skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you need to execute the button combinations as follows: \\n1. For Ball Juggle (while standing), hold the Left Trigger (LT) and tap the Right Bumper (RB).\"]", "time_sec": 10.597, "generation_time_seconds": 10.0178, "selection_time_seconds": 0.5752, "record