{"id": "573", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can start by identifying all possible entry points that mice use to get into your house. Once identified, consider putting steel wool inside these holes or vents before sealing them off. This will prevent the mice from using these paths to re-enter your home. By doing so, you eliminate their access to food or shelter in your house, which can help in getting rid of them quickly.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.\", \"Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, take immediate action. You can seal off entry points using steel wool pads, which will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. This extra protection will be helpful if your mice are persistent and resilient.\", \"Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. Mice can very quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient. Learning how to eliminate these pests from your home and preventing them from returning is crucial.\", \"Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice:\\n1. Take immediate action, as mice can quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting.\\n2. Seal off entry points such as pipes and vents with steel wool or pads to prevent mice from using them to enter your house.\"]", "time_sec": 14.927, "generation_time_seconds": 14.1125, "selection_time_seconds": 0.81, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1265, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1096, 17601, 65834, 1007, 4343, 3501, 429, 23627, 646, 990, 438, 59295, 311, 633, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 21144, 10687, 9509, 38540, 4766, 279, 13647, 476, 10378, 1573, 65834, 432, 1007, 13, 12500, 38540, 35995, 686, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 14178, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 11, 7842, 458, 4960, 2392, 315, 9135, 421, 697, 23627, 525, 24999, 323, 58680, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.0050101010055563, "g_worst_claim": 0.3344261248906453, "g_content": 2.7092921517112036, "g_traj_mean": 2.2250587940216064}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1446, 646, 25349, 1007, 4343, 3501, 1667, 9509, 38540, 35995, 11, 892, 686, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 14178, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 1096, 4960, 9135, 686, 387, 10950, 421, 697, 23627, 525, 24999, 323, 58680, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, take immediate action. You can seal off entry points using steel wool pads, which will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. This extra protection will be helpful if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.8646218071940315, "g_worst_claim": 0.3351619640986125, "g_content": 2.5247150544197328, "g_traj_mean": 1.8903621435165405}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1265, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 386, 558, 646, 1602, 6157, 1896, 705, 21682, 304, 697, 2114, 323, 1191, 66710, 13, 21144, 10687, 9509, 38540, 4766, 279, 13647, 476, 10378, 1573, 65834, 432, 1007, 13, 12500, 38540, 35995, 686, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 14178, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 11, 7842, 458, 4960, 2392, 315, 9135, 421, 697, 23627, 525, 24999, 323, 58680, 13, 20909, 1246, 311, 21725, 1493, 74956, 504, 697, 2114, 323, 26160, 1105, 504, 13451, 374, 16587, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. Mice can very quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads wil