{"id": "574", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, it is important to take immediate action as they can quickly infest your home. One effective method is to seal off any entry points that mice can use to enter your house, such as pipes and vents. Placing steel wool inside these openings before sealing them can prevent mice from reentering. Additionally, eliminating any potential food sources and shelter can help deter mice from your home.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.\", \"Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. Take steps to prevent mice from entering your house by sealing off entry points. Consider using steel wool pads inside the pipe or vent before sealing it. Steel wool will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient. Additionally, it's important to remove any food or shelter that the rodents can use to access your home.\", \"Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. One effective method is to seal off any entry points where mice can enter your house, especially using steel wool as a preventative measure. Steel wool can prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house and adds an extra element of protection. This approach is critical as mice can take up residence and start nesting very quickly in your home.\", \"Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice:\\n\\n1. Take immediate action, as they can quickly take up residence and start nesting.\\n2. Seal off entry points where mice can use them as highways.\\n3. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house.\"]", "time_sec": 14.539, "generation_time_seconds": 13.8477, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6872, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1265, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1096, 17601, 65834, 1007, 4343, 3501, 429, 23627, 646, 990, 438, 59295, 311, 633, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 21144, 10687, 9509, 38540, 4766, 279, 13647, 476, 10378, 1573, 65834, 432, 1007, 13, 12500, 38540, 35995, 686, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 14178, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 11, 7842, 458, 4960, 2392, 315, 9135, 421, 697, 23627, 525, 24999, 323, 58680, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.9949950998157318, "g_worst_claim": 0.2842307686805725, "g_content": 2.687581842595881, "g_traj_mean": 2.214298963546753}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 11778, 7354, 311, 5358, 23627, 504, 16262, 697, 3753, 553, 65834, 1007, 4343, 3501, 13, 21144, 1667, 9509, 38540, 35995, 4766, 279, 13647, 476, 10378, 1573, 65834, 432, 13, 12500, 38540, 686, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 14178, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 11, 7842, 458, 4960, 2392, 315, 9135, 421, 697, 23627, 525, 24999, 323, 58680, 13, 22406, 11, 432, 594, 2989, 311, 4057, 894, 3607, 476, 22906, 429, 279, 93109, 646, 990, 311, 2615, 697, 2114, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. Take steps to prevent mice from entering your house by sealing off entry points. Consider using steel wool pads inside the pipe or vent before sealing it. Steel wool will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient. Additionally, it's important to remove any food or shelter that the rodents can use to access your home.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.719766688133989, "g_worst_claim": 0.2842307686805725, "g_content": 2.4661712646484375, "g_traj_mean": 1.8241077661514282}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 3776, 7373, 1714, 374, 311, 25349, 1007,