{"id": "575", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action by sealing off entry points that mice could use to enter your home. Steel wool is a good material to use for this purpose as it will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Additionally, getting rid of rats and mice involves eliminating any sources of food and shelter for these rodents and preventing them from returning.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.\", \"Based on the given passages, here are steps to quickly get rid of mice:\\n\\n1. Take immediate action. This is a critical step to getting rid of mice.\\n2. Seal off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house.\\n3. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before you seal it off to prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house.\\n4. Steel wool pads will add an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.\", \"Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. Here are the steps:\\n\\n1. Identify potential entry points where mice can enter your house, such as pipes or vents.\\n2. Before sealing these entry points, consider using steel wool inside them.\\n3. Steel wool can prevent mice from using these holes to get back into your house.\\n4. This method adds an extra layer of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.\\n\\nAdditionally, consider sealing other small openings that mice can fit through and making sure there is no available food or shelter for them in your home.\", \"Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. You need to seal off any entry points where mice can enter your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. This will add an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.\"]", "time_sec": 15.734, "generation_time_seconds": 15.0417, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6729, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1265, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1096, 17601, 65834, 1007, 4343, 3501, 429, 23627, 646, 990, 438, 59295, 311, 633, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 21144, 10687, 9509, 38540, 4766, 279, 13647, 476, 10378, 1573, 65834, 432, 1007, 13, 12500, 38540, 35995, 686, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 14178, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 