es": {"g_mean_claim": 1.9347637212863202, "g_worst_claim": 0.37249211470286053, "g_content": 2.983240944998605, "g_traj_mean": 2.1752023696899414}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 56.88, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "576", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are some ways to quickly get rid of mice:\n\n1. Take immediate action to get rid of mice as soon as possible, as they can quickly take up residence in your home and start nesting (Passage 1).\n2. Seal off all entry points into your home, including holes around pipes and vents, using steel wool to prevent mice from getting back in (Passage 2).\n3. Get rid of any sources of food for mice and rats, as they will quickly take advantage of any food left behind by humans (Passage 3).\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages. The passages do not provide specific instructions on how to quickly get rid of mice once they have entered a home.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.\", \"Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points such as pipes or vents with steel wool pads to prevent the mice from using these holes to get back into your house. Steel wool pads add an extra layer of protection, making it harder for persistent and resilient mice to re-enter your home. Additionally, eliminating any potential food sources that attract rats and mice can also help in the prevention of these pests returning.\", \"Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. Consider sealing off entry points, such as pipes or vents, by using steel wool pads to prevent mice from returning. Additionally, eliminate any food or shelter sources that might attract mice to your home to prevent them from coming back.\", \"Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. This involves sealing off any entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient. Additionally, learn how to eliminate pests from your home to prevent them from returning.\"]", "time_sec": 14.382, "generation_time_seconds": 13.7117, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6651, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1265, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1096, 17601, 65834, 1007, 4343, 3501, 429, 23627, 646, 990, 438, 59295, 311, 633, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 21144, 10687, 9509, 38540, 4766, 279, 13647, 476, 10378, 1573, 65834, 432, 1007, 13, 12500, 38540, 35995, 686, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 14178, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 11, 7842, 458, 4960, 2392, 315, 9135, 421, 697, 23627, 525, 24999, 323, 58680, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.999564989846723, "g_worst_claim": 0.3169900178909302, "g_content": 2.806372729214755, "g_traj_mean": 2.253645181655884}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1265, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1096, 17601, 65834, 1007, 4343, 3501, 1741, 438, 31175, 476, 80207, 448, 9509, 38540, 35995, 311, 5358, 279, 23627, 504, 1667, 1493, 19766, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 12500, 38540, 35995, 912, 458, 4960, 6193, 315, 9135, 11, 3259, 432, 15750, 369, 24999, 323, 58680, 23627, 311, 312, 48215, 697, 2114, 13, 22406, 11, 39499, 894, 4650, 3607, 8173, 429, 9320, 31410, 323, 23627, 646, 1083, 1492, 304, 279, 26248, 315, 1493, 74956, 13451, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. This involves sealing off entry points such as pipes or vents with steel wool pads to prevent the mice from using these holes to get back into your house. Steel wool pads add an extra layer of protection, making it harder for persistent and resilient mice to re-enter your home. Additionally, eliminating any potential food sources that attract rats and mice can also help in the prevention of these pests returning.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2981999437261071, "g_worst_claim": 0.3169900178909302, "g_content": 1.9198768615722657, "g_traj_mean": 1.3517900705337524}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1265, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 21144, 65834, 1007, 4343, 3501, 11, 1741, 438, 31175, 476, 80207, 11, 553, 1667, 9509, 38540, 35995, 311, 5358, 23627, 504, 13451, 13, 22406, 11, 21725, 894, 3607, 476, 22906, 8173, 429, 2578, 9320, 23627, 311, 697, 2114, 311, 5358, 1105, 504, 5001, 1182, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action. Consider sealing off entry points, such as pipes or vents, by using steel wool pads to prevent mice from returning. Additionally, eliminate any food or shelter sources that might attract mice to your home to prevent them from coming back.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3838365877861585, "g_worst_claim": 0.3169900178909302, "g_content": 1.713715177593809, "g_traj_mean": 1.3178482055664062}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 498, 1184, 311, 1896, 13922, 1917, 13, 1096, 17601, 65834, 1007, 894, 4343, 3501, 429, 23627, 646, 990, 438, 59295, 311, 633, 1119, 697, 3753, 13, 21144, 10687, 9509, 38540, 4766, 279, 13647, 476, 10378, 1573, 65834, 432, 1007, 13, 12500, 38540, 35995, 686, 5358, 23627, 504, 1667, 279, 14178, 311, 633, 1182, 1119, 697, 3753, 11, 7842, 458, 4960, 2392, 315, 9135, 421, 697, 23627, 525, 24999, 323, 58680, 13, 22406, 11, 3960, 1246, 311, 21725, 74956, 504, 697, 2114, 311, 5358, 1105, 504, 13451, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. This involves sealing off any entry points that mice can use as highways to get into your house. Consider putting steel wool inside the pipe or vent before sealing it off. Steel wool pads will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house, adding an extra element of protection if your mice are persistent and resilient. Additionally, learn how to eliminate pests from your home to prevent them from returning.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.9092451254583893, "g_worst_claim": 0.3169900178909302, "g_content": 2.814859427657782, "g_traj_mean": 2.1219100952148438}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 37.91, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "580", "question": "what do i do if i got my sperrys wet", "gt": "Based on the given passages, if your Sperry shoes get wet, it is recommended to use a leather conditioner to help revitalize the leather and infuse moisture back into it. This is especially important if you wash your shoes with detergent, as it tends to dry out the leather. If you don't have a leather conditioner on hand, you can use a suede bar or leather brush to clean the shoes. It's best to avoid getting light tan Sperry shoes wet, as water might stain them. However, if you do get them wet, using a suede bar or leather brush should help remove any stains.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, if you got your Sperrys wet, you should use a leather conditioner to revitalize the leather and infuse moisture back into it. This is especially important if you wash your Sperry shoes with detergent, as detergent has a tendency to dry the leather out. Additionally, you can use a suede bar and leather brush to clean the shoes, which can be purchased for between $5-$10.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, if you got your Sperrys wet, you should use a leather conditioner to revitalize the leather and infuse moisture back into it. This is especially important if you wash your Sperry shoes with detergent, as detergent has a tendency to dry the leather out. Additionally, you can use a suede bar and leather brush to clean the shoes, which can be purchased for between $5-$10.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, if you got your Sperrys wet, you should use a leather conditioner to revitalize the leather and infuse moisture back into it. This is especially important if you wash your Sperry shoes with detergent, as detergent has a tendency to dry the leather out. Additionally, you can use a suede bar and leather brush to clean the shoes, which can be purchased for between $5-$10.\", \"Based on the given passages, if your Sperrys get wet, you can follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Condition the leather using a leather conditioner. This is especially important if you used detergent to clean your shoes, as detergent can dry out the leather. Conditioner helps to revitalize the leather by infusing moisture back into it.\\n\\n2. If your Sperrys are dark brown, you can safely get them wet without much concern. However, if they are light tan, there is a possibility that water might stain them.\\n\\n3. If you notice any stains on your shoes, you can use a suede bar and leather brush to clean them. Alternatively, a cleaning toothbrush can also work effectively. This cleaning kit is usually priced between $5-$10, and while some shoe stores may try to sell you additional accessories, it is worth investing in these items as they are essential for maintaining the quality and appearance of your Sperrys.\", \"Based on the given passages, if your Sperrys get wet, you should follow these steps:\\n1. Condition the leather: Use a leather conditioner to revitalize the leather, as detergent can dry it out. This helps in infusing moisture back into the leather.\\n2. Reassemble the shoes: After conditioning, reassemble the shoes when you are done.\\n3. Consider the type of Sperrys: The provided passage suggests that regular, dark brown Sperrys are not a concern, but light tan ones might be at risk of staining.\\n4. Clean the suede: Use a suede bar or a leather brush (or even a cleaning toothbrush) to clean any stains on the suede.\\n5. Treat the suede: Ensure that the suede is properly treated to prevent future stains.\", \"Based on the given passages, if your Sperrys get wet, first, use a leather conditioner if you washed them with detergent. Leather conditioner can help revitalize the leather and infuse moisture back into it. Second, you can use a suede bar and leather brush or a cleaning toothbrush to clean the shoes. These tools are generally inexpensive, costing between $5-$10. Handling a stain on these shoes without the right tools would be difficult.\"]", "time_sec": 21.104, "generation_time_seconds": 20.0748, "selection_time_seconds": 1.0219, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 421, 498, 2684, 697, 3089, 615, 1047, 14401, 11, 498, 1265, 990, 264, 17553, 64324, 311, 5772, 34313, 279, 17553, 323, 4132, 810, 31157, 1182, 1119, 432, 13, 1096, 374, 5310, 2989, 421, 498, 11369, 697, 3089, 5400, 15294, 448, 90134, 11, 438, 90134, 702, 264, 30854, 311, 9058, 279, 17553, 700, 13, 22406, 11, 498, 646, 990, 264, 96635, 3619, 323, 17553, 15625, 311, 4240, 279, 15294, 11, 892, 646, 387, 14733, 369, 1948, 400, 20, 21389, 16, 15, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, if you got your Sperrys wet, you should use a leather conditioner to revitalize the leather and infuse moisture back into it. This is especially important if you wash your Sperry shoes with detergent, as detergent has a tendency to dry the leather out. Additionally, you can use a suede bar and leather brush to clean the shoes, which can be purchased for between $5-$10.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.442844329625787, "g_worst_claim": 0.16117010513941446, "g_content": 2.474121311732701, "g_traj_mean": 1.618736743927002}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 421, 697, 3089, 615, 1047, 633, 14401, 11, 498, 646, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 15180, 279, 17553, 1667, 264, 17553, 64324, 13, 1096, 374, 5310, 2989, 421, 498, 1483, 90134, 311, 4240, 697, 15294, 11, 438, 90134, 646, 9058, 700, 279, 17553, 13, 15180, 261, 8609, 311, 5772, 34313, 279, 17553, 553, 4132, 970, 31157, 1182, 1119, 432, 382, 17, 13, 1416, 697, 3089, 615, 1047, 525, 6319, 13876, 11, 498, 646, 21000, 633, 1105, 14401, 2041, 1753, 4643, 13, 4354, 11, 421, 807, 525, 3100, 14197, 11, 1052, 374, 264, 13038, 429, 3015, 2578, 51964, 1105, 382, 18, 13, 1416, 498, 5293, 89