n passages, if your Sperrys get wet, you should follow these steps:\n1. Condition the leather: Use a leather conditioner to revitalize the leather, as detergent can dry it out. This helps in infusing moisture back into the leather.\n2. Reassemble the shoes: After conditioning, reassemble the shoes when you are done.\n3. Consider the type of Sperrys: The provided passage suggests that regular, dark brown Sperrys are not a concern, but light tan ones might be at risk of staining.\n4. Clean the suede: Use a suede bar or a leather brush (or even a cleaning toothbrush) to clean any stains on the suede.\n5. Treat the suede: Ensure that the suede is properly treated to prevent future stains.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2992344205293125, "g_worst_claim": -0.1911294937133789, "g_content": 1.8959795270647322, "g_traj_mean": 1.2722222805023193}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 421, 697, 3089, 615, 1047, 633, 14401, 11, 1156, 11, 990, 264, 17553, 64324, 421, 498, 37493, 1105, 448, 90134, 13, 31078, 64324, 646, 1492, 5772, 34313, 279, 17553, 323, 4132, 810, 31157, 1182, 1119, 432, 13, 10440, 11, 498, 646, 990, 264, 96635, 3619, 323, 17553, 15625, 476, 264, 15826, 25507, 36061, 311, 4240, 279, 15294, 13, 4220, 7375, 525, 8789, 43152, 11, 53724, 1948, 400, 20, 21389, 16, 15, 13, 55713, 264, 51964, 389, 1493, 15294, 2041, 279, 1290, 7375, 1035, 387, 5000, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, if your Sperrys get wet, first, use a leather conditioner if you washed them with detergent. Leather conditioner can help revitalize the leather and infuse moisture back into it. Second, you can use a suede bar and leather brush or a cleaning toothbrush to clean the shoes. These tools are generally inexpensive, costing between $5-$10. Handling a stain on these shoes without the right tools would be difficult.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.75205139857737, "g_worst_claim": 0.16117010513941446, "g_content": 2.72