{"id": "602", "question": "which is better exercise cycling or aerobic", "gt": "Based on the given passages, both exercise cycling and aerobic exercise are beneficial for overall fitness.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, cycling is a form of aerobic exercise that is better for individuals who have arthritic or other orthopedic problems. It is also a better option for those who cannot walk for an extended period of time without pain or difficulty. Cycling may be ideal for these individuals as it provides a low-impact workout that supports the majority of their weight.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, cycling is a form of aerobic exercise that is better for individuals who have arthritic or other orthopedic problems. It is also a better option for those who cannot walk for an extended period of time without pain or difficulty. Cycling may be ideal for these individuals as it provides a low-impact workout that supports the majority of their weight.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, aerobic exercise is better than cycling. Aerobic exercise, such as running or cycling, is good for you unless you are a competitive strongman. Cycling is another type of aerobic exercise with wide appeal and value, but it may not be ideal for individuals who, due to arthritic or other orthopedic problems, are unable to walk for an extended period of time without pain or difficulty. The indoor exercise, or stationary, bike provides you with the lowest impact workout compared to the treadmill and rowing machine, according to WebMD. Therefore, aerobic exercise is better than cycling.\", \"Based on the given passages, cycling is a form of aerobic exercise that is better for individuals who have arthritic or other orthopedic problems. It is also a better option for those who cannot walk for an extended period of time without pain or difficulty. Cycling may be ideal for these individuals as it provides a low-impact workout that supports the majority of their weight.\", \"Based on the given passages, aerobic exercise is better than cycling. Aerobic exercise, such as running or cycling, is good for you unless you are a competitive strongman. Cycling is another type of aerobic exercise with wide appeal and value, but it may be ideal for individuals who have arthritic or other orthopedic problems that make walking difficult. A stationary bike provides a lower impact workout compared to a treadmill or rowing machine, according to WebMD. However, aerobic exercise is more versatile and offers a wider variety of physical challenges. Therefore, aerobic exercise is better than cycling.\", \"Based on the given passages, both cycling and aerobic exercise are considered good for health. Cycling, particularly on a stationary bike, is an aerobic exercise with wide appeal and value, especially for individuals with orthopedic problems. It provides a low-impact workout compared to other indoor exercises like treadmill or rowing. Aerobic exercise, such as running, is also recommended for general fitness and should be considered as part of a varied approach to physical activity. Since the passages do not compare cycling to aerobic exercise directly, the answer would be a combination of both activities, suggesting that both are beneficial but may serve different purposes and populations.\"]", "time_sec": 19.74, "generation_time_seconds": 18.8278, "selection_time_seconds": 0.9071, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 90390, 10158, 374, 2664, 1091, 32062, 13, 63050, 30806, 10158, 11, 1741, 438, 4303, 476, 32062, 11, 374, 1661, 369, 498, 7241, 498, 525, 264, 14680, 3746, 1515, 13, 59970, 374, 2441, 943, 315, 90390, 10158, 448, 6884, 14303, 323, 897, 11, 714, 432, 1231, 537, 387, 10507, 369, 7775, 879, 11, 4152, 311, 796, 339, 49208, 476, 1008, 29199, 16367, 2