{"id": "620", "question": "how has it technology changed the workplace", "gt": "IT technology has significantly changed the workplace in several ways. It has improved efficiency and increased productivity, as it allows for a complete shift in how time is spent in the modern workplace. The continuous evolution of technology also changes how business is conducted and the dynamics of the workplace. Over the last 10 to 15 years, technology has drastically changed attitudes and processes in the workplace. Technology has also dramatically reshaped the average American workplace, allowing employees to interact with a global market and take work on the road.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, technology has transformed the workplace in several ways. It has improved efficiency and productivity, allowing employees to interact with a global market and even take work on the road. The evolution of technology has also changed the dynamics of the workplace, with continuous advancements leading to new processes and attitudes. Over the last 10-15 years, technology has drastically changed the environment of the workplace.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, technology has transformed the workplace in several ways. It has improved efficiency and productivity, allowing employees to interact with a global market and even take work on the road. The evolution of technology has also changed the dynamics of the workplace, with continuous advancements leading to new processes and attitudes. Over the last 10-15 years, technology has drastically changed the environment of the workplace.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, technology has changed the workplace in several ways:\\n\\n1. Efficiency and Increased Productivity: The modern workplace has experienced a complete shift in how we spend our time, leading to increased efficiency and productivity.\\n\\n2. Dynamics of the Workplace: Over the last 10 to 15 years, technology has drastically changed the attitude and processes of the workplace, transforming the environment.\\n\\n3. Global Interaction: Rapid technological advancement has allowed employees to interact with a global market, enabling them to take work out on the road.\\n\\nThese changes have reshaped the average workplace in America over the past couple of decades, moving away from the traditional office environment of the past.\", \"Based on the given passages, technology has changed the workplace in several ways:\\n\\n1. Efficiency and Increased Productivity: Technology has allowed the modern workplace to become more efficient and productive. For example, the use of computer software has made tasks easier and faster for employees. This has resulted in a shift in how we spend our time at work.\\n\\n2. Attitude and Processes: Over the last 10 to 15 years, technology has drastically changed the attitude and processes of the workplace. Employees now have access to a wider range of tools and resources, which has led to a more collaborative and innovative work environment.\\n\\n3. Global Market Interaction: Technology has dramatically reshaped the average workplace in America over the past couple of decades. Employees can now interact with a global market, allowing them to connect with clients and partners from around the world. This has opened up new opportunities for businesses and has made it possible to work remotely.\\n\\nOverall, technology has transformed the workplace by improving efficiency, changing the way work is done, and providing new opportunities for global collaboration.\", \"Based on the given passages, technology has transformed the workplace in several ways. It has improved efficiency and productivity, allowing employees to interact with a global market and even take work on the road. The evolution of technology has also changed the dynamics of the workplace, with continuous advancements leading to new processes and attitudes. Over the last 10-15 years, technology has drastically changed the environment of the workplace.\", \"Based on the given passages, technology has changed the workplace in several ways:\\n\\n1. Improved efficiency and increased productivity: The modern workplace has adapted to new technologies, leading to a shift in how employees spend their time, resulting in higher efficiency and productivity.\\n\\n2. Transformation of dynamics: Over the last 10 to 15 years, technology has significantly altered the workplace's environment and processes. This transformation has led to a new perception of what is possible in the workplace.\\n\\n3. Global market interaction: Technological advancements have enabled employees to interact with a global market, expanding business opportunities and potentially leading to growth in remote work.\\n\\nThese changes reflect a continuous evolution in the workplace, driven by technological progress and innovation.\"]", "time_sec": 24.326, "generation_time_seconds": 23.3017, "selection_time_seconds": 1.0172, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 5440, 702, 5497, 279, 26368, 304, 3807, 5510, 1447, 16, 13, 66567, 323, 61597, 5643, 1927, 25, 576, 6481, 26368, 702, 10321, 264, 4583, 6407, 304, 1246, 582, 8329, 1039, 882, 11, 6388, 311, 7172, 15024, 323, 25148, 382, 17, 13, 52611, 315, 279, 93187, 25, 6065, 279, 1537, 220, 16, 15, 311, 220, 16, 20, 1635, 11, 5440, 702, 47763, 5497, 279, 18915, 323, 11364, 315, 279, 26368, 11, 45790, 279, 4573, 382, 18, 13, 7962, 42707, 25, 46990, 29016, 49825, 702, 5420, 8256, 311, 16282, 448, 264, 3644, 3081, 11, 27362, 1105, 311, 1896, 975, 700, 389, 279, 5636, 382, 9485, 4344, 614, 63693, 10185, 279, 5461, 26368, 304, 5159, 916, 279, 3267, 5625, 315, 10793, 11, 7218, 3123, 504, 279, 8606, 5163, 4573, 315, 279, 3267, 13, 151645], "pred": "These changes have reshaped the average workplace in America over the past couple of decades, moving away from the traditional office environment of the past.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.8498990851050914, "g_worst_claim": 0.2779867847760518, "g_content": 2.782500081987523, "g_traj_mean": 1.904829502105713}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 5440, 702, 5497, 279, 26368, 304, 3807, 5510, 1447, 16, 13, 66567, 323, 61597, 5643, 1927, 25, 11791, 702, 5420, 279, 6481, 26368, 311, 3635, 803, 11050, 323, 26236, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 279, 990, 315, 6366, 3162, 702, 1865, 9079, 8661, 323, 10596, 369, 8256, 13, 1096, 702, 19006, 304, 264, 6407, 304, 1246, 582, 8329, 1039, 882, 518, 975, 382, 17, 13, 7711, 3906, 323, 62303, 25, 6065, 279, 1537, 220, 16, 15, 311, 220, 16, 20, 1635, 11, 5440, 702, 47763, 5497, 279, 18915, 323, 11364, 315, 279, 26368, 13, 43641, 1431, 614, 2615, 311, 264, 21864, 2088, 315, 7375, 323, 4963, 11, 892, 702, 6069, 311, 264, 803, 39706, 323, 18199, 975, 4573, 382, 18, 13, 7962, 7993, 42707, 25, 11791, 702, 27957, 63693, 10185, 279, 5461, 26368, 304, 5159, 916, 279, 3267, 5625, 315, 10793, 13, 43641, 646, 1431, 16282, 448, 264, 3644, 3081, 11, 10693, 1105, 311, 4564, 448, 8239, 323, 8549, 504, 2163, 279, 1879, 13, 1096, 702, 8930, 705, 501, 10488, 369, 9675, 323, 702, 1865, 432, 3204, 311, 975, 38429, 382, 27489, 11, 5440, 702, 23507, 279, 26368, 553, 18392, 15024, 11, 10018, 279, 1616, 975, 374, 2814, 11, 323, 8241, 501, 10488, 369, 3644, 20031, 13, 151645], "pred": "Overall, technology has transformed the workplace by improving efficiency, changing the way work is done, and providing new opportunities for global collaboration.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.7924619433914529, "g_worst_claim": -0.1697249412536621, "g_content": 1.3000497257008272, "g_traj_mean": 0.9143200516700745}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 5440, 702, 23507, 279, 26368, 304, 3807, 5510, 13, 1084, 702, 12944, 15024, 323, 25148, 11, 