 "g_worst_claim": 0.12156671285629272, "g_content": 1.6251689807788745, "g_traj_mean": 1.113379716873169}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 2, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 67.96, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "625", "question": "how has it technology changed the workplace", "gt": "Based on the given passages, technology has changed the workplace in several ways, including:\n\n1. Increased efficiency and productivity: Technology has enabled automation of many tasks, allowing employees to focus on more complex and creative work, leading to increased productivity.\n2. Changes in workplace dynamics: Technology has transformed the way people communicate and collaborate in the workplace, enabling remote work and virtual teams.\n3. Rapid advancements: Technology has rapidly advanced in recent years, allowing employees to access new tools and resources, and adapt to changing market conditions.\n4. Global connectivity: Technology has enabled employees to interact with a global market and work remotely, allowing for greater flexibility and mobility.\n\nTherefore, technology has had a significant impact on the modern workplace, transforming the way people work, communicate, and collaborate.", "pred": "1. Efficiency and Increased Productivity: The modern workplace has experienced a complete shift in how we spend our time, leading to greater efficiency and productivity.\n2. Dynamics of the Workplace: Technology has drastically changed the attitude and processes of the workplace over the last 10 to 15 years.\n3. Impact on the Office Environment: The office environment of yesteryear is no longer relevant and has been replaced by rapid technological advancement, allowing employees to interact with a global market and even take work out on the road.\n4. Reshaping the Average Workplace: Technology has dramatically reshaped the average workplace in America over the past couple of decades, transforming the dynamics of the workplace and the way we perceive what is possible.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "1. Efficiency and Increased Productivity: The modern workplace has experienced a complete shift in how we spend our time, leading to greater efficiency and productivity.\n2. Dynamics of the Workplace: Technology has drastically changed the attitude and processes of the workplace over the last 10 to 15 years.\n3. Impact on the Office Environment: The office environment of yesteryear is no longer relevant and has been replaced by rapid technological advancement, allowing employees to interact with a global market and even take work out on the road.\n4. Reshaping the Average Workplace: Technology has dramatically reshaped the average workplace in America over the past couple of decades, transforming the dynamics of the workplace and the way we perceive what is possible.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, technology has changed the workplace in several ways:\\n\\n1. Efficiency and Increased Productivity: The modern workplace has experienced a complete shift in how we spend our time, leading to increased efficiency and productivity.\\n\\n2. Dynamics of the Workplace: Over the last 10 to 15 years, technology has drastically changed the attitude and processes of the workplace, transforming the environment.\\n\\n3. Global Interaction: Rapid technological advancement has allowed employees to interact with a global market, enabling them to take work out on the road.\\n\\nThese changes have reshaped the average workplace in America over the past couple of decades, moving away from the traditional office environment of the past.\", \"Based on the given passages, technology has changed the workplace in several ways:\\n\\n1. Increased efficiency and productivity, leading to a shift in how we spend our time at work.\\n2. Changing the dynamics of the workplace and altering what we perceive as possible.\\n3. Reshaping the average workplace in America over the past couple of decades, moving from the office environment of yesteryear to a setting that allows employees to interact with a global market and take work on the road.\", \"Based on the given passages, technology has changed the workplace in several ways:\\n\\n1. Efficiency and Increased Productivity: The modern workplace has experienced a complete shift in how we spend our time, leading to greater efficiency and productivity.\\n2. Dynamics of the Workplace: Technology has drastically changed the attitude and processes of the workplace over the last 10 to 15 years.\\n3. Impact on the Office Environment: The office environment of yesteryear is no longer relevant and has been replaced by rapid technological advancement, allowing employees to interact with a global market and even take work out on the road.\\n4. Reshaping the Average Workplace: Technology has dramatically reshaped the average workplace in America over the past couple of decades, transforming the dynamics of the workplace and the way we perceive what is possible.\", \"Based on the given passages, technology has transformed the workplace in several ways:\\n\\n1. Improved Efficiency and Productivity: The modern workplace has seen a shift in how we spend our time, leading to increased efficiency and productivity. Technology has allowed for more streamlined processes and faster completion of tasks.\\n\\n2. Changing Dynamics and Attitudes: Over the last 10 to 15 years, technology has significantly altered the dynamics of the workplace and the attitudes of employees and businesses. With the continuous evolution of technology, the perception of what is possible in the workplace has expanded.\\n\\n3. Rapid Technological Advancement: The office environment of the past is no longer relevant as rapid technological advancement has taken over. Employees now interact with a global market, and work can be taken on the go, showcasing the impact of technology on the day-to-day operations and mobility of the workplace.\"]", "time_sec": 23.766, "generation_time_seconds": 22.8713, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8894, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 26