{"id": "627", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay close to them when they are near the three-point line, actively sliding your feet to minimize shot opportunities (passage 1). It is important to create a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against a tall player (passage 3).", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player, especially near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\n4. Use tips from an experienced basketball player to improve your defense.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player, especially near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\n4. Use tips from an experienced basketball player to improve your defense.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\\n\\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player, especially near the three-point line.\\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\\n4. Use tips from an experienced basketball player to improve your defense.\", \"Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball:\\n\\n1. Stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter near the three-point line.\\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay ne