{"id": "628", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "To guard a tall person in basketball, you can stay as close as possible to them near the three-point line, actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent, and minimize shot opportunities. Additionally, you can keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player and defend against them with tips from an experienced basketball player.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player, especially near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\n4. Use tips from an experienced basketball player to improve your defense.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player, especially near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\n4. Use tips from an experienced basketball player to improve your defense.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\\n\\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player, especially near the three-point line.\\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\\n4. Use tips from an experienced basketball player to improve your defense.\", \"Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to them, sliding your feet from side to side to minimize their shot opportunities. Additionally, it's important to position yourself with a wedge between the basket and the offensive player, as described in a free video on basketball defense.\", \"Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay as close as possible to the tall player, particularly near the three-point line, and actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities. Additionally, if you are undersized for your position, you should go with the cards you are dealt and accept your size as it is, as advised by Kareem Abdul Jabbar Jr., a 6'6 guard. However, to defend against a tall player specifically, it is recommended to keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\", \"Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\\n\\n1. Stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter when you guard him near the three-point line.\\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player if playing against a tall player.\\n4. Use tips from an experienced basketball player to improve your defense against tall opponents.\\n\\nThese strategies are supported by the advice given in the passages and are specifically directed at guarding tall players effectively.\"]", "time_sec": 17.846, "generation_time_seconds": 16.9591, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8809, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 7616, 264, 16217, 1697, 304, 19240, 11, 498, 1265, 1447, 16, 13, 28737, 438, 3265, 438, 3204, 311, 279, 16217, 2781, 11, 5310, 3143, 279, 2326, 16574, 1555, 624, 17, 13, 3218, 3132, 14983, 697, 7541, 504, 3108, 311, 3108, 311, 4717, 3143, 697, 14704, 323, 29337, 6552, 10488, 624, 18, 13, 13655, 264, 63685, 1948, 279, 14024, 323, 279, 15183, 2781, 624, 19, 