{"id": "629", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are some strategies for guarding a tall person in basketball:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter when you guard them near the three-point line and actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities (Passage 1).\n2. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against a tall player (Passage 3).\n\nTherefore, to guard a tall person in basketball, it is important to stay close to them and create a barrier between them and the basket. These strategies can help limit their shooting opportunities and make it more difficult for them to score.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player, especially near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\n4. Use tips from an experienced basketball player to improve your defense.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player, especially near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\n4. Use tips from an experienced basketball player to improve your defense.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\\n\\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player, especially near the three-point line.\\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\\n4. Use tips from an experienced basketball player to improve your defense.\", \"Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball:\\n\\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player when guarding near the three-point line.\\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to minimize shot opportunities.\\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\\n4. Be aware of your own size and position relative to the tall player, understanding your advantages and limitations.\", \"Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player. Additionally, stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter and actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\", \"Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\\n\\n1. Stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter when you guard him near the three-point line. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\\n2. Other people are tall compared to non-basketball players, but undersized for their positions. You’ve got to go with the cards you are dealt, said Kareem Abdul Jabbar Jr., a 6’6 guard—tall, but not as tall as his dad, Lakers great Kareem Abdul Jabbar, a 7’2 center.\\n3. To defend against a tall player in basketball, keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\"]", "time_sec": 17.832, "generation_time_seconds": 16.844, "selection_time_seconds": 0.9803, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 7616, 264, 16217, 1697, 304, 19240, 11, 498, 1265, 1447, 16, 13, 28737, 438, 3265, 438, 3204, 311, 279, 16217, 2781, 11, 5310, 3143, 279, 2326, 16574, 1555, 624, 17, 13, 3218, 3132, 14983, 697, 7541, 504, 3