yers, but undersized for their positions. You’ve got to go with the cards you are dealt, said Kareem Abdul Jabbar Jr., a 6’6 guard—tall, but not as tall as his dad, Lakers great Kareem Abdul Jabbar, a 7’2 center.\n3. To defend against a tall player in basketball, keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.3686119752941712, "g_worst_claim": 0.3645024299621582, "g_content": 2.97300852899966, "g_traj_mean": 2.366547107696533}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 60.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "630", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here is how to guard a tall person in basketball:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall, skilled shooter when guarding them near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against a tall player.\n\nTherefore, to guard a tall person in basketball, it is essential to stay close to them, move quickly laterally to maintain position, and use a defensive strategy such as keeping a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player, especially near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\n4. Use tips from an experienced basketball player to improve your defense.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player, especially near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\n4. Use tips from an experienced basketball player to improve your defense.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\\n\\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player, especially near the three-point line.\\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\\n4. Use tips from an experienced basketball player to improve your defense.\", \"Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\\n\\n1. Stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter when guarding him near the three-point line.\\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\\n\\nThese steps are supported by the information provided in the passages.\", \"Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball:\\n\\n1. Stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter when you guard him near the three-point line.\\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\\n3. To defend against a tall player in basketball, keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.\", \"To guard a tall person in basketball, stay as close as possible to the tall, skilled shooter. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\"]", "time_sec": 14.781, "generation_time_seconds": 13.9701, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8049, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 7616, 264, 16217, 1697, 304, 19240, 11, 498, 1265, 1447, 16, 13, 28737, 438, 3265, 438, 3204, 311, 279, 16217, 2781, 11, 5310, 3143, 279, 2326, 16574, 1555, 624, 17, 13, 3218, 3132, 14983, 697, 7541, 504, 3108, 311, 3108, 311, 4717, 3143, 697, 14704, 323, 29337, 6552, 10488, 624, 18, 13, 13655, 264, 63685, 1948, 279, 14024, 323, 279, 15183, 2781, 624, 19, 13, 5443, 10414, 504, 458, 10321, 19240, 2781, 311, 7269, 697, 9055, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to guard a tall person in basketball, you should:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall player, especially near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your 