81, 438, 43215, 13, 576, 22596, 1849, 374, 19259, 11, 448, 7761, 82316, 11, 19853, 279, 35753, 315, 279, 835, 77638, 1849, 525, 537, 21893, 8433, 323, 525, 43179, 304, 6993, 13, 576, 22596, 1849, 59780, 33213, 311, 29282, 17289, 11, 1393, 279, 835, 77638, 1849, 5711, 279, 4225, 37120, 1849, 311, 29282, 17289, 13, 151645], "pred": "The differences between the nervous system and the endocrine system are that the nervous system is made of neuron cells while the endocrine system is made of glands. Transmission in the nervous system is performed by electrochemical pulses, while in the endocrine system, it is done by chemicals known as hormones. The nervous system is continuous, with cells interconnected, whereas the organs of the endocrine system are not physically connected and are discrete in nature. The nervous system utilizes neurons to transmit signals, while the endocrine system uses the circulatory system to transmit signals.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4370558358243297, "g_worst_claim": 0.12176528147288732, "g_content": 2.0163484770676185, "g_traj_mean": 1.3349765539169312}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 43.66, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "637", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Jalapenos have numerous health benefits due to their capsaicin content. They have pain-killing properties and can serve as a natural nasal decongestant. They may also aid in weight loss and prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and possibly even cancer. Additionally, jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. They can also help increase cardiovascular health and defend heart health.", "pred": "1. Pain relief: Jalapeños contain capsaicin, which is responsible for their heat and has pain-killing properties.\n2. Weight loss: They can serve as a spicy alternative to help with weight loss.\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapeños can provide relief from nasal congestion.\n4. Possible prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer: Although not fully proven, jalapeños may have these preventative benefits.\n5. Rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants: These nutrients contribute to overall health benefits.\n6. Cardiovascular health: Jalapeños may help defend heart health and increase cardiovascular health benefits.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "1. Pain relief: Jalapeños contain capsaicin, which is responsible for their heat and has pain-killing properties.\n2. Weight loss: They can serve as a spicy alternative to help with weight loss.\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapeños can provide relief from nasal congestion.\n4. Possible prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer: Although not fully proven, jalapeños may have these preventative benefits.\n5. Rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants: These nutrients contribute to overall health benefits.\n6. Cardiovascular health: Jalapeños may help defend heart health and increase cardiovascular health benefits.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, jalapeno peppers offer several health benefits:\\n\\n1. Pain relief: Jalapeno peppers contain capsaicin, which can help alleviate pain.\\n2. Weight loss: They can be a spicy alternative to help with weight loss.\\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapenos can provide relief from nasal congestion.\\n4. Cardiovascular health: They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer.\\n5. Nutritional value: Jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\\n6. Heart health: They can defend against heart health issues and increase cardiovascular health benefits.\", \"Based on the given passages, jalapeno peppers offer a variety of health benefits including:\\n\\n1. Pain relief - jalapeno peppers contain capsaicin which has pain-killing properties.\\n2. Weight loss alternative - jalapeno peppers can be a spicy substitute for those looking to lose weight.\\n3. Natural nasal decongestant - jalapeno peppers can help with congestion.\\n4. Preventing heart disease, heart attack, and cancer - jalapeno peppers may offer protection against these conditions.\\n5. Full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants - jalapeno peppers are rich in nutrients that support overall health.\\n6. Cardiovascular health benefits - jalapeno peppers can help defend against heart health concerns like strokes, heart attacks, and high blood pressure.\", \"Based on the given passages, jalapeños have several health benefits. They contain capsaicin, which is responsible for their heat level and various health benefits. These benefits include:\\n\\n1. Pain relief: Jalapeños have pain-killing properties.\\n2. Weight loss: They can be a spicy alternative for weight loss.\\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapeños can help with natural nasal decongestant properties.\\n4. Cardiovascular health: They may help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and even cancer.\\n5. Nutritional value: Jalapeños are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\\n6. Heart health: A bowl of jalapeños can help defend heart health and increase cardiovascular health benefits.\\n7. Overall health: Jalapeños are considered a \\\"healthy pepper.\\\"\", \"Based on the given passages, jalapeno peppers have several health benefits:\\n\\n1. Pain relief: Jalapeños contain capsaicin, which is responsible for their heat and has pain-killing properties.\\n2. Weight loss: They can serve as a spicy alternative to help with weight loss.\\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapeños can provide relief from nasal congestion.\\n4. Possible prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer: Although not fully proven, jalapeños may have these preventative benefits.\\n5. Rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants: These nutrients contribute to overall health benefits.\\n6. Cardiovascular health: Jalapeños may help defend heart health and increase cardiovascular health benefits.\"]", "time_sec": 26.684, "generation_time_seconds": 25.8655, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8122, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 75974, 391, 11790, 57473, 3010, 3807, 2820, 7567, 1447, 16, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 71895, 391, 11790, 57473, 6644, 2062, 9081, 292, 258, 11, 892, 646, 1492, 60605, 6646, 624, 17, 13, 16516, 4709, 25, 2379, 646, 387, 264, 47251, 10555, 311, 1492, 448, 4680, 4709, 624, 18, 13, 38222, 278, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 25, 71895, 391, 70870, 646, 3410, 15957, 504, 71088, 54046, 624, 19, 13, 91876, 32845, 2820, 25, 2379, 1231, 1492, 5358, 4746, 8457, 11, 4746, 8776, 11, 323, 1496, 9387, 624, 20, 13, 18372, 36742, 897, 25, 71895, 391, 70870, 525, 2480, 315, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 624, 21, 13, 17965, 2820, 25, 2379, 646, 10505, 2348, 4746, 2820, 4714, 323, 5263, 40613, 2820, 7567, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Pain relief: Jalapeno peppers contain capsaicin, which can help alleviate pain.\n2. Weight loss: They can be a spicy alternative to help with weight loss.\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapenos can provide relief from nasal congestion.\n4. Cardiovascular health: They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and eve