{"id": "638", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Jalapenos have health benefits such as pain relief, weight loss, nasal decongestant properties, and potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer. They are also rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, jalapenos can help defend heart health and provide cardiovascular benefits.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, jalapeño peppers offer several health benefits. These include pain relief, weight loss as an alternative to spicy foods, acting as a natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, as well as being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, jalapeños are credited with cardiovascular health benefits, particularly in defending against heart attacks, strokes, and high blood pressure.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, jalapeño peppers offer several health benefits. These include pain relief, weight loss as an alternative to spicy foods, acting as a natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, as well as being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, jalapeños are credited with cardiovascular health benefits, particularly in defending against heart attacks, strokes, and high blood pressure.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, jalapeno peppers offer several health benefits:\\n\\n1. Pain relief: Jalapeno peppers contain capsaicin, which can help alleviate pain.\\n2. Weight loss: They can be a spicy alternative to help with weight loss.\\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapenos can provide relief from nasal congestion.\\n4. Cardiovascular health: They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer.\\n5. Nutritional value: Jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\\n6. Heart health: They can defend against heart health issues and increase cardiovascular health benefits.\", \"Based on the given passages, jalapeno peppers offer multiple health benefits, including:\\n\\n1. Pain relief: The substance capsaicin in jalapeno peppers has pain-killing properties, which can help alleviate various types of pain.\\n\\n2. Weight loss: Jalapeno peppers can be used as a spicy substitute in weight loss diets, potentially aiding in fat loss.\\n\\n3. Natural nasal decongestant: They can help clear nasal passages, providing temporary relief for those with congestion.\\n\\n4. Cardiovascular health: Jalapeno peppers have been shown to potentially prevent heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, and can also contribute to improved cardiovascular health by reducing the risk of heart attack, strokes, and high blood pressure.\\n\\n5. Antioxidants and vitamins: Jalapeno peppers are rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, which support overall health and well-being.\\n\\n6. Overall health: The high level of capsaicin in jalapeno peppers contributes to various health benefits, making them a nutritious and flavorful addition to one's diet.\", \"Based on the given passages, jalapeno peppers have several health benefits:\\n\\n1. Pain relief: Jalapeños contain capsaicin, which is known for its pain-killing properties.\\n\\n2. Weight loss: They can be a spicy alternative for weight loss due to their high capsaicin content.\\n\\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapeños can help relieve nasal congestion.\\n\\n4. Prevention of heart disease: They may help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and even cancer.\\n\\n5. Rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants: Jalapeños are full of essential nutrients that support overall health.\\n\\n6. Cardiovascular health: They can help defend against cardiovascular health concerns like heart attack, strokes, and high blood pressure.\", \"Based on the given passages, jalapeño peppers offer several health benefits. These include pain relief, weight loss as an alternative to spicy foods, acting as a natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, as well as being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, jalapeños are credited with cardiovascular health benefits, particularly in defending against heart attacks, strokes, and high blood pressure.\"]", "time_sec": 25.211, "generation_time_seconds": 24.097, "selection_time_seconds": 1.1088, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 75974, 391, 11790, 57473, 3010, 3807, 2820, 7567, 1447, 16, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 71895, 391, 11790, 57473, 6644, 2062, 9081, 292, 258, 11, 892, 646, 1492, 60605, 6646, 624, 17, 13, 16516, 4709, 25, 2379, 646, 387, 264, 47251, 10555, 311, 1492, 448, 4680, 4709, 624, 18, 13, 38222, 278, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 25, 71895, 391, 70870, 646, 3410, 15957, 504, 71088, 54046, 624, 19, 13, 91876, 32845, 2820, 25, 2379, 1231, 1492, 5358, 4746, 8457, 11, 4746, 8776, 11, 323, 1496, 9387, 624, 20, 13, 18372, 36742, 897, 25, 71895, 391, 70870, 525, 2480, 315, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 624, 21, 13, 17965, 2820, 25, 2379, 646, 10505, 2348, 4746, 2820, 4714, 323, 5263, 40613, 2820, 7567, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Pain relief: Jalapeno peppers contain capsaicin, which can help alleviate pain.\n2. Weight loss: They can be a spicy alternative to help with weight loss.\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapenos can provide relief from nasal congestion.\n4. Cardiovascular health: They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer.\n5. Nutritional value: Jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\n6. Heart health: They can defend against heart health issues and increase cardiovascular health benefits.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2487223639957508, "g_worst_claim": 0.23476841449737548, "g_content": 1.7563853408351089, "g_traj_mean": 1.05704927444458}}, {"rollout": 1, "samp