ular health benefits.\", \"Based on the given passages, jalapeño peppers offer several health benefits:\\n\\n1. Pain relief: Jalapeño peppers contain capsaicin, which is responsible for their heat and can help alleviate pain.\\n\\n2. Weight loss: The spiciness of jalapeños can be a natural weight loss alternative.\\n\\n3. Natural nasal decongestant: Jalapeños can provide relief from congestion.\\n\\n4. Cardiovascular health: Jalapeños can help defend against heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer, and improve cardiovascular health.\\n\\n5. Nutritional value: Jalapeños are rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\\n\\n6. Overall heat: The level of capsaicin in jalapeños contributes to their overall health benefits.\\n\\nBased on these points, jalapeño peppers are not only flavorful but also offer significant health advantages.\", \"Based on the given passages, jalapeno peppers offer several health benefits:\\n\\n1. Pain relief: Jalapeños contain capsaicin, which has pain-killing properties.\\n2. Weight loss: They act as a spicy alternative for weight loss.\\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapeños help alleviate nasal congestion naturally.\\n4. Cardiovascular health: They may prevent heart disease, heart attack, and even cancer.\\n5. Nutritional value: Jalapeños are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\\n6. Improved cardiovascular health: They can help defend against heart health issues.\\n\\nThese health benefits are supported by the capsaicin content in jalapeños, which is responsible for their heat level and various health advantages.\", \"Based on the given passages, jalapeño peppers offer several health benefits including pain relief, a spicy weight loss alternative, a natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, as well as being rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, jalapeño peppers can significantly contribute to cardiovascular health by potentially reducing the risk of heart attacks, strokes, and high blood pressure.\"]", "time_sec": 23.708, "generation_time_seconds": 22.6755, "selection_time_seconds": 1.0236, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 75974, 391, 11790, 57473, 3010, 3807, 2820, 7567, 1447, 16, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 71895, 391, 11790, 57473, 6644, 2062, 9081, 292, 258, 11, 892, 646, 1492, 60605, 6646, 624, 17, 13, 16516, 4709, 25, 2379, 646, 387, 264, 47251, 10555, 311, 1492, 448, 4680, 4709, 624, 18, 13, 38222, 278, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 25, 71895, 391, 70870, 646, 3410, 15957, 504, 71088, 54046, 624, 19, 13, 91876, 32845, 2820, 25, 2379, 1231, 1492, 5358, 4746, 8457, 11, 4746, 8776, 11, 323, 1496, 9387, 624, 20, 13, 18372, 36742, 897, 25, 71895, 391, 70870, 525, 2480, 315, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 624, 21, 13, 17965, 2820, 25, 2379, 646, 10505, 2348, 4746, 2820, 4714, 323, 5263, 40613, 2820, 7567, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Pain relief: Jalapeno peppers contain capsaicin, which can help alleviate pain.\n2. Weight loss: They can be a spicy alternative to help with weight loss.\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapenos can provide relief from nasal congestion.\n4. Cardiovascular health: They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer.\n5. Nutritional value: Jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\n6. Heart health: They can defend against heart health issues and increase cardiovascular health benefits.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2654465894111873, "g_worst_claim": 0.23710594177246094, "g_content": 1.773825096361565, "g_traj_mean": 1.0722812414169312}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 75974, 2027, 14529, 57473, 3010, 3807, 2820, 7567, 1447, 16, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 71895, 2027, 14529, 57473, 6644, 2062, 9081, 292, 258, 11, 892, 374, 8480, 369, 862, 8628, 323, 646, 1492, 60605, 6646, 382, 17, 13, 16516, 4709, 25, 576, 978, 292, 1880, 315, 75974, 20