arious health advantages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.286094759600195, "g_worst_claim": 0.3630513022927677, "g_content": 1.6668612336459225, "g_traj_mean": 1.0144026279449463}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 75974, 2027, 14529, 57473, 3010, 3807, 2820, 7567, 2670, 6646, 15957, 11, 264, 47251, 4680, 4709, 10555, 11, 264, 5810, 71088, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 11, 4650, 26248, 315, 4746, 8457, 11, 4746, 3359, 11, 323, 9387, 11, 438, 1632, 438, 1660, 9080, 304, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 13, 22406, 11, 75974, 2027, 14529, 57473, 646, 11941, 16792, 311, 40613, 2820, 553, 13581, 17719, 279, 5214, 315, 4746, 8776, 11, 52472, 11, 323, 1550, 6543, 7262, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, jalapeño peppers offer several health benefits including pain relief, a spicy weight loss alternative, a natural nasal decongestant, potential prevention of heart disease, heart attack, and cancer, as well as being rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, jalapeño peppers can significantly contribute to cardiovascular health by potentially reducing the risk of heart attacks, strokes, and high blood pressure.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6840819826832523, "g_worst_claim": 0.3997165362040202, "g_content": 1.9477635259213655, "g_traj_mean": 1.410470962524414}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 3, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 53.16, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "640", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are some health benefits of jalapenos:\n\n* Pain relief\n* Weight loss\n* Natural nasal decongestant\n* May help prevent heart disease, heart attack, and cancer\n* Good source of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants\n* Cardiovascular health benefits, including defending against heart health concerns and increasing cardiovascular health benefits.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What are the health benefits of jalapenos?\" can be summarized as:\n\n* Pain relief\n* Weight loss\n* Nasal decongestant\n* Anti-cancer properties\n* Cardiovascular health benefits\n* Rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.", "pred": "The passages highlight these benefits for jalapeños, focusing on their potential to provide pain relief, aid in weight loss, offer natural nasal decongestant properties, and contribute to overall health by preventing various diseases and enhancing heart health.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The passages highlight these benefits for jalapeños, focusing on their potential to provide pain relief, aid in weight loss, offer natural nasal decongestant properties, and contribute to overall health by preventing various diseases and enhancing heart health.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, jalapeno peppers offer several health benefits:\\n\\n1. Pain relief: Jalapeno peppers contain capsaicin, which can help alleviate pain.\\n2. Weight loss: They can be a spicy alternative to help with weight loss.\\n3. Nasal decongestant: Jalapenos can provide relief from nasal congestion.\\n4. Cardiovascular health: They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer.\\n5. Nutritional value: Jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\\n6. Heart health: They can defend against heart health issues and increase cardiovascular health benefits.\", \"Based on the given passages, jalapeno peppers offer several health benefits, including pain relief, as they contain capsaicin which can help alleviate pain. They also serve as a spicy alternative for weight loss and can act as a natural nasal decongestant. Additionally, jalapenos have the potential to prevent heart disease, reduce the risk of heart attacks and even help with cancer prevention. They are also rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, contributing to overall health and well-being.\", \"Based on the given passages, jalapeno peppers offer various health benefits. These include pain-killing properties, serving as a spicy weight loss alternative, acting as a natural nasal decongestant, potentially helping to prevent heart disease, heart attack, and even cancer, being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, and aiding in cardiovascular health. The health benefits of jalapenos are largely attributable to their high level of capsaicin, which is responsible for their heat.\", \"Based on the given passages, jalapeños offer a variety of health benefits:\\n\\n1. **Pain Relief**: Jalapeños have pain-killing properties, which can help alleviate discomfort.\\n2. **Weight Loss**: They can be used as a spicy weight loss alternative.\\n3. **Nasal Decongestant**: Jalapeños have natural nasal decongestant properties.\\n4. **Heart Health**: They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer.\\n5. **Vitamins and Minerals**: Jalapeños are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\\n6. **Cardiovascular Health**: Jalapeños can defend heart health and increase cardiovascular health benefits.\\n\\nThe passages highlight these benefits for jalapeños, focusing on their potential to provide pain relief, aid in weight loss, offer natural nasal decongestant properties, and contribute to overall health by preventing various diseases and enhancing heart health.\"]", "time_sec": 21.871, "generation_time_seconds": 21.0634, "selection_time_second