cate blood in the urine and could be a sign of a serious condition like an infection or cancer, prompting the need to visit a doctor. Similarly, deep purple urine is an identifying characteristic of porphyria, a rare disorder of red blood cells. Food and medication intake, such as beets, berries, and fava beans, can also affect urine color.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2247863705090647, "g_worst_claim": 0.3187780976295471, "g_content": 1.707871573311942, "g_traj_mean": 1.0926599502563477}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 1894, 315, 39235, 646, 13289, 11649, 389, 5257, 9363, 13, 576, 4622, 1894, 315, 39235, 374, 27539, 13753, 4152, 311, 279, 76578, 575, 299, 31902, 13, 4354, 11, 419, 27539, 1894, 646, 387, 28752, 304, 5048, 315, 37942, 18808, 1380, 279, 74938, 323, 42910, 312, 96410, 65081, 17628, 315, 39235, 5670, 525, 71187, 287, 13, 4710, 49574, 11, 279, 21085, 33845, 429, 2518, 39235, 1231, 13216, 6543, 304, 279, 39235, 11, 892, 646, 387, 264, 1841, 315, 6001, 4682, 1075, 458, 18873, 476, 9387, 13, 1913, 279, 1008, 1424, 11, 5538, 24932, 39235, 374, 264, 28583, 315, 4154, 12700, 4204, 11, 264, 8848, 26990, 19267, 315, 2518, 6543, 7761, 13, 39060, 323, 29910, 1741, 438, 387, 1415, 11, 62394, 11, 323, 282, 2907, 26896, 646, 1083, 7802, 39235, 1894, 13, 151645], "pred": "Additionally, the passage mentions that red urine may indicate blood in the urine, which can be a sign of serious conditions like an infection or cancer. On the other hand, deep purple urine is a characteristic of porphyria, a rare inherited disorder of red blood cells. Foods and medications such as beets, berries, and fava beans can also affect urine color.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2873729542859746, "g_worst_claim": 0.33236833052201703, "g_content": 2.285045447716346, "g_traj_mean": 1.4651710987091064}}], "selected_rollout": 0, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 60.77, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "653", "question": "how to properly clean your hair", "gt": "To properly clean your hair, first select the appropriate shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. Ensure your water is warm but not too hot, and thoroughly wet your hair. Apply a bit of shampoo into the palm of your hand and work it through the hair. If your hair is long, comb through it with your fingers to reduce tangles rather than piling it on your head. Rinse the hair completely and use a wide-tooth comb to remove any tangles. Apply conditioner in the same manner as the shampoo and let it stay on for a few minutes. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again. Pat dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoid rubbing it with the towel as it can cause damage. For complete drying, a hair dryer can be used.", "pred": "1. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\n2. Make sure the water in the shower is warm, but not too hot, and turn the flow down slightly.\n3. Thoroughly wet the hair.\n4. Apply a small amount of shampoo (about a nickel-sized amount) to the palm of your hand and work it through the hair, combing through it with your fingers to reduce tangles.\n5. Rinse the hair completely.\n6. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair if the hair is longer.\n7. Apply a conditioner in the same manner you applied the shampoo, allowing it to remain on for a few minutes.\n8. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n9. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles with a towel to prevent damage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "1. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\n2. Make sure the water in the shower is warm, but not too hot, and turn the flow down slightly.\n3. Thoroughly wet the hair.\n4. Apply a small amount of shampoo (about a nickel-sized amount) to the palm of your hand and work it through the hair, combing through it with your fingers to reduce tangles.\n5. Rinse the hair completely.\n6. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair if the hair is longer.\n7. Apply a conditioner in the same manner you applied the shampoo, allowing it to remain on for a few minutes.\n8. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n9. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles with a towel to prevent damage.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to properly clean your hair, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\\n2. Make sure the water in the shower is warm, but not too hot, and turn the flow down slightly.\\n3. Thoroughly wet the hair.\\n4. Apply a small amount of shampoo (about a nickel-sized amount) to the palm of your hand and work it through the hair, combing through it with your fingers to reduce tangles.\\n5. Rinse the hair completely.\\n6. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair if the hair is longer.\\n7. Apply a conditioner in the same manner you applied the shampoo, allowing it to remain on for a few minutes.\\n8. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\\n9. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles with a towel to prevent damage.\", \"To properly clean your hair, follow these steps: First, ensure you select the correct shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. Next, turn on the shower with warm water, but not too hot, and adjust the flow to avoid splashing. Thoroughly wet your hair. Apply a small amount of shampoo (about the size of a nickel) to your hand and massage it through your hair, using your fingers to avoid piling up the product and reduce tangles if your hair is long. Rinse your hair completely, then use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair. Apply conditioner in the same manner as shampoo and leave it on for a few minutes. Rinse the hair again with cool water, and comb through it once more. Dry your hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, never rubbing it back and forth or in circles as this can cause damage. Afterward, wrap a towel or pat your hair gently to soak the water. Use a hair dryer to completely dry your hair. Avoid rubbing it with a towel to dry it as wet hair is weak and such frictions can lead to damage. Handle your hair with proper care to make them beautiful.\", \"Based on the given passages, properly cleaning your hair involves the following steps:\\n\\n1. Ensure you use the correct shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\\n2. Make sure the water in the shower is warm, not too hot, and adjust the flow to avoid splashing.\\n3. Thoroughly wet your hair.\\n4. Apply a small amount of shampoo (about the size of a nickel) and work it through your hair with your fingers, especially if your hair is long.\\n5. Rinse your hair completely to remove all shampoo.\\n6. Use a conditioner, apply it in the same manner as you applied the shampoo, and allow it to remain on for a few minutes.\\n7. Rinse the conditioner out with cool water.\\n8. Dry your hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion instead of rubbing, which can cause damage to the hair.\", \"Based on the given passages, to properly clean your hair, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Ensure you have the right shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\\n2. Make sure your shower water is warm but not too hot.\\n3. Thoroughly wet your hair.\\n4. Apply a small amount of shampoo (approximately a nickel-sized amount) and work it through your hair, combing through it with your fingers if your hair is longer to reduce tangles.\\n5. Rinse your hair completely.\\n6. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair if your hair is longer.\\n7. Apply a conditioner in the same manner as the shampoo and allow it to remain on for a few minutes.\\n8. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\\n9. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing it back and forth or in circles with the towel as this can cause damage to the hair.\\n10. Use a hair dryer to completely dry your hair.\\n\\nThese steps ensure proper cleaning and care for your hair, keeping it healthy and beautiful.\"]", "time_sec": 33.051, "generation_time_seconds": 32.064, "selection_time_seconds": 0.9791, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 10277, 4240, 697, 6869, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 8427, 279, 6169, 61932, 323, 64324, 369, 697, 6869, 943, 624, 17, 13, 7405, 2704, 279, 3015, 304, 279, 17196, 374, 8205, 11, 714, 537, 2238, 4017, 11, 323, 2484, 279, 6396, 1495, 10078, 624, 18, 13, 663, 14438, 398, 14401, 279, 6869, 624, 19, 13, 20552, 264, 2613, 3311, 315, 61932, 320, 9096, 264, 51249, 27835, 3311, 8, 311, 279, 32452, 315, 697, 1424, 323, 975, 432, 1526, 279, 6869, 11, 3614, 287, 1526, 432, 448, 697, 19225, 311, 7949, 259, 17248, 624, 20, 13, 57368, 325, 279, 6869, 6587, 624, 21, 13, 5443, 264, 6884, 4686, 8767, 3614, 311, 4057, 259, 17248, 323, 10876, 279, 6869, 421, 279, 6869, 374, 5021, 624, 22, 13, 20552, 264, 64324, 304, 279, 1852, 11566, 498, 9251, 279, 61932, 11, 10693, 432, 311, 7146, 389, 369, 264, 2421, 4420, 624, 23, 13, 57368, 325, 279, 6869, 448, 7010, 3015, 323, 3614, 1526, 432, 1549, 624, 24, 13, 30841, 279, 6869, 448, 264, 42613, 1667, 264, 3272, 1280, 476, 30411, 10566, 11379, 11, 30426, 55935, 279, 6869, 1182, 323, 13241, 476, 304, 25362, 448, 264, 42613, 311, 5358, 5557, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\n2. Make sure the water in the shower is warm, but not too hot, and turn the flow down slightly.\n3. Thoroughly wet the hair.\n4. Apply a small amount of shampoo (about a nickel-sized amount) to the palm of your hand and work it through the hair, combing through it with your fingers to reduce tangles.\n5. Rinse the hair completely.\n6. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair if the hair is longer.\n7. Apply a conditioner in the same manner you applied the shampoo, allowing it to remain on for a few minutes.\n8. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n9. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles with a towel to prevent damage.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4696734726200662, "g_worst_claim": 0.2679348985354106, "g_content": 1.6514556541871488, "g_traj_mean": 1.3245590925216675}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [1249, 10277, 4240, 697, 6869, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 25, 5512, 11, 5978, 498, 3293, 279, 4396, 61932, 323, 64324, 369, 697, 6869, 943, 13, 9295, 11, 2484, 389, 279, 17196, 448, 8205, 3015, 11, 714, 537, 2238, 4017, 11, 323, 7500, 279, 6396, 311, 5648, 12503, 19049, 13, 663, 14438, 398, 14401, 697, 6869, 13, 20552, 264, 2613, 3311, 315, 61932, 320, 9096, 279, 1379, 315, 264, 51249, 8, 311, 697, 1424, 323, 6245, 432, 1526, 697, 6869, 11, 1667, 697, 19225, 311, 5648, 281, 7979, 705, 279, 1985, 323, 7949, 259, 17248, 421, 697, 6869, 374, 1293, 13, 57368, 325, 697, 6869, 6587, 11, 1221, 990, 264, 6884, 4686, 8767, 3614, 311, 4057, 259, 17248, 323, 10876, 279, 6869, 13, 20552, 64324, 304, 279, 1852, 11566, 438, 61932, 323, 5274, 432, 389, 369, 264, 2421, 4420, 13, 57368, 325, 279, 6869, 1549, 448, 7010, 3015, 11, 323, 3614, 1526, 432, 3055, 803, 13, 30841, 697, 6869, 448, 264, 42613, 1667, 264, 3272, 1280, 476, 30411, 10566, 11379, 11, 2581, 55935, 432, 1182, 323, 13241, 476, 304, 25362, 438, 419, 646, 5240, 5557, 13, 4636, 1606, 11, 15061, 264, 42613, 476, 3272, 697, 6869, 29273, 311, 60692, 279, 3015, 13, 5443, 264, 6869, 46622, 311, 6587, 9058, 697, 6869, 13, 34006, 55935, 432, 448, 264, 42613, 311, 9058, 432, 438, 14401, 6869, 374, 7469, 323, 1741, 1422, 21439, 646, 2990, 311, 5557, 13, 13760, 697, 6869, 448, 6169, 2453, 311, 1281, 1105, 6233, 13, 151645], "pred": "To properly clean your hair, follow these steps: First, ensure you select the correct shampoo and conditioner for your hair type. Next, turn on the shower with warm water, but not too hot, and adjust the flow to avoid splashing. Thoroughly wet your hair. Apply a small amount of shampoo (about the size of a nickel) to your hand and massage it through your hair, using your fingers to avoid piling up the product and reduce tangles if your hair is long. Rinse your hair completely, then use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair. Apply conditioner in the same manner as shampoo and leave it on for a few minutes. Rinse the hair again with cool water, and comb through it once more. Dry your hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, never rubbing it back and forth or in circles as this can cause damage. Afterward, wrap a towel or pat your hair gently to soak the water. Use a hair dryer to completely dry your hair. Avoid rubbing it with a towel to dry it as wet hair is weak and such frictions can lead to damage. Handle your hair with proper care to make them beautiful.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4450730735559174, "g_worst_claim": 0.17180389165878296, "g_content": 2.1236806138653623, "g_traj_mean": 1.5229135751724243}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 10277, 15826, 697, 6869, 17601, 279, 2701, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 29279, 498, 990, 279, 4396, 61932, 323, 64324, 369, 697, 6869, 943, 624, 17, 13, 7405, 2704, 279, 3015, 304, 279, 17196, 374, 8205, 11, 537, 2238, 4017, 11, 323, 7500, 279, 6396, 311, 5648, 12503, 19049, 624, 18, 13, 663, 14438, 398, 14401, 697, 6869, 624, 19, 13, 20552, 264, 2613, 3311, 315, 61932, 320, 9096, 279, 1379, 315, 264, 51249, 8, 323, 975, 432, 1526, 697, 6869, 448, 697, 19225, 11, 5310, 421, 697, 6869, 374, 1293, 624, 20, 13, 57368, 325, 697, 6869, 6587, 311, 4057, 678, 61932, 624, 21, 13, 5443, 264, 64324, 11, 3796, 432, 304, 279, 1852, 11566, 438, 498, 9251, 279, 61932, 11, 323, 2138, 432, 311, 7146, 389, 369, 264, 2421, 4420, 624, 22, 13, 57368, 325, 279, 64324, 700, 448, 7010, 3015, 624, 23, 13, 30841, 697, 6869, 448, 264, 42613, 1667, 264, 3272, 1280, 476, 30411, 10566, 11379, 4518, 315, 55935, 11, 892, 646, 5240, 5557, 311, 279, 6869, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Ensure you use the correct shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\n2. Make sure the water in the shower is warm, not too hot, and adjust the flow to avoid splashing.\n3. Thoroughly wet your hair.\n4. Apply a small amount of shampoo (about the size of a nickel) and work it through your hair with your fingers, especially if your hair is long.\n5. Rinse your hair completely to remove all shampoo.\n6. Use a conditioner, apply it in the same manner as you applied the shampoo, and allow it to remain on for a few minutes.\n7. Rinse the conditioner out with cool water.\n8. Dry your hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion instead of rubbing, which can cause damage to the hair.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.9913702719741397, "g_worst_claim": 0.08782106637954712, "g_content": 1.2080621719360352, "g_traj_mean": 0.926045298576355}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 10277, 4240, 697, 6869, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 29279, 498, 614, 279, 1290, 61932, 323, 64324, 369, 697, 6869, 943, 624, 17, 13, 7405, 2704, 697, 17196, 3015, 374, 8205, 714, 537, 2238, 4017, 624, 18, 13, 663, 14438, 398, 14401, 697, 6869, 624, 19, 13, 20552, 264, 2613, 3311, 315, 61932, 320, 96736, 264, 51249, 27835, 3311, 8, 323, 975, 432, 1526, 697, 6869, 11, 3614, 287, 1526, 432, 448, 697, 19225, 421, 697, 6869, 374, 5021, 311, 7949, 259, 17248, 624, 20, 13, 57368, 325, 697, 6869, 6587, 624, 21, 13, 5443, 264, 6884, 4686, 8767, 3614, 311, 4057, 259, 17248, 323, 10876, 279, 6869, 421, 697, 6869, 374, 5021, 624, 22, 13, 20552, 264, 64324, 304, 279, 1852, 11566, 438, 279, 61932, 323, 2138, 432, 311, 7146, 389, 369, 264, 2421, 4420, 624, 23, 13, 57368, 325, 279, 6869, 448, 7010, 3015, 323, 3614, 1526, 432, 1549, 624, 24, 13, 30841, 279, 6869, 448, 264, 42613, 1667, 264, 3272, 1280, 476, 30411, 10566, 11379, 11, 30426, 55935, 432, 1182, 323, 13241, 476, 304, 25362, 448, 279, 42613, 438, 419, 646, 5240, 5557, 311, 279, 6869, 624, 16, 15, 13, 5443, 264, 6869, 46622, 311, 6587, 9058, 697, 6869, 382, 9485, 7354, 5978, 6169, 15826, 323, 2453, 369, 697, 6869, 11, 10282, 432, 9314, 323, 6233, 13, 151645], "pred": "These steps ensure proper cleaning and care for your hair, keeping it healthy and beautiful.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.186542110466676, "g_worst_claim": 0.2643137375513713, "g_content": 1.4436524335075827, "g_traj_mean": 1.1832963228225708}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 65.19, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "655", "question": "how to properly clean your hair", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are the steps to properly clean your hair:\n\n1. Rinse your hair completely with warm water, then use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair (Passage 1, step 6).\n2. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type, and apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo into the palm of your hand while in the shower (Passage 2, steps 1-3). Work the shampoo through your hair without piling it up on your head, and avoid tangling it while it's still wet.\n3. After applying shampoo, rinse your hair thoroughly with warm water, and then comb through it with your fingers to remove any remaining tangles (Passage 1, step 7).\n4. Apply a conditioner to your hair, allowing it to remain on for a few minutes before rinsing it out with cool water (Passage 1, step 8).\n5. To dry your hair, gently pat it with a towel or wrap it around your head to absorb excess water, avoiding rubbing it vigorously with a towel (Passage 3).\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages. The passages do not provide instructions on how to style or dry your hair after cleaning it.", "pred": "1. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\n2. Make sure the water in the shower is warm, but not too hot, and turn the flow down slightly.\n3. Thoroughly wet the hair.\n4. Apply a small amount of shampoo (about a nickel-sized amount) to the palm of your hand and work it through the hair, combing through it with your fingers to reduce tangles.\n5. Rinse the hair completely.\n6. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair if the hair is longer.\n7. Apply a conditioner in the same manner you applied the shampoo, allowing it to remain on for a few minutes.\n8. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n9. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles with a towel to prevent damage.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "1. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\n2. Make sure the water in the shower is warm, but not too hot, and turn the flow down slightly.\n3. Thoroughly wet the hair.\n4. Apply a small amount of shampoo (about a nickel-sized amount) to the palm of your hand and work it through the hair, combing through it with your fingers to reduce tangles.\n5. Rinse the hair completely.\n6. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair if the hair is longer.\n7. Apply a conditioner in the same manner you applied the shampoo, allowing it to remain on for a few minutes.\n8. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n9. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles with a towel to prevent damage.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to properly clean your hair, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\\n2. Make sure the water in the shower is warm, but not too hot, and turn the flow down slightly.\\n3. Thoroughly wet the hair.\\n4. Apply a small amount of shampoo (about a nickel-sized amount) to the palm of your hand and work it through the hair, combing through it with your fingers to reduce tangles.\\n5. Rinse the hair completely.\\n6. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair if the hair is longer.\\n7. Apply a conditioner in the same manner you applied the shampoo, allowing it to remain on for a few minutes.\\n8. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\\n9. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles with a towel to prevent damage.\", \"Based on the given passages, to properly clean your hair, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Ensure you have the right shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\\n2. Make sure the water in the shower is warm, not too hot, and turn the flow down slightly to avoid splashing.\\n3. Thoroughly wet your hair.\\n4. Apply shampoo, about a nickel-sized amount, to your hand and work it through your hair.\\n5. If your hair is longer, comb through it with your fingers to reduce tangles.\\n6. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair if it's longer.\\n7. Apply conditioner in the same manner you applied the shampoo.\\n8. Allow the conditioner to remain on for a few minutes.\\n9. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\\n10. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion; avoid rubbing it with a towel as this can cause damage to the hair.\\n11. Use a hair dryer to completely dry your hair.\", \"Based on the given passages, to properly clean your hair, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Make sure to select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\\n2. While in the shower, make sure your water is warm but not too hot. Adjust the shower flow to avoid splashing.\\n3. Thoroughly wet your hair.\\n4. Apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo into your hand and work it through your hair. If your hair is longer, comb through it with your fingers to reduce tangles.\\n5. Rinse the shampoo completely, and if your hair is long, use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair.\\n6. Apply a conditioner in the same manner you applied the shampoo. Allow the conditioner to remain on for a few minutes.\\n7. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\\n8. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion. Avoid rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles with a towel as this can cause damage.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you can ensure that your hair is properly cleaned and cared for.\", \"Based on the given passages, to properly clean your hair, follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Ensure you select the appropriate shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\\n2. Make sure the water in the shower is warm but not too hot and adjust the flow to avoid splashing.\\n3. Thoroughly wet the hair.\\n4. Apply a small amount of shampoo (about a nickel-sized amount) and work it through the hair, combing through longer hair to prevent tangles.\\n5. Rinse the hair completely and, if the hair is longer, use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair.\\n6. Apply a conditioner in the same manner as the shampoo, allowing it to remain on for a few minutes.\\n7. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\\n8. Dry the hair by patting or stroking with a towel and avoid rubbing to prevent damage.\\n\\nThese steps ensure a thorough and gentle cleaning process that helps maintain the health and beauty of your hair.\"]", "time_sec": 34.022, "generation_time_seconds": 32.9545, "selection_time_seconds": 1.058, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 10277, 4240, 697, 6869, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 8427, 279, 6169, 61932, 323, 64324, 369, 697, 6869, 943, 624, 17, 13, 7405, 2704, 279, 3015, 304, 279, 17196, 374, 8205, 11, 714, 537, 2238, 4017, 11, 323, 2484, 279, 6396, 1495, 10078, 624, 18, 13, 663, 14438, 398, 14401, 279, 6869, 624, 19, 13, 20552, 264, 2613, 3311, 315, 61932, 320, 9096, 264, 51249, 27835, 3311, 8, 311, 279, 32452, 315, 697, 1424, 323, 975, 432, 1526, 279, 6869, 11, 3614, 287, 1526, 432, 448, 697, 19225, 311, 7949, 259, 17248, 624, 20, 13, 57368, 325, 279, 6869, 6587, 624, 21, 13, 5443, 264, 6884, 4686, 8767, 3614, 311, 4057, 259, 17248, 323, 10876, 279, 6869, 421, 279, 6869, 374, 5021, 624, 22, 13, 20552, 264, 64324, 304, 279, 1852, 11566, 498, 9251, 279, 61932, 11, 10693, 432, 311, 7146, 389, 369, 264, 2421, 4420, 624, 23, 13, 57368, 325, 279, 6869, 448, 7010, 3015, 323, 3614, 1526, 432, 1549, 624, 24, 13, 30841, 279, 6869, 448, 264, 42613, 1667, 264, 3272, 1280, 476, 30411, 10566, 11379, 11, 30426, 55935, 279, 6869, 1182, 323, 13241, 476, 304, 25362, 448, 264, 42613, 311, 5358, 5557, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\n2. Make sure the water in the shower is warm, but not too hot, and turn the flow down slightly.\n3. Thoroughly wet the hair.\n4. Apply a small amount of shampoo (about a nickel-sized amount) to the palm of your hand and work it through the hair, combing through it with your fingers to reduce tangles.\n5. Rinse the hair completely.\n6. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair if the hair is longer.\n7. Apply a conditioner in the same manner you applied the shampoo, allowing it to remain on for a few minutes.\n8. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n9. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles with a towel to prevent damage.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.489756410917551, "g_worst_claim": 0.3563303550084432, "g_content": 1.6946099099148526, "g_traj_mean": 1.33537757396698}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 10277, 4240, 697, 6869, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 29279, 498, 614, 279, 1290, 61932, 323, 64324, 369, 697, 6869, 943, 624, 17, 13, 7405, 2704, 279, 3015, 304, 279, 17196, 374, 8205, 11, 537, 2238, 4017, 11, 323, 2484, 279, 6396, 1495, 10078, 311, 5648, 12503, 19049, 624, 18, 13, 663, 14438, 398, 14401, 697, 6869, 624, 19, 13, 20552, 61932, 11, 911, 264, 51249, 27835, 3311, 11, 311, 697, 1424, 323, 975, 432, 1526, 697, 6869, 624, 20, 13, 1416, 697, 6869, 374, 5021, 11, 3614, 1526, 432, 448, 697, 19225, 311, 7949, 259, 17248, 624, 21, 13, 5443, 264, 6884, 4686, 8767, 3614, 311, 4057, 259, 17248, 323, 10876, 279, 6869, 421, 432, 594, 5021, 624, 22, 13, 20552, 64324, 304, 279, 1852, 11566, 498, 9251, 279, 61932, 624, 23, 13, 26530, 279, 64324, 311, 7146, 389, 369, 264, 2421, 4420, 624, 24, 13, 57368, 325, 279, 6869, 448, 7010, 3015, 323, 3614, 1526, 432, 1549, 624, 16, 15, 13, 30841, 279, 6869, 448, 264, 42613, 1667, 264, 3272, 1280, 476, 30411, 10566, 11379, 26, 5648, 55935, 432, 448, 264, 42613, 438, 419, 646, 5240, 5557, 311, 279, 6869, 624, 16, 16, 13, 5443, 264, 6869, 46622, 311, 6587, 9058, 697, 6869, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Ensure you have the right shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\n2. Make sure the water in the shower is warm, not too hot, and turn the flow down slightly to avoid splashing.\n3. Thoroughly wet your hair.\n4. Apply shampoo, about a nickel-sized amount, to your hand and work it through your hair.\n5. If your hair is longer, comb through it with your fingers to reduce tangles.\n6. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair if it's longer.\n7. Apply conditioner in the same manner you applied the shampoo.\n8. Allow the conditioner to remain on for a few minutes.\n9. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n10. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion; avoid rubbing it with a towel as this can cause damage to the hair.\n11. Use a hair dryer to completely dry your hair.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2895039824928554, "g_worst_claim": -0.8891379038492838, "g_content": 1.5023183407990828, "g_traj_mean": 1.2337706089019775}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 10277, 4240, 697, 6869, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 7405, 2704, 311, 3293, 279, 6169, 61932, 323, 64324, 369, 697, 6869, 943, 624, 17, 13, 5976, 304, 279, 17196, 11, 1281, 2704, 697, 3015, 374, 8205, 714, 537, 2238, 4017, 13, 27196, 279, 17196, 6396, 311, 5648, 12503, 19049, 624, 18, 13, 663, 14438, 398, 14401, 697, 6869, 624, 19, 13, 20552, 264, 51249, 27835, 3311, 315, 61932, 1119, 697, 1424, 323, 975, 432, 1526, 697, 6869, 13, 1416, 697, 6869, 374, 5021, 11, 3614, 1526, 432, 448, 697, 19225, 311, 7949, 259, 17248, 624, 20, 13, 57368, 325, 279, 61932, 6587, 11,