e senses, relieving stress, promoting digestion, and providing relief from abdominal pain, gas pain, and other stomach upsets. Clove tea also contains analgesic qualities that can help with pain relief from muscle, joint, and ligament injuries, as well as arthritis pain. It is recommended to apply clove tea compresses to unbroken skin for pain relief. The passages do not mention any side effects of drinking clove tea.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.187309060601617, "g_worst_claim": 0.03537223239739736, "g_content": 1.881933065561148, "g_traj_mean": 1.1896426677703857}}], "selected_rollout": 1, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 41.67, "GAVIE-Rel": 1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "679", "question": "benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea:\n\nBenefits:\n\n* Soothes the senses and relieves stress (Passage 1)\n* Provides relief from pain due to muscle, joint, or ligament injuries (Passage 2)\n* Soothes abdominal pain and aids in digestion (Passage 3)\n\nSide Effects:\n\n* None mentioned in the passages.\n\nNote that there are no side effects mentioned in the passages provided. However, it's important to note that consuming clove tea in large quantities can cause irritation to the stomach and digestive tract, so it's best to consume it in moderation.", "pred": "The passages do not mention any significant side effects of drinking clove tea.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The passages do not mention any significant side effects of drinking clove tea.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, the benefits of drinking clove tea include:\\n\\n1. Soothing the senses and relieving stress in the body.\\n2. Providing relief from stress when mixed with basil, mint, and cardamom in water and taken with honey.\\n3. Having skin benefits, although specific details are not provided.\\n4. Relieving pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries due to its analgesic effects.\\n5. Being applied to unbroken skin for pain relief.\\n6. Working better with arthritic pain when applied as a warm tea compress.\\n7. Soothing abdominal pain and aiding in digestion for those suffering from gas pain or other stomach upset.\\n8. Stimulating blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions to aid in digestion.\\n\\nThere are no side effects mentioned in the provided passages.\", \"Based on the given passages, drinking clove tea provides several benefits and has minimal side effects. The benefits of drinking clove tea include:\\n\\n1. Soothing the senses and relieving stress in the body.\\n2. Providing relief from stress when mixed with basil, mint, cardamom, and honey.\\n3. Offering skin benefits.\\n4. Relieving pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries.\\n5. Aiding in digestion for those suffering from stomach upset, gas pain, or other abdominal discomfort.\\n6. Stimulating blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions.\\n\\nThe passages do not mention any significant side effects of drinking clove tea.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of drinking clove tea include:\\n\\n1. Soothes the senses and relieves stress in the body.\\n2. Provides relief from stress when mixed with basil, mint, and cardamom and taken with honey.\\n3. Offers skin benefits.\\n4. Is an excellent way to relieve pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries.\\n5. Works well with warm tea for arthritic pain.\\n6. Serves as an analgesic for stomach upset.\\n7. Stimulates blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions to aid in digestion.\\n\\nNo side effects are mentioned in the provided passages.\", \"Based on the given passages, the benefits of drinking clove tea include:\\n- Soothing the senses and relieving stress in the body\\n- Providing relief from stress when mixed with other herbs like basil, mint, and cardamom\\n- Having skin benefits\\n- Relieving pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries when applied to unbroken skin\\n- Working better with warm tea for arthritic pain\\n- Soothing abdominal pain\\n- Having analgesic qualities that work well for those suffering from gas pain or other stomach upset\\n- Stimulating blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions to aid in digestion\\n\\nSide effects, based on the given passages, are not mentioned. Therefore, there are no side effects listed in the provided information.\"]", "time_sec": 25.732, "generation_time_seconds": 24.8713, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8546, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids"