45], "pred": "The passages do not mention any significant side effects of drinking clove tea.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.086584990700334, "g_worst_claim": 0.0023517529480159283, "g_content": 2.1230015541190532, "g_traj_mean": 1.4601794481277466}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 16163, 5292, 586, 15243, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 2055, 78, 6375, 279, 37107, 323, 1351, 38135, 8464, 304, 279, 2487, 624, 17, 13, 36617, 15957, 504, 8464, 979, 9519, 448, 67086, 11, 28337, 11, 323, 3701, 309, 316, 323, 4429, 448, 25744, 624, 18, 13, 51318, 6787, 7567, 624, 19, 13, 2160, 458, 9073, 1616, 311, 47739, 6646, 504, 15747, 11, 10284, 11, 476, 28313, 2838, 14970, 624, 20, 13, 21104, 1632, 448, 8205, 15243, 369, 796, 339, 49208, 6646, 624, 21, 13, 328, 13280, 438, 458, 3181, 4188, 292, 369, 22350, 22459, 624, 22, 13, 70772, 23156, 6543, 6396, 11, 84557, 5670, 11, 323, 88285, 6234, 908, 311, 12296, 304, 73402, 382, 2753, 3108, 6239, 525, 9733, 304, 279, 3897, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "No side effects are mentioned in the provided passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.096823598278893, "g_worst_claim": 0.21265151500701904, "g_content": 2.4246543145948842, "g_traj_mean": 1.6085494756698608}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 7567, 315, 16163, 5292, 586, 15243, 2924, 510, 12, 2055, 78, 1596, 279, 37107, 323, 58544, 4405, 8464, 304, 279, 2487, 198, 12, 80100, 15957, 504, 8464, 979, 9519, 448, 1008, 41293, 1075, 67086, 11, 28337, 11, 323, 3701, 309, 316, 198, 12, 20035, 6787, 7567, 198, 12, 6512, 83346, 6646, 504, 15747, 11, 10284, 11, 476, 28313, 2838, 14970, 979, 9251, 311, 650, 48909, 6787, 198, 12, 22150, 2664, 448, 8205, 15243, 369, 796, 339, 49208, 6646, 198, 12, 2055, 78, 1596, 55956, 6646, 198, 12, 20035, 3181, 4188, 292, 28500, 429, 975, 1632, 369, 1846, 15691, 504, 6819, 6646, 476, 1008, 22350, 22459, 198, 12, 70772, 15486, 6543, 6396, 11, 84557, 5670, 11, 323, 88285, 6234, 908, 311, 12296, 304, 73402, 271, 16384, 6239, 11, 3118, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 525, 537, 9733, 13, 15277, 11, 1052, 525, 902, 3108, 6239, 10007, 304, 279, 3897, 1995, 13, 151645], "pred": "Side effects, based on the given passages, are not mentioned. Therefore, there are no side effects listed in the provided information.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7979160297751076, "g_worst_claim": -0.16079660256703696, "g_content": 2.6196939219599185, "g_traj_mean": 1.6630566120147705}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "681", "question": "how to get free voip service and phone number", "gt": "To get a free VoIP service and phone number, you can visit YouTube channels which provide tutorials on how to access these services, such as the video available at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037. You could also use cloud VoIP services that require no equipment on your end. These services offer toll-free and US local numbers that can be forwarded to any US number or used with SIP devices for outgoing calls. Additionally, companies offer DID or incoming numbers from around the world either for a flat yearly rate or a monthly fee.", "pred": "1. Look for VoIP services that offer free incoming numbers (DID or imcoming numbers). These are available from various companies.\n2. Some companies, like Google, offer free Virtual Phone Numbers (VOIP).\n3. Visit a respected company's website to find and obtain a free virtual phone number that uses the internet to place and receive calls.\n4. With the virtual phone number, you will be able to receive calls from a PSTN or mobile phone.\n5. Additionally, you can use SIP devices to make outgoing calls to US numbers with your cloud account.\n6. Take advantage of any new pricing announcements for lower costs.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "1. Look for VoIP services that offer free incoming numbers (DID or imcoming numbers). These are available from various companies.\n2. Some companies, like Google, offer free Virtual Phone Numbers (VOIP).\n3. Visit a respected company's website to find and obtain a free virtual phone number that uses the internet to place and receive calls.\n4. With the virtual phone number, you will be able to receive calls from a PSTN or mobile phone.\n5. Additionally, you can use SIP devices to make outgoing calls to US numbers with your cloud account.\n6. Take advantage of any new pricing announcements for lower costs.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, to get free VoIP service and a phone number, you can follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037.\\n2. Watch the video that shows how to get a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP).\\n3. Get your free number today from a respected company named Google.\\n\\nThese steps will guide you on how to obtain a free VoIP service and a phone number.\", \"Based on the given passages, to get a free VoIP service and phone number, you can follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Look for VoIP services that offer free incoming numbers (DID or imcoming numbers). These are available from various companies.\\n2. Some companies, like Google, offer free Virtual Phone Numbers (VOIP).\\n3. Visit a respected company's website to find and obtain a free virtual phone number that uses the internet to place and receive calls.\\n4. With the virtual phone number, you will be able to receive calls from a PSTN or mobile phone.\\n5. Additionally, you can use SIP devices to make outgoing calls to US numbers with your cloud account.\\n6. Take advantage of any new pricing announcements for lower costs.\", \"To get a free VoIP service and phone number, visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037. This video will show you how to get a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP) from Google. A voip number is a phone number that uses the internet to place and receive calls.\", \"Based on the given passages, to get free VoIP service and phone number, you can follow these steps:\\n\\n1. Find a free or paid VoIP service provider.\\n2. Contact companies offering DID or incoming numbers (VoIP-In) for a flat yearly or monthly fee.\\n3. Look for a respected company like Google to get a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP).\\n4. Use a Cloud VoIP service that provides VoIP service completely in the cloud with no equipment required on your end.\\n5. Get toll-free numbers and US local numbers that can be forwarded to any US number (like a cell phone) or used with a SIP device.\\n6. Use SIP devices to make outgoing calls to US numbers with your cloud account.\\n\\nBy following these steps, you can obtain free VoIP service and a phone number.\"]", "time_sec": 22.674, "generation_time_seconds": 21.5386, "selection_time_seconds": 1.1286, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 633, 1910, 28079, 3298, 2473, 323, 264, 4540, 1372, 11, 498, 646, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 19008, 279, 13370, 5496, 518, 1758, 1110, 2136, 20145, 905, 11739, 14, 6198, 321, 17, 15, 18, 22, 624, 17, 13, 10357, 279, 2766, 429, 4933, 1246, 311, 633, 264, 1910, 20721, 14307, 5624, 320, 11169, 3298, 4292, 18, 13, 2126, 697, 1910, 1372, 3351, 504, 264, 30287, 2813, 6941, 5085, 382, 9485, 7354, 686, 8474, 498, 389, 1246, 311, 6851, 264, 1910, 28079, 3298, 2473, 323, 264, 4540, 1372, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, to get free VoIP service and a phone number, you can follow these steps:\n\n1. Visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037.\n2. Watch the video that shows how to get a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP).\n3. Get your free number today from a respected company named Google.\n\nThese steps will guide you on how to obtain a free VoIP service and a phone number.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4962885718089607, "g_worst_claim": 0.09242311904304906, "g_content": 1.9582894219292535, "g_traj_mean": 1.4918935298919678}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 633, 264, 1910, 28079, 3298, 2473, 323, 4540, 1372, 11, 498, 646, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 9192, 369, 28079, 3298, 3516, 429, 3010, 1910, 19393, 5109, 320, 35, 915, 476, 732, 4959, 5109, 568, 4220, 525, 2500, 504, 5257, 5110, 624, 17, 13, 4329, 5110, 11, 1075, 5085, 11, 3010, 1910, 20721, 14307, 34713, 320, 11169, 3298, 4292, 18, 13, 19008, 264, 30287, 2813, 594, 3910, 311, 1477, 323, 685