{"id": "691", "question": "does watching snapchat stories increase score", "gt": "Based on the given passages, watching Snapchat stories does not directly increase your Snapchat score. The score is primarily based on the number of snaps sent and received.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, watching Snapchat stories does not increase score.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, watching Snapchat stories does not increase score.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, watching Snapchat stories does not increase your Snapchat score. The passages mention that the score is a sum of the number of snaps sent and snaps received, and there is no indication that watching stories contributes to this score.\", \"Based on the given passages, watching Snapchat stories does not increase your score. The score on Snapchat is based on the number of snaps sent and received, so actively engaging with snaps through sending and receiving them will increase your score, but watching stories will not contribute to this tally.\", \"Based on the given passages, watching Snapchat stories does not increase your Snapchat score. The passages discuss how to increase your Snapchat score by sending and receiving snaps, but there is no mention of watching stories affecting your score.\", \"Based on the given passages, watching Snapchat stories does not increase score.\"]", "time_sec": 11.364, "generation_time_seconds": 10.7115, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6447, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 10099, 55179, 7343, 1558, 537, 5263, 697, 55179, 5456, 13, 576, 46769, 6286, 429, 279, 5456, 374, 264, 2629, 315, 279, 1372, 315, 51304, 3208, 323, 51304, 3949, 11, 323, 1052, 374, 902, 27039, 429, 10099, 7343, 42972, 311, 419, 5456, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, watching Snap