ry snap that you receive. Watching stories does not contribute to either sending or receiving snaps.\"]", "time_sec": 11.281, "generation_time_seconds": 10.3792, "selection_time_seconds": 0.8962, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 10099, 55179, 7343, 1558, 537, 5263, 697, 55179, 5456, 13, 576, 46769, 6286, 429, 279, 5456, 374, 264, 2629, 315, 279, 1372, 315, 51304, 3208, 323, 51304, 3949, 11, 323, 1052, 374, 902, 27039, 429, 10099, 7343, 42972, 311, 419, 5456, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, watching Snapchat stories does not increase your Snapchat score. The passages mention that the score is a sum of the number of snaps sent and snaps received, and there is no indication that watching stories contributes to this score.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.6941405627006783, "g_worst_claim": 0.23813328376183143, "g_content": 1.1302758921747622, "g_traj_mean": 0.8495583534240723}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 10099, 55179, 7343, 1558, 537, 5263, 697, 5456, 13, 576, 46769, 4190, 429, 7703, 697, 55179, 5456, 374, 16994, 553, 11628, 323, 12308, 803, 13059, 2625, 11, 537, 553, 10099, 7343, 13, 576, 5456, 374, 264, 2629, 315, 279, 1372, 315, 51304, 3208, 323, 51304, 3949, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, watching Snapchat stories does not increase your score. The passages suggest that increasing your Snapchat score is achieved by sending and receiving more Snaps, not by watching stories. The score is a sum of the number of snaps sent and snaps received.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.8793794457117716, "g_worst_claim": 0.33190345764160156, "g_content": 1.817860823411208, "g_traj_mean": 1.165648102760315}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_