, 399, 279, 9853, 12644, 6514, 4092, 311, 279, 13963, 594, 17961, 11, 892, 11136, 4990, 911, 220, 17, 15, 311, 220, 17, 20, 4420, 382, 19, 13, 9646, 279, 9853, 12644, 374, 56050, 19690, 11, 498, 646, 8683, 432, 7069, 476, 1992, 432, 304, 279, 49585, 311, 23288, 268, 369, 220, 17, 311, 220, 18, 4115, 1573, 13480, 13, 151645], "pred": "4. Once the ice cream is softly frozen, you can serve it immediately or place it in the freezer to ripen for 2 to 3 hours before serving.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 0.8712898917624519, "g_worst_claim": -0.14460508525371552, "g_content": 1.445947368493241, "g_traj_mean": 0.9715421199798584}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 1588, 374, 1246, 311, 1281, 9853, 12644, 1447, 16, 13, 1752, 279, 2331, 510, 256, 481, 19219, 697, 2331, 13, 1096, 17601, 34171, 13966, 311, 1855, 264, 46885, 2331, 13, 1446, 646, 1191, 448, 264, 1661, 32065, 9853, 12644, 2331, 624, 256, 481, 576, 2331, 646, 387, 2987, 12644, 5980, 476, 16564, 567, 5980, 13, 29700, 5980, 9853, 12644, 374, 7481, 438, 1660, 264, 2699, 17902, 1268, 323, 29573, 1091, 16564, 567, 5980, 9853, 12644, 382, 17, 13, 1752, 279, 6514, 510, 256, 481, 64192, 13163, 11, 12644, 11, 323, 14074, 1119, 264, 19187, 848, 916, 3347, 8628, 3080, 279, 13163, 702, 55667, 624, 256, 481, 26070, 279, 6514, 1101, 3080, 264, 2613, 10058, 315, 31083, 7952, 2163, 279, 6821, 624, 256, 481, 23200, 279, 12644, 20980, 311, 264, 4914, 480, 5476, 624, 256, 481, 64192, 304, 32065, 8649, 323, 36301, 279, 6514, 26364, 11, 518, 3245, 220, 17, 4115, 382, 18, 13, 1752, 279, 9853, 12644, 510, 256, 481, 25968, 279, 83942, 9853, 12644, 6514, 1119, 458, 9853, 12644, 24232, 624, 256, 481, 11999, 389, 279, 5662, 323, 80869, 4092, 311, 279, 13963, 594, 17961, 624, 256, 481, 576, 521, 53344, 1882, 1265, 1896, 13187, 220, 17, 15, 311, 220, 17, 20, 4420, 624, 256, 481, 9646, 279, 9853, 12644, 374, 56050, 19690, 11, 432, 646, 387, 10223, 7069, 476, 9099, 304, 279, 49585, 311, 23288, 268, 369, 220, 17, 311, 220, 18, 4115, 1573, 13480, 13, 151645], "pred": "3. For the ice cream:\n   - Pour the chilled ice cream mix into an ice cream maker.\n   - Turn on the machine and churn according to the manufacturer's directions.\n   - The churning process should take approximately 20 to 25 minutes.\n   - Once the ice cream is softly frozen, it can be served immediately or placed in the freezer to ripen for 2 to 3 hours before serving.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2598005911186319, "g_worst_claim": 0.3559914429982503, "g_content": 1.745669470893012, "g_traj_mean": 1.1559219360351562}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 311, 1281, 9853, 12644, 11, 1191, 553, 26792, 697, 2331, 13, 362, 1661, 32065, 9853, 12644, 2331, 374, 11102, 438, 432, 374, 4135, 311, 1281, 13, 29700, 5980, 9853, 12644, 374, 264, 2699, 17902, 1268, 323, 29573, 1091, 16564, 567, 5980, 9853, 12644, 13, 4710, 2461, 264, 3151, 1714, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 510, 16, 13, 1416, 1667, 264, 2331, 11, 6514, 432, 1632, 13, 715, 17, 13, 1416, 5916, 504, 18778, 11, 23065, 13163, 11, 12644, 11, 323, 14074, 1119, 264, 19187, 848, 916, 3347, 8628, 3080, 279, 13163, 702, 55667, 13, 26070, 1101, 3080, 264, 2613, 10058, 315, 31083, 7952, 2163, 279, 6821, 13, 715, 18, 13, 23200, 279, 12644, 20980, 311, 264, 4914, 480, 5476, 11, 1741, 438, 264, 3460, 28990, 10525, 13, 715, 19, 13, 64192, 304, 32065, 8649, 323, 36301, 279, 6514, 26364, 11, 518, 3245, 220, 17, 4115, 13, 4710, 6025, 61624, 11, 4914, 279, 20980, 1119, 458, 9853, 12644, 24232, 11, 2484, 432, 389, 11, 323, 80869, 4092, 311, 279, 13963, 594, 17961, 369, 220, 17, 15, 311, 220, 17, 20, 4420, 13, 4710, 12522, 279, 9853, 12644, 374, 56050, 19690, 11, 8683, 7069, 476, 1992, 264, 6573, 315, 12188, 15061, 5961, 389, 279, 9853, 12644, 323, 1992, 432, 304, 279, 49585, 311, 23288, 268, 369, 220, 17, 311, 220, 18, 4115, 1573, 13480, 13, 151645], "pred": "Once the ice cream is softly frozen, serve immediately or place a piece of plastic wrap directly on the ice cream and place it in the freezer to ripen for 2 to 3 hours before serving.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.4914060796311677, "g_worst_claim": 0.188964221212599, "g_content": 1.9843942517432096, "g_traj_mean": 1.4103550910949707}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 0, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.63, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 10.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "701", "question": "what do children learn with water play", "gt": "Children learn various skills and concepts through water play. It aids in the development of gross motor skills as they engage in activities like running through sprinklers or filling and pouring water from buckets. Water play also facilitates academic learning in areas such as science and math. Children learn about the concept of floating and sinking, and understand that different objects have different buoyancies. In math, they learn about measurement by determining the amount of water that fits into a bucket, and concepts of more and less by comparing water levels in different buckets. Water play also promotes creativity, allowing children to use their imagination.", "pred": "The passage also mentions that to make the most of water play, teachers should be enablers, providing engaging materials and asking open-ended questions to stimulate children's active play and learning.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "The passage also mentions that to make the most of water play, teachers should be enablers, providing engaging materials and asking open-ended questions to stimulate children's active play and learning.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, children learn several things with water play:\\n\\n1. Gross motor skills: Children run through sprinklers, fill and pour water, and engage in physical activities that enhance their gross motor skills.\\n2. Academic learning: Water play helps with science by teaching concepts like floating and sinking, and with math by practicing measuring and comparing quantities of water.\\n3. Creativity: Children use their imagination and pretend while playing with water, fostering creative thinking and expression.\", \"Based on the given passages, children learn several things with water play:\\n\\n1. Gross motor skills: Children learn by running through sprinklers and filling buckets with water and pouring it out.\\n2. Academic learning: They learn about floating and sinking, and about measuring water in different amounts.\\n3. Science: They explore the properties of water and how things can sink or float.\\n4. Math: They practice measuring and comparing the amount of water in different containers.\\n5. Creativity: They use their imagination while playing with water, pretending and engaging in creative activities.\\n\\nThe passage also mentions that to make the most of water play, teachers should be enablers, providing engaging materials and asking open-ended questions to stimulate children's active play and learning.\", \"Based on the given passages, children learn various things through water play including gross motor skills, academic learning, science concepts like floating and sinking, math, and creativity. For example, children may learn about floating and sinking by playing with objects in water, and about measuring by filling buckets with different amounts of water. They also learn to use their imagination and creativity while playing with the water.\", \"Based on the given passages, children learn through water play in several ways:\\n\\n1. **Gross Motor Skills**: Children develop gross motor skills by running through sprinklers or filling and pouring water into buckets.\\n\\n2. **Academic Learning**:\\n   - **Science**: They learn about floating and sinking, observing how different objects behave in water.\\n   - **Math**: They learn to measure by filling buckets with varying amounts of water, understanding more and less.\\n\\n3. **Creativity**: Children use their imagination and pretend while playing with water.\\n\\n4. **Discovery Learning**: Water play encourages children to explore and discover new things, such as filling the water table with ice cubes and using shakers of salt with lengths of string.\\n\\nThe teacher's role is crucial in making the most of water play by providing stimulating and open-ended activities that encourage children's active participation and learning.\"]", "time_sec": 22.43, "generation_time_seconds": 21.4416, "selection_time_seconds": 0.9795, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 2841, 3960, 3807, 2513, 448, 3015, 1486, 1447, 16, 13, 42807, 8872, 7361, 25, 15044, 1598, 1526, 50698, 9254, 11, 5155, 323, 4914, 3015, 11, 323, 16579, 304, 6961, 7488, 429, 18379, 862, 19952, 8872, 7361, 624, 17, 13, 41070, 6832, 25, 9959, 1486, 8609, 448, 8038, 553, 12629, 18940, 1075, 19057, 323, 61093, 11, 323, 448, 6888, 553, 35566, 28990, 323, 26297, 32676, 315, 3015, 624, 18, 13, 17667, 1927, 25, 15044, 990, 862, 27799, 323, 34740, 1393, 5619, 448, 3015, 11, 85544, 11521, 7274, 323, 7493, 13, 151645], "pred": "1. Gross motor skills: Children run through sprinklers, fill and pour water, and engage in physical activities that enhance their gross motor skills.\n2. Academic learning: Water play helps with science by teaching concepts like floating and sinking, and with math by practicing measuring and comparing quantities of water.\n3. Creativity: Children use their imagination and pretend while playing with water, fostering creative thinking and expression.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.2153229867683804, "g_worst_claim": 0.1938701073328654, "g_content": 1.6239912850516183, "g_traj_mean": 1.2309166193008423}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 2841, 3960, 3807, 2513, 448, 3015, 1486, 1447, 16, 13, 42807, 8872, 7361, 25, 15044, 3960, 553, 4303, 1526, 50698, 9254, 323, 21274, 42112, 448, 3015, 323, 50413, 432, 700, 624, 17, 13, 41070, 6832, 25, 2379, 3960, 911, 19057, 323, 61093, 11, 323, 911, 28990, 3015, 304, 2155, 14713, 624, 18, 13, 9965, 25, 2379, 13186, 279, 5888, 315, 3015, 323, 1246, 2513, 646, 19309, 476, 2224, 624, 19, 13, 4149, 25, 2379, 6588, 28990, 323, 26297, 279, 3311, 315, 3015, 304, 2155, 23853, 624, 20, 13, 17667, 1927, 25, 2379, 990, 862, 27799, 1393, 5619, 448, 3015, 11, 54806, 323, 22570, 304, 11521, 7488, 382, 785, 21085, 1083, 33845, 429, 311, 1281, 279, 1429, 315, 3015, 1486, 11, 13336, 1265, 387, 662, 370, 9254, 11, 8241, 22570, 7236, 323, 10161, 1787, 83075, 4755, 311, 49977, 2841, 594, 4541, 1486, 323, 6832, 13, 151645], "pred": "The passage also mentions that to make the most of water play, teachers should be enablers, providing engaging materials and asking open-ended questions to stimulate children's active play and learning.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.353216898827891, "g_worst_claim": 0.19279352823893228, "g_content": 1.6760574935318588, "g_traj_mean": 1.1925026178359985}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 2841, 3960, 5257, 2513, 1526, 3015, 1486, 2670, 19952, 8872, 7361, 11, 14250, 6832, 11, 8038, 18940, 1075, 19057, 323, 61093, 11, 6888, 11, 323, 27597, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 2841, 1231, 3960, 911, 19057, 323, 61093, 553, 5619, 448, 6171, 304, 3015, 11, 323, 911, 28990, 553, 21274, 42112, 448, 2155, 14713, 315, 3015, 13, 2379, 1083, 3960, 311, 990, 862, 27799, 323, 27597, 1393, 5619, 448, 279, 3015, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, children learn various things through water play including gross motor skills, academic learning, science concepts like floating and sinking, math, and creativity. For example, children may learn about floating and sinking by playing with objects in water, and about measuring by filling buckets with different amounts of water. They also learn to use their imagination and creativity while playing with the water.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.473554084576717, "g_worst_claim": 0.1938701073328654, "g_content": 1.6148287455240886, "g_traj_mean": 1.1409406661987305}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 2841, 3960, 1526, 3015, 1486, 304, 3807, 5510, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 38, 2128, 17614, 30240, 95518, 15044, 2225, 19952, 8872, 7361, 553, 4303, 1526, 50698, 9254, 476, 21274, 323, 50413, 3015, 1119, 42112, 382, 17, 13, 3070, 11654, 69758, 20909, 334, 510, 256, 481, 3070, 35400, 95518, 2379, 3960, 911, 19057, 323, 61093, 11, 44971, 1246, 2155, 6171, 35692, 304, 3015, 624, 256, 481, 3070, 8815, 95518, 2379, 3960, 311, 6629, 553, 21274, 42112, 448, 28765, 14713, 315, 3015, 11, 8660, 803, 323, 2686, 382, 18, 13, 3070, 30744, 1927, 95518, 15044, 990, 862, 27799, 323, 34740, 1393, 5619, 448, 3015, 382, 19, 13, 3070, 67400, 20909, 95518, 9959, 1486, 36067, 2841, 311, 13186, 323, 6997, 501, 2513, 11, 1741, 438, 21274, 279, 3015, 1965, 448, 9853, 54104, 323, 1667, 557, 8312, 315, 12021, 448, 28316, 315, 914, 382, 785, 11079, 594, 3476, 374, 16587, 304, 3259, 279, 1429, 315, 3015, 1486, 553, 8241, 64692, 323, 1787, 83075, 7488, 429, 14907, 2841, 594, 4541, 20239, 323, 6832, 13, 151645], "pred": "The teacher's role is crucial in making the most of water play by providing stimulating and open-ended activities that encourage children's active participation and learning.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.3881868206024217, "g_worst_claim": 0.19279352823893228, "g_content": 1.9129033406575522, "g_traj_mean": 1.3825711011886597}}], "selected_rollout": 3, "random_sel_rollout": 1, "rank_score": "g_content", "partner": "psg-borrow", "error": null, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.75, "GAVIE-Rel": 0.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 0.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "702", "question": "what do children learn with water play", "gt": "Children learn various skills and concepts through water play. They develop gross motor skills by running through sprinklers and pouring water. Water play also provides opportunities for academic learning, such as understanding concepts like floating and sinking, measuring water, and comparing quantities. Additionally, water play encourages creativity and imagination as children pretend and engage in imaginative play with water.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, children learn various things with water play. From a motor skill perspective, children learn to run through sprinklers and pour water. Academically, they learn about floating and sinking, measure amounts of water, and understand more and less. Creatively, they engage in pretend play and use their imagination. These activities are structured by teachers to ensure an enriching experience.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, children learn various things with water play. From a motor skill perspective, children learn to run through sprinklers and pour water. Academically, they learn about floating and sinking, measure amounts of water, and understand more and less. Creatively, they engage in pretend play and use their imagination. These activities are structured by teachers to ensure an enriching experience.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, children learn several things with water play:\\n\\n1. Gross motor skills: Children run through sprinklers, fill and pour water, and engage in physical activities that enhance their gross motor skills.\\n2. Academic learning: Water play helps with science by teaching concepts like floating and sinking, and with math by practicing measuring and comparing quantities of water.\\n3. Creativity: Children use their imagination and pretend while playing with water, fostering creative thinking and expression.\", \"Based on the given passages, children learn various things with water play. From a motor skill perspective, children learn to run through sprinklers and pour water. Academically, they learn about floating and sinking, measure amounts of water, and understand more and less. Creatively, they engage in pretend play and use their imagination. These activities are structured by teachers to ensure an enriching experience.\", \"Based on the given passages, children learn several things with water play:\\n\\n- Gross motor skills: Children develop their gross motor skills through activities like running through sprinklers or filling and pouring water.\\n\\n- Academic learning: \\n  - Science: Understanding concepts of floating and sinking.\\n  - Mathematics: Learning about measuring and comparing amounts of water by filling buckets.\\n\\n- Creativity: Children use their imagination while playing with water.\\n\\n- Discovery learning: Engaging in open-ended exploration and learning through various activities.\", \"Based on the given passages, children learn with water play in several ways. Water play helps children with gross motor skills as they run through sprinklers or fill and pour water. It also aids in academic learning, particularly in science and math, where children can learn about floating and sinking, and measure amounts of water. Additionally, water play encourages creativity, allowing children to use their imagination and pretend while playing with water.\"]", "time_sec": 17.647, "generation_time_seconds": 16.6023, "selection_time_seconds": 1.0354, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 2841, 3960, 3807, 2513, 448, 3015, 1486, 1447, 16, 13, 42807, 8872, 7361, 25, 15044, 1598, 1526, 50698, 9254, 11, 5155, 323, 4914, 3015, 11, 323, 16579, 304, 6961, 7488, 429, 18379, 862, 19952, 8872, 7361, 624, 17, 13, 41070, 6832, 25, 9959, 1486, 8609, 44