{"id": "712", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "gt": "Passage 2: The exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-set for the chest, pushups, and dumbbell bench presses.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest include high-intensity interval training from The Anarchy Workout DVD program, which lasts for 6 weeks. This workout program is designed to build lean muscle all over the body, including the chest. Additionally, a modified tri-set for the chest is included in the first workout, which involves pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest include high-intensity interval training from The Anarchy Workout DVD program, which lasts for 6 weeks. This workout program is designed to build lean muscle all over the body, including the chest. Additionally, a modified tri-set for the chest is included in the first workout, which involves pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-sets for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\", \"Based on the given passages, the exercises mentioned to tone the chest include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\", \"Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest include high-intensity interval training from The Anarchy Workout DVD program, which lasts for 6 weeks. This workout program is designed to build lean muscle all over the body, including the chest. Additionally, a modified tri-set for the chest is included in the first workout, which involves pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\", \"Based on the given passages, exercises that tone the chest include:\\n\\n1. Modified tri-set for the chest: This involves laying on your back with a dumbbell in each hand, extending your arms out to your sides, curling your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest, and then slowly returning your arms back to your sides.\\n\\n2. Pushups paired with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\"]", "time_sec": 13.185, "generation_time_seconds": 12.5515, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6248, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 2924, 10807, 2406, 12, 4917, 369, 279, 15138, 323, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-sets for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.7221279287779774, "g_worst_claim": 0.30719830592473346, "g_content": 4.006522730777138, "g_traj_mean": 2.5476436614990234}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 22932, 9733, 311, 16232, 279, 15138, 2924, 264, 10807, 2406, 24096, 369, 279, 15138, 323, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, the exercises mentioned to tone the chest include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.537932270217216, "g_worst_claim": 0.30719830592473346, "g_content": 3.5275176198858964, "g_traj_mean": 2.284060478210449}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 2924, 1550, 20052, 7968, 9873, 4862, 504, 576, 1527, 15272, 69142, 18092, 2025, 11, 892, 39658, 369, 220, 21, 5555, 13, 1096, 25242, 2025, 374, 618