{"id": "715", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest are:\n\n1. Modified tri-set for the chest (mentioned in passage 2)\n2. Pushups with heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses (mentioned in passage 2)\n\nThese exercises are designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue surrounding them, allowing for more muscle growth.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-sets for the chest, which pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue around them, and paired pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. The modified tri-sets involve lying on your back with a dumbbell in each hand, extending your arms out to the sides, curling your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest, and then slowly returning your arms back to your sides.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-sets for the chest, which pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue around them, and paired pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. The modified tri-sets involve lying on your back with a dumbbell in each hand, extending your arms out to the sides, curling your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest, and then slowly returning your arms back to your sides.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-sets for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\", \"Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-sets for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. The modified tri-set involves lying on your back with a dumbbell in each hand, extending your arms out to your sides, curling your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest, and slowly returning your arms back to your sides.\", \"Based on the given passages, exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-sets for the chest, which pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue around them, and paired pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. The modified tri-sets involve lying on your back with a dumbbell in each hand, extending your arms out to the sides, curling your hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of your chest, and then slowly returning your arms back to your sides.\", \"Based on the given passages, exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-sets designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue surrounding them, and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\"]", "time_sec": 13.912, "generation_time_seconds": 13.2469, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6557, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 2924, 10807, 2406, 12, 4917, 369, 279, 15138, 323, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-sets for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.5104975614834715, "g_worst_claim": 0.05785159766674042, "g_content": 3.6950249922902962, "g_traj_mean": 2.37371563911438}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 279, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 2924, 10807, 2406, 12, 4917, 369, 279, 15138, 323, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 576, 10807, 2406, 24096, 17601, 20446, 389, 697, 1182, 448, 264, 29255, 17250, 304, 1817, 1424, 11, 32359, 697, 11715, 700, 311, 697, 11067, 11, 139