{"id": "716", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, the following exercises are mentioned as toning the chest:\n\n* Modified tri-set for the chest (not specified)\n* Pushups\n* Dumbbell bench presses\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What exercises tone the chest?\" based on the given passages is:\n\nModified tri-set for the chest, pushups, and dumbbell bench presses.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-sets for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-sets for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "cot": "[\"Based on the given passages, exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-sets for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\", \"Based on the given passages, modified tri-sets for the chest, pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses, and arm curls with dumbbells tone the chest.\", \"Based on the given passages, exercises that tone the chest include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.\", \"Based on the given passages, exercises that tone the chest include:\\n\\n1. Modified tri-set for the chest: This exercise is designed to pump your pecs and stretch the connective tissue that surrounds them, allowing more room under your skin for the muscles to grow.\\n2. Pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses: This combination targets the chest muscles and contributes to building lean muscle.\\n\\nThese exercises are part of a fitness plan that not only focuses on the chest but also builds lean muscle all over the body.\"]", "time_sec": 12.762, "generation_time_seconds": 12.0729, "selection_time_seconds": 0.6846, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "sampled": false, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 2924, 10807, 2406, 12, 4917, 369, 279, 15138, 323, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-sets for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.6038991080390081, "g_worst_claim": 0.22723960876464844, "g_content": 3.709012884842722, "g_traj_mean": 2.4096152782440186}}, {"rollout": 1, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 10807, 2406, 12, 4917, 369, 279, 15138, 11, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 11, 323, 6773, 88949, 448, 29255, 65, 6436, 16232, 279, 15138, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, modified tri-sets for the chest, pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses, and arm curls with dumbbells tone the chest.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 2.2520267746665263, "g_worst_claim": 0.22723960876464844, "g_content": 3.66519775390625, "g_traj_mean": 2.3356568813323975}}, {"rollout": 2, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 11, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 2924, 264, 10807, 2406, 24096, 369, 279, 15138, 323, 47713, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 151645], "pred": "Based on the given passages, exercises that tone the chest include a modified tri-set for the chest and pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses.", "grounding_scores": {"g_mean_claim": 1.5680023829142253, "g_worst_claim": 0.22723960876464844, "g_content": 3.509474436442057, "g_traj_mean": 2.355963706970215}}, {"rollout": 3, "sampled": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2661,