{"id": "724", "question": "weather in wellesley", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "pred": "Based on the given passages, the weather in Wellesley is forecasted for various dates. On Tuesday, August 23, the forecast predicts 82 degrees with sunny conditions, a 39% chance of rain, and 10 mph winds from the North-Northwest. On Wednesday, August 24, it is forecasted to be 79 degrees and sunny, with a 28% chance of rain and 5 mph winds from the North-Northeast. For Thursday, August 18, the forecast shows 83 degrees and sunny, a 42% chance of rain, and 8 mph winds from the West-Southwest. On Friday, August 19, the conditions are forecasted to be the same as Thursday, with 83 degrees, sunny skies, a 42% chance of rain, and 5 mph winds from the Northwest. On Sunday, August 21, the weather is expected to be 81 degrees and sunny, with a 36% chance of rain and 10 mph winds from the South. Finally, on Monday, August 22, there is heavy rain with a 52% chance of rain, moderate to heavy winds from the South, and the temperature is 77 degrees.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "bon_grounding_random_sel", "raw_output": "Based on the given passages, the weather in Wellesley is forecasted for various dates. On Tuesday, August 23, the forecast predicts 82 degrees with sunny conditions, a 39% chance of rain, and 10 mph winds from the North-Northwest. On Wednesday, August 24, it is forecasted to be 79 degrees and sunny, with a 28% chance of rain and 5 mph winds from the North-Northeast. For Thursday, August 18, the forecast shows 83 degrees and sunny, a 42% chance of rain, and 8 mph winds from the West-Southwest. On Friday, August 19, the conditions are forecasted to be the same as Thursday, with 83 degrees, sunny skies, a 42% chance of rain, and 5 mph winds from the Northwest. On Sunday, August 21, the weather is expected to be 81 degrees and sunny, with a 36% chance of rain and 10 mph winds from the South. Finally,